msgid "ADVICE@FIRSTEMPIRESKILL_REMINDER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "You can now acquire your first empire skill.[br/][br/] Empire skills can provide you with some powerful bonuses and shape the progression of your {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink}. Your {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink} will unlock new empire skills over time. You can then spend {GLOBAL.ImperiumConcept.Hyperlink} to acquire them."

