msgid "ADVICE@MANAAMOUNT_REMINDER@INSTRUCTION"
msgstr "Select to open your Throne City panel"

msgid "ADVICE@MANAAMOUNT_REMINDER@TITLE"
msgstr "Running out of Mana"

msgid "ADVICE@NEARBY_INFESTATION@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "There is an infestation closing in on your border. While for now it might only send raiding parities, once it overlaps your territory, the patrols will start burning these provinces down as well. The damage done by such infestations can be extensive, so take care. [br/] Infestations can be slowed down by destroying their patrol stacks, but to ultimately deal with it you must destroy the Infestation Spawner."

msgid "ADVICE@NEARBY_INFESTATION@INSTRUCTION"
