msgid "CAMPAIGN@LORDS@MELENIS@BIO"
msgstr "The cruelest Dark Elf assassins revere this Godir, Dancer of Death, Melenis. Once the lithe mistress to Prince Meandor, she died and rose a deadly creature of undeath. Vanquished in that form, she revived anew as queen to Dark Elf assassins. Some say her mad dance between life and death leaves her fixated upon vengeance. Her bitter life taught her that all succumb to death and only fools dare hope.[br/][br/]These sinister Undead Lichbringers seek to master the ghastly secrets of their deadly mistress, Melenis. They tread a trail of stolen lives, steeped in tragedy. They know of no atrocity that will stay their hand from the relentless pursuit of life and death and unlife and undeath, through cultic means and forbidden lore."

