msgid "CAMPAIGN@NATURE_REALM@WONDER@LORE"
msgstr "This location was claimed by a Godir and turned into a prison, its flows twisted to bind a mystical creature to this realm. The fey that once inhabited it are long gone, its prisoner instead guarded by faithful subjects of the Siren Goddess."

msgid "CAMPAIGN@NATURE_REALM@WONDER@NAME"
msgstr "Elya's Prison"

msgid "CAMPAIGN@ORDER_REALM@ARACHNA_RITUAL@PREDICTION"
msgstr "Perform the Ritual of the Mirror Curse, which has an active effect for the rest of the game:[bulletlist][bullet/]Whenever a non-ethereal unit dies on the strategic map, if at least one Shad'rai army is within {INT_Range}-hex range, there is a {INT_Chance}% chance of an Astral creature of comparable strength spawning under control of the nearby Shad'rai (randomly chosen, if more than one).[/bulletlist]"

msgid "CAMPAIGN@ORDER_REALM@ASTRAL_ISLANDS_TRAIT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The realm was torn from reality in ancient times. Astral Void breaches the land, shattering the surface of this world.[br/][br/]Astral Rifts are the only Infestations present on this realm."

msgid "CAMPAIGN@ORDER_REALM@ASTRAL_ISLANDS_TRAIT@NAME"
msgstr "Shattered World"

