msgid "CONCEPT@TEMPORARY_HITPOINTS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Temporary Hit Points are given to a {GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink} when it is healed in {GLOBAL.CombatConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]When a Unit takes damage, Temporary Hit Points are lost first.[bullet/]When combat ends, all Temporary Hit Points are removed.[/bulletlist]"

