msgid "CULTURE_DARK@SUBCULTURE@CULTOFDEATH@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Your people are familiar with death, sacrifice is the norm and a tool for their overlord to use:[bulletlist][bullet/]Units get power when friendly or hostile units are slain through {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POWER_FROM_DEATH.Hyperlink}.[Bullet/]Heroes in your {GLOBAL.CryptConcept.Hyperlink} can be turned into [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EmbalmedSacrificeConcept][embalmedsacrifice/]Embalmed Sacrifices[/hyperlink].[Bullet/]Use [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EmbalmedSacrificeConcept][embalmedsacrifice/]Embalmed Sacrifices[/hyperlink] to build powerful City Structures or cast {GLOBAL.SPECIAL_OPERATIONS.MORBID_SACRIFICE.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

