msgstr "They have respect for smiths and other artisans, preferring a strong wall over a decorated palace."

msgid "CULTURE_INDUSTRIOUS@INDUSTRIOUS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Has higher {GLOBAL.StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink} income.[bullet/]Through {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BOLSTERING.Hyperlink}, units get sturdier as they get hit in battle.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.ScoutProspectingConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

