msgid "DIPLOMACY@DIPLOMATIC_STATE_DESC@ALLIANCE"
msgstr "The strongest bond two <<m:{GLOBAL.PlayerConcept.Hyperlink}>> can share. While in an alliance, allied victories are possible when enabled, and <<m:{GLOBAL.PlayerConcept.Hyperlink}>> are automatically [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CallToWarConcept]called[/hyperlink] for aid in <<m:{GLOBAL.WarConcept.Hyperlink}>>. {LOC.DIPLOMATICSTATES_DEFINITIONS@OPTION_RETURNCAPTUREDHEROES@DESCRIPTION_TRADE}"

msgid "DIPLOMACY@DIPLOMATIC_STATE_DESC@NEUTRAL"
msgstr "While in a Peace state, the Rulers' relationship can change positively or negatively. The path to war lies open, but more peaceful options can also be pursued, such as treaties, and eventually, by means of the Wizard's Bond, creating an alliance."

msgid "DIPLOMACY@DIPLOMATIC_STATE_DESC@WAR"
msgstr "While at war, Rulers can attack each other, claim provinces and cast spells at will."

msgid "DIPLOMACY@DISCUSSION@SELECTCASUSBELLI"
