msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]The {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} shares {incomePercentage}% of its income.[bullet/]Shares all of its <<m:{GLOBAL.MagicMaterialConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Contributes {commandPoints}[recruitmentPoints/] to the {GLOBAL.RequestMilitaryAidConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/][hyperlink,GLOBAL.IndependentCityTradeConcept]Trading[/hyperlink] costs decrease by {tradingCost}%.[/bulletlist]"

