msgid "DIPLOMACY@REQUIREMENT@TOO_MANY_CITIES_TO_SURRENDER"
msgstr "{Player.Lord.FirstName} will not consider this, because they have many <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[br/]Occupying their cities or [hyperlink,GLOBAL.SiegeConcept]Sieging[/hyperlink] their {GLOBAL.ThroneCityConcept.Hyperlink} may convince them otherwise."

msgid "DIPLOMACY@REQUIREMENT@TOO_STRONG_TO_SURRENDER"
msgstr "{Player.Lord.FirstName} will not consider this, because they are too strong to surrender.[br/]Defeating their <<m:{GLOBAL.ArmyConcept.Hyperlink}>> or [hyperlink,GLOBAL.SiegeConcept]Sieging[/hyperlink] their {GLOBAL.ThroneCityConcept.Hyperlink} may convince them otherwise."

