msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Archon Prophecy"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@DISPLAYDESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Take command of the forces of light in the Age of Wonders 4: Archon Prophecy Expansion. Join the Celestial Archons as they strike back against Urrath's corrupt forces. Consult the Oracles, glimpse the hidden prophecies that shape the fates of the realms, and become the master of your own destiny."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@DISPLAYNAME"
msgstr "Age of Wonders 4: Archon Prophecy"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EMPIRE_CORE@REALM_TRAITS@BLESSED_FIELDS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This realm features mostly rolling plains, some of which have been blessed by Celestial grace.[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.AshlandsConcept.Hyperlink} are [abilityblue]Absent[/abilityblue].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.SandConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.SnowConcept.Hyperlink}, and {GLOBAL.FrozenWasteConcept.Hyperlink} are [abilityblue]Rare[/abilityblue].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.FertilePlainsConcept.Hyperlink} are [abilityblue]Common[/abilityblue].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.BlessedTerrainConcept.Hyperlink} <<m:{GLOBAL.HandcraftedRegionConcept.Hyperlink}>> are [abilityblue]Common[/abilityblue].[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EMPIRE_CORE@REALM_TRAITS@BLESSED_FIELDS@NAME"
msgstr "Blessed Fields"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EMPIRE_CORE@REALM_TRAITS@BLESSED_REGIONS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The Archons of old have left their blessings in several locations on this realm's surface.[bulletlist][bullet/]Several hand-crafted regions with {GLOBAL.BlessedTerrainConcept.Hyperlink} can appear on the surface.[bullet/]The {GLOBAL.STRUCTURES.FOUNTAIN_OF_CREATION_LANDMARK.Hyperlink} can appear on the surface.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EMPIRE_CORE@REALM_TRAITS@BLESSED_REGIONS@NAME"
msgstr "Blessed Regions"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@ARCHON_OBSERVATORY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]The City gains the ability to convert {GLOBAL.StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink} into {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink} in the {GLOBAL.StructureQueueConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Adds the {GLOBAL.UNITS.LESSER_LIGHT_SPIRIT.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.UNITS.LIGHT_SPIRIT.Hyperlink} to the {GLOBAL.RequestMilitaryAidConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@ARCHON_OBSERVATORY@LORE"
msgstr "These astonishing structures were raised by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archons[/hyperlink] to gaze upon the stars. Within, oracles read signs of the future written in starlight, forging prophecies to guide the fate of realms. Yet power such as this rarely goes unnoticed... and never uncoveted."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@ARCHON_OBSERVATORY@NAME"
msgstr "Archon Observatory"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@EXPLORE_OPERATION@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enter the Ziggurat to access its portal."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@EXPLORE_OPERATION@NAME"
