msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@ZIGGURAT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This Ziggurat is unsuitable for annexation, but its interior portal is still functional."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@FORM_TRAITS@EXOTIC_MOUNT_01@EFFECT_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Ruler starts with a Celestial Griffon Mount."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@FORM_TRAITS@EXOTIC_MOUNT_02@EFFECT_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Ruler starts with a Griffon Mount."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_1"
msgstr "Building an undead empire requires a great deal of tomb digging and pantheon raising. Along with the maintenance of soul canals and ossuaries. As an Architect, Tiha-Mha continues her work in both life and death."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_2"
msgstr "As for any other empire, expansion and new recruits remain essential. Mha-Arduk sees to it that the legions of the undead are replenished; whether through welcoming the risen or creating them anew."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_3"
msgstr "Dead do not die, but they decay. Ossuaries are raised to preserve the body of the dead. The Baron of Bones has turn this grim necessity into a symbol of aristocracy among the unliving. For some, gold gleams brighter than death."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_4"
msgstr "Khain's stars speak of magic and immortality. They whisper of a long-forgotten arcane power. One meant to be held, but not hidden. A power to be passed on, to be bestowed upon the next generation."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_5"
msgstr "Azaeris' hand and blade are guided by destiny. The constellations on his skin are simpler than most, but no less important. They are names to be crossed, hearts to be pierced. And he will not rest until every star etched upon his flesh flickers out."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_6"
msgstr "It is strange to be one of the Children of the Stars when you don't believe in destiny. Yharlax sees the constellations etched into his skin as shackles on his freedom. He remains loyal to the cause, so long as his interests align with the stars."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_7"
msgstr "What greater art is there than the shaping of souls? For Gruth the answer is clear."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_8"
msgstr "Trees and forests are great works of art from nature. Tharthes simply elevates them to perfect them like marbles."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@BIO_9"
msgstr "Kafpal loves to admire the weather while soaring above it. Storms are breathtaking, snowfalls are heartwarming... and what a delight to turn them into a spectacle."

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@HERO_FIRSTNAME_1@NAME"
msgstr "Tiha-Mha^F"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@HERO_FIRSTNAME_2@NAME"
msgstr "Mhar-Arduk^M"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@HERO_FIRSTNAME_3@NAME"
msgstr "Isha-Tha^F"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@HERO_FIRSTNAME_4@NAME"
msgstr "Khain^M"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@HERO_FIRSTNAME_5@NAME"
msgstr "Azaeris^M"

msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@HERO@HERO_FIRSTNAME_6@NAME"
msgstr "Yharlax^M"

