msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@INTERFACE@MONUMENT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Monuments are a unique type of {GLOBAL.ProvinceImprovementConcept.Hyperlink} available to the <<m:{GLOBAL.ArchitectConcept.Hyperlink}>> and built using {GLOBAL.WonderStoneConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/]Monuments grant their owner {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.AFFINITY_INCARNATE_UNIT_PROPERTY.Hyperlink}, on higher tiers they grant additional {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink} and economic effects to their owner.[br/][br/]The foundation is built in the city in a manner similar to <<m:{GLOBAL.SpecialImprovementConcept.Hyperlink}>>. The {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink} of the Monument is chosen when this is placed down.[br/]The Monument can be improved to further increase its effects:[bulletlist][bullet/]Stage 1 - Foundation[br/]Architect units gain +{IncarnateTier1} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.AFFINITY_INCARNATE_UNIT_PROPERTY.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Stage 2 - Sanctum[br/]Architect units gain +{IncarnateTier2} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.AFFINITY_INCARNATE_UNIT_PROPERTY.Hyperlink}.[br/]The Empire gains +{AffinityBonusTier2} of the monument's {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/]+{StabilityBonus} {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} in the city.[bullet/]Stage 3 - Zenith[br/]Architect units gain +{IncarnateTier3} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.AFFINITY_INCARNATE_UNIT_PROPERTY.Hyperlink}.[br/]The Empire gains +{AffinityBonusTier3} of the monument's {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/]+{StabilityBonus} {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/]+{IncomeBonusePercentageTier3}% {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink}, and {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink} in the city.[bullet/]Stage 4 - Apex[br/]Architect units gain +{IncarnateTier4} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.AFFINITY_INCARNATE_UNIT_PROPERTY.Hyperlink}.[br/]The Empire gains +{AffinityBonusTier4} of the monument's {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/]+{StabilityBonus} {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/]+{IncomeBonusePercentageTier4}% to all income in the city.[bullet/]Counts as a Gold [siteGold/] {GLOBAL.AncientWonderConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][br/]Your Empire may gain up to {IncarnateMonumentStackCap} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.AFFINITY_INCARNATE_UNIT_PROPERTY.Hyperlink} from [br/]<<m:{GLOBAL.ArchitectMonumentConcept.Hyperlink}>>."

