msgid "DLC@ARCHONPROPHECY@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_SHADOW_STRONGHOLD@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "An empowered version of the {GLOBAL.UmbralAbyssConcept.Hyperlink} creeps over this realm, opening gates to an eldritch dimension and its invading horrors:[bulletlist][bullet/]An additional map layer called the Umbral Abyss is added, which can be reached through Umbral Gates.[bullet/]Enter the Umbral Abyss for forbidden treasures—at a great risk![bullet/]An increased amount of <<m:{GLOBAL.InfestationConcept.Hyperlink}>> and <<m:{GLOBAL.DwellingConcept.Hyperlink}>> from the Umbral Abyss will creep into the Surface and Underground, spreading {GLOBAL.GloomTerrainConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> in Gloom Terrain will suffer from {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHADOW_SICKNESS.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

