msgid "DLC@DRAGONLORDS@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_ASHEN_WAR@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The Elder Dragons that guide this realm have descended into a brutal conflict now known as the Ashen War, each side seeking to guide the realm's growth as they believe is best.[bulletlist][bullet/]The Dawnwardens {DAWNWARDENS_ORDER_LEADER.Hyperlink}, {DAWNWARDENS_NATURE_LEADER.Hyperlink}, and {DAWNWARDENS_ASTRAL_LEADER.Hyperlink} start in an Alliance and at war with each of the Reshapers.[bullet/]The Reshapers {RESHAPERS_SHADOW_LEADER.Hyperlink}, {RESHAPERS_MATERIUM_LEADER.Hyperlink}, and {RESHAPERS_CHAOS_LEADER.Hyperlink} start in an Alliance and at war with each of the Dawnwardens.[bullet/]Each of the Elder Dragons is extremely powerful and has a powerful unique ability owing to their Affinity; they extend lesser versions of these abilities to their chosen Heroes.[bullet/]Whoever forms an alliance with all Elder Dragons or forms an alliance with all members of either Alliance and defeats each member of the opposing alliance is [abilityblue]Victorious[abilityblue/].[/bulletlist]"

