msgid "DLC@DRAGONLORDS@TOME_EVOLUTION@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"The concept of evolution is a curious one. Take the lowly Slither Hatchling, whose pathetic form can barely survive even the kindest environment. Yet, when thrown into the fray, this creature adapts and changes into something more. Claim this power for yourself, force inherent growth onto your people. After all: those who persist may survive. Those who evolve... will reign.\""

