msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@CRISIS@991_6139@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Lithyl Nightweaver is preparing an eldritch ritual to corrupt all of Athla. To delay her, you need to destroy her thralls on the map which are affected by the Gloom Strider and Umbral Flesh transformations."

