msgstr "Sundren has made a pact with the {GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowConcept]Shadow[/hyperlink]. Channeling its power, she seeks to purge Athla's Umbral Abyss, taking the fight to the enemy."

