msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@DIPLOMACY@HOUSE_DIPLOMATIC_STATE@PACT_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]The {GLOBAL.DwellingConcept.Hyperlink} shares its income and <<m:{GLOBAL.MagicMaterialConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]The {GLOBAL.DwellingConcept.Hyperlink} shares its vision.[bullet/]The {GLOBAL.DwellingConcept.Hyperlink} allows building on claimed provinces.[bullet/]Contributes {commandPoints}[recruitmentPoints/] to the {GLOBAL.RequestMilitaryAidConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Will [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ReinforcementRuleConcept]reinforce[/hyperlink] in {GLOBAL.CombatConcept.Hyperlink} against <<m:{GLOBAL.MarauderConcept.Hyperlink}>> and <<m:{GLOBAL.LeaderConcept.Hyperlink}>> the {GLOBAL.DwellingConcept.Hyperlink} is at {GLOBAL.IndependentCityWarConcept.Hyperlink} with.[bullet/]Allows the purchasing of special <<m:{GLOBAL.SpellConcept.Hyperlink}>> and other bonuses to benefit from {GLOBAL.GloomTerrainConcept.Hyperlink} via Cooperation.[/bulletlist]"

