msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@SPAWNERS_STRATEGIC@SHADOW_INFESTATION@BEACON"
msgstr "When destroyed, places a {GLOBAL.BeaconOfLightConcept.Hyperlink} on this location."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@SPAWNERS_STRATEGIC@SHADOW_INFESTATION@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A hive from which <<m:{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.UMBRAL_DEMON.Hyperlink}>> emerge in their many unholy forms.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies. {beaconinsert}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@SPAWNERS_STRATEGIC@SHADOW_INFESTATION@LORE"
msgstr "Rings of tooth-like petrified tentacles appear to swallow these dread breeding grounds of eldritch abominations, a congress of forsaken creatures from the Umbral Abyss and the Astral Void. The Umbral Nest spews forth hordes of Umbral Demons that crave the flesh of the unsullied. Equally horrendous, the Eldritch Maw produces the Gloom that infests fertile lands and invokes the Umbral Malady."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@SPAWNERS_STRATEGIC@SHADOW_INFESTATION@NAME"
msgstr "Umbral Nest"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_391@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The constellation's new stars cosmically bolster the damage of this realm's [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.RANGED_UNIT]archers[/hyperlink] and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE]casters[/hyperlink], at the cost of their range."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_391@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Complaints from your archers reach you. Their arrows seem weightier. Astrologers soon find the cause: the constellation of Leana's Draw has changed!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_391@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "New stars have appeared around the \"arrow\" in the constellation of Leana's Draw. The celestial image now looks like the Huntress is drawing back a javelin on her bow. The alteration somehow affects not just your archers' arrows, but also the magical projectiles of your casters."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_391@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Let my foes draw closer, if they dare.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_391@TITLE"
msgstr "Sign of the Huntress"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_392@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "However, depending on how useful you found their temporary effectiveness, your archers' celebration could be premature."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_392@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The additional stars in the constellation of Leana's Draw have dimmed again, much to the relief of your archers."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_392@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your astrologers have several hypotheses concerning the cause of this alteration of the Sign of the Huntress, ranging from prophecies to divine intervention. Regardless, with the stars that elongated the \"arrow\" in the constellation gone, your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.RANGED_UNIT]archers'[/hyperlink] and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE]casters'[/hyperlink] natural range and damage are restored. They shake their weary arms and rejoice."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_392@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Instruct my mages to study [mana/] how to replicate this effect.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_392@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Let arrows fly far once more!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_392@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Perform a blood sacrifice to gain the enchantment."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_392@TITLE"
msgstr "Sign of the Huntress: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_400@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Fragments of the shattered world have crashed in every forest, causing them to spread and grow hostile towards your armies."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_400@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "When a great World Tree has sufficiently matured, it shoots its seeds off into the Astral Sea towards new worlds."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_400@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "World Trees do not reproduce on their own worlds. Instead, they spread their seeds on distant realms. Should a World Seed find a barren world, it will eventually make it fertile and inhabitable. However, a World Seed finding a lush world will stir the trees and plants that were already there."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_400@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Be wary of the forests! They are no longer safe!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_400@TITLE"
msgstr "Invading Sylviculture"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_401@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you restore your lands claimed by forests? Or is it more appealing to learn new power over nature?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_401@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After a period of upheaval, a World Seedling from a distant world has taken root, spawning a new {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_401@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Peace returns within the realm and balance is restored, as is Nature's wont. Your troops may once again traverse the woodlands safely and unhindered. Yet for all the turmoil the World Seedling caused, you may have an opportunity to benefit from the woody incursion."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_401@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Banish [mana/] the invading Forests and revert your provinces to their original terrains."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_401@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "The forests are here to stay, yielding us timber. [structureprod/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_401@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Learn {EventEnchantment} to have plants aid you in battle."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_401@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "No forests grow in your domain."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_401@TITLE"
msgstr "Invading Sylviculture: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_405@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Ravenous parasitic creatures that follow the Astral Leviathan descend upon your realm to feast on life!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_405@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "An impossibly deep bellow heralds the arrival of a colossal creature from the far reaches of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_405@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Although intimidating, the Astral Leviathan does not appear hostile. Yet in its wake follow swarms of malicious {GLOBAL.AstralMonstersLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, such as <<m:EventUnit>>. What's worse, the Astral Leviathan's deep song makes ethereal creatures such as these parasites more attuned to the reverberations of magic."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_405@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My empire shall not fall to these leeches from the cosmos!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_405@TITLE"
msgstr "Ravenous Visitants"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_406@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The Astral parasites that remain on your world, marooned and severed from their cosmic host, will die off soon."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_406@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The Astral Leviathan that circumscribes your world has seemingly lost interest. It drifts away peacefully, after one final bellow."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_406@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Within a few heartbeats, the colossus has gone from your sight, floating away with an unlikely haste. Most of the invaders that swarmed your world notice its departure and follow its ethereal current."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_406@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Good riddance.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_406@TITLE"
msgstr "Ravenous Visitants: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_411@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will Gabriel's Eye bring about a new era of enlightenment, in which wisdom is valued over war? Time will tell."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_411@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Stargazers discover a new star in the sky. Dubbed \"Gabriel's Eye,\" its gleam inspires all rulers to pursue knowledge."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_411@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your scholars theorize that the recent disturbance of {EventConstellation} caused the new star to light up in the firmament. You discern within yourself a rising thirst for knowledge, while your hunger for battle wanes."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_411@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Perhaps now is the time for peace and wisdom.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_411@TITLE"
msgstr "Starry-eyed Enlightenment"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_412@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Slowly, the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of this realm revert to their old, warring ways."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_412@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As suddenly as it appeared, Gabriel's Eye is fading again, as are its pacifying effects."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_412@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You wonder if the ancient wizard had truly fixed its gaze on your world, or if this was a rumor produced by your people's superstition. However it may be, you cannot deny how its presence impacted the realm, pushing an era of enlightenment."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_412@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The insolent warmongers of this realm must be held accountable.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_412@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"One way or another, this realm shall be mine.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_412@TITLE"
msgstr "Starry-eyed Enlightenment: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_438@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You grin. Fueling the imminent bonfires of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink] will deliver maximum pandemonium."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_438@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You are no stranger to nightly visions of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink], yet tonight's imagery offers an eerie clarity. An Eye of Fire calls you."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_438@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The Eye of Fire you see in your feverish vision presents itself to you as a gargantuan ring of flames in the sky. Its gaze will cause lesser lords to break oaths, and demons to ravage the realm. You wake up and realize your world is about to be plummeted into Chaos."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_438@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My magic [mana/] shall fan the flames of Chaos!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_438@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"My serfs [population/] shall kindle the flames of Chaos!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_438@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"The Eye of Fire will incite sufficient mayhem.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_438@TITLE"
msgstr "[chaos/] Eye of Fire: Foreshadowing"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_439@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The entire realm descends into a maddening domain of fiery [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink]. May the odds be in your favor."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_439@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A distant world somewhere in the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} shifts in front of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. It is ensnared in the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink] World's radiance, forming an ungodly ring of fire in the heavens."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_439@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Like a naked Balor eye in the firmament, the Eye of Fire gazes down on your helpless world. Demons and fiends summoned to your world revel in its light, while vassals are driven mad and abandon their oaths and fealty. The Eye's unholy gleam causes the fires on your world to grow, and their flames burn with searing malice."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_439@BODY_LORE@BOOSTED_BY_OTHER"
msgstr "Like a naked Balor eye in the firmament, the Eye of Fire gazes down on your helpless world. Demons and fiends summoned to your world revel in its light, while vassals are driven mad and abandon their oaths and fealty. The Eye's unholy gleam causes the fires on your world to grow, and their flames burn with searing malice.[br/][br/]An unnatural malady incites a madness in your troops, diminishing their mental and physical resistances."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_439@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We will weather this evil storm.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_439@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"What madman would reinforce this occurrence?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_439@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"All according to plan.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_439@TITLE"
msgstr "[chaos/] Eye of Fire"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_440@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "In any case, your people wish and pray that they shall never again be submitted to such an ordeal."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_440@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The demon eye in the sky, wreathed in infernal flames, turns away. Perhaps it hungers for another world to consume."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_440@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The world is given a chance to heal from its smoldering wounds. Vassals once again turn to their lords for guidance and plead for their forgiveness."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_440@BODY_LORE@BOOSTED_BY_OTHER"
msgstr "The world is given a chance to heal from its smoldering wounds. Vassals once again turn to their lords for guidance and plead for their forgiveness. [br/][br/]The chaos revealed to your diviners that {EventPlayer} was among those who fanned the infernal flames of the Eye of Fire, scorching the world permanently. <<Co:EventPlayer>> weakening malady continues to affect your troops."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_440@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Back to my ambitions for this realm.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_440@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"{EventPlayer} must answer for their part in this phenomenon.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_440@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"That was entertaining.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_440@TITLE"
msgstr "[chaos/] Eye of Fire: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_470@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The realm's [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHIELD_UNIT]Shield Bearers[/hyperlink] may carry broken shields, but they are poised to thrash your enemies in the front lines."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_470@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The \"shield\" in the constellation of Baradir the Shield Master has broken in twain! Shields and bucklers everywhere spontaneously shatter."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_470@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Now that their full advantage of shield-wielding is lost, defenders are compelled to focus on their attacks. It is a formidable sight to behold: they strike harder and deeper, paying less heed to their defensive tactics."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_470@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The best defense is a mighty offense!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_470@TITLE"
msgstr "Sign of the Cleft Shield"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_471@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Discounting the odd shield bash, this realm's [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHIELD_UNIT]Shield Bearers[/hyperlink] once again favor defense over fierce attacks."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_471@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The \"shield\" in the constellation of Baradir the Shield Master has restored itself. Your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHIELD_UNIT]Shield Bearers'[/hyperlink] shields are equally mended."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_471@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Smiths and armorers repaired or reforged every broken targe and buckler in your realm. Defenders everywhere proudly bear their shields high once again. Having favored their sword-arm over their shields for so long, they reacquaint themselves with their familiar role as protectors."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_471@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You must train [unitprod/] your sword-arm even more.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_471@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Protecting the meek is once more a shield-warrior's calling.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_471@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"By my blood, my shield bearers may hold this starbound power.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_471@TITLE"
msgstr "Sign of the Cleft Shield: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_472@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A thirst for battle rouses your citizens, while your troops are inspired to fight for your cause, instead of your gold."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_472@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Sightings have been reported of Xorn's Javelin, a long-tailed comet that pierces brightly through the nightly sky."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_472@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Every time this comet passes by a world, its denizens are overcome with an uncanny urge to fight. Already, your {EventRace} are ardently lining up to enlist! Meanwhile, your troops in the field are stirred by the omen and passionately fight for your cause, as if Xorn the Disciplined himself leads them."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_472@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Now is the time to grow my army and conquer!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_472@TITLE"
msgstr "Portent of Rousing"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_473@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With your coffers replenished, the future looks bright. You cannot wait until Xorn's Javelin returns."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_473@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Xorn's Javelin has traveled out of your sight, and the eagerness for combat that gripped your {EventRace} quickly evaporates."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_473@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "But, just as the comet crosses the horizon, it issues one final burst of burning loyalty. Your citizens that cannot fight are inspired to contribute to your war efforts. For each warrior in your army, a donation is made in celebration of the glory of your rulership."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_473@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Glory to me!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_473@TITLE"
msgstr "Portent of Rousing: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_474@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You can only witness how your domain slowly erodes into a barren desert."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_474@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "From the outer skies above the realm, cosmic winds flagellate the world. Wherever they blow, vegetation is burned or sanded down."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_474@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Rivers and lakes dry up. Not even the thickest wall or highest mountain can repel the currents. You are at the mercy of the fickle gales issued by the cosmos."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_474@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We will weather this storm.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_474@TITLE"
msgstr "Cosmic Winds"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_475@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you advance the desolate realm's restoration? Or have the sandstorms inspired you to develop new tricks."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_475@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Finally, the relentless cosmic winds recede. The world is given a chance to restore life in the barren deserts."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_475@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You only vaguely remember what your world used to look like before. Much of what was lush and verdant has been scourged by the dry tempests. There is but one solacing thought: that all your rivals have endured the same sandy ordeal."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_475@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Revitalize [mana/] the coarse Deserts and revert your provinces to their original terrains."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_475@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Learn {EventEnchantment} to summon sandstorms in combat."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_475@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Sieve your desert's sands to claim treasures [gold/] previously locked in earth."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_475@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Sand does not blanket any of your lands."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_475@TITLE"
msgstr "Cosmic Winds: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_476@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Finding uncorrupted food to harvest has become a nigh impossible challenge, while your soldiers threaten to succumb to pestilence."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_476@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Astrologers warn you of the imminent conjunction of {RandomNatureWorld}, a world of Growth, and {RandomShadowWorld}, a world of Decay."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_476@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The combined pull on your realm is causing crops to rot as they ripen. The threat of a famine looms. Equally disastrous are the reports of your troops suffering from an unnatural disease."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_476@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I pray my {EventRace} can digest this affliction.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_476@TITLE"
msgstr "Blightfall Conjunction"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_477@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The realm is healing. Only the most devious would seek to profit from this global disaster."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_477@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The realm is finally permitted respite: the Blightfall Conjunction has ended."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_477@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your famished {EventRace} are relieved to find an abundance of fresh foods after such a deprivation. Your warriors, full-bellied once again, stand strong and firm, ready at your command."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_477@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Learn the {EventSpell} spell to curse [evilact/] your enemies with this plague."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_477@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Harvest the souls [souls/] of those who succumbed to the Blightfall."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_477@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Let us leave this age of pestilence behind us."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_477@TITLE"
msgstr "Blightfall Conjunction: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_478@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Until the Sea can restore itself, the workings of <<m:{GLOBAL.STRUCTURE_UPGRADES.TELEPORTER}>> and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.PHASE]phase-shifters[/hyperlink] has been severely disrupted."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_478@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The recent visit of the {EventEntity} has stirred the cosmic cohesion of the firmament."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_478@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "What is usually fleeting in the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, is now earthbound by the lingering aura of the {EventEntity}. The magic property of some particles that allows them to shift from substance into energy, is nullified."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_478@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My troops better march on.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_478@TITLE"
msgstr "Phase-shift Nixing"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_479@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Deposits of suppressed magical energies are now suddenly released all at once, resulting in a snowfall of {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} crystals."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_479@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Finally, the comforting hums of <<m:{GLOBAL.STRUCTURE_UPGRADES.TELEPORTER}>> fill the realm once more as their connections are restored."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_479@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "But even while their abilities were disrupted, the teleporters continued to extract sublimated magic from the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. With nowhere else to go, the magical energies were stored with these structures."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_479@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"A welcome serendipity!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_479@TITLE"
msgstr "Phase-shift Nixing: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_480@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The sun's rays of winter disrupt your world. Snowstorms not only complicate combat, but also freeze the land."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_480@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A substantial celestial crystal is lining up with the sun, turning its light red as ruby and diminishing its heat."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_480@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The sun is still as bright as ever, but its rays no longer convey their comforting heat. As the welcome warmth withdraws from your realm, snow and ice change your lands to the Evercold. Your citizens seek shelter in their homes, but your troops suffer from sudden blizzards."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_480@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Winter has come.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_480@TITLE"
msgstr "Rays of Winter"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_481@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you drive back the snow that claimed your lands? Or will you draw power from the fleeting rays of winter?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_481@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Finally, the sun releases the cosmic crystal from its pull. Warm rays of sunlight wash over your domain."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_481@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Yet the otherworldly cold that affected your world is not easily dismissed. But while the icy plains of permafrost formed, your mages have studied the celestial object that caused the solar disruption. They ensure you they can harness some of the crystal's magical properties for your own benefit."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_481@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Thaw the snow with your inner magical fire. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_481@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Learn the power of {EventEnchantment} from the retreating winter."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_481@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Apply the clarity offered by the cold to gain new insights. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_481@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Fortunately, the winter never invaded your territory."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_481@TITLE"
msgstr "Rays of Winter: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_482@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "All spellcasting and sources of magic are suppressed while the stars remain dimmed."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_482@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "This night, the cries of scholars and mages echo throughout your realm: all the stars' lights have been snuffed!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_482@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "No one comprehends what caused this event, yet your wizards and sorcerers inform you that they sense a dampening of their magical powers. You know they speak true: you felt it too."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_482@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The sword is mightier than the wand. For now.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_482@TITLE"
msgstr "Astral Eclipse"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_483@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A new age of wizarding and enchantment dawns. Let the magic flow freely from your fingers once again."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_483@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Behold! The stars are reignited one by one! The astral eclipse draws to an end."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_483@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Within a single night, all the constellations have returned to the firmament. In the distance, flashes of dazzling lights evidence the glee of your mages, who too have discovered the return of their powers."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_483@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My sorcerous spark returns at last.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_483@TITLE"
msgstr "Astral Eclipse: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_484@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Those slain in combat are imperiled by this curse: to serve the masters of those they fight. In undeath."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_484@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Once, an ancient curse created the Undead on another world. Its echo now encroaches from the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and envelops your world."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_484@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The eldritch nebula, dubbed [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MelenisLoreConcept]Melenis's[/hyperlink] Kiss by seers, imprints a shared dream on the soldiers of your realm. A dream of menacing hunger and endless waking. A promise of unrelenting thralldom at the mercy of your rivals."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_484@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"A double-edged sword. My troops must be vigilant.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_484@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"They believe I am involved in this? How quaint. How delightful.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_484@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Curse {EventPlayer} and her foul tricks!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_484@TITLE"
msgstr "Melenis's Kiss"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_485@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Now you must decide how to deal with the shadowy chaos it left in its wake."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_485@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept]Astral winds[/hyperlink] finally carry away [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MelenisLoreConcept]Melenis^s[/hyperlink] Kiss back into the cosmos, where it will surely haunt another world."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_485@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Yet its presence undeniably left its stain on your world. Troops who fought loyally for their masters were forced to join the ranks of their sworn enemies. For some Godir, Melenis's Kiss was a blessing. For others, their downfall."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_485@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My glory [influence/] rejects these abominations. They must be destroyed!\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_485@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"These creatures are imperfect. My dark spells [souls/] will mend them.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_485@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I've grown quite fond of my involuntary conscripts. They may stay.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_485@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Melenis's Kiss did not gift you any Zombies."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_485@TITLE"
msgstr "Melenis's Kiss: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_486@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Volcanic blaze and ruin wreak havoc in your realm. Can you and your armies withstand the heat?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_486@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Astrologers warn you that the sun inches towards your world. Every hour, the fiery orb in the heavens seems larger."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_486@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "They suspect {GLOBAL.YakaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, or one of his overconfident acolytes, is performing an improvident ritual. Global temperatures rise until a flashpoint is reached. Volcanoes violently appear across the world, burning lush lands and renewable resources."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_486@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"If I can keep a cool head, we won't get burned.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_486@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"This wasn't my doing... this time.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_486@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"{EventPlayer} will burn for this treachery!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_486@TITLE"
msgstr "Sunstruck Eruptions"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_487@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you invest in the restoration of your lands? Or do you suffer the desolation to gain other boons?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_487@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You notice that the days become cooler again, as the sun finally abates its encroachment on your world."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_487@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The flaming chaos withdraws as the sun reclaims its usual position in the cosmos. Its warmth is once again comforting instead of scorching. Yet the devastation that the sun caused leaves a smoldering mark on your lands."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_487@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Reseed [food/] the desolated wastelands to restore their lush and life."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_487@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Extract the secrets of {EventEnchantment} from the dying volcanoes."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_487@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I will conquer [influence/] this realm, regardless of any wastelands within my domain.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_487@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Wastelands do not tarnish your domain."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_487@TITLE"
msgstr "Sunstruck Eruptions: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_488@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While builders benefit from the malleable stone, defensive structures suddenly easily crumble!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_488@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The conjunction of the {GLOBAL.MateriumConcept.Hyperlink} world {RandomMateriumWorld} and the {GLOBAL.AstralConcept.Hyperlink} world {RandomAstralWorld} was foretold. That prophecy is now fulfilled."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_488@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Magical properties seep into rock and stone, making both more compliant and easier to manipulate. However, the augmented stone cannot discern between chisel and battering ram. Masonry that was built to last now gladly yields to the striking sword."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_488@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "A time for building and breaking comes."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_488@TITLE"
msgstr "Stirring Stone Conjunction"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_489@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you welcome these stone-faced allies, or shall you bind them within your walls?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_489@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the Stirring Stone conjunction nears its end, stone and earth are magically stirred from their slumber and begin to move."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_489@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "From within city walls, <<m:EventUnit>> are trying to break free. Binding these spirits to your service is easily achieved, but their release will cause the obliteration of the {GLOBAL.STRUCTURE_UPGRADES.STONE_WALLS.Hyperlink} that birthed them."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_489@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"A simple sleep enchantment [mana/] will keep my walls intact.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_489@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"<<Cm:EventUnit>> [unit/] are worth more to me than stone walls.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_489@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Stone bends to my will. One {EventUnit} [unit/] won't destroy the walls.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_489@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"It's a good thing I don't have any Stone Walls.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_489@TITLE"
msgstr "Stirring Stone Conjunction: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_505@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The Colossus Moon reigns supreme. Shores cannot contain the seas and thunderstorms flood the lands."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_505@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The full moon draws closer to your world. Its pull on the oceans climbs to unprecedented levels."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_505@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "This is a moon unlike any you've seen before. It glows like a white-hot steel shield. Soon, salty waves stir with such violence that they wash over beaches and cliffs alike. Storm clouds black as ink form over the seas and deluge the continents, their burdens spilling on the saturated surface of the realm."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_505@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Thunderbolts and lightning do not frighten me.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_505@TITLE"
msgstr "Colossus Moon"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_506@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Can you use these new swamps to your benefit? Or will you erase the scars of the thunderstorms?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_506@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The Colossus Moon finally seems satisfied with the destruction it wrought on the world. It has begun to wane."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_506@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Scouts confirm your presumptions. Many provinces on the coast have turned into Swamps after being flooded by the torrential barrages that the thunderstorms delivered."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_506@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Drain new swamps in your domain using earth, wood, and stone. [production/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_506@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Learn the secrets of {EventEnchantment} from the thunderous onslaught."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_506@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"The downpour made the lands more fertile. [food/] My cities will grow.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_506@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Swamps never flooded your domain."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_506@TITLE"
msgstr "Colossus Moon: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_507@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Even though their strikes inflict less damage, your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHOCK_UNIT]warriors[/hyperlink] will have no trouble meeting your enemies in combat."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_507@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Half of the stars that make up the fabled great sword in the constellation of Ja'Vasqa's Charge have disappeared!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_507@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The nimble Tigran Warlord represented in the constellation now appears to brandish a short sword. Your warriors feel quickened by the cosmic phenomenon and report a surge in stamina and agility. They may move across the battlefield more deftly, at the expense of brute strength."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_507@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Charge forth on the wings of victory, my warriors!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_507@TITLE"
msgstr "Sign Of The Vanguard"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_508@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Some [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHOCK_UNIT]warriors[/hyperlink] delight in the return of their martial strength, while others miss their increased agility. What did you prefer?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_508@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Ja'Vasqa's great sword has been celestially reforged. The stars have returned to complete the constellation."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_508@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Warriors leading the charge discover that their normal stamina has been restored. Fortunately, the strength in their arms also returned. The time of bolting across the battlefield like a gale of fury has passed. Or has it?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_508@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My magical talents [mana/] may make their haste permanent.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_508@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Perform a blood sacrifice to gain the enchantment."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_508@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I prefer my warriors strong, not swift.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_508@TITLE"
msgstr "Sign Of The Vanguard: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_509@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Proud [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE]mages[/hyperlink] and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUPPORT_UNIT]healers[/hyperlink] stand taller than ever before, now that their power is surging. Their decreased speed clearly worries them not."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_509@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The star that represents the \"staff gem\" in the constellation of Anon's Ascent gleams as bright as the waxing moon."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_509@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Those who normally tend to the wounded or who empower warriors from afar, sense a hidden power burning inside them. They grow more potent, but the magnitude of their magical might weighs them down."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_509@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"May they ruin their enemies before they reach them.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_509@TITLE"
msgstr "Sign Of The Lumbering Staff"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_510@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE]Mages[/hyperlink] and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUPPORT_UNIT]soothers[/hyperlink] vainly inspect their hands, which yesterday wielded such great magical force. They lament their tempering. Do you?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_510@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your astrologers had already predicted it: the luminous star in Anon's Ascent returned to its original brightness."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_510@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "While <<m:EventUnit>> wail about the loss of their powers, warriors are keen to point out that they have not disappeared, but merely returned to their original strength."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_510@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Keeping my mages empowered deserves a personal investment of magic.\" [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_510@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Perform a blood sacrifice to gain the enchantment."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_510@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I favor their mobility returning. A slow mage is a dead mage.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_510@TITLE"
msgstr "Sign Of The Lumbering Staff: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_511@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As a servant of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.OrderConcept]Order[/hyperlink], you are compelled to foster the dawn of this Lodestar. Will you obey your duty?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_511@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A new light has appeared in the heavens. Only you seem to be able to see its gleam."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_511@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Engulfed by the light of this new star, its peace and purpose fill your spirit: this Lodestar will soon reveal itself to the rest of this world. It shall be a new True North for the allies of Order and Zeal. Let all those who serve its tenets bask in its glorious rays and grow stronger."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_511@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My inner holy fire [mana/] will brighten the star when it comes!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_511@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"A fast [food/] shall empower the Lodestar's presence!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_511@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I should not interfere with the natural order of the cosmos.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_511@TITLE"
msgstr "[order/] Dawn of the Lodestar: Foreshadowing"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_512@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The Lodestar has dawned, and it brightly ushers in an age of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.OrderConcept]Order[/hyperlink] and Zeal."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_512@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The world basks in the warm light of a new rising star, quickly dubbed the Lodestar."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_512@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The Lodestar guides those who follow the path of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.OrderConcept]Order[/hyperlink]: The Celestial, the Faithful, and the Zealous. Vassals feel their hearts and spirits bolstered and launch crusades against their Lords' enemies. Faint harmonies of a chorus resonate in the very foundations of the world, causing all who hear it to quiver."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_512@BODY_LORE@BOOSTED_BY_OTHER"
msgstr "The Lodestar guides those who follow the path of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.OrderConcept]Order[/hyperlink]: The Celestial, the Faithful, and the Zealous. Vassals feel their hearts and spirits bolstered and launch crusades against their Lords' enemies. Faint harmonies of a chorus resonate in the very foundations of the world, causing all who hear it to quiver.[br/][br/]Those who stray from the path find themselves Condemned, yet it seems a force other than the Lodestar is to blame for that."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_512@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"May its dawn nourish my plans.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_512@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"What fanatic bolstered the Lodestar's light, I wonder.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_512@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"As it is was destined to be.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_512@TITLE"
msgstr "[order/] Dawn of the Lodestar"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_513@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "After the dawn comes the setting of the Lodestar. The world has grown slightly darker, and less orderly."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_513@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The golden gleam of the Lodestar is slowly fading, and its servants lament its diminishing."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_513@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Yet the Lodestar's rays permanently touched the hearts of those who beheld it, leaving a vulnerability in their spirits."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_513@BODY_LORE@BOOSTED_BY_OTHER"
msgstr "Yet the Lodestar's rays permanently touched the hearts of those who beheld it, leaving a vulnerability in their spirits.[br/][br/]As its last light is swallowed by dark clouds, a celestial whisper carries the name of one of the Heralds of the Lodestar: \"{EventPlayer}!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_513@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The light fades. The memory lasts.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_513@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"The truth about {EventPlayer} is finally brought to light!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_513@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I pray the world reveled in the blessings I orchestrated.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_513@TITLE"
msgstr "[order/] Dawn of the Lodestar: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_514@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Is this an opportunity? Dare you drive the drifting of the ley lines and summon uncertainty within the world's magic?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_514@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Something feels off. You feel pulled at. Peeled. An inner resonance is off-key. A shift is imminent."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_514@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You invoke your deep [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralConcept]Astral[/hyperlink] attunement to divine the origin of the entrancing sensation. The electrifying realization follows soon: a storm between stars flows over the ley lines of this world. The sorcerous channels of the world are about to drift from their arcane positions. You also sense that this drifting will cause magic to become less predictable."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_514@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My curiosity ordains such an enchanting [mana/] experiment!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_514@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"My scholars [knowledge/] will uncover how to further imbalance the ley lines.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_514@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"The ley lines must drift on the Astral flows unhindered.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_514@TITLE"
msgstr "[arcana/] Drifting Ley Lines: Foreshadowing"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_515@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralConcept]Astral[/hyperlink] tremors ripple through the realms. It is an era in which little is certain, apart from magic growing unpredictable."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_515@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The magical coherence of the world is at risk. The ley lines, the fundamental [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralConcept]Astral[/hyperlink] alignment, stray from their courses."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_515@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A turbulence in the cosmos washes over the deep Astral channels that bind and guide the magic to this world. Your troops are shocked to discover that they have become conduits for lightning magic. Ethereal beings unwittingly amplify magical energies and all spells burst from potency."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_515@BODY_LORE@BOOSTED_BY_OTHER"
msgstr "A turbulence in the cosmos washes over the deep Astral channels that bind and guide the magic to this world. Your troops are shocked to discover that they have become conduits for lightning magic. Ethereal beings unwittingly amplify magical energies and all spells burst from potency.[br/][br/]A mad wizard has been abetting the drifting of the ley lines, causing magical strikes to extend beyond their intended reach."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_515@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"This world will never be the same again.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_515@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Which power-crazed wizard delivers us this misery?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_515@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Promising results, so far!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_515@TITLE"
msgstr "[arcana/] Drifting Ley Lines"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_516@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Centuries shall pass before the ley lines' drifting fully halts. Until then, all must suffer the unpredictable shape of magic."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_516@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Having strayed far from their original alignments, the drift of the ley lines is slowing down. [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralConcept]Astral[/hyperlink] stability is re-emerging."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_516@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Spells are less volatile, and the empowering tether that ethereal beings shared the Astral energies is severed. Yet the susceptibility to electrifying magics did not dissipate from your troops."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_516@BODY_LORE@BOOSTED_BY_OTHER"
msgstr "Spells are less volatile, and the empowering tether that ethereal beings shared with the Astral energies is severed. Yet the susceptibility to electrifying magics did not dissipate from your troops.[br/][br/]And the extended reach of magical strikes also persists. Your scholars inform you that {EventPlayer} is one of those who intentionally pushed the ley lines."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_516@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My ambitions require stability too, to lay it on the line.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_516@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"{EventPlayer}? <<Cp:EventPlayer>> crossed a line with this plot.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_516@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I will suffer this outcome as an absolute win.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_516@TITLE"
msgstr "[arcana/] Drifting Ley Lines: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you embrace your dark desires and torment these fresh recruits? Or are you able to transcend your eldritch instincts?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Newly recruited <<m:EventUnitB>> are brought before you for inspection. Suddenly, a sense of malicious disgust engulfs you."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The eras spent in the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink} scarred your mind. You are unable to look at your subjects and see people. You only see... repulsive miscreants. Their miserable lives in your eldritch hands. \"[runicfont]Kill[/runicfont]...\", a familiar voice whispers in the back of your mind. You close your eyes and fail to suppress a yearning smile."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Subject the <<m:EventUnitB>> to your unmitigated carnage. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Meat [food/] for your followers in {EventCity}. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Maim the <<m:EventUnitB>> and carve a bloody trophy from their remains. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Mold the <<m:EventUnitB>> into a {EventUnit}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Suppress the instinct [goodact/] and leave the <<m:EventUnitB>> alone. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_523@TITLE"
msgstr "The Willing Flesh"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The voices are all vying for your patronage. Which voice shall be yours?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The voices are back. Relentless allies that accompanied you in the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and beyond, before you lost your mind."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "They were like old friends... and nemeses. They pushed you to greatness, and dragged you down. Yet, beyond the name-calling, the flattery, the tantrums, and the gossip, their words fed you the means to survive when your mind shattered and you became [hyperlink,GLOBAL.LostWizardLoreConcept]Lost[/hyperlink]. Eventually, you regained your consciousness, your sense of self, and with it... the voices returned. To occupy your mind once again."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"There is one master above all. Everything can be bought.\" [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"To achieve serenity, all must be of one mind... mine.\" [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Chaos and ruin are ultimate. Any and all will shatter.\" [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Life only feeds the Void. Monuments adorn it.\" [structureprod/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Incantatum Omnia. [runicfont]Et mana, Magus.\"[/runicfont] [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Rise! Grow! Reproduce! Until our bodies blanket all of existence!\" [population/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"Only through dark decay, is truth revealed.\" [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "\"[runicfont]Bring me Thralls![/runicfont]\" [thralls/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "The silent one, whose terrible thoughts [evilact/] invoke strength."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@BUTTON_9"
msgstr "Silence the voices. You require none. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1167_524@TITLE"
msgstr "The Voices"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1422@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventHouse} is unmistakably a sinister lair. Nevertheless, pragmatic diplomacy produces unparalleled rewards! Can you afford the dire price of peace?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1422@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"[runicfont]Halt![/runicfont]\" The gargantuan {EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.UmbralDwellingConcept.Hyperlink} of {EventHouse.Name} ominously slinks from the shadows to address you with malicious intent."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1422@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} houses many surprises and secrets, and the dwelling of the {EventHouseRace} is one of them. \"[runicfont]Purpose[/runicfont]?\" tries the {EventHouseLord.Title}, but <<p:EventHouseLord>> then utters: \"You... Here why?\" A serendipitous glimmer in the dark betrays the presence of warriors in the shadows behind your host, ready to lunge forward at the first sign of weakness."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1422@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Tenebrous {EventHouse}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1423@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Vow to destroy them! [rs_war/] [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1484@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "To earn the allegiance of {EventHouse}, you must bleed. Metaphorically, if you're lucky. And {EventHouseLord.Name} won't abide offerings previously given."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1484@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You seek to improve your standing with the {EventHouseRace} of {EventHouse}, and with {EventHouseLord.TitleName} in particular."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1484@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The wicked {EventHouseLord.Title} silently waits for you to speak. Ages of servitude at the behest of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has made <<o:EventHouseLord>> people leery of authority. \"[runicfont]Pitiful[/runicfont],\" <<p:EventHouseLord>> barks at <<o:EventHouseLord>> lackeys, who promptly produce cramped wheezes: forgotten echoes of chuckles."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1484@TITLE"
msgstr "Enshrouded Loyalty"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1488@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "If there is to be peace between your people and the {EventHouseRace}, they will expect a tribute of significant value."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1488@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You seek to negotiate peace with the nefarious {EventHouseLord.Title}, {EventHouseLord.Name}. Your strenuous war with {EventHouse} has gone on long enough."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1488@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The concept of peace is all but alien to the {EventHouseRace}, who are habitually inclined to inflict pain and incite strife in the shadowed plains of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. {EventHouseLord.Name} observes you, intrigued by your request. \"[runicfont]Peace?[/runicfont]\" <<Co:EventHouseLord>> guttural cackle makes you wonder if you should feel offended.."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1488@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "Continue your vow to destroy them."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1488@TITLE"
msgstr "A Precarious Truce"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1491@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Whatever you seek to gain from your covenant with {EventHouse}, {GLOBAL.UmbralDwellingConcept.Hyperlink} customs expect a willing sacrifice, lest you antagonize them."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1491@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You receive troublesome word from {EventHouseLord.TitleName} of {EventHouse.Name}. A hunger grows within the {EventHouseRace} that requires sating."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1491@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Yet this hunger is not driven by famine. They crave a blood-letting. A precious offering, given freely and willingly, that they may consume. Taking delight in the destruction of something you hold dear. Such is the way of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1491@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Make them pay for their impertinence. [war/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1491@TITLE"
msgstr "Eldritch Hunger"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1492@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The creatures cautiously await a response. A bribe shan't make these umbrous guards leave. That will require something more... vicious."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1492@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your army approaches a {EventStructure.Name}, they discover that the shadowy shapes of warriors from {EventHouse} already occupy the landmark."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1492@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Despite the darkness, the {EventStackLeader} has spotted your troops long before they could even discern the silhouette of the {EventStructure.Name}. Your warriors hear the unnerving murmurs of the Umbral creatures. \"[runicfont]Food[/runicfont],\" asks one. \"[runicfont]Likely[/runicfont],\" responds the {EventStackLeader}, <<o:EventStackLeader>> maw twisted into some sort of ghastly grimace."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1492@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "\"Their eldritch reign ends here!\" [war/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1171_1492@TITLE"
msgstr "Shadowy Encounters"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The shadows push you to find yourself, to find what defines you. It is important. You are important. Who were you? How were you trapped?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You slumber. There is nothing, only darkness. You cannot move. Who are you? Who were you? It does not matter..."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Then, the darkness shifts and something nudges your mind. Its touch is dark and cold, but gentle. It pushes you to remember, to wake up. The shadows shift and an image forms: a mighty {PlayerLeader.Title}. Is that you? The image changes, showing a cage. It disturbs you, but you are not sure why... Are you trapped?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "I was bringing order to the realms, but was betrayed. [Order/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "I was looking for a new challenge... It won. [Chaos/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_10"
msgstr "I was defeated and became Lost in the Void. Something... found me."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "I was looking for knowledge at the edge of the Astral Sea... I found it. [Arcana/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "I was bringing life to forgotten worlds... but found myself drained. [Nature/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "I was looking for riches to uncover... But my greed was my downfall. [Matter/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "I was uncovering secrets that were hidden in the darkness... I found this. [Shadow/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "(Dragon) I was forming new realms in my image... But was pulled into the darkness."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "(Ascended Champion) I was leading my people towards new horizons... But was captured."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "(Wizard King) I was searching for ways to enhance my power... But I found only doom."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@BUTTON_9"
msgstr "(Eldritch Ruler) I remember nothing of my past life, if I had any. Perhaps... I was born here."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_224@TITLE"
msgstr "Eldritch Prison"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_229@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The man realizes he is in the presence of a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and quickly bows. \"You are {PlayerLeader.TitleName}, are you not? We must go. It is not safe here.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_229@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The memory fades, but the disturbing feeling remains. You become aware that you cannot move your body. You struggle against the eldritch chains that dare to bind you."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_229@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Then you hear the echo of a voice. Vague at first, then louder. \"...certain this is <<P:PlayerLeader>>? Be careful!\"[br/]Light pierces through the darkness around you as you break from your prison. You blink against the light as a man gazes up at you. \"Torches be praised. <<Cp:PlayerLeader>> is with us!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_229@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Very well. We should go.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_229@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Where am I?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_229@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Who are you?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_229@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Why should I join you?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_229@TITLE"
msgstr "Awakening"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_244@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Umbral Demons lurk around us, and the Wardens of {RealmName} have eyes everywhere. We must find sanctuary.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_244@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You ask where you are, and the man answers: \"You are in the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept]Umbral Abyss[/hyperlink] of {RealmName}, a realm long forgotten by the light of creation.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_244@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{RealmName} is a prison realm and breeding grounds for {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, ruled by two ruthless Wardens. You, like many of us, are imprisoned here. You breaking from your {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} brings us hope... but we need much more than hope to be free again.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_244@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Who are you?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_244@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Why should I join you?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_244@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Very well. We should go.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_244@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Umbral Demons?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_244@TITLE"
msgstr "{RealmName}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_245@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"There are others like us throughout the realm. But they need a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept} to unite and lead them.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_245@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The man grins and bows with a quick flourish. \"My name is {RogueHero.FirstName}, {RogueHero.LastName} to some.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_245@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Like many, I was imprisoned by the rulers of {RealmName}, then enslaved, and forgotten. I managed to break my chains, only to realize that the realm itself is but another cage. I vowed to claim my freedom and found other kindred souls. We made plans upon plans of liberation... But we lack the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept]spark[/hyperlink] to make it happen. This is why I went looking for someone to lead us.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_245@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Where am I?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_245@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Why should I join you?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_245@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Very well. We should go.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_245@TITLE"
msgstr "The Syron Thief"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_246@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We have searched long for a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} who can lead us to freedom. I certainly hope our search ends today.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_246@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The man grimaces. \"Why join us? If anything, you are as trapped here as the rest of us, O {PlayerLeader.Title}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_246@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I was led here by your {PlayerRace}, who joined us after escaping their bonds, and convinced us of your potential. You broke from your {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but I have also seen enough {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} fall to corruption to know that without us, you will not make it out of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept]Umbral Abyss[/hyperlink], nor {RealmName}, no matter what powers you alone possess.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_246@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Where am I?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_246@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Who are you?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_246@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Very well. We should go.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_246@TITLE"
msgstr "Revolution"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_248@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"One can only leave the Umbral Abyss through <<m:{EventStructure}>>. I have marked the one I used before, O {PlayerLeader.Title}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_248@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You move to start your travels, but {RogueHero.FirstName} stops you for one more moment. \"We are currently in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, a place that poisons the body and mind.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_248@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You will find that remaining here for long is lethal, even for a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. We should leave, fast, but my enterprising nature obligates me to share that many treasures are hidden in the darkness. In my experience it pays to be cautious, but opportunistic.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_248@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Onwards, then.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_248@TITLE"
msgstr "Safe Haven"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_249@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I was asked to escort you to our haven. Please, follow me. Your people await.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_249@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You step through the {EventStructure} and feel a breeze of cold air. {RogueHero.FirstName} breathes in deeply. \"We made it.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_249@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You feel as though a weight is lifted from your shoulders. Looking back, you notice a shift in the darkness behind you, as if your very shadow is relieved to be free from the corruption of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Before you can investigate further, {RogueHero.FirstName} digs into a pile of rocks to reveal a bag of gold and crystals. \"We cannot rest yet, the Wardens of {RealmName} patrol the realm.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_249@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Very well, point me there.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_249@TITLE"
msgstr "Out of the Abyss"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_255@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"It pays to destroy them sooner rather than later... But we currently barely have the power to defend ourselves, let alone to take the battle to the source.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_255@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you move through the oppressive darkness of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {RogueHero.FirstName} stops you. \"Be wary,\" <<p:RogueHero>> whispers. \"We approach a {EventStructure}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_255@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This one slumbers, but it is heavily guarded and if we linger in its territory, we will surely be attacked. I snuck past when I searched for your prison. Over time, it will grow and expand its influence.\" {RogueHero.FirstName} glares at the writhing nest at the edge of your vision."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_255@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will keep that in mind.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_255@TITLE"
msgstr "Slumbering Corruption"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_256@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{RogueHero.FirstName} bows with a flourish. \"Your throne awaits, O {PlayerLeader.Title}. Get settled, for tomorrow the true fight for our freedom begins.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_256@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Through a passage between mountains you enter a strangely welcoming sanctuary. Barren ashlands and <<m:EventGate>> make way for forests and a city, hidden in a valley."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_256@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "As you wander further, you see people emerge from hiding spots, some of whom you recognize as your very own {PlayerRace}. They gather excitedly as you approach. \"We provide sanctuary for any wandering soul,\" {RogueHero.FirstName} explains. \"Your people are resilient and loyal. They helped turn our haven into a city, and notified me of your prison. Your arrival gives them hope.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_256@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim your city and your throne."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_256@TITLE"
msgstr "Safe Haven: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_263@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"<<m:SanctuaryStructure>> will take some time and resources to build, but the rewards are considerable. Who knows, you may yet conquer the darkness itself!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_263@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you continue your journey through the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, you see a light in the distance. {RogueHero.FirstName} looks up and smiles. \"A {SanctuaryStructure}!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_263@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Sanctuaries like these help one remember that light exists, even in the darkest depths of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. They can only be built on top of beacons of light. I asked some of us to build one whilst we searched for your prison, they must have finished it recently. Claiming these yields many rewards, including respite from the {ShadowSickness}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_263@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Very well.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_263@TITLE"
msgstr "Beacon of Light"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_281@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"To truly liberate our people, we must open the {EventStructure}. It is the only way to freedom.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_281@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After settling in your newly found capital {EventCity}, you are once again approached by {RogueHero.FirstName}. \"Greetings, O {PlayerLeader.Title}. I hope you find our sanctuary accommodating.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_281@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You will find many of your people here are escaped prisoners of {RealmName}. Through time, we have gathered here, building up our strengths, protected by a mountain ridge the Wardens of {RealmName} rarely traverse. We gathered information about a hidden {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, used by the Harbinger of Urrath herself not long ago. With you, we have hopes to claim it and see the light again.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_281@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will find and open this World Gate. Tell me how.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_281@TITLE"
msgstr "Gate of Tharru'Cath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You, {RogueHero.FirstName}, and all the other allies you found along the way step through the {WorldGateWonder}. The {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} awaits!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@BODY_FOOTER@WERLAC_PATH"
msgstr "You step through the {WorldGateWonder}, leaving the despairing allies you betrayed behind."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You made your way to the {WorldGateWonder}, and your people eagerly await your blessing to step through."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@BODY_HEADER@WERLAC_PATH"
msgstr "The prisoners of {RealmName} await your blessing to step through the {WorldGateWonder}... But then you release its control to {Werlac.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "On the precipice of victory, {RogueHero.FirstName} joins you. \"I have learned many things during my imprisonment on {RealmName}. The {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has grown in the shadows, evolving through the corruption of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Lithyl Nightweaver has left with a considerable host of {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, threatening {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. I must warn my people of this invasion. But for now, the sweet scent of freedom awaits beyond the {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@BODY_LORE@WERLAC_PATH"
msgstr "Shocked, the prisoners of {RealmName} see {Werlac.FirstName} almost dismissively signal {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to attack. As you look back at the resulting carnage, you see one face in the crowd, fuming with hatred: {RogueHero.FirstName}. He shouts something at you, but it does not matter. {Werlac.FirstName} smiles slyly as you pass <<P:Werlac>>: \"Have fun in {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {PlayerLeader.Title}. The Harbinger of Urrath can use an ally like you.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Onward!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@BUTTON_0@WERLAC_PATH"
msgstr "The Astral Sea awaits!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@TITLE"
msgstr "{RealmName} Victory: To the Stars"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_300@TITLE@WERLAC_PATH"
msgstr "{RealmName} Victory: Burning Bridges"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_302@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"It is a pity to see your potential go to waste. If only you had joined the right side of history...\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_302@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Perhaps surprisingly, you meet an Elf who is not in chains. In fact, {Werlac.TitleName} seems to control many guards on this realm."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_302@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<Cp:Werlac>> appraises you. \"So this is the face of the rebellion my scouts warned me about. It is unfortunate to meet under these circumstances, but as a Warden of {RealmName} I can not allow insurrection. Soon, you and all the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizard Kings[/hyperlink] who dismissed me will be nothing but a thrall under the rule of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and I.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_302@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I will fight for my freedom if I must.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_302@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Wait, perhaps we can come to an agreement...\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_302@TITLE"
msgstr "The {Werlac.Title}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_304@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Cease your struggle. Harmony awaits. Surrender your mind to us, or fade into oblivion.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_304@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have heard the dreaded {InsectoidRace} of {RealmName} chitter about. Now, you meet their leader, the {Insectoid.Title}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_304@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{Insectoid.TitleName} speaks with hisses and clicks. \"We have heard of the escaped prisoner who brings dissonance to our harmony. Return to your {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and join us after your glorious metamorphosis. You will become one with us and Urrath, and we will please {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and His Harbinger. The trill of our exaltation will resonate within the entire {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_304@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I will fight for my freedom if I must.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_304@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I am looking to join you in the glory of Urrath. Please, allow me to join your hive.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_304@TITLE"
msgstr "The {Insectoid.Title}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_319@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "By defeating {Werlac.Name}, you have claimed the necessary knowledge about the {EventStructure} to the {WorldGateWonder}. Some of his former followers even kneel before you and ask to join you."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_319@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Werlac.TitleName} was defeated. His cult followers scatter, suddenly insecure about their future on {RealmName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_319@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "One of the {WerlacRace} speaks up. \"By besting our {Werlac.Title}, did this {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} not prove <<p:PlayerLeader>> is worthy of our reverence? Will it not be the {PlayerLeader.Title} who leads us to our rightful glory?\" The {EventUnit} leads you to Werlac's treasury. \"Please, O {PlayerLeader.Title}, take whatever you please. May {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} bless your prowess!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_319@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Anyone is free to join [population/] the right side of history.\" [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_319@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"You may leave, but you will not be forgiven [influence/] for how you treated the prisoners of Tharru'Cath.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_319@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"You will die as entertainment [happiness/] for the people you imprisoned.\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_319@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"Prove yourself by fighting on my side.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_319@TITLE"
msgstr "Shadowborn Undone"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_321@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your troops turn to you as the {InsectoidRace} flee, lost without their hive mind. \"What should we do with them, O {PlayerLeader.Title}?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_321@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have defeated the insectoid armies of the {Insectoid.Title} of {RealmName}. <<Co:Insectoid>> voice echoes through the last of <<o:Insectoid>> fallen armies as they scatter."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_321@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We are but one of many tendrils of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. We will return to his embrace, where we will be reborn anew. Then you will see what a fool you are to fight the inevitable.\"[br/]As the voices fade, you notice magic reverberates through them. The secret about the {EventStructure} to the {WorldGateWonder}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_321@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Leave them be. They are of no importance.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_321@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Squash them [unitprod/] like the insects they are.\" [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_321@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Catch [unitprod/] and study [knowledge/] them. Their connection to Urrath may be of use.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_321@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"Catch [unitprod/] them and put them to work [production/] in our city. They seem obedient enough.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_321@TITLE"
msgstr "The {Insectoid.Title}: Defeated"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_345@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{RealmName} is under your control and your victory is secured. Do you uphold your pact with {Werlac.TitleName}?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_345@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have conquered the prison realm of {RealmName}. With the realm under your control, freeing your allies and opening the {WorldGateWonder} becomes trivial."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_345@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You lead your people through the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and valiantly assault the {WorldGateWonder}. At its precipice, however, you are approached by none other than {Werlac.TitleName}. You made a deal with <<P:Werlac>> and <<p:Werlac>> expects you to uphold it. The agreement was this: your freedom, for control of the {WorldGateWonder}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_345@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Deny {Werlac.FirstName}, free {RealmName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_345@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Uphold your pact: give control of {RealmName} to {Werlac.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_345@TITLE"
msgstr "{RealmName} Victory: A Shadowborn Deal"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_365@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "GO for it"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_365@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Now you can go to the World Gate"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_365@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Good luck"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_365@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "I will"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_365@TITLE"
msgstr "Collected all Parts"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_368@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I heard you are looking for the {WorldGateWonder}. As a war-drone, I was tasked with guarding the potential locations of its connected {EventGate}. I would join the liberation of {RealmName}, if you would have me.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_368@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have fought your way to the mysterious defector of the {InsectoidRace}. <<Cp:BattleHero>> lowers her {BattleHeroWeapon} when <<p:BattleHero>> notices you."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_368@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You- you are {PlayerLeader.TitleName}?\" <<Cp:BattleHero>> wipes ichor from <<o:BattleHero>> brow. \"Thank the hive, I thought I would die here. They call me {BattleHero.FirstName}. I was a war-drone for the {Insectoid.Title}, until my head was smashed in and I stopped hearing the song of the hive. I realized the truth about {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and what His corruption does to my people.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_368@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Join me and we will fight for freedom.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_368@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I have no use for {InsectoidRace}. Share your information and leave.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_368@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting the {BattleHero.Title}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_377@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Lastly, only the Wardens of {RealmName}, {Werlac.Name} and {Insectoid.Name}, know how to open the {EventStructure} to the {WorldGateWonder}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_377@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{RogueHero.FirstName} laughs awkwardly. \"Unfortunately, both the location and means to activate the {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are currently unknown to us... But we know where to learn more.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_377@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Our legends speak of an elusive wizard, who traveled here long ago. His fate is unknown, but he may have left knowledge behind. Next to that, we have heard rumors of desertion within the ranks of the {Insectoid.Title}; they may prove informative allies. Furthermore, we have heard of a prisoner who was used to control the {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_377@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will investigate these leads.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_377@TITLE"
msgstr "Finding the World Gate"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_378@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{RogueHero.FirstName} points to the distance. \"We have all we need to open the {EventStructure} to the {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Please, {PlayerLeader.Title}, lead us to freedom.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_378@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have collected everything necessary to activate the {WorldGateWonder}. You are once again joined by {RogueHero.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_378@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This is the closest I have ever been to being free from this wretched realm. I must contain myself to not celebrate before we step through, but oh, I can already feel the sun on my face...\" {RogueHero.FirstName} sighs. \"More and more people break their chains and gather in {EventCity}, their stories echo through {RealmName}. They have faith, {PlayerLeader.FirstName}, in you.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_378@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"To the {WorldGateWonder}!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_378@TITLE"
msgstr "Finding the World Gate: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_384@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I am no stranger to the call of this Abyss. I will not give in.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_384@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You encounter an echo of the wizard who resided here. As his magic nestles in your mind, you see the shadowy reflection of a wizened human man."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_384@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I find myself in the oppressive darkness of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} once more, something I sacrificed everything to avoid. But I must reacquaint myself, if only to save her. I must find her. If not in my name, then the name of the fallen King Saridas, and her daughter who fought so valiantly in her name.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_384@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue your search."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_384@TITLE"
msgstr "Scattered Memory: Return to the Abyss"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_386@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The image fades, with a last thought. \"I hear whispers as I rest, even with my protective wards. Yet, I worry only for her...\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_386@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You find another echo of the elusive wizard, in front of a {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. He is interrogating the being within."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_386@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I managed to make contact with Lithyl Nightweaver, the invader of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. I confirmed it was she who killed Saridas... and took Julia. I can sense her madness. To know that Sundren herself captured this monster fills me with pride. But, as time and space shift around us, I realize this Lithyl Nightweaver is the only hope I have for freeing Julia.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_386@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue your search."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_386@TITLE"
msgstr "Scattered Memory: Fallen Herald"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_388@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If there is a chance for Julia to return, must I not take it? Lithyl was defeated before, surely I can do so again.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_388@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You find another echo of the elusive wizard. His thoughts become more and more desperate. \"Lithyl is toying with me.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_388@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"With all my might, I cannot break her. Even the {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} seems to only empower and feed her madness. Meanwhile, I am tormented by visions of Julia, trapped in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}... Lithyl only smiles.\"[br/][br/]\"Perhaps I can offer a pact... Julia's freedom, for Lithyl's. I would be a fool to suggest it, but...\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_388@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue your search."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_388@TITLE"
msgstr "Scattered Memories: Pact of Corruption"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_393@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cg:Expression^n,Werlac>> turns cold. \"Our pact, {PlayerLeader.FirstName}. Hand the {WorldGateWonder} to me, and I will grant you and your {PlayerRace} your freedom.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_393@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You enter the {EventStructure} into the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, to make your way to the {WorldGateWonder}. A familiar voice contacts you, however, heard by all others in your realm."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_393@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The {PlayerLeader.Title} of Tharru'Cath, So eager to claim <<o:PlayerLeader>> freedom...\" {Werlac.TitleName} says. \"Did your allies really think it was this easy? We made an agreement, remember?\"[br/]{RogueHero.FirstName} speaks up. \"What is that snake talking about? What agreement?\"[br/]{Werlac.FirstName} laughs heartily. \"The naive {RogueHero.Title} of {RealmName}, of course <<p:RogueHero>> does not know.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_393@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Honor the deal you made with {Werlac.FirstName}, betray the prisoners of {RealmName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_393@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Refuse to give up the {WorldGateWonder}, break your pact with Werlac."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_393@TITLE"
msgstr "A Deal is a Deal"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_394@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I will pry control of the {WorldGateWonder} from your void-cursed hands, if it is the last thing that I do. I am not letting you leave. Curse you and your name, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_394@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You honor your deal with {Werlac.Name}, and hand over any control of the {WorldGateWonder} to him. {RogueHero.FirstName} approaches, fuming. \"How could you?!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_394@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I thought you a savior, a hero, a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to revere! I would have followed you through the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and back, and you- you sold us. You sold me, and my freedom. I will never forgive you.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_394@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_394@TITLE"
msgstr "Betrayal"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_395@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You will grant me control of the {WorldGateWonder}, by choice or by force.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_395@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You deny {Werlac.FirstName} his due of the deal you made. <<Cp:Werlac>> smiles coldly. \"Unfortunate. But not unexpected.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_395@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{Werlac.FirstName} scoffs. \"I bent the entire ruling class of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to my will, did you really think you could outmaneuver me so effortlessly? If you refuse to uphold our covenant, I will force your hand.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_395@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_395@TITLE"
msgstr "Trust and the Untrustworthy"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_397@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Incite your rebellion. Then, when you are at the precipice of escape, you will hand control of the {WorldGateWonder} to me. I will crush the resistance of {RealmName}, and grant you and your {PlayerRace} your freedom.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_397@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Werlac.FirstName} chuckles. \"A deal? What would you have to offer me? Unless...\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_397@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Yours is not the first insurgence I have had to hunt down. The embers of revolution have proven very elusive—especially to those witless {InsectoidRace}, and I know my strengths lie beyond direct confrontation. You, it seems, have gathered the rebellion around you. Impressive, and useful. I can order my {WerlacRace} to be blind to your... mischief.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_397@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Sounds like a deal, {Werlac.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_397@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I would be a fool to trust one like you. I decline.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_397@TITLE"
msgstr "Douse the Embers"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_400@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You step through the {WorldGateWonder}, leaving the despairing allies you betrayed behind."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_400@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your allies eagerly await your blessing to step through the {WorldGateWonder}... But then you release its control to {Werlac.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_400@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Shocked, the prisoners of {RealmName} see {Werlac.FirstName} almost dismissively signal {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to attack. As you look back at the resulting carnage, you see one face in the crowd, fuming with hatred: {RogueHero.FirstName}. He shouts something at you, but it does not matter. {Werlac.FirstName} smiles slyly as you pass <<P:Werlac>>: \"Have fun in {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {PlayerLeader.Title}. The Harbinger of Urrath can use an ally like you.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_400@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "The Astral Sea awaits!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_400@TITLE"
msgstr "{RealmName} Victory: Burning Bridges"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_401@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You, {RogueHero.FirstName}, and all the other allies you found along the way step through the {WorldGateWonder}. The {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} awaits!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_401@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You made your way to the {WorldGateWonder}, and your people eagerly await your blessing to step through."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_401@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You have learned many disturbing things during your imprisonment on {RealmName}. The {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has grown in the shadows, evolving through the corruption of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Lithyl Nightweaver has left with a considerable host of {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, threatening {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. But for now, the sweet scent of freedom awaits beyond the {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. With you as their {PlayerLeader.Title}, your {PlayerRace} can overcome everything, even the Umbral Abyss itself."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_401@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Onward!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_401@TITLE"
msgstr "{RealmName} Victory: To the Stars"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_410@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.MaerLoreConcept.Hyperlink} residing within the {EventStructure} has been corrupted by the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Something, or someone, needs to interrupt their song."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_410@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you draw near the {EventStructure}, you feel a humming resonate within you. An eerily beautiful song draws you in."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_410@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "In the shadows, you see the floating movements of a graceful being with a long tail. It almost looks like a mermaid... It lures you in, invites you into the darkness. Any attempts to communicate are cut short as the being suddenly screams in frustration, and you, too, feel their pain. They are trapped here, and something festers inside them."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_410@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"If we must fight you to free you, we will!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_410@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Flee the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_410@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Protect your troops [mana/] from her corrupted song."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_410@TITLE"
msgstr "Song of Corruption"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_411@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{MageHero.FirstName} sighs. \"Thank you, for severing me from {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Once, I used my song to open the {WorldGateWonder}. I can do so again, for you.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_411@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have defeated the {GLOBAL.MaerLoreConcept.Hyperlink} within the {EventStructure}. <<Cp:MageHero>> sinks to the ground, <<o:MageHero>> song turning to sobs."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_411@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<Cp:MageHero>> speaks softly, hugging <<r:MageHero>>: \"Long ago I met a wizard, wandering the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, searching for his lost love. I guided him to the answer: a monster called Lithyl... He freed his love, and lost himself. I helped his Elven queen to escape, but I was captured... My song, twisted... I never saw either of them again.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_411@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I can use a Maer like you on my side.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_411@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You should find a place to hide until the World Gate is open.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_411@TITLE"
msgstr "Song of Corruption: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_413@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your path to freedom is blocked only by {EnemyUnit} and <<o:EnemyUnit>> troops."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_413@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.HeroConcept]<<EventHero{hero/heroine}>>[/hyperlink] {EventHero.FirstName} enters the {WorldGateWonder}, an ancient structure that was once built by the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_413@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You enter the {WorldGateWonder}, an ancient structure that was once built by the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_413@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Remarkably untouched by the corruption of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, its latent magic hums through any who enter. As {EventHero.FirstName} approaches the dormant {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in its center, however, <<o:EventHero>> path is blocked by {EnemyUnit}. With a grim expression, <<p:EnemyUnit>> readies <<o:EnemyUnit>> weapon. Any chance of negotiation has passed."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_413@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Remarkably untouched by the corruption of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, its latent magic hums through any who enter. As you approach the dormant {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in its center, however, your path is blocked by a {EnemyUnit}. With a grim expression, <<p:EnemyUnit>> readies <<o:EnemyUnit>> weapon. Any chance of negotiation has passed."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_413@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"None will stand in my way! Attack!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_413@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_413@TITLE"
msgstr "The {WorldGateWonder}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_414@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Finally, the {WorldGateWonder} is in your hands, and freedom awaits."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_414@BODY_FOOTER@WERLAC_PATH"
msgstr "Finally, the {WorldGateWonder} is delivered to {Werlac.TitleName}, and your freedom awaits."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_414@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have defeated the final resistance at the {WorldGateWonder}. Without further thought you move past them."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_414@BODY_HEADER@WERLAC_PATH"
msgstr "You have defeated {EnemyUnit}. As <<p:EnemyUnit>> sinks to <<o:EnemyUnit>> knees, you pass <<P:EnemyUnit>> and move to the {WorldGateWonder}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_414@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Through all you have learned, you recite the incantation {MageHero} has taught you. An arcane humming fills the halls around you as the {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink} activates. Recalling the echoes of the wizard of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, you set its destination, {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Energies of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} converge as the World Gate opens."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_414@BODY_LORE@WERLAC_PATH"
msgstr "Through all you have learned, you teach {Werlac.FirstName} the incantation {MageHero} has taught you. An arcane humming fills the halls around you as the {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink} activates. Recalling the echoes of the wizard of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, you recite its destination, {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Energies of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} converge as the World Gate opens."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_414@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim your freedom."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_414@TITLE"
msgstr "The {WorldGateWonder}: Opened"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_427@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "It seems like you will have to fight your way to the possible defector of the {InsectoidRace}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_427@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "When your troops enter the oppressive darkness of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} once more, you hear the sounds of battle in the distance."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_427@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It is too dark to see, but you can hear the screeches of what sounds like [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept]Umbral Demons[/hyperlink] fighting... other Umbral Demons? This must be the desertion within the ranks of {Insectoid.TitleName}, that {RogueHero.FirstName} spoke of."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_427@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Nothing will stand in the way of my freedom."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_427@TITLE"
msgstr "The {BattleHero.Title}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_432@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Collecting the echoes of the elusive wizard may provide information on the {WorldGateWonder}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_432@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your troops enter the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, they feel shivers running down their spines. Powerful magics linger here."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_432@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "One of your troops returns from the darkness and reports a broken {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in the middle of a spiraling landscape. Around it, traces of powerful magic can be seen, shimmering in the dark. \"We could not interpret the magics, my {PlayerLeader.Title}, but they seem to be echoes of the wizard who traveled here.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_432@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will piece this story together.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_432@TITLE"
msgstr "Scattered Memories"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_443@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Some Umbral Demons gather in city-like dwellings. My people say they can even be communicated with, though I never tried.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_443@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"You don't know what {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are?\" The man frowns in disbelief. \"I suppose you were caged for a long time...\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_443@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Umbral Demons are corrupted monsters, twisted through the prolonged influence of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. I believe they were once known as Shadow Demons.\"[br/]You notice a shift in the darkness nearby, almost as if it is angered by these words. The man does not seem to notice and continues: \"Umbral Demons devour any bane you place on them. But they fear light, fire, and the power of spirit.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_443@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Where am I?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_443@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Who are you?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_443@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Very well. We should go.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_443@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Why should I join you?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_443@TITLE"
msgstr "Umbral Demons"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_454@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I saw the way Julia looked at me as she fled. Can't she see? All I did was for her... I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm so sorry...\"[br/][runicfont]Embrace Urrath, Merlin. Give into your darkness.[/runicfont]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_454@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You find the final echo. The thoughts are rushed and barely coherent. \"I was a fool to think I could outplay {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_454@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"As I freed Lithyl, I realized my mistake. Julia, forgive me, I doomed us all. Already I sense our location shift, and I can feel [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]Urrath[/hyperlink] in my mind like I did the All-Devourer, tearing at my memories, searching for secrets of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}... No. I will not let it. I will shatter my mind before Urrath claims it.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_454@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Dig deeper into the corruption. [runicfont]Gaze into the Abyss.[/runicfont]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_454@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Memorize the knowledge of World Gates and shake off the corruption on your soul."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_454@TITLE"
msgstr "Shattered Memories: [runicfont]Into the Void[/runicfont]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_459@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{RealmName} is under your control and your victory is secured."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_459@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have conquered the prison realm of {RealmName}. With the realm under your control, freeing your allies and opening the {WorldGateWonder} becomes trivial."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_459@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You lead your people through the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and valiantly travel to the {WorldGateWonder}. {RogueHero.FirstName} approaches you. \"Freedom awaits, O {PlayerLeader.Title}. I admit, I did not expect you to make it this far. I must rejoin my people so we can continue our fight against {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. But know that you made an ally here, today.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_459@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"To the {WorldGateWonder}!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_459@TITLE"
msgstr "{RealmName} Conquered"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_468@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{RogueHero.FirstName} was wounded, but has escaped death. It will take some time for <<P:RogueHero>> to regain <<o:RogueHero>> strength."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_468@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{RogueHero.Name} was defeated in battle under your command!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_468@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Through effort, luck or something else entirely, <<p:RogueHero>> managed to survive the onslaught and made it back to safety. <<Cp:RogueHero>> coughs before wiping the dirt of <<o:RogueHero>> tunic. \"I have withstood many hardships on {RealmName}. It shall not claim me yet.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_468@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "So be it."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_468@TITLE"
msgstr "{RogueHero} Defeated"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_481@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The shadows around you deepen as you feel the dark presence intensify. Do you reach out, or do you recoil?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_481@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your quest for the {WorldGateWonder} progresses. As the days pass, you cannot shake the feeling that you are being watched."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_481@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You often have to suppress the urge to look behind you. Is it the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, affecting your mind? Or is it something more?[br/][br/]One night whilst you are alone, the darkness seems even deeper than before. The scent of death and decay weighs on you like a suffocating blanket."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_481@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Gaze into the darkness, ignoring any feeling of discomfort."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_481@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "The shadows are no stranger to me, I welcome them."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_481@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Ignore the feeling, you are above silly superstition."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_481@TITLE"
msgstr "Dark Presence"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_482@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You realize you stand before an avatar of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Endailon[/hyperlink] of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowConcept]Shadow[/hyperlink]. Cold, deathly tendrils reach out to you. You..."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_482@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Dark energies coalesce in your shadow as it rises above you. The pressure of mortality weighs heavy on you, even as a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_482@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You realize this is the presence that has been with you from the start, since you were locked inside your {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. It shifts, showing you a vision of tendrils from beyond the void, corrupting death, decay and rebirth. A force beyond darkness, beyond [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowConcept]Shadow[/hyperlink]. You whisper its name: {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and the entity shimmers in cold frustration. It cannot fight that which taints its very essence. But you can."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_482@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "...Accept its blessing in your fight against Urrath. [knowledge/] [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_482@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "...Reject its influence."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_482@TITLE"
msgstr "Vision of Shadows"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_549@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Werlac.FirstName} smirks. \"Soon you will be forgotten, like all the others who attempted to thwart me before.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_549@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Werlac.FirstName} gazes upon you with pure disdain. \"{GLOBAL.WarConcept} it is.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_549@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You are not the first 'chosen one' I have needed to crush, nor will you be the last. Do you really think I allowed you to roam around freely? My spies are everywhere. I think it is time that they emerge.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_549@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Have at thee!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_549@TITLE"
msgstr "Wrath of the Shadowborn"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_584@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Be careful, {PlayerLeader.Title} {PlayerLeader.FirstName}. The Umbral Abyss changes any being within. Let us hope this prisoner is not fully lost, yet.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_584@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your troops enter the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} through the {EventStructure} that should lead to the imprisoned being mentioned by {RogueHero}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_584@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Immediately, you notice a haunting melody, echoing through the darkness. Your troops are pulled towards the center of the area, some even need to be restrained from swimming across the waters. \"It is rare to find water in the Umbral Abyss,\" {RogueHero.FirstName} says. \"If this being was truly used to open the {WorldGateWonder}, they must be powerful.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_584@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Investigate the area."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_584@TITLE"
msgstr "A Haunting Melody"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "This bastion of light was overrun by darkness. Its corrupted inhabitants screech as they approach from the shadows..."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero.Name} comes across the ruins of a castle in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, which show signs of a terrible war long past."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You come across the ruins of a castle in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, which show signs of a terrible war long past."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "There is no way this was built by {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. As {EventHero.FirstName} studies an etching of a ritual in the broken wall, <<p:EventHero>> realizes this was once a bastion for the {GLOBAL.SyronLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of old, who stood against the darkness of the Umbral Abyss until it overwhelmed them. Abandoned weapons and the signs of battle scar the hallways."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "There is no way this was built by {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. As you study an etching of a ritual in the broken wall, you realize this was once a bastion for the {GLOBAL.SyronLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of old, who stood against the darkness of the Umbral Abyss until it overwhelmed them. Abandoned weapons and the signs of battle scar the hallways."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We will hold this fortress! To arms!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Invoke the Syron ritual to protect your army against the darkness."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Flee the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"By the creed of the {PlayerLeader.Title}, we shall hold fast!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Use your connection to the shadow to strengthen your troops against it."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "[runicfont]Feed, brothers[/runicfont]—Appease the Umbral Demons through a sacrifice of thralls. [thralls/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_622@TITLE"
msgstr "Fallen Bastion"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} picks up the object and the gloom of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} lessens. <<Co:EventHero>> army stands in awe, awaiting orders."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You pick up the object and the gloom of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} lessens. Your army stands in awe, awaiting orders."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After dealing with the {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {EventHero.FirstName} and <<o:EventHero>> army investigate the ruins further."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "After dealing with the {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, you and your army investigate the ruins further."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Deep within the {EventStructure}, more details about what could have been the final moments of the battle are revealed. As the onslaught of {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} continued, the <<m:{GLOBAL.SyronLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> were driven further into the bastion. At the scene of the Syrons' final stand, {EventHero.FirstName} finds an object, untainted by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept]Umbral Corruption[/hyperlink]. It shimmers in the dark, emitting a faint, warm light."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Deep within the {EventStructure}, more details about what could have been the final moments of the battle are revealed. As the onslaught of {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} continued, the {GLOBAL.SyronLoreConcept.Hyperlink} were driven further into the bastion. At the scene of the Syrons' final stand, You find an object, untainted by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept]Umbral Corruption[/hyperlink]. It shimmers in the dark, emitting a faint, warm light."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take everything you can. [gold/]. The fallen have no use for it."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Share your victory and the spoils with the realm. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Study [knowledge/] the history of the Syrons and their ancient protections."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "The fallen shall serve me, one way or the other. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Honor the fallen Syrons through an ancient funeral rite. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_623@TITLE"
msgstr "Fallen Bastion: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The Cage of Binding seems to be the source of arcane energies running through the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As {EventHero.Name} travels through the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, shadows make way for a looming {EventStructure}, its pinnacle covered by darkness."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "As you travel through the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, shadows make way for a looming {EventStructure}, its pinnacle covered by darkness."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventHero} ventures inside, and quickly notices chaotic energies, coalescing in the center of the spire. There, an eldritch being slumbers, neither dead nor alive, captured in a {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in an unending state of un-being. A prison, or an abandoned experiment? {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} gather around the cage, feeding on its arcane energies."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You venture inside, and quickly notice chaotic energies, coalescing in the center of the spire. There, an eldritch being slumbers, neither dead nor alive, captured in a {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in an unending state of un-being. A prison, or an abandoned experiment? {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} gather around the cage, feeding on its arcane energies."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Free the eldritch being, prepare for battle!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Use your knowledge of the arcane to weaken the eldritch being before freeing it."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Leave the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Use your knowledge of the arcane to weaken the eldritch being before freeing it."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "[runicfont]You are safe[/runicfont]—Invoke a Rite of appeasement before opening the Cage."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_624@TITLE"
msgstr "Dark Arcana"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I thank you for freeing me from my prison. I have much to atone for. Anything you ask, I will provide.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero.Name} freed the caged Eldritch Sovereign, and after a moment of rage and confusion, <<p:EnemyUnit>> rises once more."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You freed the caged Eldritch Sovereign, and after a moment of rage and confusion, <<p:EnemyUnit>> rises once more."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"After all my attempts, it takes a {PlayerLeader.Title} to free me from the grasp of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}... I apologize for my rage. A {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, it does things to the mind. Long ago, I attempted to make a deal with dark forces. Soon, I realized my mistake... but when I attempted to break free, I was captured in this cursed cage.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ask {EnemyUnit} to bind some Umbral Demons to your will."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Use the Cage of Binding once more to drain and kill {EventUnit}. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Ask {EventUnit} to spread the word of your deeds, here. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Your freedom is the only reward I need.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_625@TITLE"
msgstr "Dark Arcana: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_708@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you leave the strange monsters to their terrorizing or attack them?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_708@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your troops move to attack the {EventStackLeader.Name} and <<o:EventStackLeader>> collection of {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the enemy squeals and submits."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_708@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Undulating flesh and writhing tentacles weave around in a grotesque show of panic while your weapons surround the group of eldritch horrors from the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. While terrifying in aspect, these beings seem to have no fight in them. At least not for you..."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_708@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Put them down!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_708@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Allow them to flee and spread their terror in a rampage across the realm. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_708@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Satiate their hunger [mana/] so they will not harm anyone and allow them to flee. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_708@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "[runicfont]Join me[/runicfont] - Claim them as your thralls. [thralls/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@1194_708@TITLE"
msgstr "Umbral Submission"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Stories of charmed people straying into the mists and disappearing spread as an evil rumor. Ere long, there may be no one left to defend."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_FOOTER@FINAL_RAID"
msgstr "To the dismay of your {PlayerRace}, even this terrifying song is charming the people, leading them outside the walls to a gruesome fate."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the {EventRace} lay siege to {EventCity}, an uncanny song creeps into the streets and homes of the {PlayerRace}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Come, our children, come out to play[br/]To {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} we stride with glee[br/]No last escape, no place to flee[br/]The {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} on rainbow's ends[br/]Open their mouths, raise their hands[br/]Forever you will stay\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_LORE@FINAL_RAID"
msgstr "\"Come, naughty children, come out to cry[br/]From {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} you took with grief[br/]Our {EventRelicName}, accursed thieves[br/]Your own {EventBodyPart} we will tear out, mangle[br/]Grind down, carve up, gouge and strangle[br/]Forever you will die\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_LORE@ILANDRA_WAKING_SLEEP"
msgstr "\"Wake now, children, open your eyes[br/]The Fey would never tell you lies[br/]Follow us through the mist[br/]Where pain and grief cease to exist[br/]Embrace there, children, do not weep[br/]Our Slumbering Queen's eternal sleep.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_LORE@LUTH_AERIAL"
msgstr "\"Come, children, you have naught to fear[br/]There is a land, far from here[br/]Swiftly brought on winds of cheer[br/]To {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, where none shall hear[br/]Your screams and cries that ring out clear[br/]In darkness you will die, my dear.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_LORE@RAVEN_THARIC"
msgstr "\"Little children, Tharic calls[br/]Leave your beds, leave your halls[br/]Join the children of Raven[br/]{GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is their haven[br/]Better to follow {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink}[br/]Lest your end is nigh.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BODY_LORE@VENTROGH_DEVOURER"
msgstr "\"Heed our voices, hear our song[br/]In {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} you belong[br/]Beyond the veil, we attest[br/]There's a party, you're the guest[br/]Brought before the wicked beast[br/]When it kills you, we will feast!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I trust my troops to end this siege in time!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Let us open the gates [siegehealthdamage/] to lure the {EventRace} into our defensive lines!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Fey magic is a curious enigma... to study and suppress.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I am the only one whose whispers may mess with the minds of my subjects!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Within these mighty walls [garrison/], no one shall get in or out!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6030@TITLE"
msgstr "Alluring Voices"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Looking behind, you reflect on the hardships on the journey to Arcalot."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Arcalot, at last! Through clashing front lines and spreading Umbral darkness you have guided your {EventRace} into the eye of the storm."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The hastily erected city of {EventCity} is a testament to the {EventRaceTrait} of your people and a much welcomed shelter. Indeed the area it is overlooking appears to be surprisingly quiet and devoid of {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}—too quiet perhaps. It is a golden opportunity for everyone to rest before pressing onward towards {EventPlayer.FirstName} and her eldritch forces."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We battled our way [xp/][hp/] through waves of Umbral Demons.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"We were ambushed by a powerful Eldritch Sovereign and I wrested secret knowledge from her.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"We found hidden passages under the deep shadows of the mountains.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"We sacrificed many to rescue a fellow Godir [unitHero/] in need.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"[runicfont]Humans, Elves, Umbral Demons—they are all thralls![/runicfont]\" [thralls/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6072@TITLE"
msgstr "A Moment of Respite"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} is the general of this invasion. When you finally meet <<P:EventPlayer>>, there will be more at risk than the Battle for {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} itself."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While your people establish themselves in {EventCity}, your gaze already turns northwards, to the heart of the invasion."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "There, at the shores of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, where the Elves once arrived on this world, {EventPlayer} is preparing her eldritch ritual to plunge {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} into darkness. Surrounded by large Umbral hosts and the overwhelming presence of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, reaching {EventPlayer.FirstName} will be perilous. You must learn more about <<o:EventPlayer>> ritual and scout ahead before charging in."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"She is the herald of Urrath's corruption and must be smote [unitprod/] in the name of the Archons!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Her powers are admirable, but she lacks respect for the established Godir [mana/] of Magehaven.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"She brought death to my people, and I vow [influence/] to avenge them!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Seeking her out can be deadly, but bears a promise of immense rewards [gold/].\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"[runicfont]We are one in the eyes of Urrath.[/runicfont]\" [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6073@TITLE"
msgstr "Shadow of the North"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Realizing that the fate of this world dangles on a string, your Astral Flows within pulsate violently, threatening to burst open. You channel their raw powers, summoning..."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have encountered all {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} fighting for Arcalot. While you contemplate the cosmic forces at play, a magic tension is slowly charging your body."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{Lithyl} is sacrificing thralls to power up <<o:Lithyl>> eldritch rite. In this <<p:Lithyl>> is aided by {Merlin.FirstName}, who has become an instrument of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and its Umbral corruption. Through their ritual they seek to poison the {EventStructure} and corrupt the very essence of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "...a {NatureUnit}. [nature/][unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "...a {ChaosUnit}. [chaos/][unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "...a {OrderUnit}. [order/][unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "...a {AstralUnit}. [arcana/][unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "...a {MateriumUnit}. [matter/][unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "...a {ShadowUnit}. [shadow/][unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "[runicfont]A denizen of greatest malice![/runicfont][unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6078@TITLE"
msgstr "Shadow of the North: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6111@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Before we speak of the darkness ahead, may I hear who so valiantly fought their way into this valley?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6111@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"This one doesn't seem to be growing any tentacles yet, {EventPlayer.LastName}...\" –a distant voice echoes down the {EventGeo} {EventDirection} {EventCity}, before a middle-aged man clad in kingly garments comes into focus."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6111@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Well met, friend! I am {EventPlayer} of the {GLOBAL.CovenantFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and this is {Meandor.TitleName}.\" <<Cp:EventPlayer>> introduces <<o:EventPlayer>> partner, a Dark Elf. \"We are glad to see another {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} make it through.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6111@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I am {PlayerLeader.TitleName}, honored to meet you.\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6111@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Meet {PlayerLeader.TitleName}, bane of the Covenant!\" [relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6111@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"My name is of no interest to strangers in war.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6111@TITLE"
msgstr "March of the Covenant"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6117@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Until we can overcome <<ge:defenses^p,{Lithyl.FirstName}>> we may only delay the ritual by destroying <<o:Lithyl>> thralls before they can be sacrificed.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6117@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Your fondness for pleasantries in this pressing hour is astonishing, {EventPlayer.LastName}.\" {Meandor.FirstName} interrupts the conversation."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6117@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Urrath's grasp on Arcalot is strong, {PlayerLeader},\" <<p:Meandor>> says, turning to you. \"Everyone in the valley who is not protected by the might of a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has fallen to the Umbral corruption. {Lithyl.FirstName} is harvesting thrall after thrall to power her eldritch ritual. Soon <<p:Lithyl>> will be ready.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6117@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"They lost their souls to the Umbral Abyss.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6117@TITLE"
msgstr "Lost Souls"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6165@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The foul ritual of {Lithyl.Name} must be stopped,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} concludes <<o:EventPlayer>> introduction, \"for the sake of all forevermore.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6165@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The astral projection of a flying dove announces the peaceful arrival of {EventPlayer.TitleName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6165@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"May the light of the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink} shine upon you in this hour of darkness, brave Athlans,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} says with a gentle bow. \"Long ago, when my people had dwelt in uttermost enthrallment, we found allies on this world to fight alongside till death and victory. Such an oath of friendship shall now be renewed.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6165@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue to listen."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6165@TITLE"
msgstr "A Candle in the Dark"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6167@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"First, we only heard that the war of the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is not going well,\" {Meandor.FirstName} says. \"Now we are busy fighting the living proof.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6167@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"{EventPlayer.FirstName}!\" the energetic call of {Meandor.Name} is heard from afar. \"You are late.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6167@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"And you have changed,\" <<p:Meandor>> adds, eying {EventPlayer.FirstName} from top to bottom. \"When did the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} convert you? A pity, I always liked your arcane pragmatism. Though I suppose it can help me gain some answers. It has been a long time.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6167@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue to listen."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6167@TITLE"
msgstr "Reunification"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"There is an old pilgrim's path of the {GLOBAL.GloomwatchLoreConcept.Hyperlink} well inside the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of Arcalot. Those who dare to walk it, can find a torch to burn away <<ge:darkness^n,{Lithyl.FirstName}>>.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"The {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} responds, \"did not convert us, old friend. They are our brothers and forebears; our allies and adversaries; our avengers and judges.\" <<Cp:EventPlayer>> smiles. \"It is complicated.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"In the days of the All-Devourer my enslaved kin had lost even the knowledge of their own legacy. When we turned from hunted to hunters there was much to unveil.\" {EventPlayer.Name} turns pensive for a moment as if <<p:EventPlayer>> is reliving the journey of the {EventRace}.[br/][br/]\"We are part of the {GLOBAL.GloomwatchLoreConcept.Hyperlink} now, tending the {GLOBAL.DreamersLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and protecting them from {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the declared enemy of all life.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Only a truthful soul can reveal such path into light.\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"We need more than pilgrim's weapons [unitprod/] to defeat the eldritch hordes of Urrath.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"What you describe sounds shady at best. I will investigate and watch my back!\" [relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"A pilgrim's path inside the Umbral Abyss? You have my attention.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"[runicfont]Your presence is insulting, serf.[/runicfont]\" [thralls/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6171@TITLE"
msgstr "The Flame of Revelation"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6172@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventTome} appears to have chosen to reveal itself to you. Does it judge you worthy? Do you judge it worthy?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6172@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Still deep in thought, you are startled by a sudden burst of fire at the ground below the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6172@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Investigating the source, you find a heavy book, inscribed with runes of burning zeal, still smoldering like a Fireforge Stone. It is the {EventTome}! How and why it was hidden here in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} remains a mystery, but it clearly demonstrates the past exchange of knowledge and magic between the {GLOBAL.GloomwatchLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6172@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take the {EventTome}.[knowledge/] It is made to fight the Gloom!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6172@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Use the {EventTome} as an offering [knowledge/] to the true fire-masters of Obbadoth!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6172@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Reject the {EventTome}. Your faith preaches protection, not destruction [goodact/]."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6172@TITLE"
msgstr "The Flame of Revelation: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6183@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"{Lithyl.FirstName} is defiling my kindred's forgotten heritage. I feel it in the bleeding earth, hear it from the weeping trees. Soon <<o:Lithyl>> ritual will be complete.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6183@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Enshrouded within a swarm of butterflies, the graceful figure of {EventPlayer} offers <<o:EventPlayer>> aloof welcome."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6183@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The leaves are falling rapidly this season,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says, a glint of sorrow resonating in her voice. \"Only this winter may last until all sylvan wonders have perished, no return. Is that not so, {PlayerLeader}?\"[br/][br/]Then, turning to {Meandor.Name}, <<p:EventPlayer>> continues: \"It should be no surprise to see your kind arrive second in Arcalot, when the {GLOBAL.ShadraiFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink} have already dented the enemy lines. Be it Storm Cult, Wizard's Circle, or {GLOBAL.CovenantFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, you unerringly choose the feeble side, {Meandor.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6183@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Await <<ge:reaction^n,Meandor.FirstName>>."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6183@TITLE"
msgstr "Withering Glory"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6184@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you indeed put a dent in the enemy lines, {EventPlayer},\" {Meandor.FirstName} concludes, \"let us press onward together, instead of lamenting the loss of a battle not fought.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6184@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Your ability to unsee the long list of {GLOBAL.ShadraiFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink} failures is astonishing,\" {Meandor.FirstName} replies bluntly. \"But let's leave these arguments aside while we have a common enemy to fight.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6184@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"There must be truth in your words about Elven secrets still buried in Arcalot. Talic's reports of old always left me unsatisfied, though I should not be too surprised after what happened to Raven Tharic.\" For a moment {Meandor.FirstName} stops, as if lost in thought, <<o:Meandor>> mental wards allowing a rare glimpse of <<o:Meandor>> tired mind.[br/][br/]\"If it must be,\" <<p:Meandor>> continues, firmly again, \"we will dig up any remaining mud of House Inioch's past. Whatever it takes to stop {Lithyl.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6184@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Indeed, the Shad'rai are the ones who will see this war through!\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6184@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Our enemy's enemies must be our friends, for now...\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6184@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Trusting a Shad'rai? I'd rather feed my hand to a hungry Magebane.\" [relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6184@TITLE"
msgstr "Truces and Truths"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6188@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Give in to my calling, give in to the whispers inside.\" <<Cge:words^p,EventPlayer.FirstName>> boom violently in your head: \"Together we will reshape the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6188@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With an otherworldly voice, ear-splitting and terrible, {EventPlayer} foretells the beginning of Urrath's Age."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6188@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Halt in awe, people of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and gaze at Urrath's splendor!\" <<p:EventPlayer>> calls out, revealing <<o:EventPlayer>> true, eldritch form. \"For you too shall be relieved of your mortal flesh and remade in the image of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}! I have witnessed the corruption of Magehaven's {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Their petty conflicts will cease to plague the realms once all {GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are one with Us.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6188@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Shut out the voices and pick up arms."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6188@TITLE"
msgstr "The Harbinger of Urrath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6234@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {Alfred.Title} of the {EventRace} raises the {EventItem}: \"Tonight we burn the Umbral hells!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6234@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Hear my oath, accursed witch, defiler of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\" the trembling shout of {Alfred.Name} can be heard."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6234@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I pledge myself to the destruction of the Abyss[br/]To smite the Umbral[br/]To incinerate the Gloom[br/]Until the spawn of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} turn to ashes[br/]And the leech seeds of corruption are expunged!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6234@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Join the battle for Arcalot."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6234@TITLE"
msgstr "A Champion Unleashed"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6242@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"When it is done, there will be no more pain.\" The mental grip of {EventPlayer.Name} chokes your consciousness. \"Bow down to {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Inside the Void, the promise of infinite peace resides.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6242@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"So many ambitions. So much suffering.\" Two sorrowful eyes invade your mind, constricting and eclipsing your very thoughts."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6242@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Aye, young apprentice,\" the voice beyond the eyes continues, while a grizzled hooded figure slowly comes into focus. \"Your arrival grieves me for I was once not unlike you. Despair not, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}. All things come to an end.\" From underneath the robe long tenacious tentacles emerge, clutching at the fabrics of your innermost fears."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6242@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Unable to break free you await your doom."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6242@TITLE"
msgstr "Into the Cosmos Never More"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6246@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"My strength is dwindling. I cannot ward the {EventStructure} forever.\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} shrouds <<r:EventPlayer>> in a veil of glistening foliage. \"Best the storm, {PlayerLeader}! Save {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6246@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Spare us your false wisdom, old man!\" A flourishing burst of energy rejuvenates your mind as {EventPlayer} spreads <<o:EventPlayer>> wings in defiance of {Merlin.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6246@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Your tainted roots have not yet reached {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and neither will they claim {PlayerLeader}!\"[br/][br/]The {EventPlayerType} turns to you. \"The situation is dire, {PlayerLeader.Title} of the {EventRace}. {Merlin.Name} and {Lithyl.Name} seek to enter the {EventStructure} and poison {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in dark communion. {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is dear to me. She restored my children after Urrath's wrath had laid waste to this world in ages past. She must not die.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6246@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"It will be my honor to fight side by side with an Elder Dragon.\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6246@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Today we join forces for Athla's sake!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6246@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I don't need the aid of a glorified lizard to reach my goals!\" [relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6246@TITLE"
msgstr "The Touch of the Grovetender"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6257@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"To break their eldritch ritual, both {Lithyl.FirstName} and {Merlin} must be cast [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept]into the Void[/hyperlink],\" {EventPlayer} concludes. \"Enter the {EventStructure} to lend your strength to {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {PlayerLeader}! Kindle the light within!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6257@BODY_FOOTER@NO_ONERON"
msgstr "To break their eldritch ritual, both {Lithyl.FirstName} and {Merlin} must be cast [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept]into the Void[/hyperlink]. Only then may {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} be saved from this invasion of Urrath's design."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6257@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Keeping calm in this baleful hour is no easy feat, is it, {PlayerLeader}?\" {EventPlayer} approaches you with a knowing smile."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6257@BODY_HEADER@NO_ONERON"
msgstr "In this baleful hour, you are reminded of <<g:words^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>> about the {GLOBAL.GloomwatchLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the {GLOBAL.DreamersLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6257@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We of the {GLOBAL.GloomwatchLoreConcept.Hyperlink} have a saying: from the darkest nights the brightest candles are drawn.\" {EventPlayer} uncoils an enchanted map depicting the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. \"This,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> points at a flowing well at the center, \"is the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. And these\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} gestures towards a number of chalices spread across the map, \"are the {GLOBAL.DreamersLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. They are the children of the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the {GLOBAL.GloomwatchLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has given them service throughout the ages.\"[br/][br/]Eventually {EventPlayer.FirstName} puts <<o:EventPlayer>> finger on a chalice seething with foul ooze: \"This is {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. The poison of {Lithyl} is drowning her in nightmares. If we don't hurry, she will die.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6257@BODY_LORE@NO_ONERON"
msgstr "To {EventPlayer}, {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} seemed to be more than just a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept]World Within[/hyperlink]. When <<p:EventPlayer>> spoke, it had an almost intimate connotation as if {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} was like a person {EventPlayer.FirstName} loved and served. Given the circumstances it seems wisest to seek out the {EventStructure} yourself. To find answers—and to delay {Lithyl} in <<o:Lithyl>> vile ritual, if you can."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6257@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Understood!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6257@TITLE"
msgstr "Gloom and Glory"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6258@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the Umbral darkness languishes, you slowly realize that it is truly over. The battle for Arcalot and {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is won!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6258@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The earth itself groans and the winds sigh in relief as the eldritch grasp of Urrath's generals on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is lifted."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6258@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With {EventPlayer} banished and {Merlin} fled in madness into the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the Nightweaver Ritual has been broken and the poisoning of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} averted in time. You can sense the gratitude of the {EventThrallCount} souls that escaped being consumed as a twisted thrall sacrifice. The free people in Arcalot rejoice and praise the names of the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} who ended the abyssal onslaught."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6258@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "The tales of this victory will be told in the ages to come."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6258@TITLE"
msgstr "Gloom and Glory: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6267@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The fight must be taken into the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept]Umbral[/hyperlink],\" {EventHero.FirstName} continues. \"I know the ways to strike {EventPlayer.FirstName} where it hurts. You have the troops...\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6267@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The world around you falls silent, and deep shades shroud your vision. Before you can react, a cold metal blade is pressed against your throat."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6267@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You better not move!\" a voice whispers in the darkness and an ice-cold hand touches your temple. \"You still seem to be yourself, {PlayerLeader}. Good.\"[br/][br/]The blade is withdrawn and the sleek figure of {EventHero} reveals <<r:EventHero>>, still holding {EventItem}. \"From the night without end I have returned to lend my aid in this hour of Athlan doom,\" {EventHero.FirstName} says with a subtle greeting gesture."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6267@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept <<g:help^n,EventHero.FirstName>>. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6267@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Ask {EventHero.FirstName} to return to <<o:EventHero>> shadows."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6267@TITLE"
msgstr "Return from the Shadows"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6278@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"What {Merlin.FirstName} knew, we may never learn,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} concludes <<o:EventPlayer>> monologue. \"But now <<o:Merlin>> knowledge is aiding the enemy. All invaders must die.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6278@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"{Merlin.FirstName}!\" <<g:cry^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>> reveals genuine sadness. \"Why, old friend? Did I guide you through death to watch you become this?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6278@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The aged prince of House Inioch murmurs and gestures as if <<p:EventPlayer>> is mourning the dead. Then {EventPlayer.FirstName} opens <<o:EventPlayer>> eyes again, still deep in thought. \"Arcalot, the {EventStructure}—what fools we have been! Diluting our own history. Falling into the ancient web of my father's lies. During the Mending, all Elves gathered in Arcalot. Julia and Saridas channeled the magic of the {EventStructure}. They should have seen it. I should have seen it!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6278@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Leave {EventPlayer.FirstName} to <<o:EventPlayer>> thoughts."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6278@TITLE"
msgstr "Elven Flashbacks"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6288@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the Umbral darkness languishes, you slowly realize that it is truly over. The battle for Arcalot and {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is won!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6288@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The earth itself groans and the winds sigh in relief as the eldritch grasp of Urrath's generals on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is lifted."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6288@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With {EventPlayer} banished and {Merlin} fled in madness into the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the Nightweaver Ritual has been broken and the poisoning of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} averted in time. You can sense the gratitude of the {EventThrallCount} souls that escaped being consumed as a twisted thrall sacrifice. The free people in Arcalot rejoice and praise the names of the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} who ended the abyssal onslaught."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6288@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "The tales of this victory will be told in the ages to come."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6288@TITLE"
msgstr "Gloom and Glory: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6309@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I will await you in the darkness, {PlayerLeader}!\" {EventPlayer} grows fleshy tendrils to lash at a new-forming Umbral gate, but you sever <<o:EventPlayer>> grasp."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6309@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the Harbinger of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is overpowered by mortal weapons and magic blasts, <<o:EventPlayer>> broken body is kept alive by powerful dark magic."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6309@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You cannot escape corruption!\" {EventPlayer} shrieks, while <<o:EventPlayer>> shattered limbs perform one last macabre dance. \"The voice of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} whispers in every shadow. Its ceaseless embrace stirs every water, soaks every realm. From the darkest depths of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept]arcane currents[/hyperlink] wash its tangled nightmares ashore.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6309@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Banish {EventPlayer} into the Astral Void."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6309@TITLE"
msgstr "Back to Oblivion"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6311@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "In the blink of an eye, {EventPlayer} tears open an astral rift and vanishes into the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Yet <<o:EventPlayer>> last words still resonate in your mind: \"Life is a fallacy. Nothingness is eternal.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6311@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In the face of certain obliteration, {EventPlayer} shows no sign of fear, only sorrow."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6311@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Existence is pain,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> utters slowly, and you notice your own heart grow heavy. \"Why must you all prolong it?\" A feeling of cold isolation creeps down your spine. You can't shake off the thought that this must be what the erstwhile leader of Evermore's Wizard's Circle is feeling deep inside as the only human emotion left. <<Cp:EventPlayer>> truly is a lost wizard."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6311@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "While <<g:escape^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>> is troublesome, it won't endanger the purging of Arcalot."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6311@TITLE"
msgstr "The Lost Wizard"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6312@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} is performing an eldritch rite to bind {Serena} to Urrath's will."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6312@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Words of evil enchantment echo down the mountain slopes surrounding Arcalot. It is the voice of {EventPlayer}, calling upon {Serena}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6312@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Stand still, {Serena.Title} of the {EventRace}.[br/]Listen to the whispers inside.[br/]Embrace Urrath's gift; the seed you have carried since the Second Age.[br/]I have sensed you for long, {Serena.FirstName}.[br/][runicfont]Join Us, join your kindred souls![/runicfont]\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6312@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Observe the outcome, unable to intervene."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6312@TITLE"
msgstr "Eldritch Rite of Corruption"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6313@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I look at the Umbral, and I can see its natural beauty. To spread its tangled forests and nurture its sorrowful birdsong will be my life's work.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6313@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With clear agony on <<o:EventPlayer>> face, {EventPlayer} becomes wrapped in eldritch lashes. When <<o:EventPlayer>> body becomes visible again, <<p:EventPlayer>> is tainted by the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6313@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I hear you, sister, herald of the one truthful voice,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} says, opening her eyes again. \"Since the touch of the All-Devourer, I had walked as if in a false dream. [runicfont]Only now, my destiny is fulfilled.[/runicfont]\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6313@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.FirstName} has lost <<o:EventPlayer>> sanity. <<Cp:EventPlayer>> is with the enemy now."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6313@TITLE"
msgstr "The Mark of the All-Devourer"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6322@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} is performing an eldritch rite to bind {Alfred} to Urrath's will."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6322@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Words of evil enchantment echo down the mountain slopes surrounding Arcalot. It is the voice of {EventPlayer}, calling upon {Alfred}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6322@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Champion of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, temper your hatred.[br/]Since we met, our fates have been intertwined.[br/]Though called adversaries, we have much in common.[br/]The unity you seek I found and propagate.[br/][runicfont]In Urrath's embrace, everyone will act as one.[/runicfont]\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6322@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Observe the outcome, unable to intervene."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6322@TITLE"
msgstr "Eldritch Rite of Corruption"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6323@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The accumulated fire vortex of the {EventItem} is discharged as a lightning bolt of holy flame. In the distance, the surprised cry of {Lithyl} echoes the rumbling thunder."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6323@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With clear agony on <<o:EventPlayer>> face, {EventPlayer} becomes wrapped in eldritch lashes. Then, a sudden burst of flame casts the dark tendrils aside and {EventPlayer.FirstName} reappears, fiery and furious."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6323@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Burn in hell, insidious locust!\" <<p:EventPlayer>> shouts, shrugging off the eldritch ashes still lingering on <<o:EventPlayer>> body. Then <<p:EventPlayer>> raises the {EventItem} and inflames its hilt, the flame slowly growing towards the blade's tip. \"This one is for my parents!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6323@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "It is time to bring down the {Lithyl.Title}!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6323@TITLE"
msgstr "A Champion's Defiance"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The corruption of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} binds {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in nightmares. You can sense her powers dwindling as the glowing shapes—her thoughts?—are fettered by the eldritch lashes."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Going down the winding stairway beyond the bark of the {EventStructure}, you become surrounded by an otherworldly light, first dim, then ever more intense until you lose perception of anything else."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "As if in a vision, you begin to make out moving, blurry, shapes within the yellow glow: Creatures, people, monumental structures building up and moldering again within instants, short glimpses of forming landscapes. You cannot say whether these ever shifting images are Athla's dreams, memories or previsions of the things to come.[br/][br/]Suddenly, you start noticing black glistening tentacles, hunting the shapes, constricting and strangling anything they can reach. Their dark tangle sprawls violently, threatening to eclipse all light."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Offer your arcane wealth [mana/] to strengthen Athla."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Bond with Athla [nature/] through the deep roots of the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Banish as many of the eldritch lashes with your arcane might [arcana/] as you can."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Nourish Athla with your very own astral [hp/] essence."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Leave the {EventStructure}. You can return later."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6327@TITLE"
msgstr "Athla, the Dreamer"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6330@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The shrine's voice falls silent, leaving you to ponder its words in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6330@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the base of the first {EventStructure}, an ancient stone tablet rests. While examining its engravings, the following message resonates in your mind:"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6330@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"In the Days Before, the {GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept.Hyperlink} raged and the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} waged their war. When the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept]World Prison[/hyperlink] was built, Irith of the Scrying Fountain foresaw the aftermath of {GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept.Hyperlink} exile and it was ill. For from nothingness the great [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]Nemesis of the Archons[/hyperlink] would be born. Yet few of her kinsmen heeded her warning.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6330@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue on the pilgrim's path."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6330@TITLE"
msgstr "The Plate of Foresight"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6335@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The shrine's voice falls silent, leaving you to ponder its words in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6335@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the base of the second {EventStructure}, an ancient stone tablet rests. While examining its engravings, the following message resonates in your mind:"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6335@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Condemned by the High Council, the disciples of Irith went into hiding. At last they were found, and their judgment was near. But behold! Irith called upon the mercy of the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and her people grew fishtails and fins of pure aether, escaping into the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Henceforth they were called the {GLOBAL.MaerLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6335@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue on the pilgrim's path."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6335@TITLE"
msgstr "The Plate of Transformation"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6336@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The shrine's voice falls silent, leaving you to ponder its words in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6336@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the base of the third {EventStructure}, an ancient stone tablet rests. While examining its engravings, the following message resonates in your mind:"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6336@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The shadows of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]the great Nemesis[/hyperlink] spread, and hence the {GLOBAL.MaerLoreConcept.Hyperlink} wept unceasing, and their tears deepened the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. They prayed to the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, pleading for a means to fill the Void from whence the Nemesis came. The {GLOBAL.MaerLoreConcept.Hyperlink} upheld prayers for 100 cycles. Until the coming of the {GLOBAL.DreamersLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6336@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue on the pilgrim's path."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6336@TITLE"
msgstr "The Plate of the Advent"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6337@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The shrine's voice falls silent, leaving you to ponder its words in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6337@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the base of the fourth {EventStructure}, an ancient stone tablet rests. While examining its engravings, the following message resonates in your mind:"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6337@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"In their service and protection of the {GLOBAL.DreamersLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the {GLOBAL.MaerLoreConcept.Hyperlink} were bound to the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Yet they knew [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]the great Nemesis[/hyperlink] would threaten the Allfather's children both from the sea and on land. Thus they gathered in large numbers and Irith performed a ritual of great magnificence such that from every second Maer new legs would sprout. Sundered from their brethren, yet still united within the {GLOBAL.GloomwatchLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, these {GLOBAL.SyronLoreConcept.Hyperlink} walked the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6337@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue on the pilgrim's path."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6337@TITLE"
msgstr "The Plate of Sundering"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6338@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The shrine's voice falls silent, leaving you to ponder its words in the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6338@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the base of the last {EventStructure}, an ancient stone tablet rests. While examining its engravings, the following message resonates in your mind:"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6338@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We {GLOBAL.SyronLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of Athla's Ward share one oath: to nourish her dreams, fend off nightmares, ease her slumber. To fight [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]the great Nemesis[/hyperlink] and burn all fruits of its corruption. This we pledge to the {GLOBAL.GloomwatchLoreConcept.Hyperlink} with our lives—which we forfeit when our word is broken.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6338@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Conclude your pilgrimage of the Gloomwatch."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6338@TITLE"
msgstr "The Plate of Vigil"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6339@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowConcept]Shadow[/hyperlink] engraves the words of a dark incantation in your mind. \"Use this. Remove the Umbral pests.\" Its presence fades and {EventHero.FirstName} returns."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6339@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} gasps as shadows pour from <<o:EventHero>> mouth, and <<o:EventHero>> body shifts into a dark, spectral state. When <<p:EventHero>> speaks, <<o:EventHero>> voice is no longer <<o:EventHero>> own."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6339@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Then let us not waste more time.\" The entity possessing {EventHero.FirstName} moves <<o:EventHero>> hand like a puppet, conjuring the shadow image of an {EventStructure}. \"This infestation,\" it sighs with the voice of a thousand dead, \"must be purged. All vermin must die. The servant of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} will lose focus. We shall be untainted.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6339@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "While {EventHero.FirstName} regains <<o:EventHero>> senses, you prepare your troops for the Umbral Abyss."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6339@TITLE"
msgstr "Unholy Union"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6341@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Spurts of flame turn <<g:body^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>> to ashes. Yet you can sense <<o:EventPlayer>> soul wandering off to the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6341@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The cities of {EventPlayer} are smoking in Gloom. <<Co:EventPlayer>> people, the {EventRace}, lie slain or enthralled. Yet {EventPlayer.FirstName} will not yield."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6341@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Remember this day,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> shouts, \"when the {EventPlayer.Title} fell. When the other brave {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} picked up <<o:EventPlayer>> torch and pushed back the Umbral darkness.\" <<Cg:skin^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>> starts to char with black scars smoldering on <<o:EventPlayer>> face. \"While you fight, {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} can have no victory!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6341@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "The battle for Arcalot is not over yet!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6341@TITLE"
msgstr "The Broken Champion"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6343@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With a light movement of <<o:EventPlayer>> hands, {EventPlayer.FirstName} reduces <<r:EventPlayer>> to dust. It seems clear that <<p:EventPlayer>> will try to return to {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6343@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Acknowledging the overwhelming odds, {EventPlayer} lowers <<o:EventPlayer>> guard."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6343@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The Umbral darkness is growing. {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} hungers for {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Soon it could be over...\" The Prince of Shadows looks tired, worn and <<o:EventPlayer>> powers depleted. \"It is true that there can be mercy in permanent death.\" <<Cp:EventPlayer>> examines <<o:EventPlayer>> aged wrists. \"Sadly, I cannot allow myself this luxury yet.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6343@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "One day, <<o:EventPlayer>> desire for death shall be fulfilled."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6343@TITLE"
msgstr "The Fall of {EventPlayer.FirstName}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6345@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The light intensifies, until a bright flash takes {EventPlayer} from this world. You cannot dare say if <<p:EventPlayer>> left or died."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6345@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the darkness creeps up on {EventPlayer}, ready to devour <<o:EventPlayer>> soul, the {EventPlayer.Title} of the {EventRace} prays."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6345@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Forgive me, {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, for failing in your defense. [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]The great Nemesis[/hyperlink] was too strong. He is poisoning your dreams. I know he can't corrupt you, but he will kill you.\" {EventPlayer} becomes engulfed in light, a lone beacon within utter blackness. \"Keep resisting! There are others still fighting the shadows, let your dreams guide them to a new dawn!\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6345@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Athla may yet be saved."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6345@TITLE"
msgstr "The Fall of {EventPlayer.FirstName}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6347@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Entwined in <<o:EventPlayer>> own vegetal shelter, {EventPlayer.FirstName} leaves this world; a lone flower adorning <<o:EventPlayer>> tomb."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6347@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Within tainted grass and shriveling trees, the blooming powers of {EventPlayer} fade away."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6347@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Alas! I weep for this world, for its meadows and forests, its moorlands and jungles. And I weep for you, {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, beloved bringer of fauna and flora.\" The {EventPlayerType} of Nature spreads <<o:EventPlayer>> wings, spanning a dome around <<o:EventPlayer>> colossal body. Rampant vines start sprouting from the ground, quickly overgrowing the dome."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6347@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Even the <<m:EventPlayerType>> fall before Urrath."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6347@TITLE"
msgstr "The Fall of the Grovetender"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6349@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cg:tears^p,EventPlayer.FirstName>> disperse into the air, forming a mist clinging to <<o:EventPlayer>> slender figure. At last <<p:EventPlayer>> vanishes within, departing like a true Fey."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6349@BODY_FOOTER@JOINED_UMBRAL"
msgstr "Black tentacles lash out from the ground beneath {EventPlayer}, forming an {EventStructure}. They clutch the fallen {EventPlayerType}, violently dragging <<P:EventPlayer>> into the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6349@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In <<o:EventPlayer>> hour of doom, assailed by horrid nightmares, {EventPlayer} comes to <<o:EventPlayer>> senses."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6349@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"So many lies. So much treason.\" The {EventPlayer.Title} of the {EventRace} hides <<o:EventPlayer>> face in <<o:EventPlayer>> hands. \"Inioch, the All-Devourer, {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}—I have been but a pawn in their games of power. I sowed scorn, hatred, and vengeance. I thought myself a blessing, was I the blight instead?\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6349@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.FirstName} has paid for <<o:EventPlayer>> past wrongs, doubly so."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6349@TITLE"
msgstr "The Fall of {EventPlayer.FirstName}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6352@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<g:glaive^n,EventHero.FirstName>> {EventItem} pulses with shadow magic, releasing a dark surge that cleanses the surrounding gloom. Where it has passed, the area glitters with frost mist and deep shades shroud your vision."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6352@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} surrounding the destroyed {EventStructure} are cast into oblivion, {EventHero} steps from the shadows, murmuring a dark incantation:"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6352@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Night to night.[br/]Shadow to shadow.[br/]The taint of gloom[br/]Dispersed in Netherice.[br/]To restore the darkness silent.\""

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6352@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Marvel at the sight of the natural shadow plane."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6352@TITLE"
msgstr "Shadow Purge"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6411@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "It is clear that the {GLOBAL.UmbralDwellingConcept.Hyperlink} is under the influence of {EventPlayer} and {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} itself. They will show no mercy until all of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has succumbed to their swarm."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6411@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"[runicfont]Only Urrath is eternal. The people of Athla will fall![/runicfont]\" The {EventHouseLord} utters what can only be words of menace and mockery. The countless eyes of the {GLOBAL.UmbralDwellingConcept.Hyperlink} seem to watch every single step inside their dark domain, while its teeth and spikes crawl on many limbs to prey upon the victims of their corruption."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6411@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Vow to destroy them! [rs_war/] [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6411@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Their powers are intriguing, but their invasion must end! [rs_war/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6411@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"[runicfont]My brethren walk in darkness.[/runicfont]\" [rs_war/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@991_6411@TITLE"
msgstr "Harbinger's Hive: {EventHouse}"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@BOOST_ALLEGIANCE@CANCEL"
msgstr "Do nothing for now."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@DENY_HUNGER@BUTTON"
msgstr "Offer nothing."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@GREATER_SACRIFICE_WAR_HOUSE@BUTTON"
msgstr "Indulge them by declaring war on {EventHouse2.Name}. [rs_war/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@GREATER_SACRIFICE_WAR_PLAYER@BUTTON"
msgstr "Indulge them by declaring war on {EventPlayer2.Name}. [rs_war/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_FLESH@BUTTON"
msgstr "Make a sacrifice of flesh. [population/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_GLORY@BUTTON"
msgstr "Make a sacrifice of glory. [warspoils/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_NOTHING@BUTTON"
msgstr "Do nothing. [rs_war/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_POWER@BUTTON"
msgstr "Make a sacrifice of power. [mana/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_SOULS@BUTTON"
msgstr "Make a sacrifice of souls. [souls/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_THRALLS@BUTTON"
msgstr "[runicfont]Mine for yours[/runicfont] - Make a sacrifice of thralls. [thralls/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_WAR_HOUSE@TOOLTIP"
msgstr "You will declare {GLOBAL.WarConcept.Hyperlink} on {EventHouse2.Name}!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_WAR_PLAYER@TOOLTIP"
msgstr "You will declare {GLOBAL.WarConcept.Hyperlink} on {EventPlayer2.Name}!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@SACRIFICE_WEALTH@BUTTON"
msgstr "Make a sacrifice of wealth. [gold/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@VOW_OF_DESTRUCTION@PREDICTION"
msgstr "You will be permanently at {GLOBAL.WarConcept.Hyperlink} with the {GLOBAL.UmbralDwellingConcept.Hyperlink}!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_EVENT@WAR_DWELLING@PREDICTION"
msgstr "You will be at {GLOBAL.WarConcept.Hyperlink} with the {GLOBAL.UmbralDwellingConcept.Hyperlink}. You can make a sacrifice later to enter a truce."

