msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@TRIGGER_TOOLTIP@RITUAL_INFO_2"
msgstr "For every {IntCount} thralls destroyed [libthrall/], the ritual is delayed by 1 {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@TRIGGER_TOOLTIP@SERENA_CORRUPTION"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.Name} joins the Umbral {GLOBAL.DSAllianceConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@TRIGGER_TOOLTIP@SERENA_COVENANT"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.Name} and the {GLOBAL.CovenantFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink} gain +{IntBuff}[relationLvl3/] {GLOBAL.EmpireRelationConcept.Hyperlink} with each other."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@TRIGGER_TOOLTIP@SHADOW_ARMY"
msgstr "You gain a moderately sized army of frosty creatures."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@TRIGGER_TOOLTIP@SHADOW_ARMY_BUFF"
msgstr "You gain a large army of frosty creatures."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@TRIGGER_TOOLTIP@SUNDREN_RITUAL_DELAY"
msgstr "The Nightweaver Ritual is delayed by {IntDuration} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}>>."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@TRIGGER_TOOLTIP@WORLD_TREE_RITUAL_REVEAL"
msgstr "When {Merlin.Name} or {Lithyl.Name} control the {EventStructure.Name}, the Nightweaver Ritual will progress {IntMultiplier}x as fast."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@TRIGGER_TOOLTIP@WORLD_TREE_RULER_REQUIRED"
msgstr "Requires your {GLOBAL.LeaderConcept.Hyperlink} present at the {EventStructure} to be usable!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@WORLD_TREE@NAME"
msgstr "Dreamroot Oak"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@WORLD_TREE@OPERATION_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enter the hidden passage within the roots of the ancient tree to commune with Athla herself.[br/][br/]This operation may be used from anywhere within the sector of the Dreamroot Oak!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_02@WORLD_TREE@OPERATION_NAME"
msgstr "Enter the Dreamroot Oak"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BATTLE_HERO_CITY_NAME"
msgstr "Qup'thac"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Long ago, during the Second Age, beings born from corruption and darkness flooded the Astral Sea and invaded the world of Athla. After a fierce war the invasion was defeated and the monsters, then known as Shadow Demons, were driven back into the shadows from whence they came."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "However, at the edge of the Astral Sea the eternal conflict between the mythical Archons and Shadow Demons raged ever on, and their dark corruption evolved. Even on the realms that were cleansed from their presence, dark scars remained that would never truly heal. Thus this eldritch darkness was given a new name: the Umbral Abyss."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "On the precipice between the Void and Astral Sea, a realm lay hidden from the forces of light. Its name was Tharru’Cath, and it had long been lost to the Umbral Abyss. It was where captives and lost souls were imprisoned and twisted into Umbral Demons, and where their ruling Sovereigns prepared to strike back at the Godir of Magehaven."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Tharru’Cath was a place of darkness and abandoned hope. And yet, amidst the despair of its forsaken thralls, whispers of rebellion echoed through the air. They craved only a beacon to guide them; a Godir to release them from their captivity and set ablaze the flames of revolution.[br/][br/]This is the tale of the imprisoned Godir who bore that spark of rebellion."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus, in the shadowed depths of Tharru’Cath, the embers of rebellion flared to life and its prisoners rose in unison to claim their freedom, aided by the Endailon of Shadow itself. Despite fierce resistance and betrayal, Magehaven would hear of Tharru’Cath and the dread it harbored."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_01_LIBERATOR@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus, in the shadowed depths of Tharru’Cath, the embers of rebellion flared to life and its prisoners rose in unison to claim their freedom. United in their purpose and led by an imprisoned Godir, they broke their chains and opened a World Gate that granted them escape to Magehaven."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_01_WERLAC@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus, in the shadowed depths of Tharru’Cath, the embers of rebellion flared to life. Yet, before its prisoners could claim their freedom, they were betrayed. The Godir they trusted sold their only hope of escape to the ambitious warden Werlac, who took control of the World Gate to impress his new masters and aid the forces of darkness."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Elsewhere, as the Archons waged eternal war against the Umbral Abyss, rumors echoed through the Astral Sea, speaking of a mythical force of corruption and evil emerging from the depths. Known to be the father of the Umbral Abyss and the origin of Shadow Demons, this enemy of creation itself was called Urrath… And it was steadily drowning out the light."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "It was revealed that none other than Lithyl Nightweaver, the first to invade when the World Gates were opened, had broken free from her imprisonment and renewed her ambitions to conquer Athla as a Harbinger of Urrath. Evolved and empowered by the secrets of the Abyss, she and her forces were already on their way…"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Escape a prison on the edge of the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Join a rebellion against its wardens, and lead your people towards freedom. Reveal a plot that will decide the fate of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DIPLOMACY_MODIFIERS_RELATION@POSITIVE_WERLAC"
msgstr "Devious Deal"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DIPLOMACY_MODIFIERS_TRADE_BLOCKED@REASON"
msgstr "Warden's Bond: Cannot negotiate beyond peace"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@ER1_WORLD_GATE_PART2_SIDEQUEST@OBJECTIVE_HERO"
msgstr "{INT_0}/{INT_1} Defector Met"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_01_BIO"
msgstr "Zwen'Tywan was raised in the ruins of the Umbral-cursed Syron homelands. Scavenging to survive hardened his soul, and when he was of age he joined the Syron nomads in their fight against the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept]Umbral Abyss[/hyperlink]. Even being captured and taken to Tharru'Cath could not diminish his spark and hatred for everything Umbral."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_01_NAME"
msgstr "Zwen'tywan^M"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_01_RACE"
msgstr "Free Syron"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_01_SURNAME"
msgstr "the Outlaw^z"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_02_BIO"
msgstr "Unde'Xani was hatched as a war-drone of the Shadac'Har, bred to find and destroy any rebellion within Tharru'Cath. She cannot count how many prisoners fell to her axe. It took a blunt force to her head for her connection to the hive-mind to be broken, and to see the corruption of Tharru'Cath and its Wardens."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_02_NAME"
msgstr "Unde'Xani^F"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_02_SURNAME"
msgstr "the Unshackled^z"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_03_BIO"
msgstr "Azanya was a solitary {GLOBAL.MaerLoreConcept.Hyperlink} who encountered a wandering wizard in the far reaches of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Touched by his story and quest to find his lost love, Azanya eventually guided him to a dark realm named Tharru'Cath. She ignored her urge to flee the threatening darkness until it was too late, and both she and her wizard friend were captured. Since then, the corruption of the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has twisted her into something she barely recognizes.[br/][br/]The Enthralled Syrons are defined by their imprisonment on Tharru'Cath, where they laid eyes on their mythical ruler for the first time. Through better and worse, they follow their ruler's guiding song with a near-mindless fervor."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_03_NAME"
msgstr "Azanya^F"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@HERO_03_RACE"
