msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When the warnings from Tharru’Cath reached Magehaven, they were met in quick succession with disbelief, indecision, and then panic. The words of the impending invasion of Athla surged through the Astral Sea like a lightning bolt, and many a Godir native to Athla dropped everything to hurry back to the world’s defense."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Yet they were all doomed. Before strong defenses could be assembled, the Umbral Abyss opened its baleful maw. All across Athla the scars of the Second Age burst asunder and through Umbral Gates unleashed a plague of eldritch demons. Like locusts, this dark tide began to engulf all Athla in a war that knew only corruption and death."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "But the heroes of Athla stood strong. Champions and Wizard Kings, Shad’rai and Covenant—they all fought with valor as one, united by this terrible foe. As they battled wave after wave of the Umbral Demons, one fear manifested itself in their minds: what if the worst was yet to come? Where was the leader of this invasion? Where was Lithyl Nightweaver?"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At last, scouts returned from the inland of the once blessed continent with evil tidings: in Arcalot, where the Elves of the First Age had set foot on Athla, Lithyl was preparing a world-ending eldritch ritual. To confront her, many Godir marched on Arcalot, hidden in the heart of the Stormpeak Mountains. This is the tale of one such Godir."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Through might and magic, at the brink of doom, Lithyl Nightweaver was banished back into the darkest depths of the Astral Void. Without the leadership of their Sovereigns, the umbral hordes slowly crumbled beneath the combined forces of the Athlan Godir. Victory, at last!"

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Yet the aftermath of Urrath’s attack brought new sorrows. There were dead to lament, horrors to forget and corrupted to cure. Sundren, wreathed in shadow magic, ventured into the Umbral Abyss to root out the remaining seeds of evil. In her wake followed the other Godir, wary of the dark arts she was embracing, remembering Merlin’s terrible fate."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When the sad tale of Merlin reached Magehaven, it almost got lost in the shuffle of Godir reporting incursions of Urrath’s umbral hordes across the Astral Sea. O’neron and his Syron were besieged by questions about the Archons, yet they would only speak of the Gloomwatch, the Dreamers and the Eternal Conflict. While the battle for Athla was over, the war against Urrath had just begun."

msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Return to {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and stand against the sheer force of the Umbral invasion. Meet returning friends and enemies and save a world on the brink of doom."

