msgid "DLC@ELDRITCHREALMS@TOME_CLEANSING_FLAME@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"Blessed be the light which burns inside the heart of the zealot, who channels the fire within and smites the wicked with wrathful flame. Fear not the scorching heat, for it purifies the corruption that resides within all. Wield the blazing sword, cast an inferno upon your enemies, and behold: where the flame has passed, only the faithful remain.\""

