msgstr "War Spoils are gained through:[br/][br/]Killing <<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> belonging to <<m:{GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink}>>, <<m:{GLOBAL.DwellingConcept.Hyperlink}>>, or <<m:{GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} I units grant {T1Reward}[warspoils/].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} II units grant {T2Reward}[warspoils/].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} III units grant {T3Reward}[warspoils/] .[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} IV units grant {T4Reward}[warspoils/].[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitTierConcept.Hyperlink} V units grant {T5Reward}[warspoils/].[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>> grant {HeroReward}[warspoils/] per level.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]Conquering <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain {WarspoilsConquestBase}[warspoils/] + {PopWarspoilsConquest}[warspoils/] per {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} the conquered city had.[/bulletlist][br/]{GLOBAL.PillagingConcept.Hyperlink} Provinces grants +{PillageReward}[warspoils/]."

