msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_AVIANREAVERS@BIO"
msgstr "In a harsh society where the strongest thrived, Fauster was the weakest chick in a nest of seven. It was his intelligence and social aptitude that helped him survive and even thrive. Fauster has since then more than made up for his physical disadvantage and become the Avian Reavers' Master Alchemist.[br/][br/]The society of Avian Reavers took shape by their ruler's discovery of alchemy and Magelock weaponry, which revolutionized their so-called \"primitive\" heritage into a society of science and more efficient shows of force. Before, one's tail feathers decided one's social successes. Now the size of their guns and explosions matter most."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_AVIANREAVERS@NAME"
msgstr "Coppertalons"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_EDWARD@BIO"
msgstr "Ever the resourceful and honest dreadnought, Edward Portsmith has been a beacon of hope for many who still uphold the values of the {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Since the World Seals on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} were opened, his legend has only grown. Playing the role of the hero, however, can take its toll on those who don't process their own torment.[br/][br/]The soldiers of the {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink} were the first line of defense when the World Seals on Athla were opened, but rather than glorious battle they found themselves adrift in the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. After what seems like an eternity of torment, the Commonwealth Remnants struggle to uphold the values they once stood for."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_EDWARD@NAME"
msgstr "Commonwealth Remnants"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_LARYSSA@BIO"
msgstr "A powerful and cunning sorceress of Athla, Laryssa Mirabilis has played a pivotal role in forming the Torchbearers, who revealed a grand conspiracy involving [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept]Athla's[/hyperlink] most powerful nations. After being cast adrift together with her companion Edward Portsmith, Laryssa has used her skills to keep her people alive and their ideals upheld.[br/][br/]Laryssa's followers are those who value the spirit over the letter of the law. Rather than a supreme ruler, the Commonwealth Philosophers are led by a council that Laryssa represents. To these sorcerers, politics and intrigue are like a game of chess, and they take glee in playing it."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_LARYSSA@NAME"
msgstr "Commonwealth Philosophers"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_PROGENITOR@BIO"
msgstr "With scarlet wings and piercing emerald eyes, Xandera the Phoenix signals her readiness to the potential enemies of her people—which means to everyone. As the Yukara of the Krazura she is believed to be the current reincarnation of the first Krazuran Yukara, possessing great knowledge and wisdom. But the recollections of millennia of hardships and betrayal have rendered her cautious and unforgiving towards outsiders.[br/][br/]Knowledgeable and gifted in the arcane, the Krazura still resemble their [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]distant ancestors[/hyperlink] in many ways. However ages of isolation within {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink} have dulled their astral instincts and eroded their civilization, to the point that only a minority of Manuhari's inhabitants still call themselves Krazura."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_PROGENITOR@NAME"
msgstr "Krazura"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@LORDS@RACE_VALERY@BIO"
msgstr "A warlord of high principles and standards, Valery of House Avernos represents the best the fallen {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink} once stood for. When dedicated to a cause, her loyalty is beyond question, though after the {GLOBAL.ShadraiFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink} invasion on [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept]Athla[/hyperlink] she yet has to find a new cause worthy of her vow.[br/][br/]The soldiers of the {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink} were the first line of defense when the World Seals on Athla were opened, but rather than glorious battle they found themselves adrift in the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. After what seems like an eternity of torment, the Commonwealth Remnants struggle to uphold the values they once stood for."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_CHAOTIC_INFLUENCE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Chaotic energies make emotions run high.[bulletlist][bullet/]Each strategic {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}, all <<m:{GLOBAL.LeaderConcept}>> gain a stacking negative [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EmpireRelationConcept]Empire Relation[/hyperlink] modifier with each other.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_CHAOTIC_INFLUENCE@NAME"
msgstr "Chaotic Influence"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_MOTIVATED TRUCE@NAME"
msgstr "Motivated Truce"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_MOTIVATED_TRUCE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Waging war is discouraged on this realm.[bulletlist][bullet/] <<m:{GLOBAL.CasusBelliConcept.Hyperlink}>> are less impactful.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_MOTIVATED_TRUCE@NAME"
msgstr "Motivated Truce"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@ALCHEMY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "These are the followers of Alchemy, whose goal is the understanding of all matter through study and experimentation. Their mastery over matter brings prosperity in their society... and victory in their wars."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@ALCHEMY@NAME"
msgstr "Followers of Alchemy"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@ALCHEMY_TRAIT@NAME"
msgstr "Follower of Alchemy"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@ANTIMAGIC@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "These are the Masters of Antimagic. Be it from a past grudge or just curiosity, they have specialized in suppressing and outright nullifying magical effects."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@ANTIMAGIC@NAME"
msgstr "Masters of Antimagic"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@ANTIMAGIC_TRAIT@NAME"
msgstr "Master of Antimagic"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@CONSTRUCTS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "These are the Masters of Constructs, great smiths and engineers that have made manual labor redundant. If it were up to them, only their magnificent war machines would have to set foot on the battlefield."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@CONSTRUCTS@NAME"
msgstr "Masters of Constructs"

