msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@SPAWNERS@WORSKHOP_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "An ancient workshop infested with rampant mechanical creations.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@SPAWNERS@WORSKHOP_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "Few question the morality of machines, as a weapon is meaningless without its wielder. However, the war machines that emerge from the derelict workshop know no master but their collective directive. Having long outlasted their mortal creators, the workshop and its hosts now have one priority: to feed the engines that drive the creation of their own kind."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@SPAWNERS@WORSKHOP_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Derelict Workshop"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1012@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Each of these locations will bring forth reinforcements for {Edward.FirstName}, for as long as they persist. My advice would be to conquer them, or to prepare defenses before we are overwhelmed.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1012@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A rumbling thunder in the distance announces the arrival of even more adversaries. \"That magic...\" {Laryssa.FirstName} says. \"He is summoning reinforcements.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1012@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Before he left, {Edward.FirstName} and I were working on small-scale assembly teleporters, that would allow him to distribute war machines across the realm with haste. He is a very smart man,\" {Laryssa.FirstName} says somberly. \"This has made him a hero on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and a dangerous adversary to his enemies. Unfortunately, currently that means us.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1012@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1012@TITLE"
msgstr "Ironclad Reinforcements"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1013@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"This assembly teleporter is ruined beyond repair, but I can trigger one final charge. What would you use it for, O {PlayerLeader.Title}?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1013@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you claim the last location of the Commonwealth reinforcements, your troops search for the technology that allowed {Edward.Name} to call on troops so consistently."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1013@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "They find the machine in a barracks, destroyed by Edward's troops before they were overrun. {Laryssa.FirstName} sighs. \"{Edward.FirstName} did not want the technology to fall into the wrong hands. This machine is old [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]Krazura[/hyperlink] technology, adapted by {Edward.FirstName} and me. Had I known he would be using it like this...\" her voice falters, and she shakes her head."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1013@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Summon more war machines... on our side!\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1013@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Use it to channel more magic from the Astral Sea.\" [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1013@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I will study it myself to learn more about teleportation.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1013@TITLE"
msgstr "Ironclad Reinforcements: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1023@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Alfred's expression hardens. \"It saddens me to see a hero fall to the fever of war, O {Edward.Title}, but I cannot allow your threats against my allies to go unanswered.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1023@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As Edward's \"liberation\" of the realm develops, {Alfred.FirstName} attempts to reason with him."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1023@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You were one of the Torchbearers who united the nations of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" {Alfred.FirstName} says, \"but the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizards[/hyperlink] on this realm are not your enemy. We aim to bring unity to Magehaven.\"[br/]For a moment, {Edward.FirstName} seems distraught, but then anger returns: \"Unity? The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept]Commonwealth[/hyperlink] was unity. Wizards only know deceit. Your mind is poisoned, and I will not allow you to hinder me. Surrender, or perish.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1023@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Stand together with Alfred."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1023@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Do not interfere."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1023@TITLE"
msgstr "Divided We Fall"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1027@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I hereby proclaim the Sehiran Settlement a failed experiment. Resolve this conflict as you please, whilst I focus on more pressing matters.\" {Broker.FirstName} ends the conversation."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1027@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A war has broken out between you and another participant of the Sehiran Settlement. {Broker.FirstName} appears. \"That did not take long...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1027@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This initiative for peace was an admirable one, but it seems it was doomed to fail. I am not too surprised, but I am disappointed. Meanwhile, the situation in {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink} becomes more and more tense. Something seems to be affecting the minds of all {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. It was foolish of me to expect you all to resist its effects.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1027@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Unfortunate.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1027@TITLE"
msgstr "The Sehiran Settlement: Failed"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1030@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"{Lithyl.FirstName} has returned. My time for vengeance has come!\" {Alfred.FirstName} yells.[br/]{Sundren.FirstName} closes her eyes for a moment. \"No, {Alfred.FirstName}, I am not her.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1030@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Some time after your conversation with {Sundren.FirstName}, you are approached by the other residents on this realm. \"Was that who I think it was?!\" {Alfred.FirstName} demands to know."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1030@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{Sundren.FirstName}, my niece... why don't you reveal yourself for all of us,\" {Broker.FirstName} says with a slight smile. \"We have so much to talk about.\"[br/]Reluctantly, {Sundren.FirstName} joins the conversation. Before she can speak she is interrupted by {Alfred.FirstName}. \"YOU! Answer me, deceitful elf!\" His hand reaches for his weapon in a sudden surge of bloodlust. \"You are {Lithyl.TitleName}. You destroyed my kingdom and killed my father and mother!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1030@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Explain yourself further, {Sundren.FirstName}!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1030@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Disengage from this conversation."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1030@TITLE"
msgstr "Lithyl, Sundren"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1031@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I decided to take on the mask of {Lithyl.FirstName}. If {Sundren.FirstName} could not unify Athla alongside her, perhaps {Lithyl.FirstName} could unify them against her.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1031@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Sundren.FirstName} sighs. \"Yes, I was {Lithyl.Name} and yes, she is the one who invaded {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. But I was not her, then.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1031@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"When the {GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink} opened, {Lithyl.Name} was one of the first [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizards[/hyperlink] to invade Athla. I stood alongside your parents when she arrived, {Alfred.FirstName}. It was not until decades later that she and I fought in a deadly clash. I re-emerged from the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} victorious, her mask in my hands.\" Sundren's expression hardens. \"When I came back, Athla had returned to its old petty conflicts. None would listen or act on the horrors I had seen.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1031@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue to listen."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1031@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I have heard enough.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1031@TITLE"
msgstr "Lithyl Nightweaver"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1032@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Sundren.FirstName} turns to you. \"I would aid you to sever the influence [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink] has over {Edward.FirstName}. He is a hero of Athla, and a friend. He deserves this mercy.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1032@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"For so long I vowed to avenge my father and mother,\" {Alfred.FirstName} says. \"...I don't know what to believe anymore. I... I need time to think.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1032@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You played us all for fools,\" {Broker.FirstName} says to {Sundren.FirstName}, \"a feat I had not expected from anyone on that side of my family.\"[br/]{Sundren.FirstName} grimaces. \"Believe me, Uncle, deceiving you was not the goal, but merely a necessity. I must continue my search for the other [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Endailon[/hyperlink]. But first...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1032@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"If you wish to resolve the problems you have caused, join me here.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1032@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"It is best you leave. I can resolve this without your aid.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1032@TITLE"
msgstr "Ends and Means"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1036@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Sundren.Name} was wounded, but has escaped death. It will take some time for her to regrow her strength."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1036@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Sundren.TitleName} was defeated in battle under your command!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1036@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Through effort, luck or something else entirely, she managed to survive the onslaught and made it back to safety, where she appears in a cloud of shadows. She grimaces, a darker expression marking her face before the shadows disappear and she turns to you again. \"I have withstood many hardships in the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. It shall not claim me yet.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1036@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "So be it."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_1036@TITLE"
msgstr "Sundren Defeated"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You ponder your options how to best catch the attention of an influential {EventRace} who might be reasoned with."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} ignores your attempts to speak of peace, turning <<o:EventPlayer>> back on your conversation."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It is clear that the {EventRace} have suffered too much betrayal and aggression from foreigners in the past and the present. Their trust will not easily be won, but there must be someone among their people with at least the willingness to listen to you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Send out heralds [influence/] to proclaim your good intentions for Manuhari."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Raise your inner voice [mana/] to call out to the mystics of the {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Have your cities deliver gifts [production/],[unitprod/],[food/] to the {EventRace} as tokens of your good will."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Befriend the birds of Manuhari to win them as messengers with the {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "None of these options are worth the effort."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_766@TITLE"
msgstr "Voice of Reason"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_767@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I trust your words of peace, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventHero.FirstName} concludes, \"but the {EventPlayer.Title} will not easily be persuaded. There might, however, be a way...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_767@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Speaking with a melodic voice, {EventHero} of the {EventRace} is requesting audience with you, the {PlayerLeader.Title}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_767@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I have heard of your good intentions, {PlayerLeader}. Allow me to welcome you and your {PlayerRace} on Manuhari.\" {EventHero.FirstName} performs an elaborate series of wing beats. \"You must excuse the {EventPlayer.Title}. <<Cp:EventPlayer>> is wise beyond comprehension, but the memories from millennia of betrayal and suffering can be a burden on <<P:EventPlayer>>.\"[br/][br/]\"I am just a simple counselor. But now that the Everdark has ended, my people will need to relearn to trust and cooperate with foreigners—or we will perish in this changed world, where the stars of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Sky Beyond[/hyperlink] are rearranged.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_767@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Listen to what {EventHero} proposes."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_767@TITLE"
msgstr "Voice of Reason: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_770@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You will need to stay attentive and form your own opinion. Whether you seek to quench this war or fan it, your actions will define the fate of Manuhari."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_770@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Having seen the realm and heard more about the ongoing conflict, you reflect on the situation at hand."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_770@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {EventRace} and the {NativeRace} are locked in a terrible war, that much is clear. Other than that there are many unknowns. While it seems like the {EventRace} are the obvious aggressors in this conflict, the sudden reappearance of the {NativeRace} and their home world raises the question of whether they had been sealed within {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and if so, why."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_770@TITLE"
msgstr "Manuhari Besieged"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_771@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Both {EventPlayer} and {NativePlayer} had to acknowledge the grandeur of your deeds. With your goals achieved, your legend spreads further to {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_771@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Through cunning and leadership you have brought the fighting on Manuhari to an end."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_771@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Not long ago, you were a foreigner to this realm. Today the dense jungle and meandering streams of Manuhari invoke a sense of familiarity and echo the tale of your actions."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_771@TITLE"
msgstr "Manuhari Besieged: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_772@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Complete this chapter of your journey."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_773@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "I will do what it takes, one way or another."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_774@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Time is scarce. My hideout might no longer be safe. Please meet me in the {EventGeo} {EventDirection} {EventCity}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_774@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Overlooking your recently established throne city of {EventCity}, you sense the skillful {EventHero} gently invading your mind through a vision."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_774@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Bless the currents of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}—my desperate plea has been answered!\" <<Cg:voice^n,EventHero>> echoes relief. \"I thank you and your followers, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}, for putting your own lives in jeopardy for a noble purpose. The {NativeRace} native to this world and the {EventRace}, my former comrades in misfortune, are caught in a relentless war—and neither side will appreciate the appearance of a new faction.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_774@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Wait for the vision to end."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_774@TITLE"
msgstr "A Call for Aid"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_775@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"It may not seem like I have much to offer in return, but I'm a sorceress... How may I best surprise you?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_775@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With {EventHero} at your side you return to {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_775@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I thank you, {PlayerLeader}, for coming to my aid,\" {EventHero.FirstName} says, and you notice <<p:EventHero>> is less tense now that <<p:EventHero>> is in safety. \"Being adrift within the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, trying to shield our troops from the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowTrialLoreConcept]torment[/hyperlink] while slowly running out of rations, then witnessing everyone losing their sanity when salvation seemed imminent—I have seen better days in the past. But I will recover.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_775@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will be delighted to learn more [knowledge/] about your sorcery.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_775@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I would be surprised if a sorceress like you had no personal stockpile of mana [mana/] to share...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_775@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Choose an apprentice [unit/] among my people, {EventHero}!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_775@TITLE"
msgstr "A Call for Aid: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_778@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Flee these lands of our protection, {PlayerLeader}, and return to the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Sky Beyond[/hyperlink]! The {EventRace} will invoke their wrath upon any invaders.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_778@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A flurry of colorful wings accompanied with the tweeting songs from a thousand beaks heralds to you the arrival of {EventPlayer.TitleName}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_778@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Then it is true what the flying eyes have descried, and the Serpent has shed its tail to grow a second head.\" {EventPlayer} stares at you as if <<p:EventPlayer>> is attempting to pierce your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept]soul[/hyperlink]. \"But let it be known that the {EventRace} are no helpless foe—the ingenuity and indomitable will of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]our ancestors[/hyperlink] lets our spirits soar high and plunge the Serpent into the abyss.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_778@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Serpent? Sky Beyond? Admit your confusion."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_778@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Explain that the Sky Beyond knows many creatures. You are not the Serpent."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_778@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "All you hear is violence and you sign up for it in blood [rs_war/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_778@TITLE"
msgstr "The {EventPlayer.Title} of Manuhari"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_779@TITLE"
msgstr "payment time"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_782@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Why else would you have come to this hidden world of mysteries. Speak quickly, be you friend or foe!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_782@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With gun salutes and soldiers clad in razor sharp armor at <<o:EventPlayer>> side, {EventPlayer} gives you a pompous, yet tense, welcome."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_782@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Greetings, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}! Have you come to join the noble cause of the {EventRace} and liberate the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} from the {GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} invaders far and wide? We bring technology and progress to the peoples subdued by vile magic, arming them to fight back and reclaim their homes. It is the dawn of a new {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, a league among worlds which will bring peace and prosperity.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_782@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I have come to join the efforts of your Commonwealth.\"[relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_782@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You speak of peace, but is it not true you are besieging the natives of this world?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_782@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"The invader is you, {EventPlayer}. I will rise to the defense of the innocent {NativeRace}!\"[relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_782@TITLE"
msgstr "Smoke and Thunder"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_834@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Broker.FirstName} appears. \"I sense the same energies around this \"{Edward.Title}\" as I do in {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Whoever <<p:Edward>> was, <<p:Edward>> is now a danger to the realm. <<Cp:Edward>> must be stopped.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_834@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After {Edward.TitleName} left to prepare his war machines, an emergency conclave is called on the Sehiran Oasis."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_834@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I did not settle here to be provoked like this,\" {Noctus.FirstName} exclaims.[br/]{Alfred.FirstName} is surprised. \"That was {Edward.Name}, a legend on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Surely we can bring him to reason...\"[br/]\"Even {Karissa.FirstName} seems startled. \"Those war machines... They are unlike anything I have seen before.\"[br/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_834@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_834@TITLE"
msgstr "Naught but Dread"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_836@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Laryssa.FirstName} guides {Edward.FirstName} to safety."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_836@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have defeated {Edward.TitleName}. He and his war machines lie before you, broken. He looks up, several emotions fighting for dominance."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_836@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Before you can decide on his fate, you are interrupted. \"No!\" yells {Laryssa.FirstName}, who leaps in front of {Edward.FirstName} to protect him. \"Please, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}, we need him alive—he is the best example of this chaotic influence we have. You need him, we need him!\" With a grunt, she lifts {Edward.FirstName} on her shoulder. \"There has been enough bloodshed on this realm.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_836@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Very well."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_836@TITLE"
msgstr "The Last Dreadnought, Defeated"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_837@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The rules of this Trial are simple. All participating Godir will either settle their differences or compete for the emerged <<m:EventStructure>> on this realm. Waging wanton wars is... discouraged.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_837@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You step in the desert sands of the Sehiran Oasis. The air is hot and dry, whipping sand across your face."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_837@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Still, the air is clearer here than on {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, where the smallest spark seems to ignite arguments among all {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} residing there. Before you can ponder further you are approached by none other than {Broker.TitleName}. [br/]\"Greetings, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}. You have arrived at the Sehiran Oasis, where you will attempt to settle the differences between other {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} through a form of competition.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_837@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Why are we doing this?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_837@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Get to the point already!\" (skip)"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_837@TITLE"
msgstr "Sehiran Oasis"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_838@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Whilst I try to return some sense of order to Magehaven, you will settle your differences so the Pantheon can once again concentrate on more important concerns.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_838@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "<<G:expression^n,Broker>> darkens. \"When I first found {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, it was a refuge for {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} who found themselves adrift in the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Now...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_838@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"...Since the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept]World Vault[/hyperlink] was opened by my ambitious niece and those {GLOBAL.ShadraiFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink} fools, anarchy has overtaken the {GLOBAL.PantheonLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\" {Broker.FirstName} shakes <<o:Broker>> head in disgust. \"It saddens me to admit that of the entire Pantheon, you lot currently seem to be the most 'reasonable'.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_838@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue to listen."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_838@TITLE"
msgstr "Anarchy in Magehaven"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_839@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With these last words, {Broker.FirstName} severs the connection, leaving you and any other participants on this sandy realm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_839@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"The Sehiran Oasis was chosen as the cradle of this initiative. You will find the three other participants have settled around it.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_839@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"In my past experiences, it is common for simpler minds to revert to skulduggery. Especially now, petty violence seems to be the first response for many {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. As such, I am interested in the outcome here.\" A thin smile creeps across Meandor's face. \"Good luck, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}. Perhaps you can show us all violence is but one of many ways to resolve a conflict.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_839@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "I will settle these disputes... one way or another."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_839@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "I make my own rules."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_839@TITLE"
msgstr "The Sehiran Trials"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"There is one adversary left. I cannot join you, but I can offer you support from Magehaven.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have forged an alliance with all three other participants of the Sehiran Oasis. {Broker.TitleName} appears to congratulate you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@BODY_HEADER@CHAOS_KNOWN"
msgstr "Despite the influences of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink], you have forged an alliance with all three other participants of the Sehiran Oasis. {Broker.TitleName} appears to congratulate you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Despite the many challenges you managed to achieve a peace between different {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} on this realm. You have done what many, including me, assumed impossible. But danger still looms. The wizards of {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are still influenced by something, and I feel like this {Edward.TitleName} is related, somehow.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@BODY_LORE@CHAOS_KNOWN"
msgstr "\"Despite the many challenges you managed to achieve a peace between different {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} on this realm. You have done what many, including me, assumed impossible. But danger still looms. The wizards of {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are still influenced by something, and I feel like this {Edward.TitleName} is related, somehow.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Grant me the secrets of your dark magic, Meandor, so we can withstand this adversary!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Raise some soldiers for us in the Sehiran Oasis.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"United we shall persevere. My allies are all I need.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_849@TITLE"
msgstr "The Sehiran Trials: Settled"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"When I heard of this amusing initiative, I volunteered. Besides, I sense the heat of battle in the desert winds... This may become more interesting than we think.\" {Karissa.FirstName} winks at you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A gust of heat announces one of the participants of the Sehiran Settlement. \"Greetings, grand {PlayerLeader.Title},\" {Karissa.TitleName} smiles. \"Surprised to see me?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"After my visit to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept]Obbadoth[/hyperlink] and the constant war raging there, I grew... bored. It is amusing to stoke arguments between the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but without true carnage the strife of old wizards becomes bland rather quickly.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Let us exchange knowledge on war [unitprod/], {Karissa.FirstName}... Just in case.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Peace must be earned through honest strife. We shall put ourselves to the test!\" [chaos/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"The instinct to protect yourself from harm is natural. Let us thrive, together!\" [nature/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"We will surely speak again in the future.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"The only passion I feel is my disgust for you, unholy wench!\" [order/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_850@TITLE"
msgstr "The Mistress of Fire"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_851@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Karissa.FirstName} winks. \"How do you suppose we celebrate this alliance, mighty {PlayerLeader.Title}?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_851@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have forged an alliance with {Karissa.FirstName}, the {Karissa.Title}. She approaches you, a genuine warmth underneath her sly smile."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_851@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I have to admit, when I set foot on the Sehiran Oasis I did not expect to resolve our differences in any way but bloodshed. But you have impressed me, {PlayerLeader.FirstName}, despite other... less approachable guests. Perhaps we can truly make a difference in {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink} after all.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_851@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Statues shall be erected in every city to celebrate our bond!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_851@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"A feast! The {KarissaRace} and {PlayerRace} shall join [unit/] in unbridled revelry!\" [chaosboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_851@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"A fertility festival [food/], to honor the spirits of nature that brought us together!\" [natureboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_851@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"This alliance will be written in blood. We must combine our efforts to train more soldiers!\" [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_851@TITLE"
msgstr "Passionate Alliance"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"{GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has become an unreasonable cesspool of petty arguments. I believe we can write history here, in the Sehiran Oasis.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You are greeted by the dusty smell of parchment, and, oddly enough, the scent of dried bones. Another participant appears before you and nods."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Allow me to properly introduce myself. I am {Noctus.Name}, {Noctus.Title} of the {NoctusRace.Name}. I represent my people and the {GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of our forefathers, who aid us even in death. As you may know, I am closely acquainted with death and betrayal, which seems to be inevitable even for those who want nothing but gain and to share knowledge.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"As a gesture of goodwill, I will grant you access to my archives.\" [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Our intellectual goals align, {Noctus.FirstName}. I look forward to what we can achieve together.\" [arcana/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"We can indeed learn much from the dead. Let us write history, together!\" [shadow/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"We will surely speak again in the future.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Your experiments are an affront to nature, {Noctus.FirstName}. I will not stand for it!\" [nature/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_852@TITLE"
msgstr "The Eternal Archivist"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"{GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.AscendedChampLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, or anyone else, in the end we are all {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and share a responsibility for all the peoples in the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A cheer and trumpets announce the arrival of another participant: {Alfred.TitleName} of Athla. \"Hail, {PlayerLeader.TitleName} of the {PlayerRace}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"With the other {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} here, many of my counselors think me mad for participating in an initiative like this. The {Alfred.Title} of the {AlfredRace} in an honorable competition with [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizard Kings[/hyperlink]? But I have learned our natures do not define us, and that unity can be found in the most surprising places.\" <<Cp:Alfred>> smiles. \"Let our actions and alliances speak louder than our differences.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Let us break bread [food/], {Alfred.Title} {Alfred.FirstName}, so we can soon negotiate further.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Let us bring peace and order to the Oasis, and Magehaven.\" [order/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"We must all acknowledge our violent nature, only then can we surpass it.\" [nature/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Let us bring prosperity to these auspicious deserts.\" [matter/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"We will surely speak again in the future.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Your reliance on alliances makes you weak. A true Godir can fight <<o:PlayerLeader>> own battles!\" [chaos/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_853@TITLE"
msgstr "The Athlan Unifier"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_854@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I am glad to call you my ally. What shall history say about us, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_854@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have forged an {GLOBAL.DSAllianceConcept} with {Noctus.TitleName}. He approaches you and bows deeply in respect."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_854@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"When I was told about this Trial, I had little hope of resolving it in any peaceful way. But I am glad to have found a kindred spirit in you, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}. We truly are writing history and may yet be able to bring reason to this realm and {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_854@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We will be remembered for our creeds and wisdom.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_854@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"We will be remembered for unveiling the many secrets of the Astral Sea.\" [astralboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_854@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"The dead will whisper about our achievements for ages to come!\" [shadowboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_854@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"We shall be remembered for our knowledge and wisdom.\" [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_854@TITLE"
msgstr "Writing History"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I am glad to have you on my side, {PlayerLeader.Title} {PlayerLeader.FirstName}! What will our first decree be as we bring the Sehiran Oasis together?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have forged an {GLOBAL.DSAllianceConcept} with {Alfred.TitleName}. He approaches you with a smile and spreads his arms."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Great {PlayerLeader.Title}! I am glad we have reached an alliance. I knew these Trials were not in vain. No matter our origins, together we can protect the innocent people of all realms from those who mean harm.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"All bards and town criers shall promote unity and harmony between our peoples!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"All of us, young and old, must stand together [unitprod/] against the dangers to come.\" [orderboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"All will bless the spirits of nature for our shared prosperity.\" [nature/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"We shall build grand structures [structureprod/] to celebrate our shared prosperity.\" [materiumboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"All of us must provide [gold/] so we can prepare for the challenges to come.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_855@TITLE"
msgstr "Unity Above All"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Anyone interfering with our quest for liberty and peace will be considered an enemy. Tread carefully.\" Before you can answer, he leaves."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@BODY_FOOTER@PLAYER_IS_ALLY"
msgstr "\"I will cleanse the entire Astral Sea of the curse of Wizard Kings and those who support them, including you. Do not resist.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@BODY_FOOTER@PLAYER_IS_WIZARD"
msgstr "\"I will cleanse the entire Astral Sea of the curse of Wizard Kings like you. Do not resist.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The sounds of a strange thunder rumble in the distance, where dark clouds rise from the desert. A stern looking man appears before you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You are witness to the arrival of the {EdwardRace.Name}! We have survived torment to liberate the realms from all invading [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizard Kings[/hyperlink] and those who support their rule. What they have stolen, we will retake. What they have destroyed, we will rebuild. I see this realm was invaded by the wizards {Karissa.FirstName} and {Noctus.FirstName}. Do not be afraid, for your liberation has arrived.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@BODY_LORE@PLAYER_IS_ALLY"
msgstr "\"You are witness to the arrival of the {EdwardRace.Name}! We have survived torment to liberate the realms from all invading [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizard Kings[/hyperlink] and those who support their rule. What they have stolen, we will retake. What they have destroyed, we will rebuild. As the ally of the invading Wizards {Karissa.FirstName} and {Noctus.FirstName}, you are just as guilty as them.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@BODY_LORE@PLAYER_IS_WIZARD"
msgstr "\"You are witness to the arrival of the {EdwardRace.Name}! We have survived torment to liberate the realms from all invading [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizard Kings[/hyperlink] and those who support their rule. What you have stolen, we will retake. What you have destroyed, we will rebuild. We will free the realm from monsters like {Karissa.FirstName}, {Noctus.FirstName}...\" His gaze shifts to you, \"...And you.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "So be it..."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_872@TITLE"
msgstr "The Last Dreadnought"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_874@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"There is a different way to subdue the {Edward.Title}. Rather than defeating him in combat, use the <<m:EventStructure>> on this realm to lock him in. We can stop his rampage and cure him of his affliction!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_874@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Whilst the others are reeling from the arrival of {Edward.FirstName}, you are approached by a sorceress who introduces herself as {Laryssa.TitleName}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_874@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{PlayerLeader.TitleName}! She says, catching her breath. \"I traveled here as soon as I could. I see {Edward.FirstName} has already arrived. There is not much time to explain, but I know him well, and he is not behaving like himself. I am not sure what ails him, but if you carry any love for {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and its hero, hear my plea.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_874@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_874@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Your words are merely excuses. I deny your request.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_874@TITLE"
msgstr "Sealed from Chaos"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_879@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Edward's voice is hoarse as he whispers: \"What have I done?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_879@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your control over the <<m:EventStructure>> on the realm reaches a pinnacle, you can feel its connection to the Astral Sea is fully under your control."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_879@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You sense the ebb and flow of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the ripples it leaves on the realm. And you sense {Edward.FirstName}, as raw [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink] surges within him. With effort you sever his connection to the surging forces of chaos and as it leaves him he sinks to his knees. {Laryssa.FirstName} rushes towards him and for the first time since they left the Astral Sea on their broken landship, he truly sees her."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_879@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Welcome back, {Edward.FirstName}.\" "

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_879@TITLE"
msgstr "Sealed from Chaos"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_885@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We must gain full control of the <<m:EventStructure>> on this realm, so we can capture {Edward.FirstName} and cure him.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_885@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have gained control of an {EventStructure}. {Laryssa.FirstName} is pleased. \"A good first step. With these, we can save {Edward.FirstName}!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_885@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The <<m:EventStructure>> were once activated on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} by a wizard named Merlin. The one who controls the <<m:EventStructure>> controls everything that enters or leaves this realm, including the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} itself. In the hands of a novice, these Seals can bring terrible cataclysms. But with the knowledge I gained, we can use them to capture {Edward.FirstName} and stop his rampage across the realms.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_885@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Bringing the {Edward.Title} to a halt is my only goal.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_885@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I can feel the power surging through the Seals. I shall channel it!\" [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_885@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"With these Seals I shall become the sovereign ruler of this realm!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_885@TITLE"
msgstr "Claimed Seal"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_886@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Your treachery leaves me no choice. My righteous march cannot be stopped!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_886@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your increasing control over the <<m:EventStructure>> has caused disturbances in the realm which have not gone unnoticed. Now, {Edward.TitleName} approaches."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_886@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"What are you doing, {PlayerLeader.Name}? Do not think I do not feel the disturbances in the {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}! If you think you can use some cursed eldritch magic to stop me, you are not only foolish, you are no better than any other {GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\"[br/]{Laryssa.FirstName} tries to intervene. \"Edward, please, you're not yourself...\" And for a moment there is a hint of doubt and pain in his eyes. Then, an angry red glimmer returns."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_886@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_886@TITLE"
msgstr "Unveiled Suspicions"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_889@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I know what affects {Edward.FirstName} and the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. With your permission, I will elaborate.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_889@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Suddenly, you sense another presence, requesting permission to enter the realm. \"{PlayerLeader.TitleName}, if I may...\" {Sundren.Name} says."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_889@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Before you respond, I ask you to allow me to elaborate. After {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, I left to find the Endailon... It seems you all found them before I did.\"[br/]\"It saddens me to see {Edward.FirstName} so affected. The journey through the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} must have taken its toll. And perhaps I bear some responsibility for his current state.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_889@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Speak, Sundren.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_889@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I have no use for traitors and deceivers. Begone.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_889@TITLE"
msgstr "Torchbearer, Vaultbreaker"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_894@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"As participants of the Sehiran Trials, we demand to know what you learned about these Seals, and what you plan to do with them!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_894@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have gained more control over the <<m:EventStructure>>. This has gained the attention of the other settlers on this realm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_894@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{Noctus.FirstName} is the first to respond. \"I have encountered these Seals before. My knowledge of them is limited, but I am intrigued.\" [br/]{Karissa.FirstName} pouts. \"You're not secretly doing something without us, are you? That would not be courteous...\" [br/]{Alfred.FirstName} nods sternly. \"It seems only fair for you to share what you have discovered, especially considering the danger of {Edward.FirstName} in the north.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_894@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Share what you know about the <<m:EventStructure>>."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_894@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"All of Magehaven will know it was I who rediscovered the legendary Seals on this realm!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_894@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Keep your secrets."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_894@TITLE"
msgstr "Sealed Secrets"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_901@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The angrier {Noctus.FirstName} becomes, the more Karissa's smile grows. Do you interfere?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_901@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "During a diplomatic gathering, a discussion between {Noctus.TitleName} and {Karissa.TitleName} starts... heating up. \"You lecture me on morality, {Noctus.FirstName}?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_901@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{Karissa.FirstName} laughs mockingly. \"Aren't you the one who regurgitates the souls of his own forefathers to fuel his undead engines of war? At least my {KarissaRace} know that their labor ends with death!\"[br/]{Noctus.FirstName} is barely withholding <<o:Noctus>> rage, his cheeks a dark green. \"How dare you! You inspire cannibalism and raiding for the sake of violence! My experiments serve only to increase our collective knowledge!\"[br/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_901@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"{Karissa.FirstName} is right. You have no right to lecture her on morality, {Noctus.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_901@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"{Noctus.FirstName} is right. There is a greater purpose to his actions, unlike yours, {Karissa.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_901@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"{Karissa.FirstName}, {Noctus.FirstName}, we Wizard Kings should stand together despite our different... views.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_901@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Leave them to their squabbles."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_901@TITLE"
msgstr "Morals Among Wizard Kings"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_902@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"What do you think, {PlayerLeader.FirstName}? Are <<m:{GLOBAL.AscendedChampLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> better than Wizards, as so many with their granted powers believe? Or are Wizards better, for taking what they have earned?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_902@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Admit it,\" {Karissa.FirstName} says to {Alfred.Title} {Alfred.FirstName} with a grin. \"You hate me, you hate what I am.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_902@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"It was a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizard[/hyperlink] who invaded {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and killed your kin. Someone like me. Do I provoke you? Enrage you?\"[br/]Alfred's jaw tightens. \"Whatever game you are playing, {Karissa.FirstName}, I am not joining in.\"[br/]{Karissa.FirstName} continues: \"You pretend to be accepting, but you, too, fear Wizard Kings. Why is it that people love those who are granted power, but hate those who take it? What is so great about self-righteous passivity?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_902@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Wizard Kings have withstood torture and truly worked for their powers.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_902@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Ascended Champions are better. Power should not be taken, but granted.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_902@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I am not joining this argument.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_902@TITLE"
msgstr "Inciting Argument"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_903@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Alfred.FirstName} looks at you. \"{PlayerLeader.Title} {PlayerLeader.FirstName}, what do you think? Is the torture—\" {Noctus.FirstName} harrumphs—\"...Experimenting of Lost Wizards immoral, or justified?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_903@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "During a diplomatic gathering, {Alfred.Title} {Alfred.FirstName} and {Noctus.Title} {Noctus.FirstName} have an argument. \"I cannot condone your experiments, {Noctus.FirstName}.\" {Alfred.FirstName} says."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_903@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Your experiments on [hyperlink,GLOBAL.LostWizardLoreConcept]Lost Wizards[/hyperlink] are... immoral. They may be monsters, but they are tortured souls who used to be people, like us.\"[br/]{Noctus.FirstName} scoffs. \"It is typical for those of lesser intellect to fear science they do not comprehend. My experiments serve the greater good. As you say, Lost Wizards are tortured souls. How is this fate, to serve my pursuit for knowledge, worse than an eternity in the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}?\"[br/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_903@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Experimenting on Lost Wizards is immoral. They were once like you and me.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_903@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"All is allowed for the sake of science.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_903@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Withhold any comment."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_903@TITLE"
msgstr "Price of Knowledge"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_915@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"My wards and distance render me unable to delve deeper, but your presence on the Sehiran Oasis may enable you to see what affects this human {Edward.Name}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_915@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your troops enter the domain of {Edward.TitleName}, you start to sense something is affecting the realm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_915@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{Broker.FirstName} appears. \"So you sense it too. There has been a shift in the energies in the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. I am starting to suspect this is the cause of the 'erratic' behavior of the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but I am unsure of its origin. I have warded myself against any unwanted influences, but this also impairs my ability to look deeper into the cause.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_915@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Reach out to the strange energies surging through the Astral Sea."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_915@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Avert your eyes."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_915@TITLE"
msgstr "Erratic Energies"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_916@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"My wards render me unable to delve deeper, but your increasing control of the <<m:EventStructure>> may enable you to see what affects everyone.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_916@BODY_FOOTER@DOMAIN_VERSION"
msgstr "\"My wards and distance render me unable to delve deeper, but your presence on the Sehiran Oasis may enable you to see what affects this human {Edward.Name}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_916@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your control over the <<m:EventStructure>> grows, you start to sense something is affecting the realm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_916@BODY_HEADER@DOMAIN_VERSION"
msgstr "As your troops enter the domain of {Edward.TitleName}, you start to sense something is affecting the realm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_916@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{Broker.FirstName} appears. \"So you sense it too. There has been a shift in the energies in the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. I am starting to suspect this is the cause of the 'erratic' behavior of the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but I am unsure of its origin. I have warded myself against any unwanted influences, but this also impairs my ability to look deeper into the cause.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_916@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Reach out to the strange energies surging through the Astral Sea."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_916@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Avert your eyes."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_916@TITLE"
msgstr "Erratic Energies"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The energies seem threatening, but also... liberating. Ever shifting, ever enraged, ever alive. You..."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The chaotic energies of the realm collide in a cacophony of sounds, scents, visions and emotions which threaten to overwhelm your senses."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Rage soars through your body, followed by the greatest joy and the deepest despair. In the midst of this ever-changing maelstrom you sense an identity, an entity, observing your response. It is not here, not truly. But its presence is... everywhere, surging through the entire Astral Sea.[br/][br/]\"These energies,\" {Laryssa.FirstName} says, \"I have felt them too... mainly around {Edward.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "...Accept them."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "...Denounce them! [orderboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "...Deflect them. [astralboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "...Ground yourself against them. [natureboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "...Protect yourself against them. [materiumboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "...Ward yourself against them. [shadowboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "...Rejoice in them! [chaosboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "...Reject them."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_952@TITLE"
msgstr "Vision of Pandemonium"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} fight a war they cannot win alone, so I had to free entities powerful enough to make a difference. Now I aim to limit the... unfortunate side effects.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As {Sundren.FirstName} joins you, she explains further: \"I believe {Edward.FirstName}, and the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, are influenced by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Endailon[/hyperlink] of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink].\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The Endailon are very powerful entities that originate from the start of creation. They brought balance to the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but also destruction. So the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} locked them in the World Vault {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. A great wizard taught me about them before he disappeared, and until I can find him, I must continue his work in his stead.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I accept your explanation.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"If you wish to resolve the problems you have caused, join me here.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Your methods were dishonorable, but your goals seem noble. That, I can accept.\" [orderboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Sometimes destruction leads to regrowth in a never-ending cycle. I can accept that.\" [natureboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"The truly strong will be able to withstand anything these Endailon can cause.\" [materiumboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Any powerful cosmic entity deserves to be known—and perhaps channeled.\" [astralboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"For some, deception is a second nature that I can hardly judge.\" [shadowboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "\"Unfortunate? I find the chaos enlightening!\" [chaosboon/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "\"None of this justifies your deceit. Begone.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_954@TITLE"
msgstr "Endailon of Chaos"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_959@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Laryssa.FirstName} was wounded, but has escaped death. It will take some time for her to regain her strength."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_959@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Laryssa.Name} was defeated in battle under your command!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_959@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Through effort, luck, or something else entirely, she managed to survive the onslaught and made it back to safety. \"That was close, {PlayerLeader.FirstName},\" she says. \"Let's not try that again, shall we?\" "

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_959@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "So be it."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_959@TITLE"
msgstr "Laryssa Defeated"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_963@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With {Edward.FirstName} and {Laryssa.FirstName} in tow you travel to Magehaven to resolve the strife there."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_963@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have stopped the incursion of {Edward.TitleName} and brought a sense of peace to the Sehiran Oasis."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_963@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "As {Laryssa.FirstName} tends to {Edward.FirstName}, who slowly comes to his senses, {Broker.FirstName} appears in front of you once more. \"This Trial has resulted in a perhaps unexpected outcome, but with our findings and these humans' testimonies, I should be able to return a sense of control to {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. I urge you to return here with them, so we can resolve this entire affair.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_963@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Onwards!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_963@TITLE"
msgstr "Sehiran Oasis: Victory"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_964@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I am destruction! I am liberation! I am the {Edward.Title} of the Commonwealth! I will not be defeated!\"[br/][br/]Violent energies coalesce around {Edward.FirstName}... heralding the approach of dangers beyond the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Astral Veil[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_964@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you reach the capital of {Edward.TitleName}, his rage reaches new heights."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_964@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Your approach only brings me closer to victory! My <<m:EventUnit>> and <<m:EventUnit2>> will crush you as they did when {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} was invaded! On Manuhari I received a vision, a burning truth: A glorious fury, cleansing the entire {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. From the ashes of your cities, the glory of the Commonwealth will be reborn!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_964@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I am ready for you.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_964@TITLE"
msgstr "Chaos Incarnate"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_965@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I am destruction! I am liberation! I am the {Edward.Title} of the Commonwealth! I will not be defeated!\"[br/]Violent energies coalesce around {Edward.FirstName}... heralding the approach of dangers beyond the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Astral Veil[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_965@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you gain more control over the <<m:EventStructure>> on the realm, the rage of {Edward.TitleName} increases."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_965@BODY_HEADER@CAPITAL_DOMAIN_V"
msgstr "As you reach the capital of {Edward.TitleName}, his rage reaches new heights."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_965@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Your approach only brings me closer to victory! My <<m:EventUnit>> and <<m:EventUnit2>> will crush you as they did when {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} was invaded! No Shadowborn or [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralMonstersLoreConcept]Astral Sea Monster[/hyperlink] can stop us. From the ashes of your cities, the glory of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept]Commonwealth[/hyperlink] will be reborn!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_965@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I am ready for you.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1140_965@TITLE"
msgstr "Chaos Incarnate"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_22@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Give {EventHouseLord} one of your <<m:{GLOBAL.DiplomaticTokenConcept.Hyperlink}>> to start <<m:{GLOBAL.NegotiationConcept.Hyperlink}>> and gradually improve their {GLOBAL.HouseInfluenceConcept.Hyperlink} to you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_22@BODY_FOOTER@PLAYER_IS_REAVER"
msgstr "Gain {GLOBAL.WarSpoilsConcept.Hyperlink} to intimidate {EventHouseLord} and improve their {GLOBAL.InfluenceConcept.Hyperlink} with you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_22@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} of {EventHouse.Name} greets you with a nod."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_22@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Greetings, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}! You, like us, seem to understand what is necessary to discard the fetters that burden this realm. Your folk is united under the banner of progress. Our interests align. Let us act upon it.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_22@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Inspect their military might."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_22@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave them be. You have other plans."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_22@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Leave them be. You have other plans."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_22@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Pragmatic {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_23@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Give {EventHouseLord} one of your <<m:{GLOBAL.DiplomaticTokenConcept.Hyperlink}>> to start <<m:{GLOBAL.NegotiationConcept.Hyperlink}>> and gradually improve their {GLOBAL.HouseInfluenceConcept.Hyperlink} to you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_23@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} of {EventHouse.Name} greets you with a nod."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_23@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Greetings, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}! Your culture intrigues us, and we believe a cooperation could benefit us all. With our technology and your expertise as {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, we can make this realm truly ours. Why don't we set up communication and become powerful allies?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_23@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Inspect {EventHouse.Name}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_23@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Decline the offer, for now."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_23@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Expansionist {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_24@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Give {EventHouseLord} one of your <<m:{GLOBAL.DiplomaticTokenConcept.Hyperlink}>> to start <<m:{GLOBAL.NegotiationConcept.Hyperlink}>> and gradually improve their {GLOBAL.HouseInfluenceConcept.Hyperlink} to you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_24@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} of {EventHouse.Name} greets you with a stern face."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_24@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"What do you want on this realm, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}? Conquest? Pillage? Destruction? Our weapons are sharp, our [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MagelockLoreConcept]Magelocks[/hyperlink] are readied. We will fight you if we must, but let us not grind ourselves to death. A peaceful solution would be more practical. Do you agree?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_24@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Investigate whether {EventHouse} is worthy of your attention."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_24@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Keep your business to yourself."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_24@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Militant {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_25@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You are at war with {EventHouse.Name}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_25@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} {EventHouse.Name} greets you with hostility."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_25@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You are in our way, {PlayerLeader.Name}! War is inevitable. We {EventHouseRace.Name} of {EventHouse.Name} are a proud people and will fight for our freedom. With our spears sharpened and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MagelockLoreConcept]Magelocks[/hyperlink] loaded, we can defeat everyone else who threatens us, even the likes of you.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_25@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Inspect the insolent {EventHouse.Name}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_25@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"So be it!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_25@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Hostile {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventStackLeader} nods sternly. “Unfortunately, I need to ask you to leave. This place belongs to {EventHouse}.”"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The sound of magical explosions shatters the sky around the {EventStructure.Name}. A company of fighters of {EventHouse} is practicing with [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MagelockLoreConcept]Magelock weaponry[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "One of the soldiers tries to get your attention. With a proud smile <<p:EventStackLeader>> explains: “These beauties are the pinnacle of technology, powerful enough to slay any beast! By flipping a switch anyone can become a mighty fighter.” <<Cp:EventStackLeader>> shoots the head off a practice dummy to emphasize <<o:EventStackLeader>> point. “We created something truly magnificent here.”"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Leave, and {EventCity} will give you the best training [unitprod/] possible.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Enter my service instead [unit/], and I will shower you in gold [gold/]!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I challenge you to a battle of skills! The winner gets the {EventStructure.Name}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Your magelocks do not impress me. Bow before true dragonfire!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I claim this {EventStructure}. {EventHouse} will fall!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"I will leave you to your training.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_30@TITLE"
msgstr "Magelock Weapon Practice"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "One of the engineers explains: \"We are trying to extract Essence. You can stay and watch, but do not touch anything.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Approaching the {EventStructure.Name}, a group of engineers guarded by an {EventStackLeader} comes in sight."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {EventRace} are working on a triangular man-sized device. Pipe-like structures emerge from its center and extend into the environment. The device seems to be connected to Essence, but you can not ascertain in what way. As the gears start turning, the pipes start glowing and thick smoke comes out of the machine's center."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Leave, and I will bring you the finest research equipment [knowledge/] in the realm.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I am not interested in your experiment; I came here for blood!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Your experiments are an affront to nature! Flee, before you feel its wrath!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Sabotage the experiment to make them leave."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I will leave you to your experiments.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_32@TITLE"
msgstr "Essence Experiments"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_48@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "It might be dangerous, but you could learn to control this new power. Will you tap into this unfathomable energy?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_48@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A strange sensation courses through your veins, after your acquisition of the {EventStructure} has brought you closer to the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_48@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With each moment, your control of the Seals grows and the connection becomes stronger. You feel like you could touch the very essence of this realm, as if you could play with {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} like they were strings of yarn. However, every time you reach out for them, you notice something else: a danger lurking behind that power."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_48@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Embrace the feeling despite the dangers."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_48@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Ask your mages for assistance [knowledge/] in understanding this power."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_48@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Shun it, it is too dangerous."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_48@TITLE"
msgstr "A Strange Feeling"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_49@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The Seal brings new awareness, its power at your fingertips. How do you use this surge of power?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_49@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your increasing control of the {EventStructure} is causing new powers to surge through you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_49@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "For a moment you feel as if you have the entire realm at your fingertips. You sense the veil separating it from the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. You can even sense distant {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, pulling in magics from beyond... But not for much longer. With the <<m:EventStructure>> in your possession you will soon be able to control anyone and anything that attempts to enter—or leave."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_49@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Pull a creature [unit/] through the veil."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_49@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Increase your magical capabilities. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_49@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Channel these powers for the next insurgence of Seal Defenders."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_49@TITLE"
msgstr "Piercing the Veil"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_50@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your scholars are eager to learn how you plan to use the artifact."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_50@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While uncovering the secrets of the {EventStructure}, your archaeologists found an artifact of a people called the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]Ancient Krazura[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_50@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Scholars from all kinds of disciplines gather around the artifact, in excitement they speak out a jumble of explanations as to what the artifact might be: \"It could be some kind of weapon\" — \"Its interior structure unlike anything we know.\" — \"We could reference it to the creation of the Seals.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_50@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take it apart and study [knowledge/] its inner workings."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_50@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Wield it as a weapon. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_50@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Destroy it [evilact/]. Your own technology is the only one that matters. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_50@TITLE"
msgstr "Krazura Artifact"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_51@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your head scholar looks at you, barely containing <<o:EventUnit>> excitement. \"Where do you want to divert our efforts to?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_51@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"We did it!\" Your mages studying the {EventStructure} gather excitedly. \"The runes on the Seal, we decrypted them!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_51@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The scholar points at a stone tablet full of glowing runes in an ancient language.“ It has been left behind by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archons[/hyperlink]. They speak of mastering the Seals and the secrets of its creation. Of golems, of the ancient Krazura... There is so much we can learn from this!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_51@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Study its magic [knowledge/] to amplify your own magical capabilities."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_51@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Use the findings to support your scholars in their current research [knowledge/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_51@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Have your engineers decipher how to command a golem [unit/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_51@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Share your findings with the world. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_51@TITLE"
msgstr "Lost Knowledge"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_52@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your researchers very carefully retrieve the Krazuran artifacts. What do you want to do with this source of knowledge?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_52@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Discovering the secrets of the {EventStructure} also uncovered knowledge about its creators, a people named the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]Ancient Krazura[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_52@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The origin of the Krazura dates back to a time when [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archons[/hyperlink] still traveled these realms. The avian people created wonderful structures and intricate mechanisms. Now, your researchers uncovered artifacts that show their theories about magic and the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_52@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Study [knowledge/] the artifacts to channel magic [mana/] on your side."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_52@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Put the artifacts on display for your people [happiness/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_52@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Take the objects apart to reforge them into something useful. [bindingfragments/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_52@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "One of the artifacts seem particularly useful... [item/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_52@TITLE"
msgstr "Krazuran Theories"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "If you don’t stabilize the Seal, it will be a matter of time until the Seal releases deadly energy."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Reports accumulate of shifts in reality near your {EventStructure}. The Seal becomes unstable."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A barely visible force pulsates outwards from the Seal, changing the surroundings around it. Plants wilt at an alarming rate. Rocks change their shapes into indescribable figures. Cracks appear on the ground. With every pulse the changes become more deadly."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Strengthen [mana/] the Seal to stabilize it."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Allow the event to happen. Gather your scholars to study it! [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Control the inner mechanisms of the Seal. Repair the structure!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Embrace the chaos! Welcome the cataclysm and call forth a new ally!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Redirect the deadly energy to channel its power."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Build [structureprod/] a containment around it."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_53@TITLE"
msgstr "Unstable Seal"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You should act, if you want to save your people."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your workforce at the {EventStructure} is being driven mad. They claim they are hearing voices."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Reports of strange behavior are brought to your attention. Your people working on increasing your control of the <<m:EventStructure>> seem to hear voices inside their heads: Screams in languages they don’t know. In extreme cases, it starts affecting their behavior. Instead of doing their work, they are seen staring at the Seal for hours."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Send researchers [knowledge/] to investigate the phenomenon and find a remedy."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Assign additional workers [structureprod/] to the Seal to relieve the current watch."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Deploy a force [unitprod/] to keep a close eye on your workers."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "A prayer shall help them stay on the right path."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Do nothing."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1149_54@TITLE"
msgstr "Maddening Voices"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You are a good liege to me and my {EventRace}, my {PlayerLeader.Title}. How can I help you win this war?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While you are planning your strategy against your war opponent, {EnemyPlayer}, {EventHouseLord} of {EventHouse}, your vassal, contacts you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {EventHouseLord.Title} kneels before you, averting <<o:EventHouseLord>> eyes. \"Your battles are my own, my {PlayerLeader.Title}, as they ought to be. You are my Overlord and I your humble [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PactOfVassalageConcept]vassal[/hyperlink].\" {EventHouseLord.FirstName} lifts <<o:EventHouseLord>> head and <<o:EventHouseLord>> piercing gaze inspires you. \"With the strength of {EventHouse} at your side, we will claim victory over {EnemyPlayer}!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Your contribution to my war chest [gold/] is much appreciated.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"As Overlord, I am owed considerable tribute!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Lend {EventCity} a few of your drill instructors.\" [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Send your finest captains [unitprod/] to {EventCity}. I shall compensate you.\" [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Just hand over the command of your {EventUnit} to me.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"All I require is your support as my vassal, {EventHouseLord.FirstName}!\" [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_120@TITLE"
msgstr "Tribute Towards Triumph"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"{EnemyPlayer} marches upon my city, O {PlayerLeader.Title}. Will you come to your loyal vassal's aid?\" What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Hostile forces of {EnemyPlayer} have crossed into the domain of your vassal, {EventHouseLord} of {EventHouse}! A distressed {EventHouseLord.FirstName} contacts you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"An incursion! An incursion!\" You barely recognize the {EventHouseLord.Title}, who is usually quite composed. \"Our enemy is upon my {EventHouseRace}, O {PlayerLeader.Title}! Save them! Save ME!\" Your vassal suddenly pauses and tilts <<o:EventHouseLord>> head. \"Listen! I hear the drums of war in the distance!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Hastily train [unitprod/] a {EventUnitA} to help with <<G:defense^n,EventHouse>>."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Instantly summon [mana/] a {EventUnitB} nearby {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Reserve the harvest [food/] for drilling recruits [unitprod/] throughout your realm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Fallen warriors of yore will awaken to defend your domain, {EventHouseLord.FirstName}!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"You're on your own, {EventHouseLord.Title}. Good luck.\" [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_121@TITLE"
msgstr "In Dire Straits"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you spend resources to save {EventCity} from <<G:grasp^n,EnemyPlayer>>? Or do you elect to salvage some of its resources?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouse}, the city of your vassal {EventHouseLord}, is besieged by your enemy in war, {EnemyPlayer}! {EventHouseLord.FirstName} pleads for help."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I cannot say how long until they break through, O mighty {PlayerLeader.Title}. The pounding of battering rams thunders through my streets! Debris, flung high by machines of war, cleaves the sky! My {EventRace} sought shelter in basements and bunkers, biding time until the inevitable breach.\" {EventHouseLord.FirstName} stands proud, although <<o:EventHouseLord>> eyes are misty. \"{EventHouse} may fall today,\" <<p:EventHouseLord>> sighs."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Migrate refugees [population/] from {EventHouse} to {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Smuggle the {EventItem} out of <<G:treasury^n,EventHouse>> and to yourself. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Secure the coin [gold/] in <<G:vault^n,EventHouse>>."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Summon [mana/] three <<m:EventUnit>> [unit/] for {EventHouseLord.FirstName} to help <<G:defense^n,EventCity>>."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Incite mayhem within the ranks of the sieging army."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Reinforce the fortifications of {EventHouse} from afar."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_122@TITLE"
msgstr "Salvage or Salvation"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Truthfully, all Godir and Rulers of this realm pale compared to us... I mean you, O {PlayerLeader.Title}. Show them power!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your vassal, {EventHouseLord} of {EventHouse}, urgently requests an audience and appears gravely antagonized."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This is an outrage, my liege! The lords of this realm should tremble before us, and you in particular! Yet unchallenged, {RivalHouse} continuously expands its borders! Meanwhile, {RivalPlayer} builds <<o:RivalPlayer>> {GLOBAL.WizardTowerConcept} high! The hubris!\" The {EventHouseLord.Title} wrinkles <<o:EventHouseLord>> nose. \"We need to shake things up. Cause mayhem! Show these amateurs that WE set the rules!\" {EventHouseLord.FirstName} presents a guileful smile."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"{RivalHouse} will succumb to the indomitable might of my empire!\" [influence/] [relation/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I declare {RivalPlayer} to be an incompetent coward! An unfit ruler!\" [influence/] [relation/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"My vassal, {EventHouseLord.FirstName} of {EventHouse}, outclasses every Godir of this realm!\" [allegiance/] [relation/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"{EventHouseLord.FirstName}, disrupting of the natural power balance of this realm is imprudent.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I do not tolerate this warmongering. It is not how I rule.\" [relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_123@TITLE"
msgstr "Stirring the Pot"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The farmers offer to donate their pitchforks and plowshares to your soldiers. Will you accept?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Farmers from <<G:fields^p,EventCity>> request to speak with you. Their leader announces that they wish to aid your war against {EnemyPlayer} of {EnemyHouse}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BODY_HEADER@ENEMY_IS_PLAYER"
msgstr "Farmers from <<G:fields^p,EventCity>> request to speak with you. Their leader announces that they wish to aid your war against {EnemyPlayer}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We know our place, my {PlayerLeader.Title}. We don't understand the minds of Godir and Lords.\" The farmers shuffle around uncomfortably, avoiding your appraising gaze. \"We do understand that, if {EnemyPlayer} sends <<o:EnemyPlayer>> armies to {EventCity}, they will plow through our crops. And through our families. So, we reckoned our tools make for decent weapons in your soldiers' hands, O {PlayerLeader.Title}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Yes! Pitchforks [food/] are great for stabbing [unitprod/] too!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"What I demand from you serfs [happiness/] is to farm harder!\" [food/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Your concerns are noted. I will conscript [gold/] an additional {EventUnit}.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Take up arms yourself! It is your duty to lord and land!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I will handle the strategies. You tend the crops.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_126@TITLE"
msgstr "Pitchforks to Pikes"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Moving <<G:scholars^p,EventCity>> from their comfortable alcoves to the battlefield should improve your army strength. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A general discusses the war with {EnemyHouse} with you, when <<p:EventActor>> remarks: \"Curse those page-gazing scribes! Meanwhile, my boys are dying out there!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BODY_HEADER@ENEMY_IS_PLAYER"
msgstr "A general discusses <<G:war^n,EnemyPlayer>> with you, when <<p:EventActor>> remarks: \"Curse those page-gazing scribes! Meanwhile, my boys are dying out there!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The general keenly elaborates: \"It's unfair, my {PlayerLeader.Title}. My soldiers sacrifice their lives for you. What do your mages and scholars in {EventCity} do all day? Sit in ivory towers and dusty libraries! I say we put those bookworms to better use. Knowledge is only half the battle, after all... the other half demands plenty of troops in the field!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Deploy my scholars. [mana/] They will make fine <<m:EventUnitA>>!\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Send in the librarians [knowledge/] after training them as <<m:EventUnitB>>!\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Bad idea. The scholars [mana/] [knowledge/] will instead educate <<G:recruits^p,EventCity>>.\" [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"And lose talented scribes to war? They will summon a {EventUnitC} instead!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I deem this an unwise and uneducated decision.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_127@TITLE"
msgstr "Booksmart and Battlewise"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Knowing that you possess coin but lack soldiers, the commander of the {RandomIdol} mercenaries offers his trained troops to you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The war against {EnemyPlayer} of {EnemyHouse} has exposed to all that you have abundant gold reserves, yet few troops in your armies."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BODY_HEADER@ENEMY_IS_PLAYER"
msgstr "The war against {EnemyPlayer} has exposed to all that you have abundant gold reserves, yet few troops in your armies."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A mercenary company visits you. Their savvy commander introduces <<r:EventUnit>>: \"Most of me fighters used to be with the {RandomWarriorTitle} of the {RandomIdol}. But we chose greed over our creed!\" <<Co:EventUnit>> own joke makes the {EventUnit} chuckle to <<r:EventUnit>>. \"Anyways, we figure you might be interested in hiring a few of our best, so you can finally oust {EnemyPlayer}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Hire [gold/] the low-rank mercenaries: a {EventUnitA} and a {EventUnitB}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Hire [gold/] the hale mercenaries: a {EventUnitC} and a {EventUnitD}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Hire [gold/] the exceptionally trained mercenaries: a {EventUnitE} and a {EventUnitF}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Hire a {EventUnitG} from the Mercenary Guild's Black Market."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Turn the greedy mercenaries away."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_128@TITLE"
msgstr "Savvy Sellswords"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"There is only so much we can bear,\" plead your city councilors. \"Can you offer us any form of solace?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your war against {EnemyPlayer} of {EnemyHouse} weighs heavy on your cities, {EventCity} most of all. Advisors share the cities' concerns with you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BODY_HEADER@ENEMY_IS_PLAYER"
msgstr "Your war against {EnemyPlayer} weighs heavy on your cities, {EventCity} most of all. Advisors share the cities' concerns with you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"It's not that they necessarily reject this war of yours, my {PlayerLeader.Title}. But the citizens are forced to relinquish their comforts and delights. Worse so, many watch their sons and daughters enlist in your armies.\" The councilors all nod and murmur in agreement. \"They would support your campaign more if you showed them you care.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Buy [gold/] an abundance of luxurious goods [happiness/] for all!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Allow recruits [unitprod/] to return [happiness/] to their family farms. [food/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Study [knowledge/] what makes people happy and apply those lessons. [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Materialize a gift in every home in your realm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Ignore your cities' objections. You have a war to win!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_129@TITLE"
msgstr "Solacing Sacrifices"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Put your people back in line, my {PlayerLeader.Title},\" your chancellor advises. \"Hurt them dearly. Crush their hearts. Then, blame {EnemyPlayer}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your battles against {EnemyPlayer} of {EnemyHouse} have barely gotten interesting and, sure enough, your people are already complaining about the war."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BODY_HEADER@ENEMY_IS_PLAYER"
msgstr "Your battles against {EnemyPlayer} have barely gotten interesting and, sure enough, your people are already complaining about the war."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You seal the decree for public lashing, when a malicious chancellor slinks out of the shadows. \"O Great {PlayerLeader.Title}, the rabble is growing restless, especially in {EventCity}! What succor do they think they are owed?\" The chancellor shuffles forward and wets <<o:EventUnit>> lips. \"Your commoners have developed such confidence that they forget they shouldn't fear {EnemyPlayer}. They must fear you!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Launch an attack [evilact/] on your citizens [population/] in {EventCity}. Blame {EnemyPlayer}! [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Sabotage the construction [structureprod/] in {EventCity}. [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Brutally slaughter [evilact/] weak {EventHeroMin}. [unit/] Make it look like <<G:handiwork^n,EnemyPlayer>>. [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Incite a war frenzy in your population."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Ignore <<P:EventUnit>>. You don't care how miserable your population is."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_130@TITLE"
msgstr "False Flag Strike"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Rejected constructs shamble towards {EventHero.FirstName}. A {EnemyUnit} trips and promptly explodes in a fountain of molten steel. Will {EventHero.FirstName} attack?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Rejected constructs shamble towards {EventHero.FirstName}. A {EnemyUnit} trips and promptly explodes in a fountain of molten steel. Will {EventHero.FirstName} attack?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After stepping into the {EventStructure}, {EventHero} finds <<r:EventHero>> on an ancient, dusty plateau of stone and steel."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "After stepping into the {EventStructure}, you find yourself on an ancient, dusty plateau of stone and steel."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Soon, {EventHero.FirstName} discerns lumbering shapes of <<m:EnemyUnit>> and other machines. One scratches at a column and, judging from the groove's depth, has done so for centuries. Another marches jerkily in tight circles. Suddenly, someone loudly trips over a steel plate that a {EventUnitB} dropped! The machines take notice. One by one, their heads rotate towards your troops, locking onto targets."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Soon, you discern lumbering shapes of <<m:EnemyUnit>> and other machines. One scratches at a column and, judging from the groove's depth, has done so for centuries. Another marches jerkily in tight circles. Suddenly, someone loudly trips over a steel plate that a {EventUnitB} dropped! The machines take notice. One by one, their heads rotate towards your troops, locking onto targets."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Permanently put the defective constructs out of commission!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Affix [structureprod/] scattered pieces of {EventUnitB} plates to your armor for protection."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Enchant the constructs' heads to rotate and lock onto {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BUTTON_2@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Enchant the constructs' heads to rotate and lock onto yourself."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Retreat for now and seal up the machines again."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_80@TITLE"
msgstr "Contained Constructs"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As your troops clear out the {EventStructure}, you permit yourself to take one of the machines' treasures. Which one?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "For the first time in centuries, silence returns to the ancient {EventStructure}. The constructs are finally still and at peace."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventHero} investigates the ancient site. Faded glyphs and colorful mosaics reveal to <<P:EventHero>> that the plateau was originally created by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]Ancient Krazura[/hyperlink], but later used to detain constructs that showed defects, were overtly volatile, or that were discarded for other reasons. Upon entering the long-forgotten repository, the decaying constructs' behavior modules immediately assumed your troops were acute threats."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You investigate the ancient site. Faded glyphs and colorful mosaics reveal to you that the plateau was created by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]Ancient Krazura[/hyperlink], but later used to detain constructs that showed defects, were overtly volatile, or that were discarded for other reasons. Upon entering the long-forgotten repository, the decaying constructs' behavior modules immediately assumed your troops were acute threats."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take the ancient {EventItem}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Haul away the copious gold armor pieces [gold/] that litter the floors."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Reanimate [unit/] an immobilized {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Learn the secret of {EventSpell} by studying the exploded constructs."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_81@TITLE"
msgstr "Contained Constructs: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A tinny-voiced {EnemyUnit} snarls:[br/]\"What goes on no legs in the morning, [br/]four legs in the afternoon, [br/]and wings in the evening? Answer me!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} steps through the gate of the {EventStructure} and is engulfed by a sea of lush leaves and warm winds."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You step through the gate of the {EventStructure} and are engulfed by a sea of lush leaves and warm winds."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A writhing cacophony of birdsong welcomes <<P:EventHero>>. {EventHero.FirstName} breathes in the humid air and experiences a pull, as if propelled forward. <<Cp:EventHero>> senses movement in the nearby undergrowth. A small critter leaps out and agonizingly evolves into a {EventUnitB} before <<o:EventHero>> very eyes! Then, without warning, a gale topples nearby trees. An enormous Construct lands in the clearing it created."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A writhing cacophony of birdsong welcomes you. You breathe in the humid air and experience a pull, as if propelled forward. You sense movement in the nearby undergrowth. A small critter leaps out and agonizingly evolves into a {EventUnitB} before your very eyes! Then, without warning, a gale topples nearby trees. An enormous Construct lands in the clearing it created."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Nothing I can't kill! Attack!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I know this! [knowledge/] \"Dragon\" is the answer! Adjust your defenses, troops!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "A rapidly developing dragon? Nature's laws forbid your forced evolution!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Whatever it is, it won't catch us today! Retreat!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_82@TITLE"
msgstr "Sequestered Developments"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_83@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"One final riddle remains\", the {EventUnit} groans. \"What mortal bounty should I bequeath unto you?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_83@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Its creatures defeated and wings clipped, the {EventUnit} shrieks with the sound of steel wire twining, then crashes to earth."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_83@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It lifts its head one last time and speaks: \"Your puzzled expression amuses me. Have you not invaded my domain to steal my secrets? My creators, praise their feathers, tasked me to protect this hidden sanctuary. I adapted myself and those I was tasked to protect... And still I failed.\" The {EventUnit} sighs, and you are reminded of an iron flagpole creaking in a storm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_83@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Learn the spell of {EventSpell}!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_83@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Request the verdant {EventItem}. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_83@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "A {EventUnitB} for your army. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_83@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Obtain the {EvolutionTome}!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_83@TITLE"
msgstr "Sequestered Developments: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A luxuriously garbed {GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept} reveals <<r:EventGodir>>: \"I am {EnemyUnit}, <<EventGodir{God/Goddess}>> of Wealth! Take my hand and stay a while!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon entering the {EventStructure}, {EventHero} shields <<o:EventHero>> eyes from the blinding sunlight bouncing off white sands and golden idols."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Upon entering the {EventStructure}, you shield your eyes from the blinding sunlight bouncing off white sands and golden idols."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} is inside an arena, amidst a dozen gold statues. Most of them are rooted in gold puddles that spot the white sandy plains. Soldiers. Servants. Beasts. Furniture and food. All wrought from gold—Wait! Did that statue just move?! Then, {EventHero.FirstName} hears snickering. \"My, my,\" a raspy voice resounds throughout the arena. \"Have they lifted my exile at last?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You are inside an arena, amidst a dozen gold statues. Most of them are rooted in gold puddles that spot the white sandy plains. Soldiers. Servants. Beasts. Furniture and food. All wrought from gold—Wait! Did that statue just move?! Then, you hear snickering. \"My, my,\" a raspy voice resounds throughout the arena. \"Have they lifted my exile at last?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You may take my cold steel, {EnemyUnit}!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Those puddles of gold seem treacherous! Cast preemptive counter spells. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Mutter an incantation to shield your troops from unexpected aureate hexes."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "No, thanks! Retreat from this gilded realm and seal the gate."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@RACENAME"
msgstr "Touched by My'dhas"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_84@TITLE"
msgstr "Touch of My'dhas"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As My'dhas spends <<o:EventGodir>> final breaths, your troops collect <<o:EventGodir>> hoard. How else will you profit from My'dhas's demise?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your warriors proved more than {EventGodir} and <<o:EventGodir>> golden host bargained for. The impoverished {GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept} lies at your feet."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Not quite... hnng! ... the golden destiny I had coined for myself,\" the fallen {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept} smirks through the pain. \"How precious! First, my rivals enviously seal me away.\" My'dhas coughs up gold blood. \"And when my prison opens next, vault robbers arrive to raid my treasures!\" The self-proclaimed <<EventGodir{God/Goddess}>> of Wealth spits scornfully. \"Take my riches. May you choke on them.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Procure the radiant {EventItem}. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Extract the enchantment [mana/] from My'dhas's bewitched body."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Reanimate [unit/] an intact {EventUnit} that remained dormant."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Steal a fraction of My'dhas's enchantment to create a {EventUnitB}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@HERO@FIRSTNAME"
msgstr "My'dhas^M"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@1167_85@TITLE"
msgstr "Touch of My'dhas: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "This {EventHero} takes you for a savior. Reflecting on your decision to venture to Manuhari, you cannot help but smile."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the vision ends, you begin to take in the details of your surroundings."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The sight of the lush tangled flora; the buzz of colorful birds shrieking and squawking as they constantly switch from layer to layer of the verdant thicket; the smell of sprayed water, a refreshing echo of a distant waterfall, the static tension of profound magic inhabiting the land—the sensations of Manuhari's jungle are enticing, overwhelming, even intrusive."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I have indeed come to bring peace [goodact/].\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I came to tame the wild creatures [unit/] of Manuhari.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"The myths [knowledge/] surrounding the ancient {EventRace} bode power.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I must study the astral flows [mana/] of this forgotten world, unknown to all.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"My people thrive in conflicts [happiness/] like this one and the opportunities they bring.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"This intervention will spread my legend [influence/] of restored order.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"War parties in need are excellent trading victims [gold/].\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "\"I shall exploit their weakness [unitprod/] [evilact/], so foolishly revealed.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5193@TITLE"
msgstr "Freed Lands of Manuhari"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5202@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Now that you are here, {PlayerLeader}, I offer you my services to bring an end to the conflict on Manuhari in any way necessary.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5202@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Approaching the scene of a large broken landship, carefully placed arcane markings lead you to {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5202@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Well met, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}!\" {EventHero.FirstName} says, leaving concealment. \"What you see here are the sorry remains of the vessel to which I—and all the {EventRace}—owe our lives. Alas, it only led to more misery...\" {EventHero.FirstName} sighs. \"{GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the leader of our company, provoked the war with the {NativeRace}, only to leave the realm soon after. He left {EventPlayer} in charge. {EventPlayer.FirstName} is an honorable person and might be reasoned with, if <<o:EventPlayer>> loyalty to Edward doesn't betray <<P:EventPlayer>>.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5202@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept {EventHero} [unit/] into your army."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5202@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Install {EventHero} as an arcane counselor [knowledge/] in your wizard's tower."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5202@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting the Sorceress"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5209@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Now, we are at open war with the {EventRace}—a war I did not seek, but intend to win.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5209@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Excellent. All <<PlayerLeader{brothers/sisters}>> in arms are welcome to serve the cause of our new {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\" {EventPlayer} salutes you enthusiastically."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5209@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We have a problem,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} continues, abruptly changing topic, \"involving the locals of this realm, which is detrimental to the campaigns of our Supreme Leader {GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. The {EventRace} have acted adversarial since our first contact. We tried to negotiate a permit of settlement, yet their {NativePlayer.TitleName} insisted we should abandon all weapons, which we couldn't.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5209@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Allow {EventPlayer} to continue."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5209@TITLE"
msgstr "The War of Manuhari"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5214@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Our Supreme Leader {GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink} sent message of rare materials he encountered during his campaigns across the Astral Sea, which would quicken our war production further. We could confirm the occurrence of two such materials, {EventMaterial1} and {EventMaterial2}, on Manuhari. Will you help us obtain them?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5214@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"The {EventRace} are at a natural strategic advantage,\" {EventPlayer} continues to explain."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5214@BODY_HEADER@INDIRECT_JOIN"
msgstr "\"Excellent.\" {EventPlayer} smiles. \"All aid is welcome for the {EventRace} are at a natural strategic advantage.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5214@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"They know the terrain, are greater in numbers and have the infrastructure to supply their soldiers. We on the other hand are few and foreign to these lands - but we have two things the {EventRace} lack: technology and efficiency! The furnaces and forges of our assembly lines are worked by night and day, combining dreadnought war machines with devastating {GLOBAL.MagelockLoreConcept.Hyperlink} weaponry.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5214@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Consider it done.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5214@TITLE"
msgstr "Mechanized Production"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5215@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"As our ally, I want you to benefit from these advances, {PlayerLeader}. I am willing to share: weapons, knowledge, troops—choose what matches your strategy.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5215@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have obtained {EventMaterial1} and {EventMaterial2} for the new {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. {EventPlayer} is gratified."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5215@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Thanks to your contributions, our war production has reached new peak efficiency. It reminds me of the invention of Mana-Fuel Cells back on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and its promise of power and prosperity for the common man.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5215@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ask for soldiers [unit/] trained with magelock weapons."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5215@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Ask for the latest weapons [item/] developed by the {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5215@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Ask for supplies [bindingfragments/] to devise experimental weapons of your own."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5215@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Ask for insights [knowledge/] into mechanical constructs."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5215@TITLE"
msgstr "Mechanized Production: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The rumbling thunder of the {EventUnit} is drawing closer. With the large crystal in sight, {EventHero} must act quickly."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_FOOTER@NO_QUEST"
msgstr "Deedless, {EventHero} decides to leave the intriguing rocks behind, before they may mesmerize <<o:EventHero>> mind."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_FOOTER@NO_QUEST_RULER"
msgstr "Deedless, you decide to leave the intriguing rocks behind, before they may mesmerize your mind."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_FOOTER@RULER_IS_HERO"
msgstr "The rumbling thunder of the {EventUnit} is drawing closer. With the large crystal in sight, you must act quickly."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As {EventHero} combs through the rock formations, at last the secret entrance indicated by <<ge:scouts^p,EventPlayer.FirstName>> is revealed."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_HEADER@NO_QUEST"
msgstr "{EventHero} finds <<r:EventHero>> wandering through an ample, mazy field of rocks."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_HEADER@NO_QUEST_RULER"
msgstr "You find yourself wandering through an ample, mazy field of rocks."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_HEADER@RULER_IS_HERO"
msgstr "As you comb through the rock formations, at last the secret entrance indicated by <<ge:scouts^p,EventPlayer.FirstName>> is revealed."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Inside, {EventHero.FirstName} finds <<r:EventHero>> in a large cavern system sizzling with arcane energies. The cry of the Thundershriek echoes through the tunnels, while {EventHero.FirstName} carefully moves forward. Reaching the last chamber, <<p:EventHero>> is dazzled by the sight of an enormous floating crystal. Without a doubt this crystal must be linked to the Thundershriek's mysterious powers."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_LORE@NO_QUEST"
msgstr "There is a sense of something magical in the area, like an arcane presence hiding underneath the surface. But the feeling remains subtle and any efforts of following the astral echoes only lead to wandering."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_LORE@NO_QUEST_RULER"
msgstr "There is a sense of something magical in the area, like an arcane presence hiding underneath the surface. But the feeling remains subtle and any efforts of following the astral echoes only lead to wandering."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BODY_LORE@RULER_IS_HERO"
msgstr "Inside, you find yourself in a large cavern system sizzling with arcane energies. The cry of the Thundershriek echoes through the tunnels, while you carefully move forward. Reaching the last chamber, you are dazzled by the sight of an enormous floating crystal. Without a doubt this crystal must be linked to the Thundershriek's mysterious powers."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Charge at the crystal to put an end to the Thundershriek!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Flee."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@TITLE"
msgstr "Cave of the Thundershriek"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@TITLE@NO_QUEST"
msgstr "Suspicious Crag"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5234@TITLE@NO_QUEST_RULER"
msgstr "Suspicious Crag"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Even though they will never again resemble anything this potent, there is a clear opportunity to salvage and repurpose parts of the {EventUnit} and the crystal shards."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the crystal shattered, the Thundershriek is defeated at last."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "While the troops keep scouting the cavern for remaining enemies, {EventHero} examines the broken remains of the Thundershriek and its crystal, both masterful creations from a distant age and a clear testament to the magecraft and craftsmanship of the {GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@BODY_LORE@RULER_IS_HERO"
msgstr "While the troops keep scouting the cavern for remaining enemies, you examine the broken remains of the Thundershriek and its crystal, both masterful creations from a distant age and a clear testament to the magecraft and craftsmanship of the {GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Grind the shards down into binding essence [bindingfragments/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Decorate your throne room [influence/] with the Thundershriek armor."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Embed the crystal shards into a {EventItem} [item/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Leave it all to your mages for examination [knowledge/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5235@TITLE"
msgstr "Cave of the Thundershriek: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5238@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"At last, my scouts have tracked the Thundershriek to the {EventStructure}. There, the secret to its destruction must be hidden. Our war machines are susceptible to its lightning, making me hesitant to send force. So I ask you, {PlayerLeader}, will you face and destroy the Thundershriek?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5238@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"With our reinforcement lines going strong, it is time to discuss a more serious threat, {PlayerLeader}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5238@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Without doubt you must have witnessed the Thundershriek,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} continues, with fervor in <<o:EventPlayer>> eyes. \"The terrible creature, half construct, half bird, is the supposed god-protector of Manuhari and descends with lightning, wreaking havoc on our war machines. The {EventRace} say it is immortal and indeed whenever we shot it down, the Thundershriek magically retrieved its own parts and reassembled. I, however, don't believe in immortality.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5238@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The terror of Manuhari will end!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5238@TITLE"
msgstr "The Terror of Manuhari"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5239@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Now that our biggest war machines may safely be deployed again, I want you to have this, {PlayerLeader}: it is a reinvention of the Commonwealth's devastating landship, a moving fortress and siege breaker at once.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5239@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the Thundershriek destroyed for good, {EventPlayer} is overjoyed to speak to you."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5239@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"So the Thundershriek was kept alive by the magic of a pristine manacharged crystal? The Oscillator Gem... our Supreme Leader {GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink} will be very intrigued to hear of this. In any case, this is a major victory in our war against the {EventRace} and we owe it all to you, {PlayerLeader}!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5239@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept the {EventUnit} [unit/] into your army."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5239@TITLE"
msgstr "The Terror of Manuhari: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5241@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Eventually our Supreme Leader {GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink} grew impatiant and hijacked <<ge:arcane artifacts^p,the Krazura^P>> to seek aid beyond Manuhari. This was when the fighting started.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5241@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Besieging?\" <<ge:voice^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>> trembles with anger. \"We were given no choice!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5241@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We arrived on Manuhari as refugees,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> continues. \"Scarred by the {GLOBAL.ShadowTrialLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and famished we hoped to find rest at these astral shores. The {EventRace}, however, have acted adversarial since our first contact. We tried to negotiate a permit of settlement, yet their {NativePlayer.TitleName} insisted we should abandon all weapons, which we couldn't.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5241@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Then you merely defended yourselves! I will grant you my support in this war!\"[relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5241@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"If this is so, you will surely endorse my plans to end this needless bloodshed.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5241@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Your attempts to frame this incursion as self-defense are pitiful. For the {EventRace}!\"[relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5241@TITLE"
msgstr "The War of Manuhari "

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5244@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I want you to salvage the strongbox from the broken juggernaut, {PlayerLeader}. What is inside? Nothing of your concern...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5244@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Perhaps.\" {EventPlayer} examines you from top to bottom. \"But first I must ask you a favor.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5244@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The landship which would become the vessel of our misery, housed a strongbox buried deep within the captain's quarters.\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} hands to you a parchment with the technical sketch of a juggernaut. \"When we crashed upon Manuhari, much of the landship scattered within the area, and though we tried to scavenge what we could, the site had to be abandoned when the conflict with the {EventRace} escalated.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5244@TITLE"
msgstr "Priceless Possession"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5245@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"It seems your intentions are to be trusted, {PlayerLeader.FirstName}. Read a scroll from the box, if you fancy, then we may discuss more.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5245@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"You found it!\" {EventPlayer} takes the salvaged strongbox and opens it with a key shard. \"Let's see...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5245@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Good... good,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} swiftly goes through parchment scroll after parchment scroll, most of which simply seem filled with text. \"All in good order indeed,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> concludes, but noticing your questioning expression <<p:EventPlayer>> adds: \"War reports from after the opening of Athla's Shadowgate. Most of this is worthless now, but the scrolls were protected by a seal of scrying—had you opened the box to steal or spy I would have known.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5245@TITLE"
msgstr "Priceless Possession: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5246@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Study the battle reports [xp/] to broaden your tactical knowledge."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5246@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Read of the logistic support [influence/] that brought Commonwealth reinforcements to the front lines."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5246@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Examine the incantations [knowledge/] for conjuring mageslayer weapons."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5247@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"For the sake of peace I will do you this favor.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5259@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The headquarters of the 'Deadeye Dragoons' is the {EventStructure} {EventDirection} {EventCity}. Kill them. Stage it as infighting. This will restore my authority.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5259@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"What I propose will not be pretty, but at times the ends justify the means.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5259@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"There is a battalion of hardliners, led by the most ruthless generals of the {EventRace}. They barely acknowledge my leadership and foster extreme violence within their carefully picked ranks. If we were to eradicate this battalion, make it look like they cannibalized each other, this would proof the fallacy of their methods and allow me to pronounce a return to {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink} virtues.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5259@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are right. This is not pretty, but necessary.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5259@TITLE"
msgstr "Violent Intentions"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5260@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The all-encompassing voice is searing and maddening, but you can sense its power reaching out to you like a stretched hand, offering itself to be tapped into."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5260@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your troops are nearing the headquarters of the \"Deadeye Dragoons,\" a surging vision disrupts your thoughts."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5260@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Ignite your fire, {PlayerLeader}...[br/]...the strong, they are rewarded...[br/]...the meek, they burn...[br/]...they trust in their weapons of thunder and steel...[br/]...but you—bear true potential...[br/]...embrace the flame...[br/]...let it guide you to victory!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5260@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept the voice's gift, engaging the \"Deadeye Dragoons\" in a frenzy."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5260@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Deny the voice and recover your focus before the battle starts."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5260@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Flee."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5260@TITLE"
msgstr "Encountering the 'Deadeye Dragoons'"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5261@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"When the {NativeRace} call for peace, I will answer. As for yourself, {PlayerLeader}, any reward I could give shall be yours.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5261@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have made short work of the \"Deadeye Dragoons.\" {EventPlayer} applauds you, tense yet visibly relieved."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5261@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You did it!\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} brushes a tear aside, you cannot tell if joyous or sad. \"The word of the incident is spreading like a wildfire and it appears the people are buying our version of the story. The path towards old {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink} ideals will be long and I cannot foresee if I can truly contain the brutality that spread among the {EventRace}. But you have given me a fighting chance, {PlayerLeader}, and for that I am grateful.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5261@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"When there is peace, I will have my reward [goodact/].\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5261@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Let me in on the secrets of the Dreadnought [knowledge/].\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5261@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Spread my legend [influence/] to Magehaven, {EventPlayer.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5261@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I desire a share of your economic power [gold/][production/].\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5261@TITLE"
msgstr "Violent Intentions: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5263@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"All {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink} ideals are dead, but there might be a way to rekindle the virtue of my people, return them onto a path of peace.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5263@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"I suppose this is the moment where I need to make a confession, {PlayerLeader}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5263@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I am powerless,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} states with a serious voice. \"The {EventRace}, they won't obey me if I was to proclaim peace. For long I thought they were simply loyal to {GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but the truth is their loyalties lie with their violent urges alone.[br/][br/]They do not fight to win the war, they fight for the sake of fighting. Just as they loot and plunder for the sake of destruction and reworked their weapons for the sake of cruelty. They no longer resemble the men who stood valiant against Athla's Wizard King onslaught.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5263@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Hear {EventPlayer.FirstName} out."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5263@TITLE"
msgstr "The Revelation of {EventPlayer.FirstName}"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You have one chance to surrender. Otherwise there will be war!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Warning shots and readied {GLOBAL.MagelockLoreConcept.Hyperlink} rifles of soldiers clad in razor sharp armor make it clear, that {EventPlayer} does not welcome your arrival."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Begone, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}! The likes of you are the blight of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Ever hungry for power, you conquer world after world, enslaving and slaughtering the free people of the realms. This ends now! The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AscendedChampLoreConcept]Champions[/hyperlink] of the mortal races will rally under the banner of a new {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. With war machines and technology we will liberate the cosmos from the dominion of sorcery!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Then let there be war!\" [rs_war/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"The invader is you, {EventPlayer}. I will rise to the defense of the innocent {NativeRace}!\" [rs_war/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"You err in thinking all Wizard Kings are malevolent. Allow me to elaborate...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@BUTTON_2@DRAGON_RULER"
msgstr "\"You err in thinking Elder Dragons are malevolent. Allow me to elaborate...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@BUTTON_2@EDLRITCH_RULER"
msgstr "\"Don't fear what you can't comprehend. The truth about Eldritch Sovereigns...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5268@TITLE"
msgstr "Smoke and Thunder"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5270@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The only {EventPlayerType} I would trust is one trapped in a {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, at my mercy.\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} laughs grimly."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5270@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your attempt at reasoning with {EventPlayer} is immediately cut short."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5270@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Save your breath!\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} exclaims. \"I have no interest in your lies and attempts to bewitch my mind. Too often have I witnessed the foul influence of poisoned words. The Shadowborn, Emperor Leonus... it's all in the past—a past, that made me stronger. If the {GLOBAL.ShadowTrialLoreConcept.Hyperlink} didn't break me, neither will you!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5270@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Say nothing. You will prove <<P:EventPlayer>> wrong, no matter what it takes."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5270@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Give up on reasoning with {EventPlayer}. [rs_war/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5270@TITLE"
msgstr "Shackles of Trust"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5271@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "During this time of timelessness, one recurring thought, strangely so, keeps your mental health intact."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5271@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You are adrift in your mind, surrounded by nothingness."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5271@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Was it a mistake to enter the {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}? It seems this question might become the torture of your remaining existence. Like an alternate {GLOBAL.ShadowTrialLoreConcept.Hyperlink} which exposes you to your inner demons. Forever. Or until {EventPlayer} decides to end you. The void is all-encompassing, eternal, yet also nowhere and never. You cannot grasp it."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5271@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I did it all for a noble cause.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5271@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Without distractions, I can dedicate my mind to unraveling the mysteries [knowledge/] of the cosmos.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5271@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"When I return, my wrath [xp/] will know no equal.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5271@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"My bravery and sacrifice will be immortalized in legends [influence/].\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5271@TITLE"
msgstr "Shackles of Trust: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5283@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I will release you from this terrible isolation, {PlayerLeader}. Then tell me what it is you want to talk about.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5283@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "All of a sudden a voice reaches out to you, rupturing what could have been a century of isolation: \"Let us talk, {PlayerLeader}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5283@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I must admit I am perplexed, {PlayerLeader.Title}.\" {EventPlayer} reveals <<r:EventPlayer>> while glimpsing into your abyss. \"You are not what I expected. It would have been easy to seek me out on the battlefield, attempt to eradicate me as a threat. Instead, you chose this—a helpless limbo some may regard as worse than death.\"[br/][br/]\"It makes me question our condemnation of all <<m:{EventPlayerType}>>—and more. When {GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink} ordered the attack on the {EventRace} I had doubts, but trusted his judgment. Perhaps {EventHero.FirstName} was right...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5283@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Please explain why you are besieging the {EventRace}, {EventPlayer}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5283@TITLE"
msgstr "Shackles of Trust: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5290@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We prevailed through the darkest night, devoid of the light from the Sky Beyond. Now the Serpent has come with thunder and fire, maliciously feigning woe, but whenever it grows a new head, we will peck it out.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5290@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} shows no intention of enlightening you on the meaning of <<o:EventPlayer>> words."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5290@BODY_HEADER@SILVER_TONGUE"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} pauses for a moment, indicating a slight courteous movement with <<o:EventPlayer>> head. But <<o:EventPlayer>> words remain bitter."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5290@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"What a shameful age to live in, where the ignorant are given the power to challenge the wise\" <<p:EventPlayer>> continues <<o:EventPlayer>> speech. \"Our forefathers were the sages of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Sky Beyond[/hyperlink], guides and gate keepers of its many worlds. [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]The Lion[/hyperlink] himself, who ruled above all, sought their counsel and aid against its foes. But when the Lion fought the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]World Wyrms[/hyperlink], it became [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]the Manticore[/hyperlink], betraying and stinging our ancestors with its poisonous tail.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5290@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So the Serpent is the {EventRace}? I will aid them in their struggle! [rs_war/]\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5290@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I am not the Serpent, nor one of its heads! I have come to restore peace...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5290@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"If we must have war [rs_war/], then so be it.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5290@TITLE"
msgstr "Betrayal and Ignorance"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5304@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you experienced and passed the trial,\" {EventHero.FirstName} predicts, \"the {EventPlayer.Title} will be open for your peace negotiations.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5304@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"There is a ritualistic trial,\" {EventHero} explains, \"which anyone aspiring to become the new Yukara has to undergo.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5304@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"During this trial, the candidate's character will be put to the test by the spirits of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]our ancestors[/hyperlink].\" {EventHero.FirstName} holds out a silvery feather and leaves it to the wind. \"The trial has never been attempted by a foreigner. But the rules do not explicitly forbid it, and I have confidants among the trial wardens, who would ensure that you are allowed in.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5304@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Agree to undergo the trial."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5304@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Decline the trial. As a {PlayerLeader.Title} you have proven [influence/] your worth."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5304@TITLE"
msgstr "Trial of the Ancients"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5305@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I will come to your peace talks,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} ends her speech, \"if you vouch for {TargetPlayer} to attend with honest intentions.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5305@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Having left the last ritual site you are greeted by a more forthcoming {EventPlayer}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5305@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"From the nest of the Serpent,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says, \"rises the mighty Owl, a herald of the nearing dawn. I have misjudged you, {PlayerLeader}, and offer you my apology. The Everdark has left my people vulnerable. A trustworthy and respectful ally will help us redefine our position in the Sky Beyond.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5305@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Thank {EventPlayer.FirstName} and promise to contact <<P:EventPlayer>> once everything is prepared."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5305@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Thank {EventPlayer.FirstName}, but reveal you found the {TargetRace} to be indeed aggressive invaders. You will join the {EventRace} in their defensive struggle. [rs_war/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5305@TITLE"
msgstr "Trial of the Ancients: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5312@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The warden asks you to leave and return in accordance with the rules of the trial."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5312@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Before your troops comes a trial warden of the {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5312@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Halt!\" <<p:EventUnit>> exclaims with authority. \"The ritual site may only be entered by the participant and the participant alone.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5312@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Promise to respect the warden's rules."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5312@TITLE"
msgstr "The Trial Warden"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5318@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Do you answer the call to arms in this cosmic war that threatens all and everyone?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5318@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the ritual site you encounter a {EventUnit}, former familiar of the Yukara Zikuta."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5318@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} approaches you, posing a question: \"A council is convoked by the guardians of the cosmos. Like all others, your people are called to arms against primal forces. If no one is to send aid, every race may perish. If you come to aid alone, your people may suffer the most.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5318@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept the call and face the storm!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5318@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Bribe [gold/] the other rulers to accept in your stead."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5318@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Lay out to the council why your people's wisdom [knowledge/] will aid the cause more than arming them for war."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5318@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Leave the ritual site and return later."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5318@TITLE"
msgstr "Trial of Fealty"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5319@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You have passed the Trial of Fealty,\" the familiar says, ending its speech. \"May it lead you to a better doom.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5319@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Valor and responsibility, worthy of a Yukara,\" the {EventUnit} proclaims. \"Though the sacrifice it demands can be high.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5319@BODY_HEADER@BRIBE_CHOSEN"
msgstr "\"A cunning idea,\" the {EventUnit} admits. \"But would they honor the deal when you couldn't expose them for it?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5319@BODY_HEADER@KNOWLEDGE_CHOSEN"
msgstr "\"Spoken with a sage's heart,\" the {EventUnit} proclaims. \"But the sword cuts the quills when there is no shield to defend them.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5319@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"When the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Lion[/hyperlink] rallied its lieges against the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]World Wyrms[/hyperlink], Yukara Zikuta led a large Krazuran host to the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Sky Beyond[/hyperlink].\" The {EventUnit} squawks in a doleful fashion. \"But none of her kinsman ever returned and Zikuta became one of the three lost Yukaras whose spirit remained silent during the ancestral rituals.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5319@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Leave the ritual site."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5319@TITLE"
msgstr "Trial of Fealty: Conclusion"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Which part of the doomed realm do you store inside the {GLOBAL.VaultsphereLoreConcept.Hyperlink}?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the ritual site, you encounter the spirit of {EventHero}, Yukara of the Krazura during the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonCrisisLoreConcept]All-Inferno[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The spirit starts talking to you: \"Imagine a realm at the verge of being destroyed by a cataclysmic invasion. All life on the realm will cease to exist and any mark of civilization perish. You have a {GLOBAL.VaultsphereLoreConcept.Hyperlink} at your command and enough time to preserve one aspect of the realm for future ages to come.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "The records [knowledge/] of the realm's history and empires."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "As many civilians as the Vaultsphere can hold. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Samples from the realm's unique flora [food/] and fauna [unit/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "I rally troops for a last stand to save the entire realm! [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Leave the ritual site and return later."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5320@TITLE"
msgstr "Trial of Wisdom"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5321@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You have passed the Trial of Wisdom,\" {EventHero} concludes. \"A true sage must always doubt.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5321@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"A farsighted decision,\" {EventHero} applauds. \"Once, I myself believed this would eternalize all who couldn't be saved.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5321@BODY_HEADER@ATTACK_CHOSEN"
msgstr "\"A bold gambit,\" {EventHero} applauds. \"Though if it fails, all would be lost.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5321@BODY_HEADER@GOODACT_CHOSEN"
msgstr "\"An act of true mercy,\" {EventHero} applauds. \"Even if the rescued souls are a droplet in an ocean of sorrow.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5321@BODY_HEADER@NATURE_CHOSEN"
msgstr "\"A deed of pure preservation,\" {EventHero} applauds. \"Though all may wither outside its original habitat.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5321@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"As the sheer force of the amber [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]World Wyrm[/hyperlink] reshaped Izgemil,\" {EventHero.FirstName} continues, \"I ordered all scrolls, books, and stone plates of the realm to be brought to our {GLOBAL.VaultsphereLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Only when Izgemil had turned silent I realized my unmercifulness and the spirits of Izgemil haunted my conscience for the rest of my life.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5321@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Leave the ritual site."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5321@TITLE"
msgstr "Trial of Wisdom: Conclusion"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"As the leader of the suffering tribe, how do you preserve unity among your people?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the ritual site, you encounter the spirit of {EventHero}, Yukara of the Krazura during the Everdark."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The spirit comes forward to speak to you: \"During their darkest age, a once powerful and ancient people stands at the crossroads. Some keep honoring the traditions and knowledge from their civilization's zenith, while others are seeking new ways forward, threatening to cause a schism.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Persecute the followers of the new ideals to retain common customs and culture."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Grant the dissidents limited autonomy [influence/] if they swear fealty to their brethren in times of need."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Invoke [mana/] the spirits of the past to remind your people of their heritage and legacy."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "***Root your sages [knowledge/] in the common population to uphold common virtues and beliefs.***"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Leave the ritual site and return later."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5326@TITLE"
msgstr "Trial of Leadership"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5327@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You have passed this part of the trial,\" {EventHero.FirstName} concludes. \"May your leadership be a blessing to your people.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5327@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"An approach motivated by benignity.\" {EventHero} smiles. \"I too thought such concessions would preserve peace.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5327@BODY_HEADER@ATTACKED"
msgstr "\"An interesting approach,\" {EventHero} acknowledges. \"But would such unity forced with the sword last for long?\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5327@BODY_HEADER@PAID_MANA"
msgstr "\"An interesting approach\", {EventHero} acknowledges. \"But sometimes the past can be a burden that not all are able to carry.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5327@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"During the Everdark,\" {EventHero.FirstName} continues, \"many movements emerged among the Krazura, each propagating a new dawn for our people. As the Yukara, I feared civil war, allowing new houses to form and adopt their own practices. They remained bound to my lordship through pacts, but over time the respect for those contracts diminished and—after my passing—were broken one by one.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5327@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Leave the ritual site."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5327@TITLE"
msgstr "Trial of Leadership: Conclusion"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5334@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I have found a {NativeRace} researcher, {NativeHero}, dedicated to the works of the {GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. <<Cp:NativeHero>> might be willing to cooperate...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5334@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} comes before you once more, to talk about a matter of great importance."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5334@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"To restore peace,\" {EventHero.FirstName} explains, \"not only Manuhari should be considered, but also [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept]Edward's[/hyperlink] march of destruction across the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\" {EventHero.FirstName} hesitates, but then continues: \"This is not like the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept]Edward[/hyperlink] I knew. I believe—it must be—that something is affecting him, turning him wrathful and blind to reason. Directly before the conflict with the {NativeRace} escalated, Edward was studying some of their artifacts. If I could learn more about their ancient magic...\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5334@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Agree to meet this \"{NativeHero.FirstName}\"."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5334@TITLE"
msgstr "Edward's Insanity"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5336@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you were to defeat the ancestral guardians of the structure we call the {EventStructure}, we would be grateful and allow {SorcererHero} to partake in our research.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5336@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Good ascent, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}! I am {EventHero}, chief investigator of the Wing of Lost Wisdom.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5336@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"It is excruciating,\" {EventHero.FirstName} begins <<o:EventHero>> mournful singsong, \"how much knowledge became forgotten by our people during the Everdark, when the stars of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Sky Beyond[/hyperlink] no longer shone. Which is why the Wing of Lost Wisdom exists: to recover and rediscover the heritage of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]our ancestors[/hyperlink].[br/][br/]Not long ago, we found a grand structure of old Krazuran architecture half buried within the desert. But it was warded by spirit guardians and the {EventPlayer.Title} denied our request for battle mages, giving cryptic answers as is <<o:EventPlayer>> custom.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5336@TITLE"
msgstr "Lost Knowledge"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5337@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I have to thank you, {PlayerLeader}, in the name of the Wing of Lost Wisdom and all {EventRace}. As a connoisseur of our fair realm and its inhabitants I offer you a private lecture on a subject of your choice.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5337@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Not long after your troops had laid rest to the spirit guardians of the {EventStructure}, {EventHero} appears at the site in person."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5337@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"By the beaks of the Seven Sages!\" {EventHero.FirstName} screeches in excitement. \"The size of this area and the well-preserved state of the buildings exceed our wildest projections! This is a discovery of immeasurable cultural and historic significance for our people. The Wing of Lost Wisdom has a large task ahead inspecting and processing it all.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5337@TITLE"
msgstr "Lost Knowledge: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5338@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ask for a lecture about [arcana/] adaptive research."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5338@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Let {EventHero.FirstName} teach you about [nature/] survival and recovery in the wilds of Manuhari."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5338@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Hear the discourse about [shadow/] <<ge:interchange^n,EventHero.FirstName>> of ideas and uncovered historical sites with the minor lords of the realm."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5338@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "<<ge:babbling^n,EventHero.FirstName>> bores you. Ask for some coin [gold/] and you will be even!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5339@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Promise {EventHero} to clear out the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The guardian spirits seem unaware of your intrusion, but any hasty move will draw their attention. What do you do?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BODY_FOOTER@NO_RULER"
msgstr "The guardian spirits seem unaware of <<ge:intrusion^n,EventHero.FirstName>>, but any hasty move will draw their attention. What does {EventHero} do?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You enter a grand overgrown structure with a stairway leading up to a portal sphere. Around you, large aureate rings are kept in perpetual movement like a clockwork."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BODY_HEADER@NO_RULER"
msgstr "{EventHero} enters a grand overgrown structure with a stairway leading up to a portal sphere. Around <<P:EventHero>>, large aureate rings are kept in perpetual movement like a clockwork."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Stepping through the portal, you can only presume to be inside the sphere, glimpsing the fragment of another realm. You are in a rocky vale, at the gate of another structure complex of similar architecture, though better preserved. The stairways and buildings seem to lead down to a center square, but the path downward is blocked by looming guardian spirits."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BODY_LORE@NO_RULER"
msgstr "Stepping through the portal, {EventHero.FirstName} can only presume to be inside the sphere, glimpsing the fragment of another realm. <<Cp:EventHero>> is in a rocky vale, at the gate of another structure complex of similar architecture, though better preserved. The stairways and buildings seem to lead down to a center square, but the path downward is blocked by looming guardian spirits."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Charge in without hesitation!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Weaken their link to the Astral Sea [mana/] before attacking."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Flee."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5348@TITLE"
msgstr "The Eye of Manuhari"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your troops return to you with some items of interest. Which one do you take?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BODY_FOOTER@NO_RULER"
msgstr "Your troops return to {EventHero} with some items of interest. What does <<p:EventHero>> do?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the spirits pacified, you make your way down to the center square."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BODY_HEADER@NO_RULER"
msgstr "With the spirits pacified, {EventHero} makes <<o:EventHero>> way down to the center square."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "At the center rests a large arrangement of circular stone plates, which reminds you of the <<m:{GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> in {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Any obvious approaches to activating the structure yield no result, however. So you keep exploring the area, which in many ways gives the impression of an abandoned expedition site."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BODY_LORE@NO_RULER"
msgstr "At the center rests a large arrangement of circular stone plates, which reminds {EventHero.FirstName} of the <<m:{GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> in {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Any obvious approaches to activating the structure yield no result, however. So {EventHero.FirstName} keeps exploring the area, which in many ways gives the impression of an abandoned expedition site."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take the clearly magical {EventItem} [item/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Study the void stone tablet inscribed with ancient knowledge [knowledge/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Activate the {EventUnit} sphere to summon [unit/] a loyal construct."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "We should not desecrate the hallowed grounds of the {EventRace}. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5349@TITLE"
msgstr "The Eye of Manuhari: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5353@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Come to the {EventStructure}, {PlayerLeader}! Together we can solve the mystery of the {EventStructure}!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5353@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Pondering the dormant structure inside the {EventStructure}, you are greeted by {EventHero} with relevant news."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5353@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You must hear about this, {PlayerLeader}!\" <<p:EventHero>> exclaims, still gasping from the hurry. \"The Wing of Lost Wisdom has uncovered a collection of Void Stone tablets. They believe its inscriptions speak of the site and its ancient purpose. However... the tablets are still incomplete and the script is from an early Krazuran age, in need of deciphering and interpretation. Isn't this exciting? It's like a puzzle sent from the past!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5353@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Promise to send someone along."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5353@TITLE"
msgstr "A Truth Unsealed"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5354@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I must thank you for your contributions to this important discovery, {PlayerLeader}. I bestow upon you the honorary title 'Sage of Lost Wisdom'.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5354@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A euphoric {EventHero} is contacting you from inside the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5354@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Pytero xarecha! We did it, {PlayerLeader}!\" {EventHero.FirstName} evokes an astral reflection of the archaeological site with an activated structure at the center. \"This,\" <<p:EventHero>> proudly proclaims, \"is the first of the World Seals, structures used during the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonCrisisLoreConcept]All-Inferno[/hyperlink] to shroud the stars of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Sky Beyond[/hyperlink]. That it was hidden within a {GLOBAL.VaultsphereLoreConcept.Hyperlink} establishes a clear chronology of first, <<m:{GLOBAL.VaultsphereLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>, then <<m:{GLOBAL.SealLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>, and lastly [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept]Eternity[/hyperlink], all devised by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]our ancestors[/hyperlink] for [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]the Manticore[/hyperlink] in its need.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5354@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept the honors and continue to listen."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5354@TITLE"
msgstr "A Truth Unsealed: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5360@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I would welcome your insights on the tablets and our working transcriptions, {PlayerLeader}. One great mind aids another.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5360@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You are welcomed to the archaeological site by {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5360@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Take a look around, {PlayerLeader},\" <<p:EventHero>> says, pointing to the various tents and work tables populated by fluttering or chattering researchers. \"The Wing of Lost Wisdom is making good progress, deciphering and transcribing the Void Stone tablets we discovered. Void Stone was a precious resource even for our ancestors—whatever this structure represented, it must have been of great importance.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5360@TITLE"
msgstr "Investigating the Past"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Personally examine the findings of {EventHero} and <<o:EventHero>> team."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave, for now."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Delegate some sages [knowledge/] of your empire to aid the project."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Let most sages [knowledge/] of your empire aid the project."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Have {PlayerHero} aid the project."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_4@NO_HERO"
msgstr "Have one of your heroes aid the project."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Sharpen your arcane focus to learn the ancient Krazura scripture."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Connect with the rock and stone at the structure complex to find any missing tablets."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5361@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Commune with the lingering souls of the ancient Krazura to learn more."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5368@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Using this retained knowledge,\" {EventHero.FirstName} concludes, \"I will find and stop {GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. You have my profound gratitude, {PlayerLeader}. Time to share another page from my spellbook!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5368@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In accordance with {AllyHero}, {EventHero} steps in to continue <<o:AllyHero>> talk."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5368@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This is tremendous; meeting the authentic seal-creators—or, well, their descendants—after everything that happened on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}... And there is more!\" [br/][br/]{EventHero.FirstName} takes a deep breath. \"When studying the texts, we found that an activated {GLOBAL.SealLoreConcept.Hyperlink} does not necessarily block all connections to the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. With the right knowledge one can control the {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, decide who enters or leaves the realm, mold the magic coming through—if only Merlin had known at the time. The history of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} might have been a different one.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5368@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ask to be taught <<ge:favorite combat spell^n,EventHero.FirstName>>."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5368@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Ask to be taught <<o:EventHero>> favorite summon spell."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5368@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Ask to be taught <<o:EventHero>> favorite emergency spell."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5368@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Ask <<P:EventHero>> to share even more insights [knowledge/] about the World Seals instead!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5368@TITLE"
msgstr "The Seals of Magic"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5373@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The ancestral army of the {EventUnit} has been sighted at the {EventGeo} {EventDirection} {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5373@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "From above the realm's branching treetops, a mechanical shriek announces the attack of the Warden of Manuhari."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5373@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Imbued with life by the {GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the powerful {EventUnit} is the god-protector of Manuhari, assaulting trespassers or invaders of the realm without mercy. According to Krazuran myth, it once defeated the obsidian [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]World Wyrm[/hyperlink] and through this achieved immortality."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5373@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Show the \"Feather of the {EventPlayer.Title}\" to prove your friendship with the {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5373@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Let them come."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5373@TITLE"
msgstr "The Warden of Manuhari"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5436@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you indeed enter the {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to astound {EventPlayer}? Or should you do what is reasonable and instead bend <<P:EventPlayer>> with your might?"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5436@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You are alone in a secret chamber of your Wizard's Tower."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5436@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Before you lies the {GLOBAL.CageOfBindingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, a cold dark casing representing the Void. It had not been easy to get hold of it—the secrets of its creation are shrouded in mysteries. Only through a stroke of genius could you conjure the cage from a realm of shadows and horror. And strangely so, it gives you grim satisfaction."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5436@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Enter the Cage of Binding [hp/]."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5436@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Return the Cage to the darkness it came from."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5436@TITLE"
msgstr "The Cage of Binding"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5463@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You cast <<P:EventPlayer>> into the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink} as a testament to what becomes of your foes."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5463@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the smell of the burning jungle looms over the remaining settlements of the {EventRace}, {EventPlayer.TitleName} lets out a final screech of terror."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5463@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The Serpent has bested the Eagle!\" <<p:EventPlayer>> cries out in agony. \"Our great nests, they lie defenseless. Our heritage—soon devoured. No! I will live on with the next Yukara! My people, they must prevail!\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5463@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim the spoils of victory."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5463@TITLE"
msgstr "The Fall of {EventPlayer}"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5465@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You cast <<P:EventPlayer>> into the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink} as a testament to what becomes of your foes."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5465@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Amid smoldering war machines and the stinging reek of discharged <<m:{GLOBAL.MagelockLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>, {EventPlayer.TitleName} is brought to <<o:EventPlayer>> knees."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5465@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"End this now, {PlayerLeader}!\" <<p:EventPlayer>> screams, like a roaring lion at its last breath. \"I am not afraid of death. Whatever comes after this, it will be better than the horrors all {EventRace} had to endure since the invasion of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5465@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Their aggression was their downfall."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5465@TITLE"
msgstr "The Fall of {EventPlayer}"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5466@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Kept alive by some powerful magic, the {EventUnit} claps its destroyed wings and escapes into the skies."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5466@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The Warden of Manuhari collapses with an ear-splitting blend of crackling astral discharges and squeaking metal."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5466@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "For a brief moment silence ensues, and it appears the {EventUnit} has exhaled its last mechanical breath. Then however, to the horror of your troops, the broken pieces start moving again, rearranging themselves into a deranged, crooked version of the warden's former self."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5466@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Grimly, you start preparations for the warden's return."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5466@TITLE"
msgstr "Undying Vigilance"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5631@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Using this retained knowledge,\" {EventHero.FirstName} concludes, \"I will find and stop {GLOBAL.EdwardLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Thank you, {PlayerLeader}, for making this possible.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5631@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "All of a sudden, {EventHero} appears before you, excited and exhausted."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5631@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This is tremendous!\" <<p:EventHero>> exclaims, taking a deep breath. \"While you were busy with your campaign on Manuhari, {AllyHero}, <<o:AllyHero>> team, and I ventured into the {EventStructure} and uncovered a dormant structure, which we have now identified as the very first {GLOBAL.SealLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\"[br/][br/]\"When studying the texts, we found that an activated {GLOBAL.SealLoreConcept.Hyperlink} does not necessarily block all connections to the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. With the right knowledge one can control the {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, decide who enters or leaves the realm, mold the magic coming through—if only Merlin had known at the time. The history of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} might have been a different one.\""

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_EVENT@991_5631@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Thank {EventHero} for sharing this discovery."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALMS@NAME"
msgstr "Ashes from the Past"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@ACTIVATE_SEAL_OP_INFO_TOOLTIP"
msgstr "To speed up the investigations, talk to {EventHero.Name} through the \"Visit Archaeological Site\" operation at the {EventStructure.Name}."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@ACTIVATE_SEAL_QUEST_OBJ@NAME"
msgstr "{INT_0}/{INT_1} Investigation Progress"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@CB_PROGENITOR"
msgstr "Invaded Manuhari"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@CONTACT_LARYSSA_OBJ_01@NAME"
msgstr "Laryssa Met"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@CONTACT_PROGENITORS_QUEST_INTRO@NATURE_CHECK@FAILURE"
msgstr "The birds scatter unsettled, spreading wild rumors of your encounter."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@CONTACT_PROGENITORS_QUEST_INTRO@NATURE_CHECK@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to win the birds of Manuhari as your messengers:"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@CONTACT_PROGENITORS_QUEST_INTRO@NATURE_CHECK@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The birdsong spreads the word of your good intentions across Manuhari."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@CONTACT_PROGENITOR_QUEST_OBJ@TRACKER"
msgstr "{INT_0}/{INT_1} Wait for Krazura Contact"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@COUNSELOR_HERO@FIRSTNAME"
msgstr "Gyrax^M"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@COUNSELOR_HERO@LASTNAME"
msgstr "Skrand^z"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@ENCHANTED_CAVE@NAME"
msgstr "Mystic Cave^n"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@FORESHADOW_BLOCKED_PROGENITOR_PATH@TOOLTIP"
msgstr "Choosing this option will block friendly interactions with the {EventRace}!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@FORESHADOW_BLOCKED_REAVER_PATH@TOOLTIP"
msgstr "Choosing this option will block the {EventRace} Collaborator story path!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@KNOWLEDGE_BUFF_LARYSSA"
msgstr "Laryssa's Counsel"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@MAGESLAYER_BLADES_UNLOCK@TOOLTIP"
msgstr "You unlock the {GLOBAL.SPECIAL_OPERATIONS.MAGESLAYER_BLADES.Hyperlink} spell."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@PROGENITOR_MEET@ASTRAL_OPTION@FAILURE"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.FirstName} takes pity on your incoherent gibberish."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@PROGENITOR_MEET@ASTRAL_OPTION@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to reason with {EventPlayer.Name} using her own Krazuran terms:"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_01@PROGENITOR_MEET@ASTRAL_OPTION@SUCCESS"
