msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Before the Fourth Age, when the final World Seal of Athla was opened, the Elven Court and Commonwealth put aside their grievances and made a brave stand against the invading Wizard Kings. In the wars that followed, these heroic alliances crumbled and entire armies were cast into the depths of the Astral Sea."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The Dreadnought Edward Portsmith and the Sorceress Laryssa commanded the vanguard of Commonwealth war machines. After they plummeted into the Astral Sea, they were adrift between worlds, haunted by lurking horrors. Only Laryssa's magic, paired with Edward's resourcefulness, protected the castaways from the magical currents."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "After what felt like an eternity of torment, the drifting remnants of the Commonwealth sensed a shift in the currents and happened upon a realm which appeared out of nowhere. The survivors met its inhabitants—an ancient, knowledgeable people called the Krazura. Negotiations were challenging, but the survivors were allowed to recuperate from their trials."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Edward’s mind, however, did not seem to recover. Over time, his resentment toward Wizard Kings grew, and he vowed to free the entire Astral Sea from their curse. He started traveling to other realms to liberate them, leaving devastation in his wake as he condemned and hunted anyone who would support or even tolerate the rule of any Wizard King. "

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_05@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Edward’s erratic behavior concerned Laryssa, his life-long friend and companion during their journey through the Astral Sea. But amidst the growing conflict between the Krazura and Commonwealth Remnants, Edward increasingly ignored Laryssa's pleas, and her influence diminished. Thus it was shortly after Edward’s last departure that Laryssa saw no choice but to send out a secret call for aid, for a Godir who could end Edward’s march of destruction."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@EXPLAIN_SEALS"
msgstr "You tell the other participants about the <<m:EventStructure>>. They may pursue them..."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@SECRET_KEPT"
msgstr "You keep the secret of the <<m:EventStructure>> to yourself. The others will not pursue them."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus, by ending the conflict on the Freed Lands of Manuhari, a brave Godir revealed the knowledge about the legendary World Seals. Many Godir had known about the structures which had once obscured Athla itself from the Astral Sea, but only the wizard named Merlin had ever activated them. Armed with the knowledge from the Seals’ very creators, Laryssa Mirabilis continued her quest to stop Edward on his path of destruction."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Answer a call for aid from a sorceress of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, who has been missing since the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept]World Gates[/hyperlink] were opened. Investigate the fate of the once-powerful {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the ancient world they discovered."

