msgstr "Freed Lands of Manuhari"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "Answer a call for aid from a sorceress of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, who has been missing since the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WorldGateLoreConcept]World Gates[/hyperlink] were opened. Investigate the fate of the once-powerful {GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the ancient world they discovered."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@ALFRED_CITY_NAME"
msgstr "Elderholm^N"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "After Grexolis was opened and Sundren’s ruse was revealed, many Godir of Magehaven realized how fragile their alliances were. Sundren's warning of looming evil was drowned out by the clamors of powerful Wizards and Champions, seeking to release the powers from the world vault. Fierce arguments rattled Magehaven, and only its spell of protection kept it from falling apart in its entirety."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Among the Godir of Magehaven, Meandor was one of the few who remained composed. Tired of the bickering within, he had a suggestion: Groups of quarreling Godir would travel to realms where rediscovered Seals had emerged. There, they could settle their differences by competing to become the master of the Seals, without unnecessary bloodshed."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This is the story of one such group of Godir, who decided to settle their disputes on a realm called the Sehiran Oasis.[br/]Little did they know, their trial was about to be rudely interrupted…"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@DELVE_DEEPER"
msgstr "Gaze into the Astral Sea..."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@EDWARD_OUTPOSTS"
msgstr "{Edward.TitleName} will create several <<m:{EventStructure}>> on the {GLOBAL.WorldMapConcept}!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus the dreadnought Edward Portsmith and his war machines were stopped in their tracks. It was revealed that the Endailon of Chaos, released from imprisonment on Grexolis, was amplifying the passion and temper of all Godir. With this proof and newfound understanding, a sense of reason returned to the Godir of Magehaven."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "As one of the closest Godir when the Endailon were released, Edward had been the most affected of all. The torment and hatred that had driven him forward had started to cloud his mind until nothing but rage was left, and it was not until his connection to Chaos was severed that he regained his senses. Confronted by the destruction he had wrought, Edward swore to somehow atone for what he had done."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Sundren, meanwhile, did not join her old friends and allies in Magehaven. She traveled onward to search for the Endailon of Chaos and others, guided by the wisdom of her old mentor Merlin before he disappeared."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Settle on the Sehiran Oasis and become a part of a Trial between [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizard Kings[/hyperlink] and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AscendedChampLoreConcept]Champions[/hyperlink]. Bring accord to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept]Magehaven[/hyperlink]... and prepare for the arrival of an uninvited guest."

