msgstr "This realm consists of a central Oasis surrounded by deserts.[bulletlist][bullet/]Desert <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}>> are [abilityblue]Common[/abilityblue].[bullet/]Arctic, Highlands, and Temperate <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}>> are [abilityblue]Absent[/abilityblue].[bullet/]Forest <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceFeatureConcept.Hyperlink}>> and Wetlands <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceFeatureConcept.Hyperlink}>> are [abilityblue]Rare[/abilityblue].[/bulletlist]"

