msgstr "Revealed the Endailon of Chaos!"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have revealed the Endailon of Chaos and stopped Edward Portsmith from succumbing to its violent nature. Victorious, you and Laryssa guide Edward to Magehaven."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STRUCTURE_STRATEGIC@SEAL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Provides +{amount1} point for the {GLOBAL.SealsVictoryConcept.Hyperlink} every turn for the {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink} that has units standing on the Seal."

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STRUCTURE_STRATEGIC@SEAL@LORE"
msgstr "[lorefontsize][lorefont]Seals were built by order of the ancient {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, to protect the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink} from the influences of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}... or the other way around. Whoever activates these powerful structures will have full control over anyone who enters or leaves the realm. Thus, the Seals were left heavily guarded. On most worlds, these arcane machinations now lie dormant and forgotten... Unless a powerful {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} finds a way to activate them once more.[/lorefont][/lorefontsize]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@STRUCTURE_STRATEGIC@SEAL@NAME"
