msgstr "This unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{DamageBonus}% damage on attacks.[bullet/]A {Stunchance}% chance of suffering {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STUNNED.Hyperlink} for {duration} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>> after completing an attack action.[/bulletlist]"

