msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@DIPLOMACY@CRYSTAL_DWELLING@TRUCE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink} tolerates you.[br/][br/]Counts as {GLOBAL.IndependentCityNeutralConcept.Hyperlink} state.[br/][br/]Crystal Dwellings do not care about Province Claims.[br/][br/]You cannot assign a {GLOBAL.DiplomaticTokenConcept.Hyperlink} to Crystal Dwellings. Instead, completing quests will let you reach higher diplomatic states and eventually an {GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingEternalPactConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]Unlocks purchase of the following trade items via Cooperation:[br/][bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.UNITS.LITHORINE_CORE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.EQUIPMENT.CRYSTALRUNNER_MOUNT.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

