msgstr "As your empire no longer has any cities, the Giant Clans have not sent any army into your domain."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@HOTGK_FINISHER@NOTIFICATION@NO_CITY_TO_RAID@HEADER"
msgstr "Thagnokar's Heir: Giant Clans aborted attack"

