msgstr "In {IntDuration} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}>>, a Giant Clan army will appear for each other player and attack one of their cities. Those players will gain a major {GLOBAL.CasusBelliConcept.Hyperlink} against you when this happens."

