msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@MINORFACTIONS_WORLD@ETERNALS_RACE@BIO_1"
msgstr "In the eras of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the <<m:{GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> governed the realms they reshaped in all corners of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. But their reshaping did not end with the terrain, as they also modified the inhabitants of the realms the Giants ruled, infusing them with special crystals that made their mortal bodies ageless. The Elder Giants would later use these same crystals to store memories and emotions. Since the fall of Myrrida, the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} that remain are governed by Eternal Councils."

