msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@MINOR_FACTION@UPGRADE_SET@CRYSTAL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "These are the servants of the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Their bodies have been augmented with magical crystals that fortify the body and imbue the mind with memories of long-gone Giants."

