msgstr "Animal and Dragon units of this effect's owner gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_STAT_BONUS>BONUS>DEFENSE>Armor} {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_STAT_BONUS>BONUS>DEFENSE>Resistance} {GLOBAL.ResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_DAMAGE>ResolvedMultiplier}% damage[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SHOP_OGRES_UNIT_ABILITIES_09@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "While this unit is in combat, Animal and Dragon units gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_STAT_BONUS>BONUS>DEFENSE>Armor} {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_STAT_BONUS>BONUS>DEFENSE>Resistance} {GLOBAL.ResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_DAMAGE>ResolvedMultiplier}% damage[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SHOP_OGRES_UNIT_ABILITIES_09@NAME"
msgstr "Beastmaster"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SHOP_OGRES_UNIT_ABILITIES_09@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_STAT_BONUS>BONUS>DEFENSE>Armor} {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_STAT_BONUS>BONUS>DEFENSE>Resistance} {GLOBAL.ResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{BEASTMASTER_DAMAGE>ResolvedMultiplier}% damage[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SHOP_OGRES_UNIT_ABILITIES_10@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When this unit dies, friendly Animal and Dragon units gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]{amount} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink} for {STRENGTHENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BERSERK.Hyperlink} for {BERSERK_DESCRIPTION_2>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SHOP_OGRES_UNIT_ABILITIES_10@NAME"
msgstr "Herdfather"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SOTTK_FINISHER@CULT_LEADER_EFFECTS_TOOLTIP"
msgstr "Whenever you cast a soulcurse spell, there is a {IntChance}% chance of a cultist army joining your ruler. The strength of that army scales with the tier of the cast soulcurse spell. When multiple of these extra soulcurse casting effects could trigger, their triggering chance is summed up, but a maximum of {IntMax} effects triggers."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SOTTK_FINISHER@CULT_LEADER_TOOLTIP"
msgstr "For the rest of the game, you become the Cult Leader of the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SPAWNERS@LITHORINE_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A crystal formation that replicates Lithorine in an uncontrolled manner.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SPAWNERS@LITHORINE_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "A potent garden that grows rock and Lithorite, spewing forth territorial hordes of stone-form aberrations. The Elder Giants of long-lost Myrrida once created and commanded the synthetic organisms colloquially referred to as Lithorine. Defying Nature, the creatures in this garden somehow reproduce their spark of life. Evidently, even synthetic life eventually finds a way."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@SPAWNERS@LITHORINE_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Lithorine Cradle"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The escaped {EnemyUnit} notices the warriors. With a snarl, <<p:EnemyUnit>> grabs a nearby {EventUnit} and hurls it at {EventHero.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The escaped {EnemyUnit} notices your warriors. With a snarl, <<p:EnemyUnit>> grabs a nearby {EventUnit} and hurls it at you."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "<<G:army^n,EventHero>> follows forceful cracks and crunches to a pond of lava, in which an imposing {EventStructure} was built."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Your army follows forceful cracks and crunches to a pond of lava, in which an imposing {EventStructure} was built."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Inside, {EventHero.FirstName} finds <<a:EnemyUnit>> broken out of <<o:EnemyUnit>> cell, squatting on the prison floor. Dozens of Lithorine creatures who have made their hive in here, crawl around <<P:EnemyUnit>>. The {EnemyUnit} picks up two <<m:EventUnit>> and smashes them into each other. To <<G:bewilderment^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>, and the <<G:entertainment^n,EnemyUnit>>, the <<m:EventUnit>> reassemble into a {EventUnitB}!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Inside, you find <<a:EnemyUnit>> broken out of <<o:EnemyUnit>> cell, squatting on the prison floor. Dozens of Lithorine creatures who have made their hive in here, crawl around <<P:EnemyUnit>>. The {EnemyUnit} picks up two <<m:EventUnit>> and smashes them into each other. To your bewilderment, and the <<G:entertainment^n,EnemyUnit>>, the <<m:EventUnit>> reassemble into a {EventUnitB}!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Defend yourselves! To arms!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Cast an emergency stun spell [mana/] on the <<m:EventUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Manipulate the movement speed of the Lithorine pests."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Flee the scene."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Even the mightiest fall to a thousand strikes made as one, troops!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Order miners [structureprod/] from {EventCity} to hack away at the Lithorine creatures' shells."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_722@TITLE"
msgstr "Primordial Clay"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Lithorine carcasses are shipped to {EventCity} to be used as building materials. What else will you confiscate before leaving the <<G:walls^p,EventStructure>>?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The last of the Lithorine critters crumbles. The {EnemyUnit} lies at <<G:feet^p,EventHero>>, defeated."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The last of the Lithorine critters crumbles. The {EnemyUnit} lies at your feet, defeated."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} surmises that the Lithorine infestation has made the prison walls poriferous and brittle, allowing the {EnemyUnit} to escape. The beast finally raises <<r:EnemyUnit>> up and cautiously observes <<G:every action^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>. Using gestures, your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.HeroConcept]<<EventHero{hero/heroine}>>[/hyperlink] communicates to the {EnemyUnit} that <<p:EventHero>> will free <<P:EnemyUnit>> from the {EventStructure} if <<p:EnemyUnit>> is willing to fight for you. The behemoth ultimately nods."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You surmise that the Lithorine infestation has made the prison walls poriferous and brittle, allowing the {EnemyUnit} to escape. The beast finally raises <<r:EnemyUnit>> up and cautiously observes your every action. Using gestures, you communicate to the {EnemyUnit} that you will free <<P:EnemyUnit>> from the {EventStructure} if <<p:EnemyUnit>> is willing to fight for you. The behemoth ultimately nods."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Extract precious gems [gold/] from the Lithorine carcasses."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Reassemble a {EventUnit} from the rubble. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "The limb of a {EventUnitB} will serve as a {EventItem}. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_723@TITLE"
msgstr "Primordial Clay: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Once the <<G:collar^n,EnemyUnit>> breaks, <<o:EnemyUnit>> full power returns! How will {EventHero.FirstName} defend <<r:EventHero>> against <<o:EnemyUnit>> kin and allies?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Once the <<G:collar^n,EnemyUnit>> breaks, <<o:EnemyUnit>> full power returns! How will you defend yourself against <<o:EnemyUnit>> kin and allies?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As <<G:troops^p,EventHero>> march on the daunting {EventStructure}, {EventHero.FirstName} perceives shallow furrows in the hot mud, leading into its entrance. <<Cp:EventHero>> enters."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "As your troops march on the daunting {EventStructure}, you perceive shallow furrows in the hot mud, leading into its entrance. You enter."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It smells like acid inside. Towering murals depict how stalwart {GLOBAL.GiantsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} subdued behemoths from the {GLOBAL.UrwildernessLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. The murals feature one exceptionally ruthless {EnemyUnit} and its eventual chaining by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archons[/hyperlink]. {EventHero.FirstName} soon learns a terrible truth: this {EventStructure} houses that very {EnemyUnit}! What is worse, <<o:EnemyUnit>> Serpent worshipers have broken <<o:EnemyUnit>> chains and now attempt to corrode <<o:EnemyUnit>> Archon collar!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "It smells like acid inside. Towering murals depict how stalwart {GLOBAL.GiantsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} subdued behemoths from the {GLOBAL.UrwildernessLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. The murals feature one exceptionally ruthless {EnemyUnit} and its eventual chaining by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archons[/hyperlink]. You soon learn a terrible truth: this {EventStructure} houses that very {EnemyUnit}! What is worse, <<o:EnemyUnit>> Serpent worshipers have broken <<o:EnemyUnit>> chains and now attempt to corrode <<o:EnemyUnit>> Archon collar!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Charge to cut off <<o:EnemyUnit>> head!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Neutralize the Serpents' caustic pools with simple spells. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Reinforce the Archon collar to delay the <<G:escape^n,EnemyUnit>>"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Retreat from the primordial snake pit."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Induce the Serpents to snap at each other!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Take {EventCity} medicine [food/] to protect yourself from the Serpents' venom."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_724@TITLE"
msgstr "Wyrm Wars"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Soon, the lingering corrosive vapors will melt all within the {EventStructure}. What will {EventHero} take, before it is too late?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Soon, the lingering corrosive vapors will melt all within the {EventStructure}. What will you take, before it is too late?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Knee-deep in venom and acid, your victorious warriors are surrounded by dead Serpents. And one slain {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A bewildered {EventUnit} seeks to slither out discreetly. {EventHero.FirstName} pays little attention to <<P:EventUnit>>, instead inspecting the already decomposing corpse of the Basilisk. <<Cp:EventHero>> yanks out one of the <<G:fangs^p,EnemyUnit>> and judges that it passes for a {EventItem}. Only then does <<p:EventHero>> discover the Basilisk egg. It wobbles and cracks. The Basilisk's offspring may be reared to fight for you!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A bewildered {EventUnit} seeks to slither out discreetly. You pay little attention to <<P:EventUnit>>, instead inspecting the already decomposing corpse of the Basilisk. You yank out one of the <<G:fangs^p,EnemyUnit>> and judge that it passes for a {EventItem}. Only then do you discover the Basilisk egg. It wobbles and cracks. The Basilisk's offspring may be reared to fight for you!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Harvest the fallen Serpents' scales and fangs. [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Capture the {EventUnit} [unit/] before it slithers away."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Raise a new {EventUnitB} [unit/] from the <<G:corpse^n,EnemyUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Learn how to use the <<G:poison^n,EnemyUnit>> [knowledge/] in battle."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@GUARANTEED_REWARD_PRISONER"
msgstr "You gain access to Free Primordial Prisoner, which grants you a {unit}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_725@TITLE"
msgstr "Wyrm Wars: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_736@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Will you support our mission?\" The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} seek to collaborate with you in exchange for secrets from the vaults of {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_736@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A floating formation of stone faces addresses you: \"We greet you.\" The monotonous voice of {EventHouseLord.FirstName} of the {GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink} of {EventHouse.Name} resonates inside your skull."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_736@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The stone-faced entity continues: \"Do not fear us, for we mean no harm. We once shared your ambitions, when we still ruled over formidable {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. We are even greater now. We are the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. We observe. We chronicle. We preserve and collect all that the cosmos holds.\" The formation's faces show no emotion, yet there is a hopeful tone in its voice."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_736@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Inspect the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} of {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_736@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I will leave you to your quests for knowledge.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_736@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Learn what quests the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} have to offer."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_736@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Sedentary {EventHouse}"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_737@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We, the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}, will reward your aid,\" the {EventHouseLord} concludes. \"You are eternally invited to our {GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink} to exchange knowledge and secrets.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_737@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A floating formation of stone faces addresses you: \"{EventHouse} welcomes you, <<PlayerLeader{brother/sister}>>. I am {EventHouseLord.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_737@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We share ancient kinship, although our paths diverged eons ago.\" You've heard of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept]Elder Giants[/hyperlink] who turned themselves to crystals to preserve not just themselves, but also their lore. \"We, scholars of the cosmos, keenly note your mobility, Giant. Not out of envy. But out of utility. Like our {EventHouseRace}, our wisdom can guide you to erudition.\" The stone-faced entity's voice is monotonous, yet not without hopeful tone."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_737@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Inspect the crystal settlement of {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_737@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Farewell. Perhaps you can teach me Myrrida's lost secrets some day.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_737@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Offer to aid the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} with a quest for knowledge."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_737@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Perpetual {EventHouse}"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventStackLeader} and the {EventHouseRace} party are explorers sent out by the {GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink}. How will {EventHero.FirstName} proceed?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The {EventStackLeader} and the {EventHouseRace} party are explorers sent out by the {GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink}. How will you proceed?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your troops discover a band of warriors from {EventHouse} staring at a {EventStructure} in silence. <<Ca:EventStackLeader>> notices you."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Your troops discover a band of warriors from {EventHouse} staring at a {EventStructure} in silence. <<Ca:EventStackLeader>> notices {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BODY_HEADER@NO_HERO_IN_STACK"
msgstr "Your troops discover a band of warriors from {EventHouse} staring at a {EventStructure} in silence. <<Ca:EventStackLeader>> notices your army."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "While <<o:EventStackLeader>> troops continue to observe the {EventStructure} like statues, the {EventStackLeader} turns to face {EventHero.FirstName}. <<Cp:EventStackLeader>> relays a memorized speech: \"This territory is surveyed by the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Our mission is to record uncollected lore. Kindly leave us to our business.\" The {EventStackLeader} observes {EventHero.FirstName}, but <<o:EventStackLeader>> gaze is vacant, as if listening to something—or someone—faraway."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "While <<o:EventStackLeader>> troops continue to observe the {EventStructure} like statues, the {EventStackLeader} turns to face you. <<Cp:EventStackLeader>> relays a memorized speech: \"This territory is surveyed by the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Our mission is to record uncollected lore. Kindly leave us to our business.\" The {EventStackLeader} observes you, but <<o:EventStackLeader>> gaze is vacant, as if listening to something—or someone—faraway."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BODY_LORE@NO_HERO_IN_STACK"
msgstr "While <<o:EventStackLeader>> troops continue to observe the {EventStructure} like statues, the {EventStackLeader} turns to face your warriors. <<Cp:EventStackLeader>> relays a memorized speech: \"This territory is surveyed by the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Our mission is to record uncollected lore. Kindly leave us to our business.\" The {EventStackLeader} observes your army, but <<o:EventStackLeader>> gaze is vacant, as if listening to something—or someone—faraway."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Help the {EventStackLeader} complete their survey [knowledge/] of the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Forget this {EventStructure}. Deliver my {EventItem} [item/] to the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} for examination.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Gift magical crystals [mana/] to {EventHouse} to make the {EventHouseRace} warriors leave."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Force the crystal-infused warriors to abandon the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Attack the unmoving servants of the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the {EventStructure} to the warriors of the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_740@TITLE"
msgstr "Eternal Scholars"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_764@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Since we cannot leave {EventHouse}, we appreciate your capacity for retrieving what we cannot procure ourselves,\" the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} conclude. \"Kindly consider aiding us in a quest for knowledge.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_764@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} contact you from within their crystalline library in {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_764@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Greetings, {PlayerLeader.TitleName},\" the {EventHouseLord} hums \"It has been some time since we last communed. As you are aware, we scour the realm for knowledge. We seek to chronicle and preserve all lore held by the cosmos. We surmised you would be interested in aiding our cause. Naturally, we will reward you for your endeavors.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_764@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Reject the offer presented by the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_764@TITLE"
msgstr "Encouraging Eternal Thirst"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The animated warriors of clay train their weapons on {EventHero.FirstName}, obliged to protect their maker: the thrashing {EnemyUnit}! Defend yourself!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The animated warriors of clay train their weapons on you, obliged to protect their maker: the thrashing {EnemyUnit}! Defend yourself!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Amid a vast lava pool, {EventHero} discovers an unusually lofty {EventStructure}. A small gate offers a way inside."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Amid a vast lava pool, you discover an unusually lofty {EventStructure}. A small gate offers a way inside."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your army enters the vaulted courtyard adorned with clay statues, like immovable prison guards, where {EventHero.FirstName} discovers a {EnemyUnit} flying high above them! <<Co:EnemyUnit>> inherent heat melted the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon chain[/hyperlink] that drained <<o:EnemyUnit>> power. Invigorating flames fall from the <<G:wings^p,EnemyUnit>>, which graze the terracotta warrior statues, kindling life in the sculpted guards!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Your army enters the vaulted courtyard adorned with clay statues, like immovable prison guards, where you discover a {EnemyUnit} flying high above you! <<Co:EnemyUnit>> inherent heat melted the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon chain[/hyperlink] that drained <<o:EnemyUnit>> power. Invigorating flames fall from the <<G:wings^p,EnemyUnit>>, which graze the terracotta warrior statues, kindling life in the sculpted guards!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack! Cut down the moth and its clay protectors!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Nullify [mana/] the clay soldiers' ability to resurrect."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Crack the soldiers' clay with icy winds."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Escape the {EventStructure} and return another time."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Blind {EnemyUnit} with a bright ball of lightning."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Dispatch additional armor [unitprod/] from {EventCity} to protect your troops."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Draw from the surrounding lava pools to ignite the clay warriors!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_765@TITLE"
msgstr "Touched By The Flame"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Before the {EventStructure} collapses into the pool of lava, what will {EventHero} endeavor to salvage?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Before the {EventStructure} collapses into the pool of lava, what do you endeavor to salvage?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your army stands victorious over the rubble of the crumbled clay warriors, and the gargantuan husk of the {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The Moth fell on the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon chain[/hyperlink] that drained life from the {EnemyUnit} for so many centuries. Unexpectedly, energy arcs from the chain back into the {EnemyUnit}, which revives once again, as do the two remaining clay statues of a {EventUnit} and a {EventUnitB}. The revitalized {EnemyUnit} obeys you. However, for it to leave the {EventStructure}, the structure must be destroyed."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Haul the clay fragments [structureprod/] of the defeated statues to {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Collect the weapons [unitprod/] wielded by the clay warriors for {PlayerCapital}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Study the revitalizing effects of the Pyremoth to augment [unitHero/] {EventHero.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@BUTTON_2@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Study the revitalizing effects of the Pyremoth to augment [unitHero/] yourself."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_766@TITLE"
msgstr "Touched By The Flame: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_780@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you clear the {EventSpawner} to retrieve the {EventArtifact} for the Crystal Dwelling?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_780@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} approach you with a request."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_780@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We have discovered the location of a relic long thought lost. The {EventArtifact} is located in a {EventSpawner} {EventDirection} {EventCity},\" they say to you in a monotone voice. \"We wish to study the {EventArtifact} and store it within our vast crystalline libraries. However, the {EventSpawner} is not without defenders, thus complicating the retrieval of the {EventArtifact}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_780@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will reclaim this relic from the {EventSpawner}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_780@TITLE"
msgstr "Reclaiming the {EventArtifact}"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_781@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are eager to study the {EventArtifact}. Will you stay true to your word and return it?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_781@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have recovered the {EventArtifact} from the {EventSpawner}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_781@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} have already noticed your success and commune with you from afar. \"You have done well, {PlayerLeader.Title},\" their emissary speaks to you monotonously. \"We may finally unveil what secrets the {EventArtifact} holds.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_781@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Give the {EventArtifact} to the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}. [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_781@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Keep the {EventArtifact} for yourself, angering the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_781@TITLE"
msgstr "Reclaiming the {EventArtifact}: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_798@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You may capture the {EventStackLeader}, after downing <<P:EventStackLeader>> in the {EventSpawner}, by using this Lithorite capsule. It will perpetuate <<p:EventStackLeader>> within.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_798@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} approach you with a request."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_798@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We have an interest in studying and preserving the various creatures that populate the realms,\" they declare. \"One of the creatures missing from our collection is a {EventStackLeader}. We recently discovered a <<G:nest^n,EventStackLeader>> nearby: a {EventSpawner} {EventDirection} {EventCity}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_798@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I shall return with the captured {EventStackLeader}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_798@TITLE"
msgstr "Ensnaring <<m:EventStackLeader>>"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_799@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are eager to acquire the {EventStackLeader}. Will you complete your quest and hand <<P:EventStackLeader>> over to them?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_799@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {EventStackLeader} is successfully encapsulated within the large Lithorite crystal. The {EventSpawner} is dismantled."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_799@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} have already noticed your success and commune with you from afar. \"You have done well, {PlayerLeader.Title},\" their emissary speaks to you monotonously. \"We may finally study the {EventStackLeader} and <<o:EventStackLeader>> behavior for all eternity.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_799@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Offer the {EventStackLeader} to the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} [allegiance/]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_799@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Tame the {EventStackLeader} for yourself [unit/], angering the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_799@TITLE"
msgstr "Ensnaring <<m:EventStackLeader>>: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_821@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you forge the {EventArtifact} for the Crystal Dwelling so that they may study it? You will receive a bespoke [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ItemForgeConcept]Blueprint[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_821@BODY_FOOTER@FORGE_ITEM_VAR1"
msgstr "Will you reforge the {EventArtifact} for the Crystal Dwelling so that they may study it? You will receive a bespoke [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ItemForgeConcept]Blueprint[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_821@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} approach you with a request."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_821@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We have long philosophized the powers of a hypothetical weapon. A {EventArtifact}, if you will.\" they explain in a hollow voice. \"Should this {EventArtifact} come into existence, we wish to keep and study it. We believe you possess an {GLOBAL.ItemForgeConcept.Hyperlink}. We can provide you with the forging instructions if you agree.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_821@BODY_LORE@FORGE_ITEM_VAR1"
msgstr "\"Long have we kept the fragments of a {EventArtifact}, a relic from a long-lost age. Its power is chronicled in legends.\" Despite their monotone voice, there is a hint of embarrassment in the words of the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}. \"Alas, we could not repair the item ourselves. We understand you control an {GLOBAL.ItemForgeConcept.Hyperlink}. Would you be able to reforge the {EventArtifact}?\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_821@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will forge the {EventArtifact} for you.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_821@TITLE"
msgstr "Forging the {EventArtifact}"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_822@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are eager to study the effects of the {EventArtifact}. Will you hand it over?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_822@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have forged the {EventArtifact} in your Item Forge."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_822@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} have sensed your success and approach you again. \"You have done well, {PlayerLeader.Title},\" their emissary speaks to you monotonously. \"We are curious about the {EventArtifact} and its potential.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_822@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Give the {EventArtifact} to the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}. [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_822@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Keep the {EventArtifact} for yourself, angering the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_822@TITLE"
msgstr "Forging the {EventArtifact}: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_880@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Will you accept the Eternal Sages' invitation to become a Medium for their ritual to commune with other <<m:{GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink}>>?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_880@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "It has become a familiar sight: the formal greeting of the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in their crystalline library in {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_880@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<G:droning voice^n,EventHouseLord>> explains: \"You have proven yourself a valuable ally to our cause, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}. One last favor remains. We seek to reach out to our scattered kin across the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. To commune and exchange our pooled knowledge from all realms and worlds. The ritual calls for an individual to act as a Medium. An individual with the powers of a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_880@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Agree to become their Medium. The Eternal Sages gratefully prepare their ritual."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_880@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Pretend to agree [evilact/] with the intent of disrupting the Conclave ritual."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_880@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Politely decline. Request a private communion with the Dwelling [knowledge/] instead."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_880@TITLE"
msgstr "Communion Among Crystals"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_881@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "This is the Cosmic Conclave that {EventHouse} manifested, with you at its center. All-knowing power from across the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is coursing through your immortal body."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_881@BODY_FOOTER@PLAYER_NOT_MEDIU"
msgstr "The Cosmic Conclave causes this realm to grow rife with all-knowing power from across the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_881@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Stars suddenly appear in the sky, followed by droning hums that ripple through the ground. The air tastes like cherries."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_881@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Astral connections are drawn between <<m:{GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink}>> on other realms, appearing in the shape of an arcane whirlpool. Strands of purple energy emerge between the stars, reaching to connect with a Medium. At once, all strands have touched down in {EventHouse}, causing energy to shoot back into the cosmos. The surges soon reach an equilibrium. The connections are stabilized. The Cosmic Conclave, a communion among {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, has begun."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_881@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The secrets of the cosmos, laid out before me.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_881@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"We may learn much from this auspicious omen.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_881@TITLE"
msgstr "The Cosmic Conclave"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_882@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Following the cosmic culmination of your partnership with {EventHouse}, you celebrate your achievements in your research which contributed to your personal ambitions."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_882@BODY_FOOTER@PLAYER_NOT_MEDIU"
msgstr "Your research benefited from the Cosmic Conclave. How much your rivals profited from the occurrence, remains to be seen."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_882@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The Cosmic Conclave has ended. The {GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink} has successfully communed with their kin across the cosmos."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_882@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The clarity with which you beheld the world and its secrets beyond is dulling. It is as if your mind is suddenly wrapped in cotton. But while the acuity has waned, the fruits of this Age of Knowledge remain. Already have the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Hyperlink} serenely withdrawn back into their crystal strongholds to resume their eternal studies."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_882@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I now know how much more there remains to learn.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_882@TITLE"
msgstr "The Cosmic Conclave: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_883@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Having discovered your betrayal, {EventHouseLord.TitleName} of {EventHouse} contacts you. \"You will pay for this desecration!\", <<p:EventHouseLord>> booms. But you already have your prize."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_883@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Stars suddenly appear in the sky, followed by droning hums that ripple through the ground. The air tastes like cherries."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_883@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Astral connections are drawn between <<m:{GLOBAL.CrystalDwellingConcept.Hyperlink}>> on other realms, appearing in the shape of an arcane whirlpool. Strands of purple energy emerge between the stars, reaching to connect with a Medium: you. But they never find their mark. Your mages initiate the counter ritual, causing the strands to tangle and imminently strike into {EventHouse} like thunderbolts. Its eternal structures crumble; its defenders disintegrate."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_883@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I have dominion over knowledge. [knowledge/] I will have dominion over you.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_883@TITLE"
msgstr "Eternal Deception"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "How would you summarize your ambitions to the {EventUnit}?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A {EventUnit}, one of your Hastefolk subjects, boldly asks about your plans for the future."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"My {PlayerLeader.Title}, you are descended from a line of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept]mighty kings[/hyperlink] and imposing warriors. Your ancestors once defined the lay of the land, the course of rivers, and the flow of mountains. As an heir of the power of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, your {EventRace} are curious to know... what plans do you have for this realm?\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Restore Myrrida [influence/] to its former majesty."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Reshape the realms [structureprod/] as I see fit."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Protect [goodact/] those smaller than I."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Forge [bindingessence/] potent items that will decide the realms' fate."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Call mighty storms, as my ancestors did eons ago. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Raise seas of lava, as my ancestors did eons ago. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Cover continents with snow, as my ancestors did eons ago. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Erect everlasting mountains, as my ancestors did eons ago. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_905@TITLE"
msgstr "Giant Ambitions"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your {EventRace} rely on you to unlock their full potential. What path will you choose for your subjects?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You possess the power to reshape the realms. As your majesty grows, it is time to reshape your {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Not even the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept]Giant Kings[/hyperlink] of yore could rule the realms without the aid of their followers. Wicked tongues claim that they were notorious for experimenting on their lesser subjects. Whatever the case, you depend on your Hastefolk to maintain control over your dominion. It is your duty and responsibility to develop your {EventRace}. They crave your guidance."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I only wish to keep you from harm.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You shall grow tall and mighty like the Giants of old.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I will lend you the power of Storm Giants.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I will lend you the power of Fire Giants.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I will lend you the power of Frost Giants.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"I will lend you the power of Rock Giants.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"You are already perfect exactly as you are.\" [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1167_906@TITLE"
msgstr "Formative Developments"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Lithorine sentries enter the hall. Arcane waves surge through the building as they hum with power and notice {EventHero.FirstName}..."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Lithorine sentries enter the hall. Arcane waves surge through the building as they hum with power and notice you..."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A majestic {EventStructure} towers before {EventHero.TitleName}, the name of the depicted {GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} forgotten in time."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A majestic {EventStructure} towers before you, the name of the depicted {GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} forgotten in time."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Under the massive throne, {EventHero.FirstName} enters a grand hall, <<o:EventHero>> movement echoing through the building. There is no life to be found here. No cobwebs, vermin, or even dust cover the halls. And yet, there is no caretaker to be found... Until {EventHero.FirstName} feels a familiar tingle run across <<o:EventHero>> spine—a surge of arcane energy."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Under the massive throne, you enter a grand hall, your movement echoes through the building. There is no life to be found here. No cobwebs, vermin, or even dust cover the halls. And yet, there is no caretaker to be found... Until you feel a familiar tingle run across your spine—a surge of arcane energy."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Attack these rogue sentries!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Cast a protective spell [mana/] over your army."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Use your arcane knowledge to delay the surges of magic."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Flee the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Invoke the powers of Chaos to taunt and confuse the sentries."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Invoke the powers of the {EventStructure} to strengthen the armor of your army."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1367@TITLE"
msgstr "Fractured Sentries"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Next to the knowledge found within, {EventHero.FirstName} finds troves of hidden treasure, and even a room of dormant Lithorine sentries."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Next to the knowledge found within, you find troves of hidden treasure, and even a room of dormant Lithorine sentries."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After destroying the Lithorine sentries of the {EventStructure}, {EventHero.Name} is free to explore the pristine halls."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "After destroying the Lithorine sentries of the {EventStructure}, you are free to explore the pristine halls."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With the sentries obsessively cleaning and protecting the halls for centuries, everything within was preserved. Clear runes, carvings and rows of books line the walls, sharing a wealth of stories about {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. There are depictions of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept]Giant Kings[/hyperlink] and their covenants with the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the fall of Myrrida and the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and even secret legends of the {GLOBAL.EternalCouncilLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take a weapon covered in crystals. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Claim the treasure [gold/] found within the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Bind some of the sentries on your side. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Gather the Lithorite crystals. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1368@TITLE"
msgstr "Fractures Sentries: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Their leader points at {EventHero.FirstName} and shouts: \"Great Kings of old! Bless us with your prowess to smite these heretics!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Their leader points at you and shouts: \"Great Kings of old! Bless us with your prowess to smite these heretics!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} enters the {EventStructure} and finds a group of figures worshiping the statue of an ancient {GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You enter the {EventStructure} and find a group of figures worshiping the statue of an ancient {GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "At first, the worshippers don't seem to notice {EventHero,FirstName} at all, instead chanting in the ancient language of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. It is only when {EventHero.FirstName} approaches the statue that their leader lifts <<o:EnemyUnit>> gaze. \"You are no Giant worshippers. You trespass on hallowed grounds! You dare taint the grand steps of the {EventStructure} with your soldiers?!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "At first, the worshippers don't seem to notice you at all, instead chanting in the ancient language of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. It is only when you approach the statue that their leader lifts <<o:EnemyUnit>> gaze. \"You are no Giant worshippers. You trespass on hallowed grounds! You dare taint the grand steps of the {EventStructure} with your soldiers?!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Attack!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You want to become giants, you will be felled like them!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"The blessing of growth can be granted, but I can take it away.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Leave the cultists to their ceremony."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"You worship my kin! Bow to me, my followers!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1370@TITLE"
msgstr "Primal Prowess"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Without the cultists to protect their treasure, the objects are free to claim."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After slaying the worshipers of the {EventStructure}, {EventHero.FirstName} can freely approach the statue."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "After slaying the worshipers of the {EventStructure} you can freely approach the statue."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "No thunder crashes down, no lightning nor divine wrath smites {EventHero.FirstName} or <<o:EventHero>> army. Instead, the {EventStructure} lies silent, the grand halls echoing every footstep as the statue looms above the army. At the giant base of the statue, the cultists had gathered a pile of artifacts to worship and sacrifice to their beloved {GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "No thunder crashes down, no lightning nor divine wrath smites you or your army. Instead, the {EventStructure} lies silent, the grand halls echoing every footstep as the statue looms above the army. At the giant base of the statue, the cultists had gathered a pile of artifacts to worship and sacrifice to their beloved {GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Gather everything of value to sell. [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Take the ritual scroll of Colossus' Grace."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Claim the {EventItem}. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Take the tome of ancient lore [knowledge/] on Giants and their magic."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Claim nothing. This remnant of civilization should be kept intact. [materiumboon/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1371@TITLE"
msgstr "Primal Prowess: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The Giant looks up at {EventHero.FirstName} as <<p:EventHero>> approaches. \"Interlopers! This is my throne! Attack them!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The Giant looks up at you as you approach. \"Interlopers! This is my throne! Attack them!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Inside the looming {EventStructure}, remnant to the glory of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {EventHero.Name} finds a {GiantUnit}, together with a group of Demigiants."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Inside the looming {EventStructure}, remnant to the glory of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, you find a {GiantUnit}, together with a group of Demigiants."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Aeons ago, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept]Giant Kings[/hyperlink] ruled over all lesser races,\" the Giant boasts to <<o:EnemyUnit>> Demigiant followers. \"It is only just that I claim this throne once more, per the natural order.\" A confused silence falls, and the Giant yells in frustration: \"The small follow the big, you fools!\" The Demigiants cheer, glad they understand, as the Giant sighs."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack these lumbering fools!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"My Dragon kin have bested you before, Giant! I will do so again!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Confuse the Demigiants with rhetoric [knowledge/] about Giants and their kin."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Leave the Giant and <<o:EnemyUnit>> followers."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Like the legend of the boy shepherd, we too can slay Giants!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"A group of hunters can take down the largest quarry!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1373@TITLE"
msgstr "Size Matters"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The lone Demigiant poses no threat to {EventHero.FirstName}. What do you ask of <<P:EventUnit>>?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The lone Demigiant poses no threat to you. What do you ask of <<P:EventUnit>>?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} has slain a would-be {GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and his followers. With that, the {EventStructure} is yours and can be explored freely."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You have slain a would-be {GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and his followers. With that, the {EventStructure} is yours and can be explored freely."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "As {EventHero.FirstName} wanders the halls, <<p:EventHero>> encounters a lone {EventUnit}, who raises <<o:EventUnit>> arms. \"You stomped the Giant? You win. Giant told me guard the treasure... But I got bored so I walked around.\" The Demigiant snickers. \"You stomped the Giant. I am free.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "As you wander the halls you encounter a lone {EventUnit}, who raises <<o:EventUnit>> arms. \"You stomped the Giant? You win. He was mean anyways. Called us dumb. He told me to guard the treasure... But I got bored so I walked around.\" The demi-giant snickers. \"Now he got stomped and I am free.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Recruit the Demigiant to your side. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Demand the Demigiant guide you to their collected treasures. [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"You are free to go, {EventUnit}.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Kill the surrendering {EventUnit} as an example to your troops. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1374@TITLE"
msgstr "Size Matters: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1476@BODY_FOOTER@NO_AI_LORDS"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} raises <<o:EventUnit>> hands and wails in ecstasy. \"You are blessed by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept]Kjörnoe[/hyperlink]! We will worship you as we did them!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1476@BODY_LORE@NO_AI_LORDS"
msgstr "\"I am a <<EventUnit{Son/Daughter}>> of the Kjörnoe, a follower of the true [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept]Giant Kings[/hyperlink] so unfairly declared 'Traitors.' For long, we have followed the Artifacts you now possess, waiting for someone to embody the blessings of the Kjörnoe. You are <<P:PlayerLeader>>! And thus, the Sons of the Kjörnoe vow their loyalty to you!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1490@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Guide the fragmented souls to {ReplacedPlayerFallback}. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1490@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Stop the ritual and use the Artifacts to rule the Sons of the Kjörnoe yourself."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1490@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Sacrifice your <<EventHero{hero/heroine}>> {EventHero.TitleName} to bring back the Traitor King under your command. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1498@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{PreviousPlayer.TitleName} has been cast into the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink} by {TriggeringPlayer}. The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept]Traitor King[/hyperlink] {TraitorKingLord} now rules the {ReplacedPlayerRace} in <<o:PreviousPlayer>> stead."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1498@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your plans are interrupted by a dark arcane surge, rushing over the realm."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1498@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "After investigating its cause, you find that {TriggeringPlayer} has used the {CauldronRelic}, {MirrorRelic}, and {GrailRelic} to reawaken the ancient {GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. The summoning process has cast {PreviousPlayer} into the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and replaced <<P:PreviousPlayer>> with {TraitorKingLord}. Unfortunately, there is nothing you can do against this Traitor King magic."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1498@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will learn [knowledge/] from the dark magic of this Traitor King!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1498@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Send the {ReplacedPlayerRace} some alms [gold/] out of sympathy. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1498@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"This forbidden act can not go unanswered.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@1194_1498@TITLE"
msgstr "Return of the Kjörnoe: Dark Summoning"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6766@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Spurts of flame emerge in the skies, quenching the storm until the barrier at the plateau center collapses."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6766@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Grunting contently, the {EventUnit} takes all the Lithorine cores you gathered. Then <<p:EventUnit>> raises <<o:EventUnit>> hands:"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6766@BODY_HEADER@OGRE_DEFEATED"
msgstr "Beaten and threatened by the might of you and your troops, the {EventUnit} begrudgingly begins <<o:EventUnit>> invocation:"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6766@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Spark, li'l rune![br/]Hear flame[br/]Fissures past[br/]Carved name:[br/]Thwart an' blast[br/]—boom!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6766@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to face what lay beyond the ward."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6766@TITLE"
msgstr "Crystalstorm Plateau: Shatterward Invocation"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6768@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.StormClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} Giants have bound the {EventStackLeader} to their will. They are ready to unleash it on anyone daring to interfere."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6768@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Reaching the center of the plateau, your troops gaze at an enormous {EventStackLeader}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6768@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Distracted by the sheer size of the {EventStackLeader}, it takes a few moments before your troops even notice the Giants gathered around a large menhir, its carved runes glowing with magic. There is some turmoil amongst those Giants, as if they were interrupted in a ritual. Seeing the insignia of the {GLOBAL.StormClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, it can only be assumed that the raging {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.TSR_CRYSTAL_STORM_AUTO_SPELL.Hyperlink} were their doing."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6768@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We must retreat, for now.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6768@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"This {GLOBAL.StormClanLoreConcept.Name} is no match for us, attack!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6768@TITLE"
msgstr "Crystalstorm Plateau: Storm Clan Ritual"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6791@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You sense a strong magic of bound allegiance within the {EventRelic.Name}. While the region turns windless at last, you can claim your victory."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6791@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have defeated the {GLOBAL.StormClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and its evoked Lithorine. Their present leader, a {EventUnit}, gathers its last strength to raise <<o:EventUnit>> voice."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6791@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Accursed {GLOBAL.FireClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} traitors, accursed all Hastefolk!\" <<p:EventUnit>> yells violently. \"They sicced you on us, broke our spell...\" Just slightly, the {EventUnit} moves <<o:EventUnit>> enormous fist. \"We will persist. We tamed the Lithorine. The power of the Giant Kings will be rightfully ours! A storm will erupt. All Hastefolk... shall... tremble!\" The {EventUnit} exhales <<o:EventUnit>> last breath, collapsing beside the {EventRelic.Name}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6791@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Absorb the lingering astral energies [mana/] before they dissipate."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6791@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Declare your dominion [influence/] over the {GLOBAL.StormClanLoreConcept.Name} on the entire realm."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6791@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Trace the rippling echoes of the storm to summon beings [unit/] of pure lightning."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6791@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "What can be learned of the {GLOBAL.StormClanLoreConcept.Name} magic must be shared with the Crystal Dwelling. [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6791@TITLE"
msgstr "Crystalstorm Plateau: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6922@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"Share what you learned about the {EventBeastName} with the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}.\" [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6989@BODY_FOOTER@ENIGMA_LOCKED"
msgstr "You must return to the other halls and solve its enigmas. Only afterwards will the Creator speak to you."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6989@BODY_HEADER@ENIGMA_LOCKED"
msgstr "At the center chamber, your troops find a {EventStackLeader}, observing the region in silence."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6989@BODY_LORE@ENIGMA_LOCKED"
msgstr "They dare not approach the {EventStackLeader} as if an impassable mountain was blocking their path. No words must be spoken to discern that this Creator worshiped by the {GLOBAL.StoneClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is not here to talk to you, but awaits another {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} engaged in the Hall of Enigmas."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6989@BUTTON_0@ENIGMA_LOCKED"
msgstr "Leave."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_6989@TITLE@ENIGMA_LOCKED"
msgstr "Hall of Enigmas: Observant Creator"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7003@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Share the knowledge about the Creator with the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}. [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7060@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Convoke the chilling host [unit/] of the Frost Clan!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7309@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} examines your troops. \"Only when the manifestations of <<ge:malice^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>> have been weakened, the spirit of {EventHero} <<r:EventHero>> may be challenged and forever destroyed.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7309@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Daunted by the vast desolate ruins extending towards the horizon, your troops are contacted by a shimmering spirit from afar."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7309@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Beware, brave citizens!\" The {EventUnit} shouts, as <<p:EventUnit>> draws near. \"For you are entering an accursed land. In ages long past this was the domain of a terrible [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept]Traitor King[/hyperlink]. Though {EventHero} fell to the rightful punishment of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]my people[/hyperlink], <<o:EventHero>> broken spirit continues to plague the realm, inflicting beasts, worms and even the soil itself with an insatiable hunger.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7309@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Consider the warning of the {EventUnit} as your troops enter the ruins."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7309@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Ask the {EventUnit} to hallow your troops [statuseffectresistance/] before they proceed."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7309@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Siphon [mana/][evilact/] holy energies from the {EventUnit} to protect [statuseffectresistance/] your own troops."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7309@TITLE"
msgstr "Exploring the Famished Fields"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventStackLeader} violently shakes <<o:EventStackLeader>> head. Then <<p:EventStackLeader>> fixates your troops: \"Which meal or prey have you brought to my platter?\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BODY_FOOTER@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "To confront {EventHero}, you must find and weaken the other aspects."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Gobbling the {EventStructure}, a terrible {EventStackLeader} is interrupted by your troops. As <<p:EventStackLeader>> turns towards them, <<p:EventStackLeader>> speaks with the sinister voice of {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BODY_HEADER@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "You have weakened the aspect of hunger."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I come to all, timeless my breath,\" the {EventStackLeader} says, baring <<o:EventStackLeader>> enormous teeth. \"In my wake I bring ravenous death. Bones are gnawed, trees devoured, bushes gobbled, <<m:{EventSmallAnimal}>> swallowed, <<m:{EventLargeAnimal}>> eaten bit by bit. All consumed within my pit.\" The {EventStackLeader} roars. \"Was I not their king, for them to feed? To rule, my birthright; to feast my primal pleasure. Yet they all failed me...\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BODY_LORE@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "Feeble as it is, it no longer poses a threat to you."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BUTTON_0@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "Leave the {EventStackLeader} to <<r:EventStackLeader>>."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"The head of a {EventStackLeader}, freshly served!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Enough {RandomFood} [food/] from our realm to fatten hunger itself.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"We bring the bane of all gluttons: The Tome of Fasting!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"The lost tail of a lizard, escaping the maw...\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7315@TITLE"
msgstr "Famished Fields: Aspect of Hunger"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventStackLeader} takes up <<o:EventStackLeader>> knife again. \"Which one of you will be the first?\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In the heat of an infernal lava-fueled kitchen, a {EventStackLeader} turns from the {EventStructure} to greet your troops with the deep voice of {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@BODY_HEADER@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "You have weakened the aspect of carnage."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Ah, visitors!\" <<p:EventStackLeader>> calls out, putting <<o:EventStackLeader>> large butcher's knife aside. \"Which dish do you fancy today, dear guests? Some {EventRace1}, fresh from the oven? Stewed {EventRace2}? Or better yet hashed {EventRace3} on a stick?\" The {EventStackLeader} leans forward, as if <<p:EventStackLeader>> was sharing a secret. \"These upstarts from {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} think their temples of carnage are a novelty. They should have seen this Slaughterhouse Arena in all its splendor! We served kings and held knightly banquets unequaled...\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@BODY_LORE@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "Blood-drenched and tired, the {EventStackLeader} no longer poses a threat to your troops."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Flee the {EventStackLeader}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You, {EventHero}—this slaughter ends now!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Boil the {EventStructure} [mana/] to cook the {EventStackLeader} <<r:EventStackLeader>>."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7320@TITLE"
msgstr "Famished Fields: Aspect of Carnage"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The gaze of the {EventStackLeader} penetrates your troops, staring right at you—the {EventPlayerType}—observing from a distance, seeking a way inside your mind..."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept]slopes of reality[/hyperlink], where the physical world seems to devour itself, a {EventStackLeader} preys upon the {GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} lost in an age long past."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@BODY_HEADER@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "You have weakened the aspect of delirium."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Toothless I bite. Mouthless I swallow,\" the {EventStackLeader} murmurs engulfed by an unworldly silence. \"No flesh could satiate my needs. The earth itself must vanish in my maw. A dozen minds a meal for me to feed. Yet most of all, I crave delicious souls!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@BODY_LORE@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "Silently afloat, the {EventStackLeader} no longer poses a threat to your troops."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Flee the {EventStackLeader}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Strike down this abomination, before it can enchain your thoughts!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Feed the {EventStackLeader} souls [souls/] cursed with oblivion."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7321@TITLE"
msgstr "Famished Fields: Aspect of Delirium"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7324@BUTTON_0@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "Leave the {EventStackLeader} to <<r:EventStackLeader>>."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7328@BUTTON_0@SPIRIT_WEAKENED"
msgstr "Leave the {EventStackLeader} to <<r:EventStackLeader>>."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7328@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Lure the {EventStackLeader} inside, to crush it with your force of will [knowledge/]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7461@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Through vile magic, {EventHero} calls upon <<o:EventHero>> minions to protect <<o:EventHero>> wretched unlife. Only a mighty army may challenge the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept]Traitor King[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7461@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Having weakened the aspects of hunger, carnage, and delirium, {EventHero} is forced to reveal <<o:EventHero>> true form, a vengeful accursed spirit."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7461@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Who do you think you are to dare challenge me?\" <<p:EventHero>> shouts, filled with fury. \"I have outwitted the {GLOBAL.EternalCouncilLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, escaped [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink] wrath. {GLOBAL.DragonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} shun my domain, afraid of my inescapable reach.\" <<Cge:voice^n,EventHero.FirstName>> growls with thunder, and the surrounding ruins start to crumble. \"I have become a primal power. I AM HUNGER. I AM DEATH!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7461@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to face {EventHero} and end <<o:EventHero>> malice."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7461@TITLE"
msgstr "Famished Fields: {EventHero} Exposed"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} vanishes within a radiant flare, <<o:EventUnit>> light rejuvenating the soil that it touches. Left alone amid the newly sprouting life, you determine the fate of the Famished Fields."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the presence of {EventHero} fades, deep-drawn sighs echo from the walls of the ruined city and the scarce trees murmur in relief."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} that had warned you about the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept]Traitor King's[/hyperlink] curse returns to your troops. \"{EventHero} is vanquished—at last!\" <<p:EventUnit>> exclaims, rejoicing with radiance. \"You, {PlayerLeader.TitleName}, have relieved the Famished Fields of their curse and restored peace upon the land. Take the {EventRelic} from <<ge:remains^p,EventHero.FirstName>> and watch <<p:EventRelic>> well. There dwells an evil within that never fades.\" The {EventUnit} lays down <<o:EventUnit>> weapons, placing <<o:EventUnit>> translucent hand on the ground for a last prayer: \"My vigil ends here. This is my parting gift...\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"This shall be a memorial to the triumph of good [goodact/] against evil!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"The power of the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept.Name} was great. Yet I stand above all!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Where there was hunger and famine, there shall be abundance [food/] and bounty!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"To study the city and its fate, we must invite the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name}.\" [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"We must learn [knowledge/] what we can about <<ge:potent soulcurse magic^n,EventHero.FirstName>>...\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7466@TITLE"
msgstr "Famished Fields: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7496@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Reclaim {EventUnit} Throne! Punish {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\" the troll commands. \"Cultists cast spell. Crush Cultists. Crush spell!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7496@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the foot of an imposing mountain, the path of your troops suddenly becomes blocked by a large, regal troll."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7496@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Bow before Mount Godkeep,\" the troll calls out, pointing towards the glimmering structures towering atop the mountain plateau, \"seat of {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and throne of mightiest {EventUnit}!\" <<Cp:EventUnit>> flaunts the crown on <<o:EventUnit>> head. \"But {EventUnit} betrayed. {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink} came. Poisoned minds of {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} with pride. Ogres and trolls rebelled... serve traitors!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7496@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ask the {EventUnit} where to find the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Name}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7496@TITLE"
msgstr "Discovering Mount Godkeep"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7514@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With a terrible cry, the {EventUnit} pours out <<o:EventUnit>> own soul, seeking to escape your reach."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7514@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Beaten and wounded, a {EventUnit} of the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink} speaks to your troops, still instilled with pride."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7514@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You think you can stop us?\" the {EventUnit} calls out, <<o:EventUnit>> jaw kept in movement by dark magic alone. \"For our gods, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept]the Kjörnoe[/hyperlink], death was just a door, a mere pathway to new powers.\" <<Cp:EventUnit>> rips an icicle from <<o:EventUnit>> shoulder, squashing it with <<o:EventUnit>> fists. \"They alone dared to oppose the false order of the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. As {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, we carry on their legacy and master their magic. Immortality is nigh...\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7514@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Let <<o:EventUnit>> soul escape to <<o:EventUnit>> masters."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7514@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Banish [mana/] the soul to end <<o:EventUnit>> malice. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7514@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Trap [mana/] the soul to wring out the sweet secrets [knowledge/] of Kjörnoe magic... [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7514@TITLE"
msgstr "Mount Godkeep: The {EventRace}"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7515@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} collapses. If <<o:EventUnit>> lunatic last words contained any grain of truth, the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is abusing the {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} as sacrifices in its vile rituals."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7515@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the verge of <<o:EventUnit>> last breath, a {EventUnit} of the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink} suddenly bursts out in laughter."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7515@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Have you seen the ogres?\" the {EventUnit} asks giggling, <<o:EventUnit>> sanity long gone. \"They splash like big frogs. Green intestines, blue goo. Paints the walls. Bloat 'em with magical essence, prick 'em with an ice shard and—plop! It's funny, stupid!\" <<Cp:EventUnit>> spouts blood as <<p:EventUnit>> laughs. \"They think we'd grant them power. Oh, yes, green splashing frog power!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7515@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We will find out soon enough.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7515@TITLE"
msgstr "Mount Godkeep: {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Name} Sacrifices"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7516@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Cult leader strong,\" the {EventUnit} warns. \"{EventUnit} has three loyal servants. One joins {PlayerLeader}, fights {EventHero}. {PlayerLeader} choose.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7516@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your troops have decimated the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink} roaming the slopes of Mount Godkeep. The {EventUnit} returns to them, grinning with malicious joy."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7516@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Cultists laugh and torture {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" the {EventUnit} says resentfully. \"Who laugh now?\" <<Cp:EventUnit>> swings <<o:EventUnit>> large mace towards the mountain top. \"Spell shield of Cultists broken. Now, {EventHero} fear {EventUnit} vengeance. Cower in throne room. <<Co:EventHero>> skull necklace for {EventUnit}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7516@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Choose the nurturing {BeastOgre} [unit/]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7516@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Choose the skillful {TrainerOgre} [unit/]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7516@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Choose the cunning {SeerOgre} [unit/]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7516@TITLE"
msgstr "Mount Godkeep: To the Throne!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I see no gifts nor thralls worthy of my magnificence,\" {CultHero} concludes. \"So you die.\" From behind the throne, large {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} grunts appear, ready to defend their newfound \"<<CultHero{King/Queen}>>\"."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BODY_FOOTER@ENTRY_BLOCKED"
msgstr "It seems the {EventUnit} spoke the truth and {EventStructure} can only be entered after enough of the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink} have been slain to disrupt their spell."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Entering the front gate of the imposing structure complex with its grand walls and statuary, your troops find themselves in a pristine hall of unparalleled grandeur."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BODY_HEADER@ENTRY_BLOCKED"
msgstr "Approaching the imposing structure complex with its grand walls and statuary, your troops find any path inside blocked."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Have you come to offer me reverence?\" an ice cold voice calls out, echoing through the giant chamber. \"Or will you end your lives in foolish defiance? For when I looked into the Mirror, I foresaw my destiny to wield the powers of the gods. I, {CultHero}, who bears the secret mark of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept]the Kjörnoe[/hyperlink] and leads their Sons to dark dominion.\" In the distance, the Netherice crown of {CultHero} reveals <<o:CultHero>> bearings below the ancient giant throne."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BODY_LORE@ENTRY_BLOCKED"
msgstr "A powerful spell seals each gate, each door, each tiny breach within the ancient walls, blocking it with an impenetrable barrier of Netherice."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Bring this false <<CultHero{King/Queen}>> to <<o:CultHero>> knees!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Berate [influence/] the trolls and ogres for betraying their king."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Flee."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@TITLE"
msgstr "Mount Godkeep: The False <<CultHero{King/Queen}>>"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7522@TITLE@ENTRY_BLOCKED"
msgstr "Mount Godkeep: Ice Barrier"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} takes off <<o:EventUnit>> crown. \"{PlayerLeader} worthy {PlayerLeader.Title}. {EventUnit} has {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} no longer. Will follow {PlayerLeader}!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the {CultHero} fallen victim to <<o:CultHero>> hubris, the {EventUnit} returns to the throne room <<p:EventUnit>> once ruled."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{EventUnit} brothers, all dead...\" <<p:EventUnit>> says, looking over the bodies of the fallen {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} scattered throughout the many chambers of {EventStructure}. The {EventUnit} hangs <<o:EventUnit>> enormous head, <<o:EventUnit>> hideous eyes growing misty. \"{EventUnit} fault. {EventRelic} doomed {EventUnit}. Showed glory. Brought death. Now {EventRelic} doomed {CultHero}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Accept the fealty of the {EventUnit} [unit/]."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Send the {EventUnit} to the {GLOBAL.EternalSagesLoreConcept.Name} [allegiance/], sharing knowledge about the {GLOBAL.BloodClanLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the {GLOBAL.TraitorKingCultLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Sacrifice the {EventUnit} [evilact/] to reanimate {CultHero} [hero/] as your dark servant."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "Sacrifice the {EventUnit} [evilact/] to reanimate {CultHero} [hero/] as your dark servant."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@BUTTON_9"
msgstr "Only take the crown of the {EventUnit}, as an emblem [influence/] of your growing splendor."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7523@TITLE"
msgstr "Mount Godkeep: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7754@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"The wise know [knowledge/] that they may only find what they carried within themselves.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7754@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"The arcane energies [mana/] emanated by the crystals of this island will sharpen our minds.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BODY_FOOTER@TRIAL_FAILED"
msgstr "The unison voice ends its ordeal: \"You will be detained on these islands, like many petty thieves and raiders that have come before!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BODY_FOOTER@TRIAL_LOCKED"
msgstr "You should return to the trial locations and answer the {EventStackLeader} there."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BODY_HEADER@TRIAL_LOCKED"
msgstr "Your troops carefully approach the {EventStackLeader}, floating amidst the three islands, yet <<p:EventStackLeader>> ignores them."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BODY_LORE@TRIAL_FAILED"
msgstr "\"You have answered our trials,\" the {EventStackLeader} speaks, \"and we have deemed your responses unworthy!\" There are crystal reflections in the water, blinding your troops, but they vanish again as the {EventStackLeader} continues: \"The <<m:{GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> ruled {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} with great wisdom. There was equality between giants and the smaller kin and even the <<m:{GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> themselves abided by the law and the verdicts of the {GLOBAL.EternalCouncilLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BODY_LORE@TRIAL_LOCKED"
msgstr "\"We have come to judge another {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" the {EventStackLeader} exclaims. \"Return to us when you have answered in our trials.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BUTTON_0@TRIAL_LOCKED"
msgstr "Leave."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BUTTON_1@TRIAL_FAILED"
msgstr "\"You underestimate the powers of a {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Name}. This detention ends now!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Valor.\" [unitprod/][chaosboon/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"Charity.\" [gold/][orderboon/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "\"Frugality.\" [food/][natureboon/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7774@TITLE@TRIAL_LOCKED"
msgstr "Trinity Island: The {EventStackLeader}"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7777@BODY_HEADER@TRIAL_FAILED"
msgstr "You have destroyed the {EventUnit} and wrested Trinity Island from <<o:EventUnit>> eternal grasp."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7800@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The Last Legion is awaiting its orders,\" the {EventUnit} speaks. \"We are the defenders of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Speak the word and we will drive off any invaders.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7800@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Examining the Flowrock Artifacts you possess, they suddenly spark alive and within the triangle they form, a {EventUnit} rises, pulled from the realm's depths."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7800@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You have summoned us to your aid, master?\" <<p:EventUnit>> asks, uttering with a mouthless voice. \"We have slumbered throughout the ages, lingering in wait below the earth. Is this the day that we finally rise, driving off all invaders that threaten {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}?\" In your mind the images of endless lines of clay soldiers form, opening their lidless eyes within eternal tombs. Their flanks warded by levitating weapons of the old <<m:{GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> bound by an undying magic."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7800@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Unleash the Last Legion on the realm!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7800@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Say that you will call upon the Last Legion one after one, as actual defenders."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7800@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Relieve the Last Legion from their eternal duty, absorbing the magical essence [mana/][bindingessence/][bindingfragments/] that kept them alive."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7800@TITLE"
msgstr "The Last Legion: Introduction"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7819@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The Last Legion is rising from its buried chambers of old to assault the realm. How do you wish to prepare for their attack?"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7819@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The realm is shaken by fear as doom-tales of a mythical Last Legion of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} run rampant."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7819@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Indeed the earth is in turmoil. You can feel its rippling tremors, hear its ancient murmurs. Villagers from all across the land are telling stories of clay-bound figures moving in the darkness of their fields. Smiths speak of weapons sparking alive and leaving the forges to join the ranks of the Last Legion. The truth of those stories remains to be judged, yet you sense immediate danger."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7819@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Rally the lieges! [influence/] This is the time they shall honor our pacts.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7819@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Let the heralds [influence/] muster any man or woman [unitprod/] willing to defend our cities!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7819@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"A Godir fears neither lumps of clay nor rusty weapons.\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7819@TITLE"
msgstr "The Last Legion: Stirrings in the Earth"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7821@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Armies of the Last Legion are marching on your cities. Repel their assaults, or all will be brought to naught!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7821@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "An unsettling silence falls over your cities as endless lines upon lines of Clay Soldiers rise from the earth."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7821@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "They speak no word, nor do the enchanted weapons floating at their flanks. But it is clear that this Last Legion of Myrrida has only one purpose: to wipe anyone with a footing in their lost ancient kingdom off the realm—except within the lands of {EventPlayer}. In this moment of greatest peril the treachery of the {EventPlayer.Title} of the {EventRace} becomes clear. It was <<P:EventPlayer>> who unleashed the Last Legion!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7821@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Once we have bested the storm, {EventPlayer} will pay for this!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7821@TITLE"
msgstr "The Last Legion: Global Assault"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7848@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "In this moment of mournful victory, the {EventRace} turn to their {PlayerLeader.Title}. You close your eyes and reshape the scattered clay and weapons into..."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7848@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the Last Legion squashed and beaten, a sense of peace returns to your realm, at last."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7848@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Yet there is little reason for cheerful victory. For when the foes were only heartless clay and steel, the corpses found on the battlefields too clearly illustrate the losses of your people. There are words speaking of other Godir still standing against the Last Legion in their domains. But it must not concern you, for the {EventRace} are in safety."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7848@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "...a monument of war. [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7848@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "...a monument of peace. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7848@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "...a mausoleum for the fallen. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7848@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "...clay workers to rebuild your cities. [structureprod/]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7848@TITLE"
msgstr "The Last Legion: Fragments of Clay"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7857@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"One battalion is yours to command directly, master,\" the {EventUnit} ends. \"May you lead us to victory!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7857@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The Last Legion arrives in terrible splendor as endless lines upon lines of Clay Soldiers rise from the earth."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7857@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The hour is nigh, master,\" a {EventUnit} that manifested <<r:EventUnit>> within your throne room speaks. \"Today we climb from our deep chambers to defend the vestiges of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. At last our purpose will be fulfilled!\" The countless armies of the Last Legion start their march against the other Godir of the realm. Realizing your treachery, they curse your name, yet it is too late."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7857@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"And victory it shall be!\""

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@STORY_EVENT@991_7857@TITLE"
msgstr "The Last Legion: Glory of Myrrida"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Attacks of enchanted units gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]A base {VOLATILE_CHARGE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of applying {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VOLATILE_CHARGE.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Crystal Focus"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_1@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit's attacks have:[bulletlist][bullet/]A base {VOLATILE_CHARGE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of applying {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VOLATILE_CHARGE.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enemy units in a {VOLATILE_CHARGE_TARGETER>AREA>Radius}-hex radius:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustain {CRYSTAL_CRASH_UNIT_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Physical} {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Sustain {CRYSTAL_CRASH_UNIT_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Shock} {GLOBAL.LightningDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Have a base {VOLATILE_CHARGE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VOLATILE_CHARGE.Hyperlink} for {VOLATILE_CHARGE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Crystal Crash"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POLEARM_UNIT.Hyperlink} that immobilizes enemies. Draftable in cities."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Lithorine Shardlancer"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE.Hyperlink} that inflicts {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VOLATILE_CHARGE.Hyperlink} in a large area. Draftable in cities."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Lithorine Gemcaster"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Revive target non-Lithorine non-Hero unit as a Lithorine of its Tier.[br/][br/]If victorious in combat, units revived can be kept for a {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} cost."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Crystallize Essence"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TOME_CRYSTAL_DWELLING@SKILL_6@DESCRIPTION"
