msgstr "Their clay proves to be incombustible. The animated warriors advance."

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ANCIENTWONDER_MOTH@AFFINITY_CHECK_CHAOS@HEADER"
msgstr "Test the clay soldiers' love of fire. Engulf them in it:"

