msgstr "After surviving your attack, the {TSR_HORNED_GOD} went into hiding. By facing {TSR_DRAGON_LORD_NAME} and destroying the {TSR_CG_STRUCTURE}, <<p:{TSR_HORNED_GOD}>> might however still be swayed."

