msgstr "After {TSR_WINNING_PLAYER} defeated the Draconic creatures roaming the area, the {TSR_HORNED_GOD} invoked a thunderstorm, shattering the black mountain at the region's center. Therein dwells {TSR_DRAGON_LORD_NAME} within <<o:TSR_DRAGON_LORD_NAME>> {TSR_CG_STRUCTURE}, which the {TSR_HORNED_GOD} desires to be eradicated!"

msgid "DLC@GIANTKINGS@TSR_CG@NOTE_VICTORY_OTHER"
msgstr "Colonnade Garden: Completed by {TSR_WINNING_PLAYER}!"

