msgstr "{TSR_WINNING_PLAYER} has ended the conflict between the {TSR_HORNED_GOD} and {TSR_DRAGON_LORD_NAME}. <<Cp:TSR_WINNING_PLAYER>> has claimed the {TSR_RELIC} {GLOBAL.ArtifactConcept.Hyperlink} for their empire!"

