msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@DEFAULT@LORDS@RACE_ARVIK@BIO"
msgstr "Arvik was a talented necromancer from {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, standing next to the Elven Court and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CommonwealthLoreConcept]Commonwealth[/hyperlink] when his home world was invaded. Together with his people, Arvik was cast into the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PrimalSpiritsLoreConcept]Primal Spirit[/hyperlink] of the Glacial Mammoth gave him the strength to escape his {GLOBAL.ShadowTrialLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]The Risen Frostlings originate from Athla, but have since evolved under Arvik's cold rule. They believe power lies in strength of both mind and body, worshiping the resilient Glacial Mammoth as they fight to reclaim their frozen empire once more."

