msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1350@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You find yourself between two Godir who fight over nature's domain. With whom do you side?"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1350@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Soon after meeting {EventPlayer.TitleName}, <<p:EventPlayer>> contacts you. \"Nature's blessings-\" <<p:EventPlayer>> starts, but before <<p:EventPlayer>> can finish <<o:EventPlayer>> greeting, <<p:EventPlayer>> is interrupted by {EventPlayer2.TitleName}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1350@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Immediately the two {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} start bickering. \"The blessings of {GLOBAL.NatureConcept} should be protected, not twisted and devolved,\" {Serena.FirstName} sneers: \"All who threaten my domain will be exterminated, even mad 'goddesses' like {Nimue.FirstName}.\"[br/][br/]{Nimue.FirstName} scoffs. \"My {NimueRace} will flood your precious forests. Only the strongest survive the tide, and for that, you must adapt. Allow me to demonstrate, {Serena.FirstName}!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1350@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Side with {Nimue.TitleName}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1350@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Side with {Serena.TitleName}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1350@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Pick no side, let nature (and war) take its course."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1350@TITLE"
msgstr "The Primal Dispute"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1351@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your people cheer you on as you return to {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, victorious."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1351@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have resolved the conflict between the two bickering {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of {GLOBAL.NatureConcept}, one way or another. A sense of peace returns to the realm."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1351@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Whether this peace will last is unclear. Alliances crumble, friendships change, and the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept]Void[/hyperlink] twists any mind it touches. In the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, few things are eternal.[br/]\n"
"But for now, the lands of {RealmName} are devoted to your rule."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1351@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Victory is ours!"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1165_1351@TITLE"
msgstr "The Primal Dispute: Resolved"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_198@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {PlayerSpirit} has given you this task: obtain and eat from any source of {EventMaterial}. Only then are you worthy of <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> blessings."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_198@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Now that you've claimed your <<in:EventNumber>> {EventStructure} and your {EventImprovement} stands tall, you hear a sudden howling in the wind. You sense the {PlayerSpirit}!"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_198@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Yet almost immediately, the entity departs again, leaving behind the smell of <<G:disapproval^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> of you. You attempt to pursue <<P:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>>, but <<p:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> has vanished in the wind. Until you can prove yourself worthy, you are not allowed into <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> pack. A new scent then presents itself. Instinctively, you know that it will lead you to {EventMaterial}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_198@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will find {EventMaterial} and gain your favor, O {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_198@TITLE"
msgstr "Pack Runner"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_199@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You howl your oath alongside the wolves. The {PlayerSpirit} bestows its favor onto your {EventRace}! You have become <<G:Avatar^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>>!"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_199@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you consume the acquired {EventMaterial}, you sense something is watching you from the trees. The {PlayerSpirit} observes you."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_199@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You stand tall and fierce. Where you sensed disapproval before, you now feel pride. In the nearby tree line, you witness several Wolves and Spirit Wolves coming to welcome you to the pack. The pack of {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}, the {PlayerSpirit}! In unison, the wolves howl."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_199@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "There is strength in numbers. The {EventRace} fight together! [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_199@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Beckon a {EventUnit} to serve you in battle. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_199@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Boast about your achievement to your {EventRace}. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_199@TITLE"
msgstr "Pack Runner: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_201@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The <<G:existence^n,EventSpawner>> offends {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}. <<Co:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> rage now resides in you! You must tear down the {EventSpawner}! For the glory of {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}!"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_201@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The <<in:EventNumber>> {EventStructure} is claimed. The {EventImprovement} is built. Suddenly, you detect a fiery presence nearby. The {PlayerSpirit} is here..."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_201@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The spirit fills your immortal body with its power. You feel exhilarated. Aroused. Enraged. You seek a target on which to unleash this powerful wrath. As you close your eyes, {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} shows you a {EventSpawner}. Insolent <<m:EventUnitA>> and <<m:EventUnitB>>. You crave the spilling of their blood. A rumbling, like a growl, ripples through the earth. The power then recedes, but the rage remains."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_201@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Their blood will flow in your name, O {PlayerSpirit}!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_201@TITLE"
msgstr "Ire of the Tiger"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_202@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You roar: \"The {EventRace} are the chosen people of the {PlayerSpirit}! I have embraced <<G:fury^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> and will guarantee <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> devastating domination!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_202@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The deed is done. The {EventSpawner} is razed. The wrath that flowed through you recedes. The {PlayerSpirit} has been appeased."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_202@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The temperature of your surroundings rises, heralding the return of {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}. You sense that the Spirit recognizes in you an agent of destruction. A weapon <<p:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> can wield, as deadly as <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> two fangs. Within your deepest core, you can feel <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> wrath still beating, like a second heartbeat. Ready to blaze anew when needed."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_202@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Let <<G:fury^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> inspire your people to fight! [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_202@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Imbue {EventHero} with some of the Sabertooth's rage that remains within you."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_202@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Boast about your success to your {EventRace}. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_202@TITLE"
msgstr "Ire of the Tiger: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_203@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {PlayerSpirit} hungers. <<Cp:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> feeds on [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ManaConcept][mana/]Mana[/hyperlink]. You have tasted it. To glut <<G:hunger^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>>, build [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ConduitConcept][conduit/]Conduits[/hyperlink]!"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_203@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With your <<in:EventNumber>> {EventStructure} claimed and {EventImprovement} constructed, the world immediately goes quiet. The {PlayerSpirit} is nearby. Lying in wait..."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_203@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It is as if Nature itself holds its breath to witness what will transpire. {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} suddenly drags you down into a vision. Submerged in a cold, black pool, all you feel is an insatiable hunger. Crystal fragments, leftovers of a previous bite that fizz and crackle with magical energy, are stuck between your endless teeth. You taste... sorcery! You're chewing on mana crystals."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_203@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My domain shall be your banquet, {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}! Conduits will strengthen you!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_203@TITLE"
msgstr "Insatiable"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_204@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cp:EventCultureUnit>> looks at you, muddled. You roar: \"The {EventRace} sated the hunger of the {PlayerSpirit}! <<Cp:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> left us <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> blessing!\" Where will you find it?"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_204@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the construction of the final [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ConduitConcept][conduit/]Conduit[/hyperlink] complete, the now-familiar silence befalls your domain once again. You know {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} has returned."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_204@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You scavenge the nearby swamps for a sign of the spirit. An enormous scaly tail whips out from the water. Without hesitation, you wade into the cold water to follow it. Submerged in the black pool, you feel hard, sharp limbs graze your body. Then, another sensation! Repletion! Satisfaction! A {EventCultureUnit} then pulls you out of the water."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_204@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Pick up a massive tooth left near a conduit. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_204@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Find a young {EventUnit} in the swamps."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_204@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Boast about your success in {EventCity}. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_204@TITLE"
msgstr "Insatiable: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_205@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{PlayerSpirit.LoreName} has told you <<p:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> yearns for a warm, deep nest. Build [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MineConcept][mine/]Mines[/hyperlink] in <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> name, and earn <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> blessings."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_205@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After claiming your <<in:EventNumber>> {EventStructure} and building your {EventImprovement}, you sense a shift in the air and realize: the {PlayerSpirit} visits you."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_205@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Sand blows into your face and you close your eyes to feel {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} embracing you. As you surrender to <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> vision, the sensation of slithering through sand overtakes you. Sand is coarse. It gets underneath your scales. Then, you taste the smell of gold! You covet dark, warm shafts penetrating the earth."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_205@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I understand, {PlayerSpirit}. I will build mines for your glory.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_205@TITLE"
msgstr "Beneath The Sands"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_206@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You declare: \"Do not fear the arrival of {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}! The {EventRace} are <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> favored children, and I am <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> Avatar!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_206@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Following the guidance of the {PlayerSpirit}, you built new [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MineConcept][mine/]Mines[/hyperlink] in your domain. You sense movement beneath the earth."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_206@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your {EventRace} working the mines tell you that they've heard hisses in the depths of the shafts. Other times, they see something slither away just beyond their sight. When they investigate... they oftentimes find new gold deposits that had gone unnoticed before! You smile and imagine {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} slinking through corridors of gold, or coiled up in the deep dark."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_206@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Use the stone you unearthed when excavating the mines for construction. [structureprod/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_206@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Venture deep within one of the mines to find a {EventUnit}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_206@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Boast about your achievement to your {EventRace}. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_206@TITLE"
msgstr "Beneath The Sands: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_210@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You declare: \"The <<G:secrets^p,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> now bolster the {EventRace}! For preserving <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> wisdom forever, <<p:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> graced me with <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> power!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_210@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have constructed [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ResearchPostConcept][researchpost/]Research Posts[/hyperlink] to conserve the knowledge of the {PlayerSpirit}. The trembling earth signals <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> intimidating presence once more."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_210@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "As before, snowfall heralds <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> arrival. The cold barely bothers you. You sense the warmth of the spirit's thick fur. You strip down to your undergarments and lie next to {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} in the field. Bliss overcomes you. After several hours, some of your <<m:EventUnit>> find you thus."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_210@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Shake potent ice crystals from your hair. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_210@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Find clarity in the cold of your body. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_210@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Boast about your experience to your {EventRace}. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_210@TITLE"
msgstr "Glacial Secrets: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_211@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You wake up and nod. Vanquishing the {EventSpawner} will ensure the blossoming of the <<G:offspring^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>>. The {PlayerSpirit} will reward your devotion."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_211@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Spiders weave webs in your {EventImprovement} after you claimed <<n:EventNumber>> <<m:EventStructure>>. Their spiraling gossamer enthralls you. Your crawling skin tells you: the {PlayerSpirit} skulks nearby..."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_211@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Gazing deeper into the spiders' lacework, {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} spins you a vision. In another realm, a {EventUnit} mocked you. <<Cp:EventUnit>> has now built a nest. The unnatural denizens of that {EventSpawner} must die. They shall be nourishment for your spawn. Your offspring must multiply. You chitter at the thought of fresh eggs in their warm, lifeless bodies."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_211@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"To this promise I bind myself: the {EventSpawner} will be destroyed!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_211@TITLE"
msgstr "Breeding Grounds"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_212@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You request the embrace of the {PlayerSpirit}, the Guardian of your {EventRace}, to receive <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> blessings. <<Cp:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> obliges. You also..."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_212@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {EventSpawner} is torn apart. Lifeless bodies of <<m:EventUnit>> litter the blood-soaked ground. The will of the {PlayerSpirit} was done."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_212@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Spiders of all sizes are already swarming the ruins of the <<G:nest^n,EventUnit>>. Crawling over the warm bodies, they nibble at the skin of the dead. They inject their egg sacs into the corpses. In time, the spawn of {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} will flow from this place. You are overwhelmed with pride and jubilation. {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} then fixes her many eyes on you."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_212@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "... salvage some of the slain <<m:EventUnit>> [food/] to feed {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_212@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "... lure a {EventUnitB} away from the swarm to join your army. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_212@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "... boast about your success by spinning tales for the {EventRace}. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_212@TITLE"
msgstr "Breeding Grounds: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_213@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cm:EventMaterial>> mesmerize {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}. Securing an additional source will make the {PlayerSpirit} roost in your realm, and you the receiver of <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> blessing."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_213@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A murder of crows surrounds you once you've claimed <<n:EventNumber>> <<m:EventStructure>> and built the {EventImprovement}. Their caws herald the arrival of the {PlayerSpirit}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_213@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Lightning crashes nearby, right before thunder and rain roll in. You close your eyes in the downpour. In a vision, you fly through storm clouds, always searching, yearning, seeking things to discover, sensations to experience, lands to visit. The world below you reveals nothing you haven't seen before. Nothing, except the {EventMaterial}! You thoroughly desire to drink from it. The vision then abruptly ends."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_213@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Fly back to me once I have secured the {EventMaterial}, {PlayerSpirit}!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_213@TITLE"
msgstr "Where The Crow Flies"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_214@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Now you may claim your prize. The {PlayerSpirit} blesses the {EventRace}, and you feel your strength soaring to unprecedented heights."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_214@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After securing the {EventMaterial}, you drink from it. Almost immediately, you hear the flapping of invisible wings. The {PlayerSpirit} descends!"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_214@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You can taste lightning in the air. Kicked-up dust clouds betray where {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} flutters. You hear a caw, and another vision whisks you away. You are shown faraway lands and strange cities. After everything, you see yourself from <<G:perspective^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>>. When you wake again, a feather floats on the surface of the {EventMaterial}. {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} claimed <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> prize."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_214@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take the large feather found in the {EventMaterial}. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_214@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Share what you've seen in your visions with your scholars. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_214@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Boast about your experience to your {EventRace}. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_214@TITLE"
msgstr "Where The Crow Flies: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_215@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {PlayerSpirit} is weary of <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> treks. Build [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ResearchPostConcept][researchpost/]Research Posts[/hyperlink] where {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} may rest and reveal <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> secrets."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_215@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You claimed <<n:EventNumber>> <<m:EventStructure>> and built the {EventImprovement}. Snowy winds rise, concealing the presence of an enormous entity. The {PlayerSpirit} looms over you!"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_215@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The cold makes you shiver. The massive size of {PlayerSpirit.LoreName} makes you feel tiny and insignificant. Through a vibration in the air, you experience <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> sensations. <<Cp:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> has wandered the realms for ages, but now <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> ancient bones are tired. <<Cp:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> longs to rest. <<Cp:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> longs to share <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> secrets."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_215@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Your lore will be safe with me, Great {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_215@TITLE"
msgstr "Glacial Secrets"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_218@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} {EventHouse.Name} acknowledges you with the ancestral greeting of the {EventHouseRace}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_218@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Well met, {PlayerLeader.Title}.\" {EventHouseLord.Name} observes you for a beat. \"It is obvious to me that you and I both follow {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}, the {EventHouseSpirit}. Kin is what I shall call you. Let us not wage war, but speak of peace. What say you?\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_218@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Hold a meeting with your kin of {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_218@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Go with {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}, my <<EventHouseLord{brother/sister}>>.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_218@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Kindred {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_222@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} {EventHouse.Name} greets you with the ancestral greeting of <<o:EventHouseLord>> {EventHouseRace}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_222@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I see you, {PlayerLeader.Title}. You have the looks of a follower of the {PlayerSpirit} on you. {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}, the {EventHouseSpirit}, guides our life paths.\" {EventHouseLord.TitleFirstName} smiles warmly. \"It is good to find one so versed in the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PrimalSpiritsLoreConcept]Old Ways[/hyperlink]. Come, let us discuss the matters of peace.\" The {EventHouseLord.Title} extends <<o:EventHouseLord>> hand as an invitation."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_222@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Investigate the followers of the {EventHouseSpirit}, in {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_222@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Wish the {EventHouseRace} the blessing of the {PlayerSpirit} and leave."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_222@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Congenial {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_223@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} {EventHouse.Name} greets you kind-heartedly while clasping an effigy of a {HouseSpiritAnimal}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_223@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You and I are not the same, {PlayerLeader.Title},\" decides the {EventHouseLord.Title}. \"But that does not mean there cannot be peace between the {EventHouseRace} and the {PlayerRace}. Once our tribes work together, we will achieve great things. Our ancestral spirit, the {EventHouseSpirit}, will smile down upon us.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_223@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Inspect {EventHouse} to learn more about it."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_223@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the {EventHouseRace} and their spirit alone for now."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_223@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Spiritual {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_224@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} {EventHouse.Name} acknowledges your presence with a raised hand, <<o:EventHouseLord>> palm open."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_224@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I've been watching you, {PlayerLeader.TitleFirstName}. You and your {PlayerRace} cross these lands as if you rule them.\" The {EventHouseLord.Title} lowers <<o:EventHouseLord>> voice while <<o:EventHouseLord>> gaze intensifies. \"Be careful not to trespass. Our hunting grounds are vast and not always marked.\" The {EventHouseRace} that accompany {EventHouseLord.FirstName} tighten their grip on their spears."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_224@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I am not here to invade, but to converse, {EventHouseLord.TitleFirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_224@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Take leave of these followers of the {EventHouseSpirit}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_224@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Territorial {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_225@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of the {GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink} {EventHouse.Name} greets you with bared teeth."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_225@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Halt, {PlayerLeader.Title}! So, the rumors are true! You seek to invade our ancestral lands!\" The {EventHouseLord.Title} spits. \"We {EventHouseRace.Name} of {EventHouse.Name} do not bow before outlanders. We follow the sacred {EventHouseSpirit} for guidance. <<Cp:{EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}>> has instructed us to reject your lies and your fetters.\" {EventHouseLord.Name} grins. \"We will meet you on the battlefield.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_225@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Inspect the aggressive {EventHouseRace} of {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_225@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"The fittest shall survive.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_225@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Hostile {EventHouse.Name}"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The hunters are required to complete their sacred hunt ere they may leave the {EventStructure.Name}. How will you deal with them?"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your army approaches a {EventStructure.Name} and discovers hunters from {EventHouse} performing a pre-hunt ritual."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Their leader, a {EventStackLeader}, explains the ritual: \"I see you, {EventHero}. You have arrived at an inconvenient time. At this {EventStructure.Name}, we will perform our sacred hunt. We must honor {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}, the {EventHouseSpirit}, as is our duty, by killing an animal as <<p:{EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}>> would: {EventPhrase}! Once the Great <<C:HouseSpiritAnimal>> is appeased, we can move on.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Send recruits [unitprod/] from {EventCity} to help the hunters' pursuit."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Give honor [influence/] to {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName} to end the hunt."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Level the surroundings of the {EventStructure.Name} to expose their prey."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Commune with the {EventHouseSpirit} to abandon the hunt at the {EventStructure.Name}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Your blood will be my offering to the {EventHouseSpirit}! Die!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the hunters to perform their ritual in peace."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_250@TITLE"
msgstr "Prey of the <<C:HouseSpiritAnimal>>"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The company from {EventHouse} will not leave unless they sense their <<C:HouseSpiritAnimal>> spirit. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your troops approach a {EventStructure.Name}, but are stopped by a company from {EventHouse}. \"Stay away! We believe the {EventHouseSpirit} is here.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "An {EventUnit} walks about with eyes closed, chanting softly. \"Please, go away!\", the company leader insists. \"We believe that {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}, the {EventHouseSpirit}, resides in this {EventStructure.Name}. Our shaman is trying to make contact.\" The {EventUnit} kneels and places <<o:EventUnit>> palms on the ground. \"We will leave once <<p:EventUnit>> confirms the presence of the Great <<C:HouseSpiritAnimal>>.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Donate mana [mana/] to expedite the <<G:survey^n,EventUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Share your lore [knowledge/] on how to find the {EventHouseSpirit} with the company."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Contact {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName} to show the company where to find it."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Summon a shadowy illusion of the {EventHouseSpirit} to lure the company away."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "They will meet their spirit in the next life. Attack!"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Leave the company to their spiritual investigation."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_251@TITLE"
msgstr "Finding the {EventHouseSpirit}"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_266@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Does the {PlayerSpirit}, whom your people intimately call {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}, truly grace this realm? You should visit the {EventStructure} presently."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_266@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You've led your {EventRace}, ardent followers of the {PlayerSpirit}, to a new realm, when something catches your eye."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_266@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Not far from {EventCity}, a wondrous tree pulsates with invigorating energy. Its strangely familiar energy inspires you, even from afar. A faint {EventFlavor} on the wind calls you to it. Your eyes fixed on the tree, you discern a faint apparition of immense power. Could it be..? Is that the ancestral spirit of your {EventRace}, the {PlayerSpirit} <<r:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>>?"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_266@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}? Here? I will meet with <<P:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> right away!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_266@TITLE"
msgstr "Spirits of the <<t:EventTerrain>>"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_268@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Win <<G:favor^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> by securing at least <<n:EventNumber>> <<m:EventStructure>> and build the {EventImprovement}. The {PlayerSpirit} is guaranteed to notice your devotion."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_268@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "When you arrive at the {EventStructure}, the visage of the {PlayerSpirit} that lured you there has disappeared. Yet you {EventPhrase}."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_268@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You examine the enthralling tree and notice that {EventFlavor}. <<G:influence^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> is palpable here. You recall ancient legends that promise formidable boons to the most ardent torchbearers of {PlayerSpirit.LoreName}. Claim this territory so you may build the {EventImprovement}, which invokes the power of the {PlayerSpirit} to slowly turn your domain into <<Cm:EventTerrain>>, where your {EventRace} thrive."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_268@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"For <<G:glory^n,{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>>, I will secure <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> Dens and build <<o:{PlayerSpirit.LoreName}>> Temple!\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1167_268@TITLE"
msgstr "Spirits of the <<t:EventTerrain>>: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You are invited to join {EventHouseLord.Name} in a meditation about your empire and rulership. During this time, you see..."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} of {EventHouse} invites you to a moment of contemplation and meditation."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"As {EventHouseLord.Title} of {EventHouse}, I am expected to commune with the {GLOBAL.PrimalSpiritsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} through ritual and meditation. These meditations bring me guidance during times of unrest. Since we are to share this realm, it would be an honor if you joined me in one such ritual, O {PlayerLeader.Title}.\" <<Cp:EventHouseLord>> gestures for you to get comfortable. \"Please, close your eyes and follow my voice.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BODY_LORE@PRIMAL_PLAYER"
msgstr "\"As {EventHouseLord.Title} of {EventHouse}, I am expected to commune with the {GLOBAL.PrimalSpiritsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. As a follower of the {PlayerSpirit}, you undoubtedly know that these meditations bring me guidance during times of unrest. It would be an honor if you joined me, O {PlayerLeader.Title}.\" <<Cp:EventHouseLord>> gestures for you to get comfortable. \"Please, close your eyes and follow my voice.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "... A night's sky with a bright moon. You howl at its majesty. [orderboon/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "... A land of ash and ruin, the taste of blood on your fangs. [chaosboon/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "... An infested but tranquil bog, with you sleeping just below the surface. [natureboon/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "... A scorching desert, with you slithering to the riches buried below. [materiumboon/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "... Stormy plains, with you soaring above it as lightning strikes. [astralboon/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "... A towering glacier, the cold creeping ever onward. [shadowboon/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "...Dark caves, a labyrinth of secrets, with you at its center."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "... Yourself. A vision of what could have been [knowledge/], had you made different choices..."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "... Nothing. You have no time for meditations. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_48@TITLE"
msgstr "Shared Meditations"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventHouseLord.TitleName} offers you a talisman, chosen from a selection of {GLOBAL.PrimalSpiritsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Which one do you pick?"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "To honor the bonds you have forged with {EventHouse}, {EventHouseLord.TitleName} offers you a gift."

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Although we {EventHouseRace} follow the wisdom of {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}, the {EventHouseSpirit},\" {EventHouseLord.FirstName} explains, \"we recognize that each [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PrimalSpiritsLoreConcept]Primal Spirit[/hyperlink] carries their own wisdom. So today, as a token of our bond, I offer you a gift from our people.\" <<Cp:EventHouseLord>> presents several finely crafted objects. \"These talismans represent the many Primal Spirits. Carry one, and the Spirit shall bring you fortune and insight in your rule.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BODY_LORE@PRIMAL_PLAYER"
msgstr "\"Although we {EventHouseRace} follow the wisdom of {EventHouseSpirit.LoreName}, the {EventHouseSpirit},\" {EventHouseLord.FirstName} explains, \"we recognize that each [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PrimalSpiritsLoreConcept]Primal Spirit[/hyperlink] carries their own wisdom, which can bring new insights. So today, as a token of our bond, I offer you a gift.\" <<Cp:EventHouseLord>> presents several finely crafted objects. \"These talismans represent the many Primal Spirits. Pick one, and it shall bring you fortune and insight in your rule.\""

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "The {WolfSpirit}, for wisdom and unity. [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "The {SabertoothSpirit}, for bravery and ferocity. [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "The {CrocodileSpirit}, for good health. [food/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "The {SerpentSpirit}, for wealth. [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "The {CrowSpirit}, for favorable weather. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "The {MammothSpirit}, for perseverance. [structureprod/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "The {SpiderSpirit}, for guidance in the darkest times. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "\"I reject all forms of idolatry, except when the one being idolized is me.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1194_51@TITLE"
msgstr "Idol of Appreciation"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Free them from their punishment, extracting their animal essence under your command. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Free them and extract their animal essence under your command. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@STORY_EVENT_TOOLTIP@PEOPLE_APPRECIATION"
msgstr "Your people appreciate your faith in your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PrimalSpiritsLoreConcept]Primal Spirit[/hyperlink]:"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@CROCODILE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Your people worship the Mire Crocodile, bestowing benefits to your culture:[bulletlist][bullet/]Start in the Swamp.[bullet/]Swamp provinces are {GLOBAL.FavoredTerrainConcept.Hyperlink} and gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][bullet/]Access to the {GLOBAL.UNITS.PRIMAL_CROCODILE.Hyperlink} summon[bullet/]Units have:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASE_IMMUNITY.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SWAMP_WALK.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.PRIMAL_FURY_MOD_GROUP_CROCODILE.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@CROCODILE@LORENAME"
msgstr "Deep-Maw^F"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@CROCODILE@NAME"
msgstr "Mire Crocodile"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@CROW@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Your people worship the Storm Crow, bestowing benefits to your culture:[bulletlist][bullet/]Start in the Grasslands.[bullet/]Grassland provinces are {GLOBAL.FavoredTerrainConcept.Hyperlink} and gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][bullet/]Access to the {GLOBAL.UNITS.PRIMAL_CROW.Hyperlink} summon.[bullet/]Units have:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GRASSLAND_WALK.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.PRIMAL_FURY_MOD_GROUP_CROW.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@CROW@LORENAME"
msgstr "High-Squall^M"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@CROW@NAME"
msgstr "Storm Crow"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@INTRODUCTION_QUEST@CROCODILE@OBJECTIVE_1"
msgstr "Mire Crocodile Dens Secured"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@INTRODUCTION_QUEST@CROCODILE@OBJECTIVE_2"
msgstr "{GLOBAL.CrocodileTempleConcept.Hyperlink} Produced"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@INTRODUCTION_QUEST@CROW@OBJECTIVE_1"
msgstr "Storm Crow Dens Secured"

msgid "DLC@PRIMALFURY@SUBCULTURE_PRIMAL@INTRODUCTION_QUEST@CROW@OBJECTIVE_2"
