msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@CATACLYSM@TOOLTIP@NEW_HERALD_PLAYER"
msgstr "If you retain all three <<m:{GLOBAL.ArtifactConcept.Hyperlink}>>, you will achieve victory in 5 turns.\n"
"You will lose the Artifacts if {PlayerLeader} is defeated in combat."

