msgstr "The Devouring Winds make casting <<m:{GLOBAL.WorldMapSpellConcept.Hyperlink}>> dangerous, eventually culminating in a {GLOBAL.CataclysmConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][bulletlist][bullet/]Casting a World Map Spell adds its <<m:{GLOBAL.WorldMapCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> cost to the Cataclysm Meter.[bullet/]When the Cataclysm meter is filled to 50% or more, <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}>> become marked for the next Cataclysm.[bullet/]When the Cataclysm Meter reaches the maximum. a {GLOBAL.CataclysmConcept.Hyperlink} is triggered.[bullet/]The higher the Level of the Cataclysm Meter, the more Provinces will be marked and struck during a Cataclysm.[bullet/]The Cataclysm Meter decreases by {decrease} per {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]For every Level of the Cataclysm Meter, all <<m:{GLOBAL.SpellConcept.Hyperlink}>> have {percentage} chance of {GLOBAL.BackfireConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@EMPIRE_CORE@REALM_TRAITS@CATACLYSM_METER@NAME"
msgstr "Cataclysm Meter"

