msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink} with {GLOBAL.SandConcept.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.AstralBarrensConcept.Hyperlink} in the {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink} {GLOBAL.DomainConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Adds the {GLOBAL.UNITS.GRIMBEAK_CROW.Hyperlink} unit to the {GLOBAL.RequestMilitaryAidConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Unlocks the Restore action which turns this {GLOBAL.AncientWonderConcept.Hyperlink} into a {GLOBAL.STRUCTURES.HIDDEN_WELLSPRING.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

