msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@ANCIENT_WONDERS@WITHERED_TREE@LORE"
msgstr "Only this wooden carcass remains of a mighty {GLOBAL.STRUCTURES.WORLD_TREE.Hyperlink}, which are attestations to life's unbridled resilience. Its roots once grew deep and far, its boughs high and long; nourishing, healing, and protecting all that lives and grows in between. Hence, the death of a World Tree, which only an earth-shattering force could wreak, is an affront to life itself."

