msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_ESSENCES@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Essences are magical objects tied to a city, granting income and other bonuses. They are obtained by {GLOBAL.OverharvestingConcept.Hyperlink} <<m:{GLOBAL.NodeConcept.Hyperlink}>> with a Nomad City.[br/][bulletlist][bullet/]The type of income an essence gives depends on the node they come from.[bullet/]Essences from <<m:{GLOBAL.MagicMaterialConcept.Hyperlink}>> grant that material to the city's owner.[bullet/]If a city carrying {GLOBAL.MagicMaterialConcept.Hyperlink} essences is razed, those <<m:{GLOBAL.MagicMaterialConcept.Hyperlink}>> will appear as nodes nearby.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]Nomads of the Scavenger tradition also gain unique Essences with {GLOBAL.WonderScavengingConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_ESSENCES@HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.EssenceConcept]Essence[/hyperlink]"

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_ESSENCES@NAME"
msgstr "Essence"

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_OVERHARVESTING@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Nomad <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> Overharvest <<m:{GLOBAL.NodeConcept.Hyperlink}>> in their {GLOBAL.DomainConcept.Hyperlink}. This process takes several turns but may be accelerated using {GLOBAL.ImperiumConcept.Hyperlink} proportionate to the time remaining on that particular Node.[br/][br/]Once Overharvested:[bulletlist][bullet/]The City gains an {GLOBAL.EssenceConcept.Hyperlink} corresponding to that Node.[bullet/]The {GLOBAL.NodeConcept.Hyperlink} is destroyed, becoming a {GLOBAL.RuinedNodeConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_OVERHARVESTING@HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.OverharvestingConcept]Overharvesting[/hyperlink]"

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_OVERHARVESTING@NAME"
msgstr "Overharvesting"

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_SETTLER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Nomad <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> may pack up into a City Barge, a unit that can move around on the {GLOBAL.WorldMapConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]This unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Can Unpack into a Nomad {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}, able to immediately claim <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}>> as its {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} allows.[bullet/]Can place any <<m:{GLOBAL.SpecialImprovementConcept.Hyperlink}>> it had before being packed up for free.[bullet/]Does not participate in {GLOBAL.CombatConcept.Hyperlink} and is defeated immediately if not defended by other friendly units.[bullet/]Combat against this unit will take place on the Siege city defense map with all City Defense structures present.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]If this unit is defeated in combat, it may be captured by the victor or immediately {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COMBATPROPERTY_RAZED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_SETTLER@HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.NomadSettlerConcept]Nomad City Barge[/hyperlink]"

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_SETTLER@NAME"
msgstr "Nomad City Barge"

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_WONDER_SCAVENGING@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When an {GLOBAL.AncientWonderConcept.Hyperlink} is annexed to a {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink} belonging to Nomad Scavengers, it will be [hyperlink,GLOBAL.OverharvestingConcept]Overharvested[/hyperlink], granting the city a unique {GLOBAL.EssenceConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]Overharvesting Ancient Wonders:[bulletlist][bullet/]Does not destroy the Ancient Wonder.[bullet/]Can only be done once per Ancient Wonder.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]The type of {GLOBAL.EssenceConcept.Hyperlink} gained is based on the Improvement type and [siteBronze/]Tier of the Ancient Wonder."

msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@INTERFACE@NOMAD_WONDER_SCAVENGING@HYPERLINK"
