msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@LORDS@HERO_HAR'ACRAN@BIO"
msgstr "The sands do not regret—they feast. Har'Acran learned that lesson young, when her tribe was plundered. The very raiders who slaughtered her people took her in and raised her. They taught her to survive, to move among the dunes, and to ride upon the scorpions. But they never showed a shred of remorse.[br/][br/]In time, Har'Acran rose to become the Queen of the Dunes, leader of the Sand Stalkers. And she came to understand the raiders, her tribe did not die because of the assault; they died because they could not defend themselves. In the desert, there are only enough resources for those who can take it."

