msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_SHROUDED_REGIONS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Ancient gates are scattered throughout the realm. They lead to floating isles in a mysterious dimension where powerful {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} hid away their most prized secrets.[br/][bulletlist][bullet/]A new Shrouded map layer is added to the realm.[bullet/]This layer contains <<m:{GLOBAL.ShroudedIsleConcept.Hyperlink}>> and <<m:{GLOBAL.BreachedIsleConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Various portals can be found on the Surface and Underground which lead to these Isles.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@META_EMPIRE@TRAIT_SHROUDED_REGIONS@HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShroudedIsleConcept]Shrouded Isle[/hyperlink]"

