msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SECRET_SPELLS@01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Summon a {GLOBAL.UNITS.FEY_ABOMINATION.Hyperlink}, a powerful unit that uses the abilities of a powerful fiend with a Fey twist."

