msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@LORDS@EMPEROR_RACE@BIO"
msgstr "To some, he is the divine progenitor who sired perfection into existence through the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]Pureblood Archvampires[/hyperlink]; while to others he is but a mythological monster who once terrorized the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in a bygone age. Yet to one alone, he shall forever be remembered as the gallant Pale Prince of Roses... [br/][br/]Urvatogh the First Vampire, Blood Emperor Eternal of the Crimson Reign, and Deathless God who died yet rose again. His Grand Dominion of Drevanya once spread far and wide, until deepest betrayal sealed him away within a crypt, to fade beyond memory into myth. Here, he slumbers in perpetuity, though certain cults tell that he shall one night rise again to bring about a coveted reckoning of blood. [br/][br/]His Eternal Attendants are but animated remnants of a now long-forgotten race. They once served the family of the Pale Prince of Roses, back in brighter days."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@LORDS@EMPEROR_RACE@NAME"
msgstr "Eternal Attendants"

