msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@LORDS@HUNTRESS_RACE@BIO"
msgstr "What she wouldn’t have given for a normal life. Griselda was once a lively girl who enjoyed the simple things, until an unknown Vampire took it all away. Dedicating herself to vengeance ever since, her long hunt has made her stoic and bitter. Too often has she seen good people's lives destroyed by the unending hunger of Vampire-kind. Determined to end it all, Griselda has devoted herself and her whole family to eradicating the parasitic tumor at its root—one {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink} after another. [br/][br/]Aiding her to the best of their abilities are her own devoted clan, the Stoic Dawnwatchers. Resourceful vagabonds and tough wayfarers all, they have been away from home for so long that most barely even remember where it was in the first place..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@LORDS@HUNTRESS_RACE@NAME"
