msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@LORDS@HUSBAND_RACE@BIO"
msgstr "{GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, Prince-Consort Wtorakh stands at the peak of the pureblood bloodline, second only to his own Sire: the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] himself. He is accomplished amongst his peers for siring a substantial number of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]Elder Vampires[/hyperlink], though equally infamous amongst his own brood for abandoning them shortly after their embrace. Since his true obsession rather lies in the unholy art of blood revelry—a dark and cultish practice, readily exercised by his crazed flock of followers: the 'Ravishing Blood-Revelers.' [br/][br/]This race of fallen Elves long ago welcomed and worship Vampire-kind as elevated deities. Now, all devote themselves to the darkest excesses of carnal revelry, each desiring nothing more than to be embraced next."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@LORDS@HUSBAND_RACE@NAME"
msgstr "Ravishing Blood-Revelers"

