msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@LORDS@WIFE_RACE@BIO"
msgstr "Eldest of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]Archvampires[/hyperlink] and notably first to be turned, the prickly Princess Consort Mavelith stands at the peak of the pureblood bloodline, second only to the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] himself. Infamously ruthless, cold and cruel, the Grave Archdam eagerly doles out torment in her hungry pursuit to obtain dominion over all others—the more resistant her victim, the more enticing they become. [br/][br/]She perfected her torturous obsessions upon a race of hysterical beings, feared as the Flagellant Screechers. Warping their souls and minds so that they desire pain more than food or drink. Many whip themselves up into an ecstatic frenzy before charging into the fray, all slobbering and howling, hankering to attain harm, or even death."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@LORDS@WIFE_RACE@NAME"
msgstr "Flagellant Screechers"

