msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@BODY"
msgstr "The moon bleeds through an open wound, staining the sky crimson. Animals flee to hide, villagers bar their doors, and the creatures of the dusk rejoice in its glow. For the night is red and ruled by horrors."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "During its eclipse, the Blood Moon empowers all [hyperlink,GLOBAL.VampireLordConcept]Vampires[/hyperlink] and allows them to roam freely throughout the world."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@BODY_FOOTER@NO_AI_LORDS"
msgstr "This is the Moon of Blood"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The sky darkens into scarlet. The Blood Moon, summoned by {BloodMoonPlayer}, eclipses the light of the sun."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@BODY_HEADER@PLAYER_IS_CASTER"
msgstr "The sky darkens into scarlet. The Blood Moon you summoned eclipses the light of the sun."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@BODY_LORE@NO_AI_LORDS"
msgstr "This is the Moon of Blood"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare for the red night."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@HAPPENING_HEADER"
msgstr "The sky darkens into scarlet. The Blood Moon eclipses the light of the sun."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1142_933@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood Moon"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "From what crimson well will you quench your thirst? Whose blood will satiate the craving?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your fangs itch. Flashes of red blur your vision. Your body craves blood. You can suppress your unholy desires no longer."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You sense the heartbeats of the mortals that surround you. {EventRace.Name}. Animals. Your trusted lieutenants and your prisoners of war. You try to shake off the craving. It is not becoming of a <<PlayerLeader{lord/lady}>> of your standing, after all. But the bloodlust relentlessly grows until the roars of your hunger drown out all other sounds. Blood. You must drink blood."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"No one will miss a few {EventRace} [souls/] from {EventCity}. [happiness/]\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"{EventHero} is feeble anyway. <<Co:EventHero>> blood will invigorate me.\" [xp/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I will feast on cattle.\" [food/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Drink dead man's [souls/] blood, despite its harmful effects. [hp/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Devour your thralls [thralls/] to still the hunger."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Consume {EventHeroB}, chained in your prison."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1249@TITLE"
msgstr "The Craving"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1255@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The camp of the Vampire Hunter and <<o:EventStackLeader>> entourage is located {EventDirection} of {EventCity}. Vanquish <<P:EventStackLeader>>, lest they beset you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1255@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Something stirs in your domain. Your subjects whisper of a Vampire Hunter that has come to end your reign."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1255@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "None other than {EventStackLeader}, renowned Slayer of <<m:{GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>, has set up camp near your borders. <<Cp:EventStackLeader>> surely plans an incursion to drive a stake through your heart. Serendipitously, the Vampire Hunter hasn't located your shadow-wrapped territory yet, but this is likely a matter of time. <<Co:EventStackLeader>> fading disorientation presents you with an opportunity to hunt the Hunter."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1255@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Pursue the Vampire Hunter. Thirst for <<o:EventStackLeader>> blood."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1255@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "I summon [thralls/] the very night itself [shadowboon/] to swallow the Hunter whole."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1255@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Send out scouts [unitprod/] to lure them away from {EventCity}. [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1255@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Ignore the Vampire Hunter and hope <<p:EventStackLeader>> never finds your domain."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1255@TITLE"
msgstr "{EventStackLeader.FirstName}, the Vampire Hunter"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1256@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventItem} you keep for yourself: to use or to dismantle. But what shall you do with {EventStackLeader}?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1256@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your army tore through the bodyguards of the Vampire Hunter. {EventStackLeader} lies defeated, within an inch of <<o:EventStackLeader>> life."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1256@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Go on then,\" {EventStackLeader.FirstName} gurgles right before <<p:EventStackLeader>> coughs up blood. \"End my life. I do not fear death.\" You are amused by the thought of slaying the Hunter. But there are better uses for <<P:EventStackLeader>>. Your troops ransack the camp and find several magic items used for Vampire slaying. Most notably, a {EventItem} tucked away in a burlap sack."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1256@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Nail <<G:still living body^n,EventStackLeader>> to the gates of {EventCity}. [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1256@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Embrace [unitHero/] {EventStackLeader}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1256@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Let {EventHero} feed [xp/] on <<P:EventStackLeader>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1256@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Harvest the souls [souls/] of the Hunter and <<o:EventStackLeader>> entourage."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1256@TITLE"
msgstr "{EventStackLeader.FirstName}, the Vampire Hunter: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit}, as blind as <<o:EnemyUnit>> bats, steps towards you menacingly. <<Co:EnemyUnit>> bloodthirsty <<m:EventUnit>> follow suit. How will {EventHero.FirstName} proceed?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit}, as blind as <<o:EnemyUnit>> bats, steps towards you menacingly. <<Co:EnemyUnit>> bloodthirsty <<m:EventUnit>> follow suit. How will you proceed?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} descends into the dark of the {EventStructure} and is welcomed by high-pitched shrieks bouncing off the cavern walls."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You step into the dark of the {EventStructure} and are welcomed by high-pitched shrieks bouncing off the cavern walls."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<m:EventUnit>>, bred by a deranged {EnemyUnit}, are the source of the shrieks. Your horrified {GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink} witnesses how the {EnemyUnit} offers <<o:EnemyUnit>> arms to the <<m:EventUnit>>, who willingly drink <<o:EnemyUnit>> blood. \"Drink up, my pets,\" <<p:EnemyUnit>> cries through agony. \"Drink and I shall soon be an {GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\" <<Cp:EnemyUnit>> then becomes aware of your troops' presence and withdraws <<o:EnemyUnit>> arm."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "<<m:EventUnit>>, bred by a deranged {EnemyUnit}, are the source of the shrieks. You witness in horror how the {EnemyUnit} offers <<o:EnemyUnit>> arms to the <<m:EventUnit>>, who willingly drink <<o:EnemyUnit>> blood. \"Drink up, my pets,\" <<p:EnemyUnit>> cries through agony. \"Drink and I shall soon be an {GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\" <<Cp:EnemyUnit>> then becomes aware of your presence and withdraws <<o:EnemyUnit>> arm."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Clip the bat wings! Attack!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Confuse the bats by the clanking of laborer's tools [structureprod/] from {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Transform the cavern walls to dampen its acoustics."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Reveal your full Vampiric might [thralls/] to intimidate the {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1262@TITLE"
msgstr "Echoes of Insanity"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1265@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Flee the bat cave."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1266@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "After copying the research notes, what else will {EventHero} take from the cleared {EventStructure}?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1266@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The deafening screeches that echoed through the {EventStructure} are silenced. Blood floods the guano-coated cave floor."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1266@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Some of the {EventUnit} pups were spared from the slaughter. {EventHero.FirstName} soon discovers that the delusions of the {EnemyUnit} ran deeper than previously thought. Moldy tomes and wall scribbles describe rituals and processes concerning vampirism and bat anatomy. Although the notion of <<m:EventUnit>> transforming mortals into <<m:{GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> remains preposterous, the experiments might yield valuable new insights."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1266@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Some of the {EventUnit} pups were spared from the slaughter. You discover that the delusions of the {EnemyUnit} ran deeper you thought. Moldy tomes and wall scribbles describe rituals and processes concerning vampirism and bat anatomy. Although the notion of <<m:EventUnit>> transforming mortals into <<m:{GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> remains preposterous, the experiments might yield valuable new insights."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1266@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Scrape the bat droppings from the floor, to fertilize your fields. [food/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1266@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Rear a {EventUnit} [unit/] to fight for you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1266@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Mount a {EventMount} [item/] to fly you into battle."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1266@TITLE"
msgstr "Echoes of Insanity: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The <<m:EventUnit>>, led by a {EnemyUnit}, won't let {EventHero.FirstName} go near the beautiful sleeper. How does <<p:EventHero>> respond?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "The <<m:EventUnit>>, led by a {EnemyUnit}, won't let you go near the beautiful sleeper. How do you respond?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} leads <<o:EventHero>> army into the dead quiet courtyard of an ancient palace. The courtyard is overgrown with rose vines."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You lead your army into the dead quiet courtyard of an ancient palace. The courtyard is overgrown with rose vines."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "At the far edge of the courtyard, a beautiful <<EventHero{woman/man}>> lies motionless on a bed of stone. A decomposed spinning wheel stands nearby, its spindle stained by blood as red as the roses that cover the courtyard. {EventHero.FirstName} notes the remains of <<m:EventUnit>> beneath the vines, thorns fused to their bones. When <<p:EventHero>> takes a step forward, the dead rise."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "At the far edge of the courtyard, a beautiful <<EventHero{woman/man}>> lies motionless on a bed of stone. A decomposed spinning wheel stands nearby, its spindle stained by blood as red as the roses that cover the courtyard. You note the remains of <<m:EventUnit>> beneath the vines, thorns fused to their bones. When you take a step forward, the dead rise."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the {EnemyUnit} to save the beautiful sleeper."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Before attacking, ignite the rose bushes with simple spellcraft. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Manipulate the roses. Make them lose their thorns."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Summon cold winds to wither the thorny vines in the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Let the beauty sleep and leave the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1267@TITLE"
msgstr "<<EventHero{Rose/Thorne}>> of <<EventHero{Thorns/Roses}>>"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The curse is broken. The magic of the {EventStructure} wanes and the vines crumble. Before departing, what trophy will {EventHero} claim?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The curse is broken. The magic of the {EventStructure} wanes and the vines crumble. Before departing, what trophy will you claim?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the {EnemyUnit} reduced to thorny bones and armor, {EventHero} approaches the beautiful sleeper on the stone bed."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "With the {EnemyUnit} reduced to thorny bones and armor, you approach the beautiful sleeper on the stone bed."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<Cp:EventHero>> leans forward to inspect if the sleeper still lives. As <<G:breath^n,EventHero>> touches the <<EventHeroB{man's lips/woman's lips}>>, <<p:EventHeroB>> opens <<o:EventHeroB>> eyes and gasps. \"Greetings, Hero,\" <<p:EventHeroB>> sighs. \"Cursed I was by a witch, jealous of my youth and skill. I am {EventHeroB}.\" <<Cp:EventHeroB>> looks around. \"Is this my father's castle? It seems... I was asleep for a very long time.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You lean forward to inspect if the sleeper still lives. As your breath touches the <<EventHeroB{man's lips/woman's lips}>>, <<p:EventHeroB>> opens <<o:EventHeroB>> eyes and gasps. \"Greetings, Hero,\" <<p:EventHeroB>> sighs. \"Cursed I was by a witch, jealous of my youth and skill. I am {EventHeroB}.\" <<Cp:EventHeroB>> looks around. \"Is this my father's castle? It seems... I was asleep for a very long time.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Recruit [unitHero/] {EventHeroB}, now awakened."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Let your scholars chronicle [knowledge/] <<G:memories^p,EventHeroB>> from yesteryear."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Let {EventHeroB.FirstName} go. Pick up the <<G:{EventItem},EnemyUnit>>. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Harvest the lingering magical power [mana/] of the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1268@TITLE"
msgstr "<<EventHero{Rose/Thorne}>> of <<EventHero{Thorns/Roses}>>: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"My adulterous husband died before receiving punishment, but my scorn will be suffered.\" <<G:sudden scream^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>> shatters the statue, before <<p:EnemyUnit>> lunges at {EventHero.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "\"My adulterous husband died before receiving punishment, but my scorn will be suffered.\" <<G:sudden scream^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>> shatters the statue, before <<p:EnemyUnit>> lunges at you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} enters the courtyard of an ancient and forgotten palace. A woman stands weeping before the statue of a king."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You enter the courtyard of an ancient and forgotten palace. A woman stands weeping before the statue of a king."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The statue is defiled with blood. Scratches, as if made by fingernails, run over the eyes of the man. The wailing woman whips <<o:EnemyUnit>> head around when <<p:EnemyUnit>> hears <<G:army^n,EventHero>> approach. \"Have you come to mock the Banshee Queen,\" <<p:EnemyUnit>> whimpers. \"Poor {EnemyUnit.FirstName}, betrayed by <<o:EnemyUnit>> husband, that King of Cheats.\" <<Cp:EnemyUnit>> bares <<o:EnemyUnit>> fangs as <<m:EventUnit>> appear around <<P:EnemyUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "The statue is defiled with blood. Scratches, as if made by fingernails, run over the eyes of the man. The wailing woman whips <<o:EnemyUnit>> head around when <<p:EnemyUnit>> hears your army approach. \"Have you come to mock the Banshee Queen,\" <<p:EnemyUnit>> whimpers. \"Poor {EnemyUnit.FirstName}, betrayed by <<o:EnemyUnit>> husband, that King of Cheats.\" <<Cp:EnemyUnit>> bares <<o:EnemyUnit>> fangs as <<m:EventUnit>> appear around <<P:EnemyUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Time to silence the Banshee Queen. Charge!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "A reward [gold/] for whoever brings me <<g:head^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>>!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Conjure a visage of <<G:adulterous spouse^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Disguise yourself as <<G:dead husband^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Flee the {EventStructure} and <<G:scorn^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@HERO@FIRSTNAME"
msgstr "Mayv^F"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1286@TITLE"
msgstr "Queen of Banshees"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Eager to leave the dark tragedies of the {EventStructure} behind <<P:EventHero>>, what memento will {EventHero.FirstName} take from the palace?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Eager to leave the dark tragedies of the {EventStructure} behind you, what memento will you take from the palace?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The Queen of Banshees lies at <<G:feet^p,EventHero>>. Her heart now at rest. Her wailing finally stopped."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The Queen of Banshees lies at your feet. Her heart now at rest. Her wailing finally stopped."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The few <<m:EventUnit>> that remain, scatter to hide in the darkest corners of the {EventStructure}. They were drawn to <<G:scorn^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>> centuries ago and had driven her mad. When {EventHero} surveys the opulent palace chambers for treasures and antiquities, <<p:EventHero>> discovers the decayed bodies of servants. Their throats are marked by long and deep cuts made by claws. Or fingernails."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The few <<m:EventUnit>> that remain, scatter to hide in the darkest corners of the {EventStructure}. They were drawn to <<G:scorn^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>> centuries ago and had driven her mad. When you survey the opulent palace chambers for treasures and antiquities, you discover the decayed bodies of servants. Their throats are marked by long and deep cuts made by claws. Or fingernails."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Restore the husband's statue [influence/] to be placed at your court."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Bind one of the wandering <<m:EventUnit>> to join [unit/] your army."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Extract the dormant souls [souls/] that linger in the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Give the Banshee Queen a proper burial. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1287@TITLE"
msgstr "Queen of Banshees: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A {EnemyUnit} notices {EventHero.FirstName} peeping in. All Vampires, sobering up at a moment's notice, turn to face <<P:EventHero>>, poised to strike."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "A {EnemyUnit} notices you peeping in. All Vampires, sobering up at a moment's notice, turn to face you, poised to strike."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While readying <<o:EventHero>> army to explore an {EventStructure}, outwardly abandoned and overgrown, {EventHero} hears music."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "While readying your army to explore an {EventStructure}, outwardly abandoned and overgrown, you hear music."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Peering through tall windows of red-stained glass, {EventHero.FirstName} discovers a coven of Vampires feasting in the palace courtyard. They fill wine glasses with the blood of bound mortals, hung upside down and force-fed ale. The intoxicated Vampires revel in the light that enters the courtyard through the red-stained windows, and toast the Bloodmoon and the supremacy of their kind."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Peering through tall windows of red-stained glass, you discover a coven of Vampires feasting in the palace courtyard. They fill wine glasses with the blood of bound mortals, hung upside down and force-fed ale. The intoxicated Vampires revel in the light that enters the courtyard through the red-stained windows, and toast the Bloodmoon and the supremacy of their kind."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Charge into the courtyard to slay the Vampires."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Wield your piety to purify the dreadful light."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Crack the red-stained glass of the windows."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Declare your standing [thralls/] as {PlayerLeader.Title} to establish dominance."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Run away before the Vampires confront you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1288@TITLE"
msgstr "Bloodmoon Banquet"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The rescued <<m:EventUnit>> are eager to serve you in battle. Before {EventHero} departs, what purpose will the {EventStructure} stockpiles serve?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The rescued <<m:EventUnit>> are eager to serve you in battle. Before you depart, what purpose will the {EventStructure} stockpiles serve?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After thrashing the Vampire revels, {EventHero} frees their blood-drained prisoners. Among of them are <<m:EventUnit>> of your {EventRace}!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "After thrashing the Vampire revels, you free their blood-drained prisoners. Among of them are <<m:EventUnit>> of your {EventRace}!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Praise to our {PlayerLeader.Title}\", the least drained {EventUnit} sighs. \"I had very little more blood to give.\" {EventHero} investigates the palace grounds. The Vampires were feeding on the captured prisoners, yet their palace was stocked with the finest quality viands to fatten their blood suppliers. It would be a shame to let the feast go to waste."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "\"Praise to you, O {PlayerLeader.Title}!\", the least drained {EventUnit} sighs. \"I had very little more blood to give.\" You investigate the palace grounds. The Vampires were feeding on the captured prisoners, yet their palace was stocked with the finest quality viands to fatten their blood suppliers. It would be a shame to let the feast go to waste."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Plunder the stockpiled provisions [food/] for {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Send the palatial vittles to your recruits [unitprod/] in {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Allow your victorious army to finish the banquet. [morale/] They earned it."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Study the Bloodmoon Ritual to empower [xp/] {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Enthrall [thralls/] the other rescued prisoners. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1289@TITLE"
msgstr "Bloodmoon Banquet: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "They notice {EventHero} when a stray {EventUnit} attempts to latch onto <<o:EventHero>> leg. The frenzied <<m:EnemyUnit>> immediately move to attack."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "They notice you when a stray {EventUnit} attempts to latch onto your leg. The frenzied <<m:EnemyUnit>> immediately move to attack."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} marches into the scent of warm blood wafting from the maw of the {EventStructure}, pelted by harrowing screams and chittering."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You march into the scent of warm blood wafting from the maw of the {EventStructure}, pelted by harrowing screams and chittering."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Leading <<o:EventHero>> army inside, {EventHero.FirstName} witnesses how <<m:EnemyUnit>> expose their bodies to <<m:EventUnit>>, who rapaciously drain their blood. Bloated <<m:EventUnit>> writhe on the cavern floor, laying eggs. Shapes move underneath the skin of the <<m:EnemyUnit>>, who cry arcane chants about blood purity and the Bloodletter's Tenets. Their screams reveal no agony, only exaltation."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Leading your army inside, you witness how <<m:EnemyUnit>> expose their bodies to <<m:EventUnit>>, who rapaciously drain their blood. Bloated <<m:EventUnit>> writhe on the cavern floor, laying eggs. Shapes move underneath the skin of the <<m:EnemyUnit>>, who cry arcane chants about blood purity and the Bloodletter's Tenets. Their screams reveal no agony, only exaltation."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Expedite the bloodletting of the misguided <<m:EnemyUnit>>. Attack!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Infect [hp/] your troops with Blood Parasites to share the cultists' boon."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Corrupt your flesh to repel the voracious Blood Parasites."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Invoke the primal urges of all newly hatched <<m:EventUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Retreat. Leave these wretched <<m:EnemyUnit>> to their crazed rituals for now."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1291@TITLE"
msgstr "Bloodletter's Tenets"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} howls ecstatically and <<o:EnemyUnit>> disciples flock around <<P:EnemyUnit>>: \"Teach these uninvited voyeurs about pain!\" How will {EventHero} respond?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} howls ecstatically and <<o:EnemyUnit>> disciples flock around <<P:EnemyUnit>>: \"Teach these uninvited voyeurs about pain!\" How will you respond?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} is initially apprehensive of the screams pouring out of the {EventStructure} below <<P:EventHero>>. But the subsequent laughter stirs <<o:EventHero>> curiosity."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You are initially apprehensive of the screams pouring out of the {EventStructure} below you. But the subsequent laughter stirs your curiosity."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} discovers the spectacle within with horror. A {EnemyUnit} instructs <<o:EnemyUnit>> acolytes in the Teachings of Pain: they pinch, stab, twist, and slice each other open. Blood gushes out from their self-inflicted wounds, and euphoric screams from their throats. The {EnemyUnit}, embellished with blood spatters, grins with eager delight when <<p:EnemyUnit>> spots <<G:army^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>> and whispers: \"More willing flesh?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You discover the spectacle within with horror. A {EnemyUnit} instructs <<o:EnemyUnit>> acolytes in the Teachings of Pain: they pinch, stab, twist, and slice each other open. Blood gushes out from their self-inflicted wounds, and euphoric screams from their throats. The {EnemyUnit}, embellished with blood spatters, grins with eager delight when <<p:EnemyUnit>> spots your army and whispers: \"More willing flesh?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"There is no pain in death! Strike them down!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Think happy thoughts, troops! Take your mind off their torment!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"You deviants should all be ashamed of yourselves!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"This looks like my kind of party! Count me in!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Leave the {EnemyUnit} and <<o:EnemyUnit>> disciples to their rituals in privacy."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1292@TITLE"
msgstr "Tormenter's Teachings"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<m:EventUnit>> flee the {EventStructure}. Is there anything worth salvaging in this forsaken site?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon slaying the last of the <<m:EnemyUnit>>, {EventHero} discovers the true purpose the {EventStructure}: it is an altar to {GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Upon slaying the last of the <<m:EnemyUnit>>, you discover the true purpose the {EventStructure}: it is an altar to {GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} discovers tomes that mention the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink], and his so-called Bloodletter's Tenets. The power of the dark entity had infected the minds of the <<m:EnemyUnit>> with the broken belief that offering their blood to the <<m:EventUnit>> would lead to greatness and the First Vampire's return. Their repeated rites amassed unpredictable magical energies, which {EventHero.FirstName} quickly precipitates as mana."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You discover tomes that mention the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink], and his so-called Bloodletter's Tenets. The power of the dark entity had infected the minds of the <<m:EnemyUnit>> with the broken belief that offering their blood to the <<m:EventUnit>> would lead to greatness and the First Vampire's return. Their repeated rites amassed unpredictable magical energies, which you quickly precipitate as mana."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Research [knowledge/] the advantages of bloodletting in battle."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Adopt a lost {EventUnit}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Studying the Deathless God's tenets turns your {EventStackUnit} into a {EnemyUnit}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Grind the dead <<m:EventUnit>> into fertilizer [food/] for <<G:farms^p,EventCity>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1293@TITLE"
msgstr "Bloodletter's Tenets: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Besides the {EventItem}, what should {EventHero} extract from the {EventStructure} before moving on from this depraved site?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Besides the {EventItem}, what would you extract from the {EventStructure} before moving on from this depraved site?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} has slain the ritualists that occupied the {EventStructure}. A delighted smile is frozen on the dead <<G:lips^p,EnemyUnit>>, to <<G:discomfort^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You have slain the ritualists that occupied the {EventStructure}. A delighted smile is frozen on the dead <<G:lips^p,EnemyUnit>>, to your discomfort."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The dim light of the {EventStructure} reveals that the cave floor is now thoroughly flooded with the blood of the battleslain. Citizens from all over the realm gathered here to worship Pain together. {EventHero.FirstName} peruses the elaborate toolkit of the {EnemyUnit} and finds <<o:EnemyUnit>> {EventItem}. <<Cp:EventHero>> wonders if <<p:EventHero>> could ever truly understand what conviction drove these ritualists."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The dim light of the {EventStructure} reveals that the cave floor is now thoroughly flooded with the blood of the battleslain. Citizens from all over the realm gathered here to worship Pain together. You peruse the elaborate toolkit of the {EnemyUnit} and find <<o:EnemyUnit>> {EventItem}. You wonder if you could ever truly understand what conviction drove these ritualists."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Experiment with the <<G:arts^p,EnemyUnit>> [unitHero/] to increase <<G:durability^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BUTTON_0@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Experiment with the <<G:arts^p,EnemyUnit>> [unitHero/] to increase your durability."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "[order/] Purge all evidence of the <<G:aberrant rituals^p,EnemyUnit>> from the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Drink the blood that was spilled everywhere. [xp/] Waste not, want not!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Study the <<G:lessons^p,EnemyUnit>> to empower your ranged combatants. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1294@TITLE"
msgstr "Tormenter's Teachings: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "They pause, expecting you to settle their volatile disagreement. Whom will you favor? Mighty {EventHeroA.FirstName}? Or ambitious {EventHeroB.FirstName}?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your nightly court banquet is disrupted when tensions between {EventHeroA} and {EventHeroB} erupt in a hissing match."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Coward!\" {EventHeroA.FirstName}, the stronger of the two, drags {EventHeroB.FirstName} across the dining table, spilling some of your finest bottled blood. The more recently sired {EventHeroB.FirstName} sucks <<o:EventHeroB>> teeth. \"You oaf,\" <<p:EventHeroB>> giggles. \"Soldiers cannot forge empires! Weaving spells shapes mighty realms! Everybody knows that!\" {EventHeroA} draws <<o:EventHeroA>> weapon. \"Let's see how your weaving fares against my blade, cur!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Side with {EventHeroB} [morale/]. Your empire should grow by spellcraft. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"This is no way to behave! You will both obey ME!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Side with {EventHeroA} [morale/]. Your empire should grow by the sword. [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Stop this childish rivalry. Feast on some thralls [thralls/] instead. Cheers!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Neither of them appear to understand statecraft. Ignore them."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Haha, this will make a great fight! May the best Vampire win!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1295@TITLE"
msgstr "Bad Blood"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1298@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A {PlayerLeader.Title} like yourself should flaunt <<o:PlayerLeader>> {EventMaterial} to show off your opulence. Will you hunt down a new source?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1298@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The origin of Vampires is tied to the legendary substance commonly called {EventMaterial}, which invigorates Vampires and generates bloodlust."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1298@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The <<m:{GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>, your ancestral lords, would craft swords, rings, and crowns from the glass to display their wealth and authority. The windows of their ancient palaces would be made from {EventMaterial} panes, transforming the bright rays that pierce them into a revitalizing red light. The greatest of kings had whole covens of trusted lieutenants equipped with masterful {EventMaterial} weaponry."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1298@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The {EventMaterial} will be a great help in my conquests!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1298@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Flaunt {EventMaterial}? I will erect a statue [structureprod/] of myself [influence/] instead!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1298@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I have no interest in the follies of dusty kings.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1298@TITLE"
msgstr "Glass of Crimson"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Acquiring the {EventMaterial} boosts your magic item production. The blacksmiths may even finish one weapon for one {GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink} immediately!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Holding a shard of {EventMaterial}, you faintly sense a pulse. You feel its invigorating effects. And your growing hunger."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your blacksmiths arrive to inform you that their forges are ready. They are eager use this material to craft biting blades and deflecting plates. Your <<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>> in particular can benefit from the improved armaments that the {EventMaterial} can provide. You give the signal, and your grinning blacksmiths haul the {EventMaterial} away to their shadowed smithies."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Forge a {DefenderItem} [item/] for {DefenderHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Forge a {MageItem} [item/] for {MageHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_10"
msgstr "Forge a {WarriorItem} [item/] for {WarriorHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_11"
msgstr "Forge a {DeathItem} [item/] for {DeathHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Forge a {RangerItem} [item/] for {RangerHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Forget Heroes. Mix it in with my regular troops' armaments. [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"My Heroes have abandoned me. I shall create a weapon for myself.\" [item/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Forge a {RitualistItem} [item/] for {RitualistHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "Forge a {SpellbladeItem} [item/] for {SpellbladeHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@BUTTON_9"
msgstr "Forge a {WarlockItem} [item/] for {WarlockHero}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1299@TITLE"
msgstr "Glass of Crimson: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1302@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "If you wish to learn more about your foresires, build <<m:{GLOBAL.ResearchPostConcept.Hyperlink}>> to study the history of your bloodline more profoundly."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1302@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As an {GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink} {PlayerLeader.Title}, you are descended from a great line of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]<<PlayerLeader{Archsires/Archdams}>>[/hyperlink]. But which one?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1302@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "There were many clans, covens, and houses in the sunless past of your kind. Each vaunted their own talents, strengths, and skills. And while you thirst to learn where your ambitions take you, knowing the origin of your power may prove useful. Scribes and scholars already work tirelessly to uncover hidden magics, but will need bolstering to study your lineage."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1302@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Build the <<m:{GLOBAL.ResearchPostConcept.Name}>> to fortify your scholastic capacities."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1302@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "You know [knowledge/] enough. It is willing hands [thralls/] you lack."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1302@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Let the past rot. Your focus is dominating the future."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1302@TITLE"
msgstr "Lore of the <<PlayerLeader{Archsires/Archdams}>>"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Tapping this new well of power already strengthens you. How will you use this discovery to shape your domain?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The last of the <<m:{GLOBAL.ResearchPostConcept.Hyperlink}>> has been raised and already your scribes report a breakthrough."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "They successfully translated ancient scrolls, written in a dead language, which harbors the annals of one of the dark children of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Blood Emperor Eternal[/hyperlink]. Comparing these annals to the dynasty tree of your <<PlayerLeader{sire/dam}>>, you can trace your lineage all the way back to {EventPhrase}"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Use the knowledge to attract recruits for your army. [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Exploit this insight to cement your high class [influence/] status."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Announce this discovery to reinforce the pride [happiness/] of your {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Adduce your lineage to bind more thralls [thralls/] to your will."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Accept this knowledge as proof of your devotion [devotion/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1303@TITLE"
msgstr "Lore of the <<PlayerLeader{Archsires/Archdams}>>: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "So many thralls to spare! Surely you can find a better use for them than to congest your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.STRUCTURE_UPGRADES.LORD_CASTLE_FOUNDATION]Vampire Castle[/hyperlink]?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Thralls gather in your keep in {EventCity}. They are huddled up in throngs, occupying your deepest dungeons and deadliest laboratories."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Thralls are a symbol of your influence over lesser folk. Stripped of their wills and lusts, they follow your every order without pause or objection. But to Vampires, thralls should not be kept idle. The most cunning Vampire princes and consorts issued hordes of thralls to execute their dark biddings. Many of yours are unspent, as is their potential."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Flay thralls [thralls/] to entertain [morale/] your coven."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Spend thralls [thralls/] to curry favor with lesser lords. [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_10"
msgstr "[nature/] Dispatch thralls [thralls/] to your butchers. [food/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_11"
msgstr "[shadow/] Drain thralls [thralls/] to learn [knowledge/] more about the Cosmos."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_12"
msgstr "Too many thralls? No such thing. Bring me more! [thralls/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Parade your thralls [thralls/] to display your lordship. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "[chaos/] Send thralls [thralls/] to work the forges [unitprod/] in your smithies."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "[arcana/] Spend thralls [thralls/] to draw mana [mana/] from the Astral Sea."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "[order/] Deploy thralls [thralls/] as tax [gold/] collectors."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@BUTTON_9"
msgstr "[matter/] Issue thralls [thralls/] to delve in your quarries. [structureprod/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1167_1304@TITLE"
msgstr "Throngs of Thralls"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1194_1919@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Co:Emperor>> crypt is said to lie beneath the blood-soaked mound of a shattered heart. Find it, for the one who unseals it shall decide the future fate of all Vampire-kind."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1194_1919@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink], first of all Vampires, was long ago laid to rest upon this realm. <<Cp:Emperor>> awaits the coming of one who shall instigate a reckoning of blood."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1194_1919@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Hated or beloved, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] is an enigma venerated by secretive blood cults throughout the ages. They long preached the coming of an event, so named the 'Blood Reckoning.' A time when {EventRealm} returns from banishment, and the hallowed blood of the Deathless God will either be spilled or once again reinstated to even greater glory!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1194_1919@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The reckoning is at hand.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1194_1919@TITLE"
msgstr "Crypt of the Deathless God"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The figure turns to dust before the eyes of {EventHero}, leaving <<P:EventHero>> with a request to save the blighted village. What will {EventHero} do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The figure turns to dust before your eyes, leaving you with a request to save the blighted village. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "From the corner of <<o:EventHero>> eye, {EventHero} senses it. Limping and badly wounded, a figure approaches <<P:EventHero>>, gesturing for help."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "From the corner of your eye, you sense it. Limping and badly wounded, a figure approaches, gesturing for help."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Please, we cannot take it anymore. Something terrible is stalking our village, taking our people. I managed to get here to ask for help. But my children... my family, they are still there.\"\n"
"\n"
"<<Co:VillageSoulHero>> eyes suddenly fix on <<o:VillageSoulHero>> own lethal wounds. With a look of terror, <<p:VillageSoulHero>> says, \"But be careful... it seems I did not make it out alive.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Burn the damned place down—the curse must not spread."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Search for survivors; someone may still live."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Connect with the source of the evil that haunts the place."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the lost soul."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_212@TITLE"
msgstr "The Blighted Village"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_213@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "This is not over. One final deed remains."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_213@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After slaying the last creature, the village should have been cleared. Yet something is wrong, this place still feels haunted."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_213@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The houses rot in silence, dilapidated, abandoned. Yet you felt it, no sense of peace came after killing the last monster. A dark presence lingers, whatever cursed this place is still here. You see it in the shadows of the town. Their shapes do not match the buildings"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_213@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare the fuel. Light the torches. Set this town ablaze."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_213@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Enter the village—someone must still live."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_213@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Tap into the dark presence."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_213@TITLE"
msgstr "The Blighted Village's Curse"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_214@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The fate of the this domain lies in your hands. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_214@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The fire cleanses the corruption on this land. Blazes engulf the buildings, the shadows, the curse."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_214@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You cannot tear your gaze from the flare. Not only the village burns, the flames are consuming something else that lingers in the air. You can hear it shriek and twist. You can see the fire turn black at its touch. Nothing escapes the inferno. But once the land is burned, you may choose what becomes of it."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_214@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ban [influence/] anyone from settling here. [renown/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_214@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Reshape the land [unitprod/] into farming fields [food/]."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_214@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Reconstruct the foundations."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_214@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Vampire lord option or other lord option (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_214@TITLE"
msgstr "The Blighted Village: Ablaze"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_215@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "What will you do? (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_215@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A newborn maggot cries, it is wounded and lost. (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_215@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Its eating the village supplies. \n"
" \n"
"A maggot for free, do you want it? (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_215@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Pet the maggot [unit/] (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_215@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Kill the maggot [goodact/] (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_215@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Study the maggot [knowledge/] (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_215@TITLE"
msgstr "The Blighted Village - Weeping (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The fate of the family is in your hands. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "No house holds a living soul. None but one, the door of which creaks open as you approach."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The inhabitants of the house creep out of it. A parent and two children, famished and afraid. You can see the corruption running through their veins, they may turn into the same monsters that hunted them. The adult speaks with a broken voice: \"We have little left... but you can keep this heirloom, if you grant us safe passage.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Let them join {EventCity}. [unhappiness/] [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "End them, you cannot let the curse spread."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Free them [mana/] from the malefice [goodact/]."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Dispel the shadow's energy to lift their curse. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Unravel the chaos energy to lift their curse. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_216@TITLE"
msgstr "The Blighted Village: Survivors"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_217@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Though worn and frayed, the mantle yet hums with ancient power. You will need your {GLOBAL.ItemForgeConcept.Hyperlink} to mend it."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_217@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Though no wind blows, a ragged cloak stirs across the surface. As if sensing {EventHero}'s presence, the cloak veers toward <<P:EventHero>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_217@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Though no wind blows, a ragged cloak stirs across the barren earth. As if sensing your presence, the cloak veers toward you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_217@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "From the mantle a ghostly presence emanates, barely holding the fabric. A weary voice echoes: \n"
"\"The {EventArtifact}... binds my bloodline to this world. It must be mended... before my family name vanishes.\" \n"
"With <<o:SoulHero>> last words, the spirit withers, leaving the mantle to fall at your feet. Like the shed skin of something no longer of this world."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_217@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "From the mantle a ghostly presence emanates, barely holding the fabric. A weary voice echoes: \n"
"\"The {EventArtifact}... still binds our bloodline to this world. It must be mended... before we become extinct.\" \n"
"With <<o:SoulHero>> last words, the spirit withers, leaving the mantle to fall at your feet. Like the shed skin of something no longer of this world."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_217@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"This lineage shall not be consigned to oblivion.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_217@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"This burden is not mine to bear.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_217@TITLE"
msgstr "Forefather's Cloak"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_218@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The ghost yearns for the {EventArtifact}. What will you answer?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_218@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have reforged the {EventArtifact}. From the patched cloak rises the spectral figure, <<o:SoulHero>> outline now clear and <<o:SoulHero>> presence revitalized."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_218@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With your very essence, you have rekindled the {EventArtifact} that was mine... and my ancestors', of course. Your generosity is... delicious, {PlayerLeader}; but I would hate to test it further. Allow me to return this garment to its rightful place myself, so that—under my name—new blood may clothe it once more.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_218@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Take it and remember who saved your lineage.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_218@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"The attire is attuned to me now.\" [item/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_218@TITLE"
msgstr "The Cloak's Owner"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_219@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The spirit whom you assisted was no lost soul, but a Vampire cloaked in need. What will you decree?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_219@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "People have been disappearing in your realm. The reports from your investigators have allowed you to find the perpetrator, <<o:SoulHero>> hands still bloody."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_219@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The ghost you once aided now shows <<r:SoulHero>> before you as a Vampire, the {EventArtifact} draped over <<o:SoulHero>> shoulders. \"We meet again, {PlayerLeader}. I owe you an explanation,\" <<p:SoulHero>> says with a grin. \"Vanquished and in desperation, I poured the last of my essence into my cloak, hoping to hide and regain my strength. The very cloak you restored to its full glory.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_219@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So long as you serve [unitHero/] me, you may quench your hunger [population/] [evilact/].\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_219@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You will not escape my judgment.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_219@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Know your place fledgling, you will serve [unitHero/] me and feast outside [thralls/] my domains.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_219@TITLE"
msgstr "Cloak of the Vampire"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_221@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The apparition is bound by wrath and grief. Will {EventHero} answer her cry?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_221@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} hears a heartbroken cry; a scream of pain that has no wound; a ghost wearing an eternal grimace of agony."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_221@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Gesticulating between sobs, she says: \"What kind of world is this where there is no justice? What kind of pain is this, that not even death can silence it? My children... my poor children.\"\n"
"Her grief bursts into fury as she claims: \"You will not escape me! I can sense your stench, {FairSoulHero2}.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_221@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will claim your vengeance.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_221@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the tormented soul."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_221@TITLE"
msgstr "Fair Lady's Lament"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_224@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The wrath of the specter knows no bounds. Will you persist with her quest for vengeance?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_224@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After the recent battle, amid the fallen, the vengeful apparition rises upon her terrified victim."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_224@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"What have I done to you,\" cries the man. \"You may not be him—but you carry the same stench of evil. The stench of one capable of spilling the blood of their own offspring,\" responds the specter. And after lunging at him with all her rage, she leaves the man lifeless. \n"
"\"It was not him, we must continue searching,\" says the apparition."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_224@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will continue till you rest in peace.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_224@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I cannot follow you, you have lost your way.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_224@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"This carnage needs to cease.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_224@TITLE"
msgstr "Fair Lady's Vengeance"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_240@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The wrath of the specter knows no bounds. Will you persist with her quest for vengeance?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_240@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After the recent battle, amid the fallen, the vengeful apparition rises upon her terrified victim."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_240@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"How did I wrong you,\" exclaims the man. \n"
"\"You may not be him—but the same evil stench clings to you. The stench of one who abused the very soul they swore to love,\" responds the specter. And after lunging at him with all her rage, she leaves the man lifeless. \"It was not him, we must continue searching,\" says the apparition."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_240@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will continue till you rest in peace.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_240@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I cannot follow you, you have lost your way.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_240@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"This carnage needs to cease.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_240@TITLE"
msgstr "Fair Lady's Vengeance"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_241@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The wrath of the specter knows no bounds. Will you persist with her quest for vengeance?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_241@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After the recent battle, amid the fallen, the vengeful apparition rises upon her terrified victim."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_241@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I am not him, I've never met you,\" cries the man. \"Maybe not—but you wear the same stench of evil. A stench that smells like lies, betrayal and torture,\" responds the specter. And after lunging at him with all her rage, she leaves the man lifeless. \n"
"\"It was not him, we must continue searching,\" says the apparition."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_241@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will continue till you rest in peace.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_241@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I cannot follow you, you have lost your way.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_241@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"You need to stop this carnage.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_241@TITLE"
msgstr "Fair Lady's Vengeance"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_242@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The apparition has shown her true faces. How will you respond?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_242@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The visage of the apparition twists and splits in impossible grimaces, forming multiple faces and showing her true nature, that one of a {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_242@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Their voices cry out: \n"
"\"We are the suffering of those who were abused. We are the anger of those who died in agony. We are those who never knew justice.\n"
"They took our sanity. They took our lives. They took everything we had.\n"
"They will not take our tears. They will not take our rage. And you will not take our revenge!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_242@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You will accept death—willingly or not.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_242@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Perhaps our goals are, in fact, aligned.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_242@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Walk on, but I shall not walk beside you.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_242@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "[reputation8/] \"I cannot fathom your pain, but together, we can eradicate evil.\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_242@TITLE"
msgstr "Fair Lady's Faces"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_243@TITLE"
msgstr "Fair Lady's Banished"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_246@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With <<o:SoulLoverHero>> unfinished business concluded, the ghost fades away. What will {EventHero} do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_246@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "With <<o:SoulLoverHero>> unfinished business concluded, the ghost fades away. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_246@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A ghost manifests in front of {EventHero}. <<Co:SoulLoverHero>> gaze, drenched in tears that never fall, implores for help."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_246@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A ghost manifests in front of you. <<Co:SoulLoverHero>> gaze, drenched in tears that never fall, implores for help."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_246@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Your presence... calls to me... You can aid me. I fade, I am coming undone, I don't want to leave; not now that I can be with my beloved. We spent a lifetime trying to reach one another, but we met only in death. Please, bind us. Bind our souls in our wedding ring, so we may always be together.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_246@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Rest your soul now, I will honor your wishes.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_246@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You know not what you ask for.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_246@TITLE"
msgstr "Nuptial Demise"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_247@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You have but a moment before the soul of the consort is lost forever. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_247@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the soul is embedded to the ring, a flare of spectral light erupts. A second spirit manifests in its shine."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_247@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"No! What have you done?! Where is <<p:SoulHero>>?!\" With a glance at the {EventArtifact}, <<p:SoulLoverHero2>> understands. \"Oh my dear, my sweet dear, what have you done? You were the last tether that held me here. I yearned to depart together... wherever the journey... takes... us.\" \n"
"\n"
"Before almost fading, the soul cries \"I do not... want to be... alone... again.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_247@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Break the ring, allowing both souls to pass. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_247@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Bond both souls to the ring. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_247@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"You shall be together—but nay in life, and nay in death.\" [evilact/] [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_247@TITLE"
msgstr "Till Death Do Us Part"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_265@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The ghost who once begged for your help now stands before you—<<o:SoulHero>> soul disfigured by vengeance. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_265@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Ever since you chose to keep {EventArtifact}, whispers plague the corners, with words you can not make out."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_265@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You are never alone, even when the room is empty. The murmurs seize upon you in your moments of rest, they have been growing louder and louder. Suddenly, a voice—shattered, incomplete, yet bound together—whispers with perfect diction: \"There is no true slumber for the wicked.\" The spirit appears before you, his lust for vengeance has deformed <<o:SoulHero>> soul, turning him into a {LivingFogUnit}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_265@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Face the vengeful spirit."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_265@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"What is a wicked soul to a necromancer?\" [souls/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_265@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"In the name of all that is sacred, be gone, foul presence!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_265@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Sever <<o:SoulHero>> connection to the realm of the living."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_265@TITLE"
msgstr "Cloak of Vengeance"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_356@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The spoils of the fray lay in the field. What will you do with them?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_356@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the skirmish over, the battlefield emanates a solemn stillness. A ghostly force manifests in the distance."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_356@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "She appears again, the spirit who led you here, rising beside the target of her rage. But something is wrong; they both seem confused.\n"
"\n"
"Your mind comes back to the aftermath of the battle. Not much is left after the fight, but enough for you to be able to take advantage of it."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_356@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Trade the goods for gold. [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_356@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Yield them to your scholars. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_356@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Commit them to your city, {EventCity}. [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_356@TITLE"
msgstr "Spoils Of The Fray"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_475@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You will have to come back later."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_475@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A presence obscures the air, but its form is veiled."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_475@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The soul will only manifest upon greater wills, like the one of heroes and Rulers."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_475@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Leave the lost soul."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_475@TITLE"
msgstr "Lost Soul"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_515@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.VampireLordConcept]Vampires[/hyperlink] are no longer empowered by the Blood Moon and once again suffer the consequences of walking in the light of day."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_515@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The Blood Moon wanes, and the fear of light returns to those who bask in darkness."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_515@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The sun rises behind the fading moon, restoring color to the world. Its rays breathe life into the meadows and kindle hope in weary hearts. The creatures of the dusk retreat to their lairs, sheltered by the shadows within them."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_515@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Bid farewell to the red night."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_515@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood Moon: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_542@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The voices shout for {EventHero} to follow them. Will <<p:EventHero>> find the origin of their suffering?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_542@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} can sense their presence. Not one, not two, but an amalgamation of ghosts. All talking at the same time."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_542@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Stop them. Help us. Our flesh... our souls... consumed.\" One of the voices tears itself free from the amalgam, \"They are trying to create it. The essence of life, the tincture, the stone of immortality.\" Then, as one, they speak again. \"One to turn lead into gold. One to turn death into life. But magic demands a cost, and it was us.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_542@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Track where they lead."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_542@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the lost souls."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_542@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood And Soul"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_543@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The energy lies before you, awaiting transmutation by your will."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_543@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The last cultist falls. Blood and flesh are consumed by the ritual circle, completing the rite."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_543@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "As the fallen are absorbed into the blood sigil, a crimson energy erupts. Waves surge outward, swirling into a violent vortex. With each turn it contracts, condensing into a scarlet anomaly. It calls to you. It is power—raw and unbound, waiting to be shaped."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_543@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Create a {BloodGlass} in the area."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_543@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Dispel the energy [mana/]. Free the souls [goodact/]."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_543@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Shape the energy into the essence of life needed to forge the immortality stone."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_543@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood And Soul: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_549@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The voices shout for you to follow them. Will you find the origin of their suffering?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_549@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You can sense their presence. Not one, not two, but an amalgamation of ghosts. All talking at the same time."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_555@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "What haunts this village is no mere curse, but a living sickness: conscious, ravenous, unbound. What will you do with it?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_555@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You close your eyes and reach for the presence that plagues this village. It is shapeless, old, patient."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_555@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The presence is conscious. Flashes of memory seize you: a man in red, experimental rituals of blood and souls. A sickness that infects the blood, blood that infects the soul, soul that shapes the body into its wicked reflection. Then you understand, you are seeing through the eyes of those taken by the illness. The illness is the presence itself."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_555@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Feed [mana/] and let the presence consume the village [evilact/], completing its metamorphosis [unit/]."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_555@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Allow the presence to infect you [hp/], granting you its power [xp/]."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_555@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Isolate the sickness [unitprod/], your scholars will learn [knowledge/] from it and avoid it from spreading."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_555@TITLE"
msgstr "Dark Presence"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_577@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PALYERLE"
msgstr "The apparition is bound by wrath and grief. Will you answer her cry?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_577@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PALYERLE"
msgstr "You hear a heartbroken cry; a scream of pain that has no wound; a ghost wearing an eternal grimace of agony."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_579@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your troops have freed this land from this menace. But a trail of ghostly hoofprints leads the way to an uncertain location."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_579@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The dead cavalry lies defeated, yet their ghosts find no rest."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_579@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The souls of knights and horses rise from their remains. Compelled by an imperative force, they spur their steed and gallop away. Only the Beheaded Knight resists the urge, for an instant <<p:RiderSoulHero>> turns towards you. Yet for that brief moment, you feel <<o:RiderSoulHero>> desperation, as if <<p:RiderSoulHero>> no longer commands his own actions."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_579@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Track the equine apparitions."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_579@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the knights' souls."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_579@TITLE"
msgstr "Decapitated Cavalry"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_580@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The head of the ghost flies away, carried by an unknown entity."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_580@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A ghost manifests in front of {EventHero}. Unaware of <<o:EventHero>> presence."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_580@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "As if still alive, the ghost strolls along, speaking to a figure that is not there. Suddenly, <<p:HeadlessSoulHero>> turns, with fear across <<o:HeadlessSoulHero>> face. You hear the ghostly thunder of galloping hooves drawing near—and then, SHUNK! <<Co:HeadlessSoulHero>> head is severed, flying from <<o:HeadlessSoulHero>> shoulders. An unseen force snatches it from the ground and vanishes into the distance."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_580@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Track where it leads and face the beheader."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_580@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the lost soul."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_580@TITLE"
msgstr "Headless Victim"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_583@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A ghost manifests in front of you. Unaware of your presence."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_600@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The head of the headless horseman lies in your hands. Will this be the end of <<o:RiderSoulHero>> duty?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_600@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The dead have returned to their graves. The cemetery lies in peace once more."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_600@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Beside the statue of the knight lie several severed heads and scattered bones, encircled by runes painted in blood. The necromancers used these remains to summon the cavalry and bind them to their will. One head radiates a daunting energy, an aura you recognize from the Beheaded Knight."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_600@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Your oath is not yet fulfilled.\" [item/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_600@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "The lost souls [souls/] are yours to claim."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_600@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Cleanse the curse [goodact/] and leave your banner behind. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_600@TITLE"
msgstr "End Of My Duty"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_602@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The cemetery seems to hide great dangers."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_602@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The report from your scout is brief: the ghostly trail ends in a grim graveyard."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_602@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The message is hastily written with a shaky hand: \"I think I can hear chanting within the graveyard. My mount refuses to approach the area any further. But through the gate I glimpse a group surrounding a large statue of a knight on his steed. Tombs here are empty, {PlayerLeader.Title}. Please beware.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_602@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare your troops."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_602@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the lost souls."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_602@TITLE"
msgstr "Where My Bones Rest"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_623@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The spirit longs for you to raise a great palace where <<p:FluteSoulHero>> can perform <<o:FluteSoulHero>> music."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_623@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A gust of wind whistles a melody. Carried by the same breeze, a spirit takes form."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_623@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<Co:FluteSoulHero>> flute sings with a dancing rhythm, yet each note drags along the ground with a heavy gloom. The spirit notices {EventHero}'s presence and exclaims:\n"
"\"Can you hear me? You can hear me! It has been decades since anyone could. You... You serve a {EventPlayerType}... With <<o:LeaderType>> magic, <<o:LeaderType>> whole kingdom could hear my song! Please, build a great stage where I may play.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_623@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "<<Co:FluteSoulHero>> flute sings with a dancing rhythm, yet each note drags along the ground with a heavy gloom. The spirit notices your presence and exclaims:\n"
"\"Can you hear me? You can hear me! It has been decades since anyone could. You... You are a {EventPlayerType}... With your magic, your whole kingdom could hear my song! Please, build a great stage where I may play.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_623@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Promise the spirit <<o:FluteSoulHero>> stage."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_623@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the lost soul."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_623@TITLE"
msgstr "Last Symphony"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_624@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The ghostly bard now offers <<o:FluteSoulHero>> service. What will you ask of <<P:FluteSoulHero>>?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_624@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Once the structure is built, the spirit lifts <<o:FluteSoulHero>> flute, and music floods the halls."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_624@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The song echoes through the high chambers that bear your name, your emblem, your very essence. Amplified by your empire’s bond with the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]Astral Sea[/hyperlink], the melody spreads across every corner of your domain. When the final note fades, the spirit turns to you:\n"
"\"Thank you. I have always longed to play for an entire kingdom. Before I vanish, allow me to grant you something in return.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_624@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Leave your flute so we can still hear your music.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_624@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Keep playing, so people will come to my kingdom."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_624@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Sing a song in my name."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_624@TITLE"
msgstr "Last Symphony: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_638@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The spirit offers <<o:KingSoulHero>> aid in your new reign. What will you ask of <<P:KingSoulHero>>?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_638@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The ghost of the dead monarch appears at your side as you reclaim {EventHouse}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_638@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The usurper is gone, and my domain rests now in your hands. How sweet is victory, and how fleeting. My time here is over, {PlayerLeader.Name}. Yet before I depart, I still hold some strength within me. Allow me to offer one last gift to this resurgent kingdom.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_638@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Access to <<o:KingSoulHero>> private archives. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_638@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Ancient treatises on commerce, to be invoked at your will. [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_638@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "A commendatory letter, addressed to the free cities of the realm. [allegiance/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_638@TITLE"
msgstr "Dethroned: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_639@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "It seems the former monarch of {EventHouse} lingers, demanding vengeance against the usurper of <<o:KingSoulHero>> throne."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_639@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A spirit appears before {EventHero}, babbling and flailing in fury. <<Co:KingSoulHero>> voice rises into a bitter rant:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_639@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A spirit appears before you, babbling and flailing in fury. <<Co:KingSoulHero>> voice rises into a bitter rant:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_639@BODY_LORE"
msgstr " \"Cursed be <<p:CityRuler>>! May <<o:CityRuler>> schemes fester and poison <<o:CityRuler>> own blood, may <<o:CityRuler>> bile burn <<P:CityRuler>> from within! <<Cp:CityRuler>> wanted me dead, for <<p:CityRuler>> coveted my kingdom. And now I am dead, and my kingdom is <<o:CityRuler>>. Know this, the one who reigns in {EventHouse} is no rightful Ruler. I will not depart this world until I have had my revenge!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_639@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will execute your revenge.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_639@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the lost soul."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_639@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Teach me the finest harvesting techniques for these lands."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_639@TITLE"
msgstr "Dethroned"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventHero} has become the standard-bearer of this dreadful procession of souls, and they claim <<o:EventHero>> essence. What will <<p:EventHero>> do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You have become the standard-bearer of this dreadful procession of souls, and they claim your essence. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The condemned bearer hands the heavy banner to {EventHero}. As <<o:PilgrimHero>> grip loosens, <<p:PilgrimHero>> collapses lifeless to the ground."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The condemned bearer hands to you the heavy banner. As <<o:PilgrimHero>> grip loosens, <<p:PilgrimHero>> collapses lifeless to the ground."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The entire march turns their gaze upon {EventHero}. And then <<p:EventHero>> feels it—<<o:EventHero>> very essence is drawn into the banner, seeping away like water into barren soil, vanishing into an unfathomable void. The dead require the living to lead their unholy procession. {EventHero} has taken up the mantle of the previous penitent, the curse is <<o:EventHero>> now."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The entire march turns their gaze upon you. And then you feel it—your very essence is drawn into the banner, seeping away like water into barren soil, vanishing into an unfathomable void. The dead require the living to lead their unholy procession. You have taken up the mantle of the previous penitent, the curse is yours now."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Banish the unholy procession."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "{EventHero} is stronger than the curse, <<p:EventHero>> can take it."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BUTTON_1@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You are stronger than the curse, you can take it."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Feed mana [mana/] to the standard to satiate it."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "It will not be <<o:EventHero>> soul [souls/] that they drain."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BUTTON_5@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "It will not be your soul [souls/] that they drain."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "{EventHero} already walks among the dead [unitUndead/], they have no claim on <<P:EventHero>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@BUTTON_6@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You already walk among the dead [unitUndead/], they have no claim on you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_640@TITLE"
msgstr "Penitential Burden"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The condemned man begs {EventHero} to take <<o:PilgrimHero>> banner and ease <<o:PilgrimHero>> torment."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The condemned man begs you to take <<o:PilgrimHero>> banner and ease <<o:PilgrimHero>> torment."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A procession of spirits takes shape before {EventHero}. Yet the one who leads it does not seem like a soul at all."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A procession of spirits takes shape before you. Yet the one who leads it does not seem like a soul at all."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The march advances in two long lines, each ghostly pilgrim clutching a lit candle. All save one, the figure at the front. Cadaverous and grim, <<p:PilgrimHero>> carries a heavy banner, <<o:PilgrimHero>> hollow voice calls to {EventHero}:\n"
"\"Mercy, bear my burden, if only for a moment.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The march advances in two long lines, each ghostly pilgrim clutching a lit candle. All save one, the figure at the front. Cadaverous and grim, <<p:PilgrimHero>> carries a heavy banner, <<o:PilgrimHero>> hollow voice calls to you:\n"
"\"Mercy, bear my burden, if only for a moment.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Aid the standard-bearer."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Leave the lost soul."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1224_641@TITLE"
msgstr "Unholy Procession"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you want my blood, then bring me the Obsidian Rose from {Emperor.FirstName}’s crumbling palace and lay it before my feet. The offer is made little '[hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]Elder[/hyperlink].' I’ll be watching you, ta-ta.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Tut-tut, little pet,\" purrs {Wife.TitleFirstName}, \"However do you intend to enter <<Co:Emperor>> final resting place without even my blood, hmm?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@BODY_HEADER@DONT_KNOW"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} curls <<o:Wife>> lip. \"Aww, isn’t that adorable. How would you like it if mother gave you a little—motivation?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@BODY_HEADER@RESIST_WIFE"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} erupts in a tittering cackle. \"Oh how delightful! Your petty resistance is simply... Mhh, irresistible. I must have more of it!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Yes, I have decided, you may stay,\" grins {Wife.TitleFirstName}. \"Doubtlessly, you came here to unseal that stinking crypt of my rotting husband, {Emperor.FirstName}. But in order to do that, one first needs my exalted blood, with which that place is thoroughly sealed. However, if you so intend to slay that wretched bastard, then I might be open to make a little—trade...\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I will have your blood for plucking my heartstrings!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"No thanks.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@TITLE"
msgstr "Key to my Heartstring"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@TITLE@DONT_KNOW"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} curls <<o:Wife>> lip. “Naw, isn’t that adorable. How would you like it if mother gave you a little—motivation?” (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_223@TITLE@RESIST_WIFE"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} erupts in a tittering cackle. “Oh how delightful! Your petty resistance is simply… Mhh, irresistible. I must have more of it!” (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} <<o:Wife>> maleficent stare probes your sight and pricks your very heartstring... \"Tell me, my sweet, what brings you to my dominion?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Strange shadows blind your senses, then a sharp whisper enters your inner ear... \"What is this I find, an unfamiliar '{GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}' roving my realm? After all this time.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "From the deepest darkness appears the terrifying shape of an {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {Wife.TitleName}, fabled author of the Tome of Torment and first wife of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] <<Cr:Emperor>>. <<Cp:Wife>> inspects you with a predatory gaze, then lifts <<o:Wife>> chin and produces a faint, fanged grin. Suddenly, your chest starts to ache! It appears <<p:Wife>> is casting some sort of spell on you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"To awaken the Deathless God.\" [xp/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Remain silent."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"That is none of your business!\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Resist <<P:Wife>> spell. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"I have come for blood, yours in particular!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_224@TITLE"
msgstr "The Grave Archdam"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_225@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} trembles all over in fury. \"In fact, this is the request I make of you by granting my blood to open <<Co:Emperor>> stinking crypt... Kill <<CP:Emperor>>!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_225@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Splendid!\" squeals {Wife.TitleFirstName}. \"My, oh my, you seem to know the way to a Vampire’s heart with deadly precision. We might share a common interest there, my sweet.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_225@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} studies the Cruor Rose with a fey, melancholic frown. \"This bloody rose was grown for <<Co:Emperor>>... <<Co:Emperor>> damned witch...\" <<Cp:Wife>> shuts <<P:Wife>> eyes for a moment and presses the rose against <<o:Wife>> bosom. Then, <<P:Wife>> eyes flare open with a blood-lusting stare. \"Yes. I want <<P:Emperor>> dead!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_225@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will take care of everything.\" [rs_alliance/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_225@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"No thanks. Now hand me your blood!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_225@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Anything, for a price...\" [thralls/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_225@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Whatever you want. First strengthen me through pain!\" [xp/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_225@TITLE"
msgstr "Key to my Heartstring: Earned"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_240@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With <<Po:Emperor>> crypt now unsealed and vacant, the crown inheritance of '{Emperor.Name}' remains yours for the taking—title, throne, and all..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_240@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "By your hand, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] has been defeated. An act that is felt by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]Archvampires[/hyperlink] far and wide, all across the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_240@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Though they might not yet know your name, all Archsires and Archdams will know you by your deeds, and forever fear you for it! For, if one Vampire could slay the deathless—Sire of all—what then stops the Spawn from rising up against their own Sires in complete and total anarchy? Thus, by this credence dawns a new blood-stained age for all Vampire-kind."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_240@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Blood for blood!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_240@TITLE"
msgstr "Crypt of the Deathless God: Shattered"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_248@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "None have since entered {EventRealm}, until now. As a destined night dawns at the distant howling of wolves, you are left to reflect upon the reason why you have come here..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_248@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Before you spans a sunless realm of myth and legend, older than the oldest memories of even most {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Here, the pureblood lineage long ago began and reached its historic zenith."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_248@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "In those bygone days, Vampire-kind ruled a blood-hungry dominion that terrorized the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Back then, all purebloods were united under an 'eternal emperor,' now only remembered as the '[hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink]'. Whether through hubris or betrayal, this dominion of terror ultimately crumbled and was banished into {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink} for reasons long forgotten."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_248@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Betrayal undid our greatness, but I aim to restore it once again!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_248@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Hubris caused the downfall of Drevanya, I intend to finish the job.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_248@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"The night summoned me here, its children [unit/] shall show me the way.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_248@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Who cares about the past? I only hunger for blood!\" [xp/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_248@TITLE"
msgstr "Night Falls on Rued Drevanya"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_257@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Who do you give the Cruor Rose to? (TEMP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_257@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You got the Obsidian Rose. (TEMP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_257@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Give this rose to one of the consorts to gain their trust and be offered an alliance. (TEMP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_257@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Give Rose to Princess Consort Mavelith (TEMP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_257@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Give Rose to Prince Consort Wtorakh (TEMP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_257@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Neither! Take it for yourself. (TEMP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_257@TITLE"
msgstr "Obsidian Rose Cheat (TEMP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Husband.TitleFirstName} fingers <<o:Husband>> glistening lip as <<p:Husband>> secretly casts a spell on you that boils your blood. \"Show me how a proper Vampire greets their superior.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "An odd bubbling and boiling occurrence enters your awareness, followed by a low hiss... \"My, oh my... What a quaint, anomalous toy do I here espy?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "From the corner of your eye, you see a hot, crimson mist erupt, out of which a blood soaked figure emerges with distinguished poise: the fabled {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {Husband.TitleFirstName}. \"After ages of solitude, I am finally graced with a fresh new face—and what a face it is... Are you 'one of mine,' perhaps? No matter, I do so believe introductions are in order, wouldn’t you agree? Or has your generation abandoned their manners as they once did the {Emperor.Title}?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Bow down low and courteously. [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Simply regard <<P:Husband>> in silence."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Stand tall and scoff at <<P:Husband>> in defiance! [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Offer <<P:Husband>> a fresh sacrifice of blood. [thralls/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"No one is my superior. Perish you clown!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_264@TITLE"
msgstr "Boiling First Impressions"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you pledge to me, your fabulous Prince, <<p:Husband>>, the Obsidian Rose from the palace of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink]. Then I would be open to sharing a drop of my purest blood.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Charmed, surely,\" smiles the {Husband.Title} with a nod. \"Ah youth, reminds me of myself at that age, skirting etiquette and insolence. So bold, so brazen.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@BODY_HEADER@BOW_LOW"
msgstr "\"Why, my dear supplicant,\" acknowledges {Husband.TitleFirstName}, as <<p:Husband>> makes an aristocratic bow in return, \"You grace your Prince^m with a truly savory class of courteousness.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@BODY_HEADER@RESIST_HUSBAND"
msgstr "\"Oh? You, an [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]Elder[/hyperlink], dare defy me? An {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}?\" chuckles {Husband.TitleFirstName} with a bestial snarl. \"How delicious, how delectable, how... Debonair!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Let us conduct business, shall we,\" begins the {Husband.Title}. \"I know everything about you, {Player.Name}. Seeking to open the crypt of our hallowed '{Emperor.Title},' are you not? For this purpose one would need the blood of <<Co:Emperor>> Consorts—like mine. Now, owing to your... somewhat... remarkable introduction, I daresay I’m budding the desire to—potentially—entertain your dashing enterprise. In exchange, naturally, for a trifling sacrifice.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I will have your blood for boiling mine!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"No thanks.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_268@TITLE"
msgstr "Key to my Desire"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_269@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cp:Husband>> slowly crushes the Obsidian Rose in <<o:Husband>> fist and licks the black sap from <<o:Husband>> palm. \"Can you keep a little secret, my new found ally?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_269@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"For me? Oh, you shouldn’t have,\" feigns {Husband.TitleFirstName}. \"Why, what a gorgeous, magnificent specimen; as, of course, is the rose...\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_269@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Nosing the rose, <<p:Husband>> looks up at you with a slow blink. \"Ah, the smell of true love,\" smiles the {Husband.Title}, \"How null... Well, go on, then. Let us entertain this magnificent enterprise of yours, hmm? Imagine we were to awaken the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink], then what? Praise and glory? Oh no, I must warn you: my Sire^m is no fairytale and pleasing <<CP:Emperor>> is folly indeed. No, our ancient Creator, splendid as <<Cp:Emperor>> may be, is a most wickedly evil mind who accepts no equals—if you 'catch my drift...'\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_269@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"But of course, my Prince.\" [rs_alliance/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_269@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"No thanks. Now hand me your blood!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_269@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"For a price [thralls/], of course.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_269@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"My Prince, you flatter me. Secrets are my specialty.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_269@TITLE"
msgstr "Key to my Desire: Won"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_273@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you are also out to slay this 'Deathless God,' then I have an offer to make,\" <<p:Huntress>> proposes, slowly lowering <<o:Huntress>> arms."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_273@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A foul mortal stench enters your nostrils. Then, a dark, stalking figure appears in sight. \"I know a Vampire when I see one.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_273@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Keeping <<P:Huntress>> hand close to <<P:Huntress>> weapon, <<p:Huntress>> nevertheless regards you with a dark smirk. \"You are not from around here, are you? I reckon you also seek to uncover that so-called '[hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink]' of yours, no? Well, so do I, {Huntress.TitleFirstName}. My reasons require no explanation, I expect.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_273@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Listen to her offer, for now..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_273@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "“I know a hunter when I smell one, prepare to die!” (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_273@TITLE"
msgstr "Two Predators Crossing"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_277@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Declare war on both {Wife.FirstName} and {Husband.FirstName},\" announces {Huntress.FirstName} grimly. \"So I know I can trust you. We kill the Consorts, get their blood, and slay [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Urvatogh[/hyperlink] once and for all. What say you?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_277@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} returns you a thin, honest smile. \"Thank you for hearing me out. I’ll get to the point.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_277@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"My research tells me that the crypt of this '[hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink]' is locked with a blood rite, cast by <<o:Emperor>> Consorts,\" explains {Huntress.FirstName}. \"Most of these fled the realm before it got sealed, save two: {Wife.TitleFirstName} and {Husband.TitleFirstName}. So they stand in our way. Fortunately, they also hate each other's guts, so, if you want to open that crypt, this is what we do...\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_277@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will think about it.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_277@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Why should I trust a Vampire Hunter? Be gone!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_277@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"You dare waste my time, die!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_277@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"It is already done.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_277@TITLE"
msgstr "Enemy of My Enemy"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_278@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cp:Huntress>> cocks <<o:Huntress>> crossbow and passes you a determined glance. \"Let's go hunt some Vampires.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_278@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Nicely done,\" chimes {Huntress.FirstName} with a slightly perplexed grimace."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_278@BODY_HEADER@BADASS"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} stares at you with <<o:Huntress>> mouth slightly agape, before correcting <<r:Huntress>> with a surprised smirk."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_278@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I'll be honest, I doubted you'd do it. With us being on different sides of the aisle, so to speak. But now that you've declared war on both those [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]arch suckers[/hyperlink] I'm quite eager to see this through to the end.\" <<Cp:Huntress>> rummages in <<co:Huntress>> pouch, then glances up at you, before tossing over a jangling bag. \"Don't worry, it's gold. That's your first half of the bounty, because now things are gonna get real serious, real soon.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_278@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Tell me your plan.\" [rs_defensivepact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_278@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Thanks for the gold, fool. Now die!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_278@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I need more gold [gold/] than this before I start listening.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_278@TITLE"
msgstr "Enemy of my Enemy: My Friend"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_284@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} grins lustily, \"There's no begging for mercy now. I will see you in my dungeons!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_284@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "For a brief moment, {Wife.TitleFirstName} curls <<o:Wife>> lip and casts you a disheartened glance."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_284@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Aw...\" <<p:Wife>> sighs airily, \"Looks like you prefer the path of pain, what a pity. Well, for you at least. I, instead, will be looking forward to making you squeal, my naughty little [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]Elder[/hyperlink].\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_284@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_284@TITLE"
msgstr "Pain and Treachery"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_285@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"My mind is set,\" grins the {Husband.Title} as <<p:Husband>> looks away. \"Rue this day, churl. You will soon learn your rightful place.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_285@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "For a brief heartbeat, or even two, {Husband.TitleFirstName} frowns and casts you a pained glance."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_285@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Oh well,\" begins <<p:Husband>>, with a nonchalant flick of <<o:Husband>> wrist, \"What else was I to expect from the boorish likes of an '{GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}'? No matter, it seems I must obtain my adoration 'the usual way...' By force.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_285@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_285@TITLE"
msgstr "Boiling Betrayal"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_290@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"This is where you come in, my sweet,\" smiles {Wife.FirstName}. \"Take my blood, seek out <<Co:Emperor>> crypt and slay that vile swine for me! It would free me from <<Co:Emperor>> influence, at last!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_290@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Oh, I like you,\" observes {Wife.TitleFirstName} with a toothy grin. \"Trust you even. This is why I shall reveal the truth to you, and only you.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_290@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I was <<Co:Emperor>> first victim, you know. And when {Emperor.FirstName} turned me, <<Cp:Emperor>> cast a mind control curse that prevented me from ever harming <<CP:Emperor>>. Oh, I hated being a Vampire, and <<Cp:Emperor>> enjoyed making me suffer. I begged for death, but <<Cp:Emperor>> refused me every time. So, I vowed to see <<CP:Emperor>> destroyed! Yet... All this time I was powerless to do so myself.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_290@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Let us slay <<CP:Emperor>>, together.\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_290@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Anything, for a price...\" [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_290@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"No thanks, I will go it alone.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_290@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood for Blood"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_291@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Far off, a wolf howls into the night, signaling the dawning of a new age for all Vampire-kind. With the throne now vacant, it is yours to claim—and share."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_291@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the dust of war settles and a new moon rises over this realm, {Wife.FirstName} appears besides you with an uncannily earnest smile. \"Freedom...\" <<p:Wife>> whispers."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_291@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I have lost count of the ages that this wretched bastard tormented me. To see <<P:Emperor>> defeated, fills my cold unalive heart with... With...\" Suddenly, {Wife.FirstName} grasps <<o:Wife>> chest with a sigh. Then glances over at you with a wide, toothy grin and curious, pearly eyes. \"What?\" <<p:Wife>> scoffs, as a slight blush fills <<o:Wife>> face. \"Do not just look at your Princess^f like that, do something.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_291@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Offer {Wife.FirstName} your hand."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_291@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood for Blood: New Moon"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_295@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You, however, can do what I could not,\" teases the {Husband.Title}. \"Go to <<Co:Emperor>> crypt, and end the {Emperor.Title} for good! Then, I will be free!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_295@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Husband.TitleFirstName} sighs. \"Being an {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is not all that it seems...\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_295@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I was there when our kind was 'born,' when <<Co:Emperor>> blessings were first distributed. And so too, <<Co:Emperor>> curse... To be bound to the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] for all eternity, and to follow <<Co:Emperor>> dominant will like some wretched puppet on bloodied strings. Ugh, {Emperor.FirstName} made me do... 'unspeakable' things, and I had no will to deny <<CP:Emperor>>. So yes, I admit it, I conspired with {Wife.FirstName} and the others to seal <<CP:Emperor>> away! For, as <<Co:Emperor>> wretched spawn, I could not slay <<CP:Emperor>>...\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_295@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Let us end <<CP:Emperor>> together, my Prince.\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_295@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"For a price [gold/], of course.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_295@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"No thanks, I will go it alone.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_295@TITLE"
msgstr "Thirsting for Regicide"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_296@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Far off, a wolf howls into the night, signaling the dawning of a new age for all Vampire-kind. With the throne now vacant, it is yours to claim—and share."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_296@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the dust of battle settles, a new moon rises above Drevanya. And at this moment {Husband.TitleFirstName} comes before you with a devilish grin."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_296@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Oh my, the taste of freedom,\" whispers {Husband.FirstName}. \"It is the most—wonderful thing! And to think I have you, my dearest {Player.FirstName}, to thank for it.\" A silent moment passes as {Husband.FirstName} just eyes you with curious delight. \"The imperial throne of Drevanya is looking awfully 'empty,' wouldn’t you agree? What say, you and I warm it up a little? I know just the spell.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_296@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take {Husband.FirstName} up on <<o:Husband>> offer."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_296@TITLE"
msgstr "Thirsting for Regicide: Quenched"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_300@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} looks into your eyes with furious determination. \"{Emperor.FirstName} must be stopped. Go, lead the way to the {EventStructure}, only a Vampire can enter it.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_300@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Before we begin,\" sighs {Huntress.FirstName}, \"I think it is important that you know what we are up against...\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_300@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You probably don’t need to be told what is at stake here, but let me spell it out for you, regardless. {Emperor.FirstName} sired the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]Archvampires[/hyperlink], like {Wife.FirstName} and {Husband.FirstName}. These, in turn, sired most [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]Elder Vampires[/hyperlink], like yourself. If {Emperor.FirstName} were to return, all Archvampires and their spawn would instantly flock to <<o:Emperor>> side. Together, they would unleash an unstoppable, united front against all the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_300@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Let us slay this 'Deathless God', together.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_300@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"On second thought, I will go on alone.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_300@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Ignorant fool. I long to see all Vampires united! Now die!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_300@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Yes {Huntress.FirstName}, look into my eyes...\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_300@TITLE"
msgstr "Death to the Deathless God"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_301@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Far off, a wolf howls into the night, ushering a new age for Vampire-kind. What the future holds, none can tell, and perhaps it is better this way."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_301@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With <<o:Emperor>> banishment complete, the crypt of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] lies in ruins before you and your job here is done."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_301@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Impressive stuff,\" observes {Huntress.FirstName} with a remarkable hint of awe. <<Cp:Huntress>> stands besides you for a while and takes in the devastation you wrought. \"I mean it, you know. You prevented the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]Archvampires[/hyperlink] from reuniting under a common master, once more. I gotta admit, I never thought I’d feel any kind of admiration for a Vampire in my life, but you... Well, you changed everything.\" {Huntress.FirstName} stops and chuckles. \"What is your name, anyway?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_301@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Walk off into the night."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_301@TITLE"
msgstr "Unsung Hero of the Night"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_305@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Prepare yourself well! Explore the {EventStructure} to come face to face with the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Vampire Progenitor[/hyperlink] <<Cr:Emperor>> and bring about the long awaited Blood Reckoning."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_305@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the blood of the Consort in your possession, you can finally unseal the crypt that drew you to this realm, all along."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_305@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "All Vampire-kind draw their origin from a single source: the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink], the Sire^m of all, <<Cp:Emperor>> who spread <<Co:Emperor>> blessing and <<Co:Emperor>> curse upon the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink} from the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]First Brood[/hyperlink], to eventually even you. The sunless lands, the rivers of blood, the hunger and the power, all these came about through <<Co:Emperor>> awesome and terrible power."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_305@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I am the reckoning.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_305@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "... Feast on your thralls for blood. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_305@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "... Feast on your thralls for glory. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_305@TITLE"
msgstr "Sepulchral Pilgrimage"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_306@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Far off, a wolf howls into the night. With the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] defeated, <<o:Emperor>> throne and title remains vacant for the taking..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_306@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Blood for blood! By your hand, {Emperor.Name} was defeated and the legends of his 'deathless' greatness were proven false."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_306@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "This was the 'Blood Reckoning' that ushered in a new age for all Vampire-kind, one freed from the oppressive inheritance of their creator. Your actions on this realm leveled the hierarchy order which long segmented Vampire-kind, since time immemorial. For if you, an {GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink} could topple the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] without consequences, what then stops the Lesser Vampire Spawn from rebelling against their own Sires in turn? No, your legacy shall surely inspire generations of Vampires who will strive to follow in your footsteps."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_306@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"My legacy will be undying.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_306@TITLE"
msgstr "A Legacy Undying"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_315@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"{Player.FirstName}, my deliverer,\" <<p:Emperor>> darkly declares. \"I have dreamed of this very moment for days beyond number. And now, like a prayer made flesh, you have come. Welcome.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_315@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A stark, haunting melody reverberates across the light-abandoned halls and corridors of dark stone that makes up the underground necropolis beneath the bleeding mound."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_315@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Following the music to its source reveals a forgotten city of the dead, welled all in a majestic, yet sorrowful leitmotif, reminiscent of a long lost love. Then, the music abruptly ends and a tyrannical silence wholly conquers the auricular void, a silence so intense it creates a gaping vacuum into oblivion itself. Yet, from that void, a deep, sonorous voice emerges drenched in immemorial sovereignty and remorse..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_315@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Reveal yourself.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_315@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "(DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_315@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Fight and defy the Deathless God! (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_315@TITLE"
msgstr "Prelude to a Moonless Dark"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_319@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We begin at once. Destroy everyone left upon the realm, leave no soul alive, or unalive. I care not how it is done, but baptize new Drevanya wholly with their blood!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_319@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "For a brief instance, {Emperor.FirstName} closes <<Co:Emperor>> eyes and sheds a single tear. Then, <<Cp:Emperor>> flashes <<Co:Emperor>> eyes with imperial resolve. \"Drevanya shall rise again.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_319@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<Cp:Emperor>> looks at you, and a darkness falls over <<Co:Emperor>> face. \"We shall unleash a Blood Reckoning upon the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} that will stir fear in the hearts of all. Starting with my flawed creations, {Wife.FirstName} and {Husband.FirstName}, those seditious and ungrateful miscreants who still call themselves my Consorts, as any who dare stand to oppose us.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_319@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Thy will be done.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_319@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Behold, I have already done as you wish!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_319@TITLE"
msgstr "Reckoning Upon the Traitors"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_320@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Join me in union, {Player.FirstName} and together we shall dominate the wide {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} with a Vampire dominion grander than before.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_320@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the whole realm covered in the blood of traitors, {Emperor.Name} appears beside you with a dark, pensive glance. \"You have done well.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_320@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<Cp:Emperor>> sighs, then turns to you with a distant smile. \"When I was a younger man,\" begins <<Cp:Emperor>>, \"I made the mistake of satiating the void in my unalive heart with the idle comfort of indulgent Consorts. Ever since, I have had an eternity to reconsider my childish appetites and come to understand that partnership is, ultimately, a union of power. And on this day, {Player.FirstName} you are the most powerful Vampire I have ever known.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_320@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The reckoning is ours.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_320@TITLE"
msgstr "A Reckoning Unequaled"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_341@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Hissing whispers eminate from the shadow-veiled chasm found below the sacrifical altar... (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_341@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You sacrificed the Paramour's Pledge and cleared the crypt, but did not discover the Deathless God... (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_341@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The stiffened Vampire corpse was a ruse, this is not the Deathless God. Where could He be found? The heart is gone, the fountain of blood is all syphoned into the floor... But wait! Upon inspecting the altar a peculiar outline is detected in the dais, the ebony, carven altar can be moved to reveal a great, abbysmal chasm underneath. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_341@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Could it be?\"... (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_341@TITLE"
msgstr "Desecrating the Unholy Crypt (PLACEHOLDER EVENT)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_377@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Lo, this is the vacated {EventStructure}. Its shadowed halls and corridors are said to harbor unspeakable secrets, as well as a single rose of legendary splendor..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_377@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon yonder hill dawns an awesome yet doleful structure. It appears abandoned though it still emanates a powerful, evil aura."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_377@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The grounds before the rose-choked palace are marked by blood-soaked swamps, reeking with the odious stench of death. Its silent inner courtyard is fended off with a vast creeping wall of razor sharp thorn bushes, overseen by petrified gargoyles that ward off unwanted visitors... They protect the unhallowed place where countless lives of mortals were sacrificed in ancient blood rites and orgies in the bygone days when the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Blood Emperor Eternal[/hyperlink] reigned supreme."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_377@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Press on."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_377@TITLE"
msgstr "Palace of the Pale Prince"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The endless corridors of the maze bend and wind with uncanny vastness. All who enter it always exit the very same way they came in..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@BODY_FOOTER@HAVE_QUEST"
msgstr "The endless corridors of the maze bend and wind with uncanny vastness. But a familiar voice strokes your mind and guides your way onward, towards a host of thorned, skeletal protectors..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "High upon a rocky protrusion stands the {EventStructure}, surrounded by a vast, living maze of rose-choked hedges."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "This fiendish maze exudes a terrible ancient aura born of a blood magic most foul, long ago woven by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] <<Cr:Emperor>>. Approaching it, one can hear the faint, ghastly wailing of a thousand sacrificed victims. The tributary souls to the {Emperor.Title}, back in the heyday of Drevanya's splendor... Now, their unending suffering feeds and twists the rose-choked foliage of their own prison."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Dispel [mana/] the warding spell protecting the maze."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Abandon the maze, for now."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Follow the voice of Princess Consort Mavelith. [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Follow the voice of Prince Consort Wtorakh. [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_378@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood Swamped and Amazed"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The Obsidian Rose gleams like a gem. It is a living, immortal plant exuding a powerful aura of shadow magic, and now it is yours."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon defeating the host of undead rose guards, the Rose Palace of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] is free to explore."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "At the sound of a thunderstrike, the great doors decorated with the insignia of a rose, open. Beyond lies a rose chocked palace filled with countless many abandoned ballrooms and drawing rooms caked all in dried splashes of blood. Ascending the dusty stairs leads you to the top-most tower. Its doors open to reveal a curious glasshouse, filled with many withered roses. But in its center grows a single Obsidian Rose, so magnificent it boggles the mind!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Give the Obsidian Rose to Princess Consort Mavelith. [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Give the Obsidian Rose to Prince Consort Wtorakh. [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Take the rose for yourself and siphon its power! [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BUTTON_2@HAVE_QUEST"
msgstr "Take it for yourself and siphon its power. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Claim this bounty of shadow and scrutinize its power. [shadowboon/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Obtain this marvel of nature and use it to enhance your crops! [natureboon/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_380@TITLE"
msgstr "The Obsidian Rose"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A mad rapture overcomes the cultists as they all charge at you, knives in hand. As many more figures emerge from the shadows of the chamber..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BODY_FOOTER@NO_KEY"
msgstr "The last line reads: \"In His body forever undying, but in our memory hereafter unlived. May He rest in misery.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Like the motions of a dream, the great stone doors that sealed this crypt for untold ages, open before you without sound or vibration; vanishing, as if they never actually existed..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BODY_HEADER@NO_KEY"
msgstr "Before you stands a grand, abandoned blood-fountain memorial. It is built around a massive, elaborately inscribed stone slab, which reads:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Stepping into the blackness beyond, you are overcome by the scent of bedrock, blood, and candle wax. Before long, a narrow, candlelit chamber reveals itself, attended by a host of hooded figures all murmuring around a rose chocked statue of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink]. With your arrival, the cultists all look up, their eyes sparkling with raptured delight. \"The reckoning,\" one cultist cackles. \"The hour of the Blood Reckoning has come, at last! Brothers and sisters, rejoice! By the Deathless God, let our blood be spilled in celebration—spill it now!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BODY_LORE@NO_KEY"
msgstr "\"Two rose-torn lovers spilled blood and conceive a curse; a sunless land drenched in rivers of red. One broken heart conjured new lovers coerced; to never be true loves, but servants instead. Thirteen consorts neglected, pledged their blood here to amerce; and sealed thus their Sire in perdition and dread.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Retreat!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BUTTON_0@NO_KEY"
msgstr "Return later."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Spill their blood!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@TITLE"
msgstr "Raptured for the Reckoning"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_410@TITLE@NO_KEY"
msgstr "Loveless and Deathless"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_411@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Moving the statue reveals a hidden, blood-well leading even further down into the bowels of the earth. And deep from within its eternal darkness echoes the faint haunting sound—of music."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_411@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Red! Red! Red! After the battle, the whole chamber is drenched in blood and bodies covering everything so completely in crimson it nigh stirs your Vampiric bloodlust to delirium."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_411@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "But as you stand there, up to your ankles in blood, listening to the sound of your own breath, a sudden clarity enters your awareness: If this crypt was sealed, how did these mortal cultists get in? And where is <<Cp:Emperor>>? Where in damnation is the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink]? You sharpen your senses and search every corner of this remarkably small crypt, but find nothing. However, after a while, you notice how all the blood in the room drains towards the foot of the statue..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_411@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Follow the music to its source."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_411@TITLE"
msgstr "Rhapsody of a Reckoning"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_423@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "'{Husband.TitleFirstName}' and '{Wife.TitleFirstName}'. Surely these must know <<Co:Emperor>> unhallowed name, perhaps if you simply ask them? (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_423@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Following the mysterious pull has led you to a dark and hallowed mound, where it was said all vampire-kind once originated. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_423@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "In its southern shadow stands a monument, bathed in blood. It lists the names of those who were witness to the birth of Nightborne Sire in <<Co:Emperor>> ascended vampire form. At its top are the names of <<Co:Emperor>> unholy consorts, most of which are violently scratched through, save for two... (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_423@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "I might consider this. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_423@TITLE"
msgstr "Bloodied Stele (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_427@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "To unseal the crypt, one needs to seek out {Wife.TitleFirstName} and {Husband.TitleFirstName}, and obtain their blood—one way or another."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_427@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "So, the crypt of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] is sealed with the blood of <<Co:Emperor>> Consorts, and only their blood can make it undone."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_427@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Little is actually known about the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] besides cultic myth and legend. But amongst [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]Elder Vampires[/hyperlink] it is well known that the Deathless God created the First Brood, the dreaded [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]Archvampires[/hyperlink]. Of this brood, <<Cp:Emperor>> selected a harem of Consorts whom <<Cp:Emperor>> bound to <<Co:Emperor>> indomitable will. It appears, however, that they conspired to lock their Deathless God away in this crypt. How and why, well, only the remaining Consorts could tell."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_427@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I know what to do.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_427@TITLE"
msgstr "Spouse Hunting"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_428@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Either oblige the Consorts in their quest, or defeat them in battle and collect their blood from their corpses. The choice is yours..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_428@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You have found both {Wife.TitleFirstName} and {Husband.TitleFirstName}, and both acknowledged they sealed the {EventStructure} with their blood."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_428@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Both seemed eager to obtain this Obsidian Rose, their reasons why remain unclear... Regardless, a decisive choice now rests on your consciousness: will you oblige them in their little challenge and hope they will stay true to their word, or will you draw their blood by force?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_428@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Obtain the Obsidian Rose, if only for now."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_428@TITLE"
msgstr "Spouse Hunting: Found Your Match"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_429@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Pursue the bloody path of war!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_429@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Press on, and torture a Thrall [thralls/] or two to woo {Wife.TitleFirstName}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_429@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Press on, and sacrifice a Thrall [thralls/] or two to woo {Husband.TitleFirstName}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_430@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I should, perhaps, remain vigilant...\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_430@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I do not care either way; I only crave blood!\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_453@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "What was once sealed with blood shall soon be unsealed with it. Defeat either {Wife.TitleFirstName} or {Husband.TitleFirstName} to obtain their blood."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_453@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "It is only natural for Vampires to rival their peers. From life to unlife, from Spawn to Sire^m, from peer to rival, from [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]Elder[/hyperlink] to {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_453@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Yes. Inevitably, all Vampires sire new spawn. The 'Sire^m,' or 'Dam^f,' is thereafter the steward and overlord of their progeny, often governing their every action. That is, until the spawnling eventually becomes powerful enough to rival their maker... This ruthless powerplay of dominance dictates the lifecycle of virtually all Vampires: one either dominates, or is themselves dominated. So what will it be?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_453@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Their blood will be mine.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_453@TITLE"
msgstr "Climbing the Food Chain"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_456@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You have obtained the exalted blood of an {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink} Consort. Though... Do you really need all of it to open the {EventStructure}?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_456@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{ConsortKilled} is defeated! Now, the once pale, sunless earth is stained with the pure blood of an {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_456@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Unlike the {GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, only a limited select brood of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept]Archvampires[/hyperlink] was ever sired into existence by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink]—let alone made into <<Co:Emperor>> Consort. Now, by your fangs, there exists even one less upon the realm of {EventRealm}!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_456@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Abstain from your hunger [goodact/], you are greater than this. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_456@TITLE"
msgstr "Climbing the Food Chain: Near the Top"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_473@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"The blood of the Consort is already mine!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_474@BODY_FOOTER@GOT_BLOOD"
msgstr "You have obtained the exalted blood of an {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Press on to the {EventStructure} to awaken the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Progenitor of all Vampire-kind[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_474@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Commit Diablerie [evilact/] and consume a portion of this exalted blood! [xp/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_474@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Cast a Hemoc Rite [thralls/] with this exalted blood to expand your reign. [food/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_474@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Collect all the blood, but reserve a portion for your studies. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_474@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"The Blood Reckoning draws near!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_485@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Slay either {Wife.TitleFirstName} or {Husband.TitleFirstName}, and get their blood. Then we can open the crypt and put an end to {Emperor.Name}.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_485@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} regards you with a studious stare. \"All right, now for the easy part of the plan.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_485@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Let's do what I do best, and see if you do too. Kill Vampires. Then, you do what your kind does best: all that wretched blood voodoo, to open the crypt. As established, we will need the blood of the Consorts to perform your—rite, so you know what that means?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_485@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The hunt is on.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_485@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"That is a terrible plan. I am going my own way.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_485@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Their blood is already mine.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_485@TITLE"
msgstr "The Hunt is On"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_486@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} looks up at you with an impatient glint in <<o:Huntress>> eye. \"Your move, partner.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_486@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With {ConsortKilled} defeated, {Huntress.FirstName} approaches you with an ambitious glint in <<p:Huntress>> eye."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_486@BODY_HEADER@SUPERBADASS"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} steps back and gasps. \"H– How? Who?...\" <<p:Huntress>> stutters with wide eyes. \"That is some superior huntsmanship!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_486@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Impressive work—'partner', \" grins {Huntress.FirstName}. \"With this blood we can open the {EventStructure} and do what was long thought impossible. My, how I have dreamed of this moment, and to think it would happen with a bloody Vampire by my side, pha!\" <<Cp:Huntress>> stares off into the distance for a moment, then whispers, \"Mother would be proud...\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_486@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Time to hunt the big game, partner.\" [rs_alliance/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_486@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Partner? This blood is mine and mine alone, perish!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_486@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I do not need a partner, I need gold.\" [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_486@TITLE"
msgstr "The Hunt is On: Success!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_491@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cp:Emperor>> reaches out <<o:Emperor>> hand and whispers, \"Arbiter of the Blood Reckoning, reveal to me what I have longed to learn for all eternity: shall we reign together, forever; or will you be my coveted destruction?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_491@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "From the lightless void, two ivory fangs emerge, followed by eyes blazing like portals into the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Endailon of Shadow[/hyperlink] itself. <<Co:Emperor>> exalted gaze arrests your full attention."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_491@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Thank you for unsealing me, my peerless progeny,\" confides {Emperor.Name}. \"And what a magnificent Vampire you are... All My sealed slumber I have dreamed of your arrival {Player.Name}. Yet now, witnessing you here before Me, in all your majestic perfection, I must declare: you are a sight more glorious than dreams could ever conceive.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_491@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Join the Deathless God at <<Co:Emperor>> awakened side."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_491@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Vow to destroy the Deathless God!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_491@TITLE"
msgstr "Face of the Fanged Creator"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_492@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "DEPRECATEd"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_492@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_492@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_492@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_492@TITLE"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_493@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cp:Emperor>> glances at you longingly for a space, before turning away and drawing <<o:Emperor>> weapon. \"Blood for blood.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_493@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "For a brief instance, {Emperor.FirstName} smiles upon you with earnest affection. \"You are exactly as I had hoped you would be, my progeny of doom.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_493@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Oh, how I hunger for your best attempt at my life, {Player.FirstName},\" laments {Emperor.Name} with bitter melancholy. \"Though my longing might very well be in vain, as always. Regardless—come, let us join in this black dance of bloodshed I am eternally fated to perform.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_493@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Blood for blood.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_493@TITLE"
msgstr "Reckoning Upon the Creator"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_508@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} studies you with calculative intent. \"So tell me, are you still considering my offer, or what?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_508@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In your moment of determination, {Huntress.FirstName} reaches out to you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_508@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<Cp:Huntress>> eyes you with a nasty smile. \"I've been keeping my eyes on you. You are up to something, aren’t you?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_508@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I am, just be patient.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_508@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"No, I am going my own way.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_508@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"You; spying on me? This means war!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_508@TITLE"
msgstr "Bloody Conflict of Interests"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_513@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Yes, here lies the Crypt of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink]. Though, from a distance, it shows no obvious entry. Better inspect it up close."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_513@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "All about you lies a blood moor, far, far older than any {GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. The rancid air is stale and thick with decay."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_513@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Rivers of blood seep down the great hill, leading towards a deep depression in the earth. There, in a misty corpse-ridden vale, you find a large, overgrown monument from antiquity. It appears to be—an ancient sepulcher? Or perhaps even a crypt."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_513@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue your quest."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_513@TITLE"
msgstr "A Sepulcher Sealed Shut"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_516@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Heaving from exhaustion, a crazed cackle emerges from <<o:Wife>> trembling form. \"Very well. Lesson learned: Never. Trust. Anyone. Ever! Time to kill. Kill. Kill!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_516@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "For a long instance, {Wife.TitleFirstName} stares at you with wide perplexed eyes, <<o:Wife>> mouth agape and trembling."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_516@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You...\" <<p:Wife>> seethes with a dry throat. \"You vile wretched liar! You cursed rat, you! I will tear your throat out for this! I’ll pull your fangs and tear you limb from limb, I’ll... I’ll...\" <<Co:Wife>> face and body tremble with a fit of hysteria as <<p:Wife>> throws <<o:Wife>> head back and screams out to the sky like a banshee!"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_516@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Time to kill, indeed.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_516@TITLE"
msgstr "Deep Stinging Betrayer"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_517@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"N–no matter,\" <<p:Husband>> stammers with a vile, widening grin. \"'Tis my fault entirely for trusting the inferior class. This error shall be corrected shortly, with furious determination!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_517@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Husband.TitleFirstName} looks at you with red-hot, furious intent. <<Co:Husband>> nostrils flare and steam comes out from <<o:Husband>> skin."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_517@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"How could you do this to me,\" <<p:Husband>> demands with a growling tremor in <<o:Husband>> voice. \"To me? {Husband.TitleName}! You impudent peasant! You do not know what you have done! You do not...\" <<Cp:Husband>> corrects <<r:Husband>> with a dismissive gesture of <<o:Husband>> trembling hands."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_517@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Do your worst.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_517@TITLE"
msgstr "Hot Blazing Betrayer"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_518@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You made it personal now, sucker,\" <<p:Huntress>> grins darkly. \"I'm gonna carve a stake with your name on it. Come and get it!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_518@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} turns towards you with a look of stupefied surprise on <<o:Huntress>> brows, before spitting out a silent curse."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_518@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Well, can’t say I'm entirely surprised,\" <<p:Huntress>> grumbles. \"Hurt? Sure, a little. But surprised? From being backstabbed by a no-good, lousy Vampire? Nah, it's in your vile, blood-sucking nature, isn’t it? Wretched abominations; the whole lot of you!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_518@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Your death will be my pleasure.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_518@TITLE"
msgstr "Bloody Double Crosser"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_521@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Wife.TitleFirstName} chokes in <<o:Princess>> scream and then falls eerily silent as {Emperor.Name} wholly dominates <<o:Wife>> mind. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_521@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Very well, {Player.FirstName},\" grins {Emperor.Name} as <<p:Emperor>> begins a powerful blood-rite. \"You leave me no choice but to level our imminent playing field.\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_521@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Then, {Wife.TitleFirstName} is summoned forth, screaming and screeching as she tears at <<P:Wife>> hair. \"No! No! Not again you wretched pig! Get out of my head! Aaaaargh!\"[br/][br/]{Emperor.Name} bleeds out of <<o:Emperor>> eyes, as <<p:Emperor>> snarls bestially. \"Silence, you insolent strumpet,\" sneers <<p:Emperor>>. \"I will deal with your treachery later. First, we have a reckoning to honor. To me, my Consort!\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_521@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it.\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_521@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Attempt to thwart the spell! (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_521@TITLE"
msgstr "Tormented Renewal of Vows (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_532@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Husband.TitleFirstName} chokes in <<o:Husband>> stutters and then falls eerily silent as {Emperor.Name} wholly dominates <<o:Husband>> mind. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_532@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Very well, {Player.FirstName},\" grins {Emperor.Name} as <<p:Emperor>> begins a powerful blood-rite. \"You leave me no choice but to level our imminent playing field.\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_532@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Then, {Husband.TitleFirstName} is summoned forth, stuttering and resistant as a bloody sweat breaks out on <<o:Husband>> forehead. \"Mercy, my Sire^m,\" begs <<p:Husband>>. \"{Wife.FirstName} made me do it I swear! I was ever your faithful Consort!\"[br/][br/] {Emperor.Name} bleeds out of <<o:Emperor>> eyes, as <<p:Emperor>> snarls bestially. \"Silence, you insolent cur,\" sneers <<p:Emperor>>. \"I will deal with your treachery later. First, we have a reckoning to honor. To me, my Consort!\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_532@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it.\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_532@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Attempt to thwart the spell! (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_532@TITLE"
msgstr "Forceful Jubilee of Vows (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_533@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Come, cease your struggle, my ecstasy,\" offers {Emperor.Name}. \"Join my side, where you rightfully belong! And together, we shall unleash a reckoning that shall inspire terror into even the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_533@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Emperor.Name} comes before you, <<o:Emperor>> eyes glitter and sparkle like a galaxy as <<p:Emperor>> addresses you with delicate speech. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_533@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{Player.FirstName}, I admire your fighting spirit,\" coaxes <<p:Emperor>>. \"Indeed. You are ethereally magnificent as you grace the earth with your grand, impeccable sense of purpose. The very ground beneath your feet is utterly unworthy of your presence, and it fills me with rapturous, elevated pride to know that you are my progeny. My ultimate creation, perfection made flesh.\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_533@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"No means no!\" (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_533@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Accept the offer and join the Deathless God after all. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_533@TITLE"
msgstr "Charms of the Deathless God (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_547@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With a shudder, a realization dawns... Was this, {Emperor.Name}? Did <<Cp:Emperor>> truly just reach out to you?"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_547@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Suddenly, a curious, cold breeze brushes your senses. It carries an eerie murmur, a whisper from the beyond..."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_547@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Sharpening your Vampiric senses, you notice how the ghastly sigh contains audible words. \"My... Deliverer...\" it says. \"Come... Come to me. Unseal it... Unseal the Crypt...\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_547@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will find you yet!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_547@TITLE"
msgstr "Whispers from the Crypt"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_EVENT@1229_619@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood of Consorts"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALMS@NAME"
msgstr "Blood and Courtship"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@AISTARTINGBONUS@DESCRIPTION@EMPEROR"
msgstr "Ruler starts with additional structures unlocked and extra heroes."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@AISTARTINGBONUS@NAME@EMPEROR"
msgstr "Starting Bonus Emperor"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@ANCIENT_WONDER@CRIMSON_FANE@ALT_STRUCT_DESCR"
msgstr "This now long shunned and overgrown sepulcher was long ago erected both to entomb the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] and to memorialize the creation of all Vampire-kind. Legend tells that a kingdom of roses once prospered upon this hill, where, one day, two lovers met and ultimately bled to death. Through this unholy ordeal, the first Vampire arose who, thereafter, sired many more."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@ANCIENT_WONDER@FANE_CRYPT@ALT_STRUCT_NAME"
msgstr "Crypt of the Deathless God"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@ANCIENT_WONDER@ROSE_PALACE@ALT_STRUCT_DESCR"
msgstr "Countless blood orgies were had within the walls of this accursed place. And through the sacrifice of untold many souls, an evil spell was woven about it, arresting the whole estate in time—warding off both ruin and looters. For an enchanted, thorny maze creeps about it, which is said to protect a singular, true love’s rose cultivated within the top-most tower."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@ANCIENT_WONDER@ROSE_PALACE@ALT_STRUCT_NAME"
msgstr "Blood Emperor’s Rose Palace"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "As an {GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, return to the rued origin realm of all Vampire-kind. Foil or court its two feuding {GLOBAL.ArchvampireLoreConcept.Hyperlink} guardians, as you venture to uncover the mythical Crypt of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Deathless God[/hyperlink] and bring about a long awaited reckoning of blood."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@NAME"
msgstr "Rued Drevanya"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@SITE@FANE_CRYPT@ALT_STRUCT_NAME"
msgstr "Bloodsink Altar of Revival"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_01@SITE@THORNED_HEART@ALT_STRUCT_NAME"
msgstr "Shattered Rosewood of the Endailon"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Ages ago, in a time when the forces of elemental might roamed the cosmos, a prince betrayed his lover and through this bloodshed was accursed. Thus arose a being of great power and allure, neither dead nor alive, who fed on the living and prospered in shadows: The first Vampire."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This Vampire would spread his curse of power and damnation through his lethal 'kiss.' Through this, he became the Deathless God; a scourge who invaded and enthralled entire realms. And yet, after being born from betrayal, betrayal would be his downfall... For unrest rose from within."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "False love sealed the Deathless God in a crypt, and the unrest that followed damned him and his entire Realm to the World Vault called Grexolis. As the first Vampire was reduced to myth and legend, the Vampires who remained were hunted down or fled into the shadows."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "But then, after Ages of banishment, the realm of the undying first Vampire emerged from Grexolis' oblivion. Few remembered the cruel Deathless God, but many Vampires knew the myth of the Blood Reckoning, when the Deathless God would awaken once more and the Age of Vampires would begin.[br/][br/]This is the story of the Vampire who would bring forth this Blood Reckoning."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@CHOSE_SIDE_HUNTRESS@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_01"
msgstr "Continue with the Huntress Quest, but end your own. (For now...)"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@CHOSE_SIDE_HUNTRESS@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_02"
msgstr "Ends the Huntress Quest, continue on your own."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_01_RECKONING@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus by the hand of his progeny the Deathless God was raised from his dark slumber, and at his royal command the scattered Vampire aristocracy were summoned to the imperial crypt of Drevanya. There they paid homage to the Deathless God and the Godir who freed him."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_01_REGICIDE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus, the Deathless God was slain by one of his own progeny. This Blood Reckoning was felt by all Vampires far and wide, and in their cold and blackened hearts stirred the anxious fear of anarchy... And opportunity."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_02_RECKONING@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The legends of Urvatogh’s cruel greatness would once again impel the Worlds Within to shudder, for his long avowed Blood Reckoning had only just begun... with his savior beside him, expected to abide in his shadow forever."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_02_REGICIDE@CONSORT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "With his crypt now unsealed and vacant, the title, throne, and Dominion of the Blood Emperor Eternal would belong to the Vampire Godir who had banished him. Together with a newfound consort, this Godir would bring about the new Age of Vampires."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_02_REGICIDE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "With his crypt now unsealed and vacant, the title, throne, and Dominion of the Blood Emperor Eternal would belong to the Godir who had banished him. And it was this Godir who would bring about the new Age of Vampires."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_02_REGICIDE@HUNTRESS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "With his crypt now unsealed and vacant, the title, throne, and Dominion of the Blood Emperor Eternal would once again fall to oblivion, as the hunt against Vampires waxed fierce... Even by their own kin."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@GIVE_ROSE_HUSBAND@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_01"
msgstr "You gain three <<m:{EventUnit}>> of the {EventRace.Name}."

