msgstr "Summon Blood Exarch"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL2@AUTOSPELL"
msgstr "At the start of the caster's turn:[bulletlist][bullet/]Up to {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_ENEMY_TARGETER>NumTargets} enemy units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustain {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Physical} {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Have a base {BLOOD_PARASITE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of gaining {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLOOD_PARASITE.Hyperlink} for {BLOOD_PARASITE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist][bullet/]Up to {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_FRIENDLY_TARGETER>NumTargets} friendly units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Heal for {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_HEAL>NumHitpointsToRestore} <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FORTUNE.Hyperlink} for {FORTUNE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When cast and for the next {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_UNIT_AUTO_SPELL>TimeToLive} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>:[bulletlist][bullet/]Up to {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_ENEMY_TARGETER>NumTargets} enemy units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustain {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Physical} {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Have a base {BLOOD_PARASITE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of gaining {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLOOD_PARASITE.Hyperlink} for {BLOOD_PARASITE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist][bullet/]Up to {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_FRIENDLY_TARGETER>NumTargets} friendly units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Heal for {TEARS_OF_THE_CRIMSON_SOVEREIGN_HEAL>NumHitpointsToRestore} <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FORTUNE.Hyperlink} for {FORTUNE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL2@NAME"
msgstr "Tears of the Crimson Sovereign"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL3@BUFF_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Has +{MANTLE_OF_THE_BLOOD_NOBLE_HP_BONUS>BONUS>HitPoints} <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Receives +{MANTLE_OF_THE_BLOOD_NOBLE_HEAL_MODIFIER>ResolvedHealing Multipli}% healing in combat.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Grants enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COAGULATE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]At the start of combat, for each friendly non-summon Tier I and Tier II unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount1} <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]+{amount2}% healing received in combat.[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL3@NAME"
msgstr "Mantle of the Blood Noble"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL3@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Has {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COAGULATE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]At the start of combat, for each friendly non-summon Tier I and Tier II unit, gains:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount1} <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]+{amount2}% healing received in combat.[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Tier III, IV, and V units you own gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount1} {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink} regeneration on the world map.[bullet/]Gain {amount2} {GLOBAL.ExperienceConcept.Hyperlink} per turn on the world map.[/bulletlist][bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.CrimsonCourtMagistrateConcept.Hyperlink}, letting you gain mana from Vassal and when Migrating, Razing, or Pillaging.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL4@NAME"
msgstr "Crimson Court"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL4@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Has +{CRIMSON_COURT_REGEN_PER_TURN>BONUS>Regen} {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink} regeneration on the world map.[bullet/]Gains {CRIMSON_COURT_XP_PER_TURN>XP} {GLOBAL.ExperienceConcept.Hyperlink} per turn on the world map.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Transform your units as they ritually imbibe blood from an Exarch, granting them:[bulletlist][bullet/]The {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.UNDEAD.Hyperlink} unit type.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.LIFEDRINKER.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Base attacks have a base {BLOOD_PARASITE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLOOD_PARASITE.Hyperlink} for {BLOOD_PARASITE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>. This effect is increased for Single Shot attacks.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL5@NAME"
msgstr "Gift of the Old Blood"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@SKILL5@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]The {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.UNDEAD.Hyperlink} unit type.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.LIFEDRINKER.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Base attacks have a base {BLOOD_PARASITE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLOOD_PARASITE.Hyperlink} for {BLOOD_PARASITE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>. This effect is increased for Single Shot attacks.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Embrace a forgotten and corrupt magic that empowers your high tier units and has your faction embrace an ancient form of undeath, gaining the power to spread <<m:{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLOOD_PARASITE.Hyperlink}>> onto your enemies."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"Blood carries greater power than mortals may think. Does the blood of the Archons not carry their essence? Do we not use blood as payment for our magic? Blood is where the soul resides! And so, we drink, to fill the void within. For the Gift of the Old Blood demands souls to sacrifice... And we have long spent our own.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_CRIMSON_REIGN@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Crimson Reign"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@ABILITY01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Strike target unit and gain <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> equal to {DRAINING_STRIKE_LIFE_STEAL>ResolvedHealProportion}% the damage dealt."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@ABILITY01@NAME"
msgstr "Draining Strike"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@ABILITY02@NAME"
msgstr "Tormenting Lash"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@ABILITY03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Teleport to target hex."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@ABILITY03@NAME"
msgstr "Shadow Step"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Torment your enemies by turning their very actions against them and make your units empowered by pain."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"Make their bodies tremble with torment. For every inch they move, they will pay with grunts of agony. Let suffering drip like honey across their pulsing skin. Make them bow, make them beg, make them plead to their bringer of pain... And save some torment for yourself, for suffering is best inflicted when enjoyed first hand.\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Torment"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@PAIN_BRINGER@NAME"
msgstr "Pain Bringer^f"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target race embraces pain and when hit by an attack gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]{PAINBOUND_MORALE>Morale Change} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]A random positive status effect.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL1@NAME"
msgstr "Painbound"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL1@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When this unit is hit by an attack it gains:[bulletlist][bullet/]{PAINBOUND_MORALE>Morale Change} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]A random positive status effect.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MYTHIC_UNIT.Hyperlink} that torments their enemies and can easily flank them and drain their vitality."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL2@NAME"
msgstr "Pain Bringer"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Attacks of enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Have a base {TORMENTED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.TORMENT.Hyperlink} until the end of combat.[/bulletlist][br/]{LOC.INTERFACE@ENCHANTMENT_NON_REPEATING@INSERT}"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL3@NAME"
msgstr "Tormenting Imbuement"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL3@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit's attacks:[bulletlist][bullet/]Have a base {TORMENTED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.TORMENT.Hyperlink} until the end of combat.[/bulletlist][br/]{LOC.INTERFACE@ENCHANTMENT_NON_REPEATING@INSERT}"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enemy units in a {AGONIZE_UNIT_TARGETER_CIRCLE>AREA>Radius}-hex radius:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustain {AGONIZE_UNIT_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Frost} {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Have a base {AGONIZE_RESISTANCE_CHECK>ResolvedStrength}% chance of gaining {TORMENT_REPEATER>Count} stacks of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.TORMENT.Hyperlink} until end of combat. On failure, inflict {amount} stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.TORMENT.Hyperlink} instead.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL4@NAME"
msgstr "Agonize"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+{amount2} <<m:{GLOBAL.CombatCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.DamageSpellConcept.Hyperlink}>> and <<m:{GLOBAL.DebuffSpellConcept.Hyperlink}>> apply an extra {amount3} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} loss.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]Can only be built in the {GLOBAL.ThroneCityConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL5@MOD_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Targets lose {amount} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SKILL5@NAME"
msgstr "Lens of Anguish"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SPI@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} income.[bullet/]+{amount2} {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink} income.[bullet/]+{amount3} {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount4} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent {GLOBAL.FarmConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+{amount5} {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.ConduitConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TOME_TORMENT@SPI@NAME"
msgstr "[conduit/] Basilica of Lamentation"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "{LOC.DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD@DESCRIPTION_SHORT}[br/][bulletlist][bullet/]An {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.UNDEAD.Hyperlink} unit with an [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUNLIGHT_WEAKNESS]aversion to light[/hyperlink].[bullet/]Has access to {GLOBAL.STRUCTURE_UPGRADES.LORD_CASTLE_FOUNDATION.Hyperlink} which replaces the {GLOBAL.STRUCTURE_UPGRADES.WIZARD_TOWER_FOUNDATION.Hyperlink} and grants the use of <<m:{GLOBAL.ThrallConcept.Hyperlink}>> to cast powerful ritual <<m:{GLOBAL.SpellConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Drains {amountXP}% of the combat {GLOBAL.ExperienceConcept.Hyperlink} earned by Turned Vampire heroes.[bullet/]Faction is immune to Sunless terrain's penalties to {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Elder Vampires are <<m:{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.HEROTRAIT_GOVERNANCE_VAMPIRE_GOVERNOR.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Elder Vampires have a {amount3} {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} {GLOBAL.UnitUpkeepConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD@DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgstr "[helpcolor]A deathless Vampire who drains the life from enemies under cover of night.[/helpcolor]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD@HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.VampireLordConcept]Elder Vampire[/hyperlink]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD_HYBRID@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "{LOC.DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD_HYBRID@DESCRIPTION_SHORT}[br/][bulletlist][bullet/]Can be of any form.[/bulletlist][br/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD_HYBRID@DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgstr "[helpcolor]A Vampire descended from one of the many races who inhabit the Astral Sea.[/helpcolor]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD_PUREBLOOD@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "{LOC.DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD_PUREBLOOD@DESCRIPTION_SHORT}[br/][bulletlist][bullet/]Has unique appearance options.[/bulletlist][br/]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRAITS_BACKGROUND_CHARACTERS@MAIN_TYPE@VAMPIRE_LORD_PUREBLOOD@DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgstr "[helpcolor]A Vampire descended from the Archvampires of Drevanya.[/helpcolor]"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_ECHOES_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your transmutation attempts have no effect."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_ECHOES_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@HEADER"
msgstr "Negate the echoes that bounce off the cave walls:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_ECHOES_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Your army's resolve grows against the <<m:EventUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_MAGGOTS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@FAILURE"
msgstr "Nature cannot overcome the manipulation of the <<m:EventUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_MAGGOTS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@HEADER"
msgstr "Negate whatever sway the <<m:EnemyUnit>> have over the <<m:EventUnit>>:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_MAGGOTS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Newly hatched <<m:EventUnit>> attack their willing hosts first."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_MAGGOTS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@FAILURE"
msgstr "The bloodthirst of the <<m:EventUnit>> transcends your foul tasting flesh."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_MAGGOTS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@HEADER"
msgstr "Enchant your army to deter the <<m:EventUnit>> from drinking your blood:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_MAGGOTS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The <<m:EventUnit>> are less likely to inject blood parasites in your warriors."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_TORMENT_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@FAILURE"
msgstr "To <<G:disappointment^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>, pain still does harm."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_TORMENT_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} looks for pleasure in pain too:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_TORMENT_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The same exaltation that inspires the ritualists also benefits {EventHero.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_TORMENT_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@FAILURE"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} and <<o:EnemyUnit>> disciples mock your prudish disapproval."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_TORMENT_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to condemn the <<G:ritualists^p,EnemyUnit>>:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@CRIMSON_FANE_TORMENT_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Your words hit their mark. Your opponents are burdened by shame."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ENTHRALL_HUNTRESS@AFFINITY_CHOICE@FAILURE"
msgstr "Furious, {Huntress.FirstName} resists your attempt to enthrall <<o:Huntress>>."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ENTHRALL_HUNTRESS@AFFINITY_CHOICE@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to enthrall {Huntress.FirstName} in <<P:Huntress>> moment of distraction."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ENTHRALL_HUNTRESS@AFFINITY_CHOICE@SUCCESS"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} becomes your thrall and <<P:Huntress>> {Huntress.Race} follow suit."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ENTHRALL_HUNTRESS@AFFINITY_CHOICE@SUCCESS_ALT"
msgstr "{Huntress.FirstName} becomes enthralled. All <<o:Huntress>> <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> and <<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> will be removed from the map."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@LOST_SOUL@LEVEL_UP_TWICE"
msgstr "{EventHero} gains enough experience to level up [xp/] twice."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@LOST_SOUL@SPIRIT_RES"
msgstr "{EventHero} gains +2 {GLOBAL.SpiritResistanceConcept.Name}[defensespirit/] ."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANQUET_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your summoned tremors fail to crack the Bloodglass windows."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANQUET_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@HEADER"
msgstr "Break the Bloodglass windows to scatter the malicious light:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANQUET_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The cracked glass permits fewer Bloodmoon rays to pass through it."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANQUET_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@FAILURE"
msgstr "The malicious light refuses to bend to your piety."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANQUET_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to bend the devious red light into a Holy Aura:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANQUET_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@SUCCESS"
msgstr "When the red light touches {EventHero}, it empowers <<o:EventHero>> sanctity."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANSHEE_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@FAILURE"
msgstr "{EnemyUnit} sends <<o:EnemyUnit>> <<m:EventUnit>> flying through the visage to attack you."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANSHEE_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@HEADER"
msgstr "Summon a spectral illusion of <<G:husband^n,{EnemyUnit.FirstName}>>, as if he were still alive:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANSHEE_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@SUCCESS"
msgstr "{EnemyUnit} and <<o:EnemyUnit>> <<m:EventUnit>> shriek and briefly cower from despair."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANSHEE_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your illusions have no effect. {EnemyUnit} hisses: \"Have I not been deceived sufficiently?\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANSHEE_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} takes on the guise of the Banshee Queen's husband:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_BANSHEE_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@SUCCESS"
msgstr "\"You?!\", {EnemyUnit} wails. \"Attack my cheating husband first!\""

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_THORNS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@FAILURE"
msgstr "The thorns endure, fortified by magic stronger than yours"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_THORNS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to dethorn the creeping rose vines:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_THORNS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The rose vines lose their thorns and no longer harm your army."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_THORNS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@FAILURE"
msgstr "The creeping vines resisted your cold winds."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_THORNS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@HEADER"
msgstr "Wither the creeping vines that cover the courtyard."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ROSE_PALACE_THORNS_01@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Half of the vines in the courtyard wither away."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@VAMPIRE_RULER_EVENT@BAD_BLOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@FAILURE"
msgstr "{EventHeroB} wins the duel, killing {EventHeroA}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@VAMPIRE_RULER_EVENT@BAD_BLOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@HEADER"
msgstr "Encourage your Heroes to settle their argument with a blood duel:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@VAMPIRE_RULER_EVENT@BAD_BLOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@SUCCESS"
msgstr "{EventHeroA} wins the duel, killing {EventHeroB}."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@VAMPIRE_RULER_EVENT@BAD_BLOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@FAILURE"
msgstr "The rival Heroes continue their quarrel, disrespecting your authority."

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@VAMPIRE_RULER_EVENT@BAD_BLOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@HEADER"
msgstr "Lord over your embraced Heroes:"

msgid "DLC@THRONESOFBLOOD@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@VAMPIRE_RULER_EVENT@BAD_BLOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@SUCCESS"
