msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1024@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "It is said that those who lean too far into [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink] risk stirring the bringer of cataclysms, the harbinger of destruction. The end of realms is heralded by a draconic roar..."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1024@NAME"
msgstr "Dawn of Calamity"

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1024@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "{IntriguePreviousRuler} has been replaced..."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1117@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When a realm is in turmoil and no solution seems to be in sight, the divine machinations of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} bring forth a Judge to restore [hyperlink,GLOBAL.OrderConcept]Order[/hyperlink]. The day of judgment has come."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1117@NAME"
msgstr "Day of Judgment"

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1117@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "{IntriguePreviousRuler} has been replaced..."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1225@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "As immortal souls, many {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} stop fearing death altogether. A grave mistake, for Death itself is not one to taunt. When you play games with the Reaper, make sure you win... and ask not for whom the bell tolls."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1225@NAME"
msgstr "Game of Death"

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_1225@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "{IntriguePreviousRuler} has been replaced..."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@CRISIS@1194_817@DESCRIPTION"
