msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@LORDS@HERO_BIO_1"
msgstr "Xorn used to be a mercenary commander, hired by the former Elven Court on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. As the {GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} invaded, Xorn found himself fighting alongside former enemies. Ever stoic and true to his name, it is said he ascended when he fell holding off an {GLOBAL.EldritchSovereignLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and its armies—an act of bravery still lauded among his people.[br/][br/]Originating from a mercenary army, the Othrakar have since developed a culture and morality of their own. Their myths and legends consist mostly of acts of heroism and overcoming great odds, which is also why they hold their leader in such high reverence."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@LORDS@HERO_BIO_2"
msgstr "Aya's gaze has always drifted beyond the limits of the physical realm. It was her mind that elevated her to become guide to her people and ascended her to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept]Godirhood[/hyperlink]. She has seen many futures and guides her people through them with kindness, but prejudice.[br/][br/]The Simians of the Open Hand value wisdom and harmony above all else, aiming for a life of peace and study. Once threatened, however, they use their inner strength to exploit the weaknesses of their adversaries."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@LORDS@HERO_BIO_3"
msgstr "Megaira was born in the fires of her burning parental home. Since then she has fought for her place in the world of the Pyrekin. She has slain many who challenged her, and even more who happened to be in her way, with tooth and fist if necessary. Thus, she was given the title of Thornfist.[br/][br/]The Pyrekin believe they were born from the heart of the flame that devours the worlds, and thus they need to feed the flame in their hearts. No challenge unanswered, no deed undone, they charge into battle like an inferno and burn all they deem unworthy."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@LORDS@HERO_BIO_4"
msgstr "When his name is whispered on a realm, everyone starts to prepare for war: Woko Ulang, the Apex Slayer, invokes fear even in the most ferocious warriors, for his blade strikes true and his heart knows no respite. After he slew the Elder Jade Dragon Shoqwuna on his home world, Woko Ulang started to travel the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, seeking opponents worth striking down.[br/][br/]The Warring Jungleborn are the relentless tide which Woko Ulang unleashes on the realms he enters. They are agile fighters, jumping from liana to liana, and they will carry the drums of war to anyone unable to flee their rapid expansion in time."

msgid "DLC@WAYSOFWAR@LORDS@HERO_BIO_5"
msgstr "Ever watchful and bold, Grand Vindicator Skonyru judges those who threaten the meek, descending upon them with grim anger. Said to originate from a forgotten kingdom in which the larger and smaller races lived together in harmony, Skonyru is determined to carry on the legacy of his forebears—a noble mission which earned him the allegiance of the Graceful Judges.[br/][br/]Since Skonyru saved them from the pitiless forges of {GLOBAL.KhirUranonLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the Vigilant Smithlings have been his loyal and dexterous followers. Through their special bond, the inner fire of the ogrekin was invoked within them and they became gifted in the carving of runes, making their formidable smithworks able to withstand almost any kind of harm."

