msgid "EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@STRUCTURE_WIZARD_TOWER@LORE"
msgstr "[lorefontsize][lorefont]This crumbled spire was once a mighty Archmage's seat of power. It is constructed in a style often favored by the Wizards of the Circle of Evermore. While some powerful force seems to have destroyed the tower and long vanquished its owner, dangerously arcane energies still seep from within the ruins.[/lorefont][/lorefontsize]"

