msgstr "Lost Wizard Tower"

msgid "EXPLORATIONSITES_STRATEGIC@STRUCTURE_WIZARD_TOWER@SPELL_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]During combat, whenever you cast a {GLOBAL.CombatSpellConcept.Hyperlink}, an astral comet strikes a random enemy unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Enemy units within a {radius} hex radius suffer {damage}, {damage2}, and {damage3}.[bullet/]Obstacles within a {radius} hex radius are destroyed.[/bulletlist][/bulletlist][br/][br/]Requires a captured Fallen Tower {GLOBAL.AncientWonderConcept.Hyperlink}."

