msgid "EXTERNAL_EVENT@RACE_KEEPER_LOST@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The {Race} have decided that they crave a different future. You no longer hold the same sway over them as you did in the past. They have decided to look for a new {GLOBAL.KeeperConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]You are no longer the {GLOBAL.KeeperConcept.Hyperlink} of the {Race}."

