msgstr "Custom content to be used by this {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "FACTION_CREATION@SETTINGS@CITY_NAMES"
msgstr "Create a list of custom {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink} names to be used for cities of your race.[br/]This list will be used from top to bottom when you: [bulletlist][bullet/]Found a new city of your race[bullet/]Migrate a city to your race[/bulletlist]"

msgid "FACTION_CREATION@SETTINGS@HEROES"
msgstr "Create a list of custom <<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>> to be used as unaffiliated heroes in the recruitment pool. The heroes will show up following the order of the list from top to bottom."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DELAY_RAID_TOOLTIP"
msgstr "The invasion army will take {IntDuration} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}>> longer to reach {EventCity.Name}."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_ACTIVE_RAID"
msgstr "From the mists the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} have emerged to lay siege to {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY}."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_CITY_LOST"
msgstr "The {FEY_INVASION_RACE} and their terrifying allies have captured your city of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY}. Every {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}, the city will lose {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} and <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}>>. If {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY} isn't liberated in time, the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} will raze it to the ground!"

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_CITY_LOST_OTHERPLAYER_A"
msgstr "As the mist in the realm of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER} clears away, only ruins and ghosts remain of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY}. It is as if the city and its inhabitants vanished within the mists."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_CITY_LOST_OTHERPLAYER_B"
msgstr "The mists have vanished and the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} are gone. Only time will tell when or where they will strike again..."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_CITY_RAZED"
msgstr "The mists have vanished and the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} are gone. Only time will tell when or where they will strike again..."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_CRISIS_DEFEATED"
msgstr "You have repelled the assault of the {FEY_INVASION_RACE}, pursued them to the Fey realm, and destroyed their relic of power. They will no longer plague this realm with their raids of submission and mass abduction."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_CRISIS_DEFEATED_FINAL"
msgstr "You have repelled the final assault of the {FEY_INVASION_RACE}. They lack the power to return from their Fey realm, making you the undisputed owner and channeler of the {FEY_INVASION_RELIC_NAME}."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_CRISIS_DEFEATED_OTHERPLAYER_A"
msgstr "{FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER} has cleared away the mists on {REALM_NAME}. <<Cp:FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER>> proclaims <<r:FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER>> a savior of the realm, telling wild tales about vanquishing murderous Fey folk armed to defeat even a Godir."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_CRISIS_DEFEATED_OTHER_PLAYER_B"
msgstr "{FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER} has defeated the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} on {REALM_NAME}. <<Cp:FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER>> proclaims <<r:FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER>> a savior of the realm, for the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} will never return to terrorize the realm."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_NEW_RAID"
msgstr "Thick mists have spread near the city of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY.Name}. Rumors of dark figures and people disappearing sow panic among the populace, which is seeking your protection."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_NEW_RAID_FINAL"
msgstr "The mists near the city of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY.Name} herald the beginning of the final {FEY_INVASION_RACE} assault. Any available defenses must be mustered!"

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_NEW_RAID_OTHERPLAYER_A"
msgstr "Stories of a creeping mist haunting the land of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER.Name} are spreading throughout the realm. It is said the city of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY.Name} has started to vanish within the shroud."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_NEW_RAID_OTHERPLAYER_B"
msgstr "The mists near the city of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY} herald the beginning of a {FEY_INVASION_RACE} assault against {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER}."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_PACT_ENDED"
msgstr "With the defeat of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER}, the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} regard their part of the agreement fulfilled. We should not expect them to still honor the former non-aggression pact and prepare for their possible return."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_PACT_ENDED_FAILURE"
msgstr "There are rumors that the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} have lost their {FEY_INVASION_RELIC_NAME} and made a pact with another faction to retrieve it. We must expect the worst from these traitors and prepare for their possible hostile return."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_PORTAL_CLOSED"
msgstr "The entrance to the Fey realm has vanished, and the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} are gone. Until the next time the mists spread..."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_PORTAL_REVEALED"
msgstr "The {FEY_INVASION_RACE} have been driven back! As the mists dissipate, an entrance to the Fey realm has been revealed. This is the opportunity to follow them and strike back—but soon the entrance will collapse."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_PORTAL_SEALED"
msgstr "The entrance to the Fey realm was shattered, and the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} are gone. Until the next time the mists spread..."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_RAID_ABORTED"
msgstr "Irritated by the destruction of their target {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY}, the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} have withdrawn into the mists. Only time will tell when or where they will strike again..."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_RAID_ABORTED_OTHERPLAYER_A"
msgstr "As the mist in the realm of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER} clears away, the scenes of destruction only hint at the terror that was hidden within."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_RAID_DEFEATED_OTHERPLAYER_A"
msgstr "The mists in the realm of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER} have cleared away. Many tales surrounding the horrors that plagued the city of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY} are spreading throughout the land."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_RAID_DEFEATED_OTHERPLAYER_B"
msgstr "The {FEY_INVASION_RACE} have been driven back by {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER} and retreated to the Fey realm. Until the next time the mists spread..."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_RELIC_DENIED"
msgstr "You have denied the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} the return of the {FEY_INVASION_RELIC_NAME}. Full of wrath, they are preparing their final assault to reclaim it."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_RELIC_RECLAIMED"
msgstr "The {FEY_INVASION_RACE} have razed {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY} and retrieved the {FEY_INVASION_RELIC_NAME}. Hopefully this satisfies their lust for vengeance..."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_RELIC_RETURNED"
msgstr "You gave the {FEY_INVASION_RELIC_NAME} back to the {FEY_INVASION_RACE}. In return, they will attack the realm of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_PLAYER.Name}."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_RELIC_STOLEN"
msgstr "The mists have vanished and the {FEY_INVASION_RACE} are gone. But they will not tolerate the loss of their {FEY_INVASION_RELIC_NAME} and return to reclaim it."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_SIEGE_RAID"
msgstr "The {FEY_INVASION_RACE} are besieging your city of {FEY_INVASION_TARGET_CITY}. Every {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}, the city will lose {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} and <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}>> until it has no population left and is razed."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_START"
msgstr "There are ill tales told on {REALM_NAME}, speaking of a thick mist that lays itself upon the land. When it dissipates, villages and entire cities disappear, leaving no trace of their former inhabitants."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_TYPE_REVEALED_AUTUMN"
msgstr "There are ill tales told on {REALM_NAME}, speaking of a thick mist that lays itself upon the land. Interrogating the doomsayer you have learned that when the mists spread, mysterious Fey will come with the tempestuous [damageLightning/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.LightningDamageConcept]Lightning[/hyperlink] of Autumn, to abduct the people of the unprepared."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_TYPE_REVEALED_SPRING"
msgstr "There are ill tales told on {REALM_NAME}, speaking of a thick mist that lays itself upon the land. Interrogating the doomsayer you have learned that when the mists spread, mysterious Fey come with the sprawling [damageBlight/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept]Poison[/hyperlink] of Spring, to abduct the people of the unprepared."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_TYPE_REVEALED_SUMMER"
msgstr "There are ill tales told on {REALM_NAME}, speaking of a thick mist that lays itself upon the land. Interrogating the doomsayer you have learned that when the mists spread, mysterious Fey come with the searing [damageFire/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept]Fire[/hyperlink] of Summer, to abduct the people of the unprepared."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@DESCRIPTION_TYPE_REVEALED_WINTER"
msgstr "There are ill tales told on {REALM_NAME}, speaking of a thick mist that lays itself upon the land. Interrogating the doomsayer you have learned that when the mists spread, mysterious Fey come with the [damageFrost/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept]Frosty[/hyperlink] Shadow of Winter, to abduct the people of the unprepared."

msgid "FEY_INVASION@CRISIS_EVENT@FORESHADOW_EVENT_BUTTON_0"
msgstr "You gain additional information about the \"Toll of Seasons\"."

