msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]{amount} {GLOBAL.StatusResistanceConcept}.[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.NegativeStatusEffectConcept.Hyperlink}>> last {amount2} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>, with a minimum of {amount3}.[/bulletlist]"

