msgid "INTERFACE@CITY@FORTIFICATION_DAMAGE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Fortification Damage represents the speed at which a {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink} progresses to breach the defenses of a {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}[br/][br/]Fortification Damage is subtracted from {GLOBAL.FortificationHealthConcept.Hyperlink} of the {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink} during a {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink} until it is reduced to 0.[br/][br/]Fortification Damage in a {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink} comes from:[bulletlist][bullet/]A base value of {base}[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.SiegeProjectConcept.Hyperlink}>> the besieger is undertaking.[bullet/]Besieging <<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SIEGE_BREAKER.Hyperlink} that are adjacent to the {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

