msgid "INTERFACE@CITY@FORTIFICATION_HEALTH"
msgstr "[garrison/] Fortification Health"

msgid "INTERFACE@CITY@FORTIFICATION_HEALTH_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[garrison/] Fortification Health represents how long the duration of a {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink} will be on a {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}. The greater the [garrison/] Fortification Health, the longer the {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink} will take.[br/][br/]During a {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink}, the besieger will try and reduce the City's [garrison/] Fortification Health to 0 by dealing {GLOBAL.FortificationDamageConcept.Hyperlink}. Fortification Health cannot increase during a Siege.[br/][br/]<<m:{GLOBAL.CityDefenseStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>> are the primary source of [garrison/] Fortification Health.[br/][br/]A City with Fortification Health still requires any Wall structure to be present before a siege is required."

