msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@DEFEAT"
msgstr "Defeat!"

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@DEFEATED_TEXT_GENERIC"
msgstr "You have been defeated. Know that every stone you moved and every word you uttered will leave an everlasting echo in this cosmic symphony."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@DLC2_MISSION_01_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have ended the conflict on Manuhari and unraveled the secrets of the Krazura and their ancestors."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@DLC4_MISSION_02_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have bested the Umbral storm and banished the eldritch general of the invasion!"

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@EXPANSION_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "While some empires lie in ruin,[br/]you dominate this world under the banners of newly formed alliances, proving that strong diplomatic bonds can be more powerful than the largest of armies. In trust and unity, we march forward to a better tomorrow."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@HEADER"
msgstr "The journey of {Player.Name}"

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@LAST_MAN_STANDING_ALLIANCE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "A victor stands proudly upon the remains of their enemies. You subjugated this world through force, as the empires of the past did before you. When the dust settles, you will discover whether your cause was just, or if you merely fanned the flames of entropy."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_ASTRAL_ALLIANCE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your ally {OtherPlayer.Name} has become the Archmage of Astral. Your people look up in awe as you rise together, Astral flows surrounding you and <<P:OtherPlayer>>. Reality itself bends to your will as you welcome the Age of Astral."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_ASTRAL_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your people look up in awe as you rise above your empire, floating on magical currents. Reality bends to your will and magical rifts open as you call forth the Age of Astral.[br/]Well done, Archmage."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_CHAOS_ALLIANCE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your ally {OtherPlayer.Name} has become the <<OtherPlayer{Lord/Lady}>> of Chaos. Your people watch in awe as you stride forth together, leaving madness and destruction in your wake. A red dawn shines upon the realm as you welcome the Age of Chaos and claim your victory."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_CHAOS_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your people watch in awe as you stride forth, leaving madness and destruction in your wake. A red dawn shines upon the realm as you call forth the Age of Chaos.[br/]Well done, <<OtherPlayer{Lord/Lady}>> of Chaos."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_MATERIUM_ALLIANCE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your ally {OtherPlayer.Name} has become the Creator of Materium. Your people watch in awe as you join <<P:OtherPlayer>> and sink your feet into the earth. The realm trembles and reforms beneath your gaze as you welcome the Age of Materium."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_MATERIUM_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your people watch in awe as you sink your feet into the earth and raise your arms. The realm trembles and reforms beneath your gaze, and you call forth the Age of Materium.[br/]Well done, Creator."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_NATURE_ALLIANCE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your ally {OtherPlayer.Name} has become the <<OtherPlayer{God/Goddess}>> of Nature. Your people watch in awe as you stride together. Tree and beast bow before you, heeding the primordial call of their <<OtherPlayer{God/Goddess}>>. A new dawn shines upon the realm as you welcome the Age of Nature."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_NATURE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have become the <<OtherPlayer{God/Goddess}>> of Nature. Your people watch in awe as you stride to the center of your empire. Tree and beast bow before you, heeding your primordial call. A new dawn shines upon the realm as you call forth the Age of Nature and claim your victory."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_ORDER_ALLIANCE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your ally {OtherPlayer.Name} has become <<OtherPlayer{God Emperor/God Empress}>>. Your people watch in awe as you join <<P:OtherPlayer>>, radiant and divine. To gaze upon <<P:OtherPlayer>> is to stare into the light itself. All kneel as you welcome the Age of Order and claim your victory."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_ORDER_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your people watch in awe as you rise from your empire, radiant and divine. To gaze upon you is to stare into the light itself. All kneel before you as you call forth the Age of Order.[br/] Well done, <<OtherPlayer{God Emperor/God Empress}>>."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_SHADOW_ALLIANCE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your ally {OtherPlayer.Name} has become Eternal. Your people watch in awe as you rise together and call upon unending armies. An eternity of cold and death awaits the realm as you welcome the Age of Shadow and claim your victory."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@MAGIC_SHADOW_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Your people watch in awe as you call upon unending armies of frost and undead. An eternity of cold and death awaits the realm as you call forth the Age of Shadow.[br/]Well done, <<OtherPlayer{Eternal Lord/Eternal Lady}>>."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@SCORE_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "Victory is imagined as a dazzling moment of glory, the hero slaying the dragon. In reality, success is the result of a series of small achievements, slowly outpacing all rivals. Well done, Ruler."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@STORY_01_VALLEYOFWONDERS_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have defeated the invading Wizard King Yaka and led your people to a brighter future in the Valley of Wonders. You hear them cheer as you ascend from Athla."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@STORY_02_ENCHANTEDARCHIPELAGO_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have defeated the wizard Nimue and freed the Enchanted Archipelago. Victorious, you return to Magehaven to rejoin the Covenant together with Elya."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@STORY_03_CRIMSONCALDERA_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have defeated the Princes of Obbadoth and claimed the Gildercoil for the Shad'rai. Victorious, you return to Magehaven with your prize."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@STORY_04_ETERNALCOURT_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have broken the curse that threatened the Eternal Court. Victorious, you and Sundren guide Meandor to Magehaven."

msgid "INTERFACE@END_GAME@STORY_05_GREXOLIS_VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have defeated the custodian of Grexolis. After revealing her true identity, Lithyl uses the Gildercoil to open the World Vault..."

