msgstr "Woko Ulang^M"

msgid "INTERFACE@LORE_CONCEPT@WORLDS_WITHIN@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The material worlds embedded within the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. They are the places where mortal races thrive and build their empires, and where the grand plots of the past and coming ages unfold.[br/][br/]According to ancient knowledge, the worlds were drawn from the {GLOBAL.TheWellLoreConcept.Hyperlink} by the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, after which {GLOBAL.DragonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} shaped them and {GLOBAL.GiantsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} refined them. Through the ages, the worlds and their distinguished realms have been altered and reshaped by various factions and forces, making each uniquely distinct in terms of the lay of the land, creatures and people living there, but also the abundance of magic and its representing {GLOBAL.AffinitiesLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "INTERFACE@LORE_CONCEPT@WORLDS_WITHIN@HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept]Worlds Within[/hyperlink]"

msgid "INTERFACE@LORE_CONCEPT@WORLDS_WITHIN@TITLE"
msgstr "Worlds Within"

msgid "INTERFACE@LORE_CONCEPT@WORLD_GATE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "To shortcut the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept]dangerous journey[/hyperlink] to other [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept]Worlds[/hyperlink], the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} have devised elaborate portal structures known as World Gates, which allow the user to travel to other worlds almost instantly. Great knowledge and skill is required to use such a portal. Otherwise, the Godir and their companions may be lost in the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink} or stranded on an isolated world."

