msgid "INTERFACE@MAGIC@SPELLS_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Magical rites and incantations used by <<m:{GLOBAL.LeaderConcept.Hyperlink}>>. Obtained through {GLOBAL.ResearchConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]Spells usually cost {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} and <<m:{GLOBAL.WorldMapCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> or <<m:{GLOBAL.CombatCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[br/][br/]Spells are divided in 2 main categories, depending on where they can be cast. Each category has their own collection of spell types:[bulletlist][bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.WorldMapSpellConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.CombatSpellConcept.Hyperlink}>>[/bulletlist]"

