msgid "INTERFACE@MAGIC_VICTORY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "To achieve the Magic Victory, an {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink} needs to annex three [hyperlink,GLOBAL.RootNodeConcept]Root Nodes[/hyperlink] into its {GLOBAL.DomainConcept.Hyperlink}. Root Nodes appear in the world once any Empire has reached {affinityrequirement} total {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink} and an Empire can have a maximum of three Root Nodes in total.[br/][br/]Once annexed, Root Nodes can be converted into an Affinity Root Node of the highest Affinity in their Empire through a unique Affinity {GLOBAL.SpellConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]Through research of the final {GLOBAL.TomeConcept.Hyperlink} of an Affinity, an ultimate Spell can be unlocked which can be used to start the final victory {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink} timer.[br/][br/]Channeling the ultimate Spell will start to spread the effects of the Root Nodes slowly across the world. At the end of each turn all unused <<m:{GLOBAL.WorldMapCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> are put towards achieving victory. Once the required number of casting points is reached, they and their [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DSAllianceConcept]Allies[/hyperlink] are victorious."

