msgstr "[food/] Food is used to gain new {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} in your <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> and pay {GLOBAL.PopulationUpkeepConcept.Hyperlink}. Greater [food/] Food income will cause Cities to grow faster.[br/][br/]Gain [food/] Food by:[bulletlist][bullet/][hyperlink,GLOBAL.ProvinceAnnexationConcept]Annexing[/hyperlink] Pastures.[bullet/]Building Farms and Foresters in <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Building certain <<m:{GLOBAL.CityStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Collecting <<m:{GLOBAL.PickupConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[/bulletlist][br/]A city with insufficient [food/] food income will suffer from {GLOBAL.StarvationConcept.Hyperlink}."

