msgid "INTERFACE@SETTINGS_GAMEPLAY@TUTORIAL_SETTING_TOOLTIP"
msgstr "Set the amount of help messages the game will provide you:\n"
"\n"
"Full Tutorial - All help messages will appear to help you learn how to play Age of Wonders 4. The tutorial explains the basics and will include beginner's help messages. \n"
"\n"
"Off - No help messages will appear."

