msgstr "Movement Animation Speed"

msgid "INTERFACE@SETTINGS_GAMEPLAY@WORLD_ANIMATION_SPEED_TOOLTIP"
msgstr "Set the speed of movement animations on the world map.\n"
"\n"
"Default - Movement animations run at the standard speed\n"
"Faster - Movement animations run at twice the standard speed\n"
"Very Fast - Movement animations run at four times the standard speed"

