msgstr "The number of <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> your {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink} can control.[br/][br/]Exceeding your City Cap results in {incomepercentage} {GLOBAL.CityIncomeConcept.Hyperlink} to all your <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> for each {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink} above City Cap.[br/][br/]Your City Cap can be increased through {GLOBAL.EmpireDevelopmentConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_CAP_DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgstr "The number of <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> you can control without suffering economic penalties.[br/]City Cap can be increased through the {GLOBAL.EmpireDevelopmentConcept.Hyperlink} tree."

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_CAP_HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.CityCapConcept]City Cap[/hyperlink]"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_CAP_PENALTY"
msgstr "-{Value}% City Income due to {NumOver} <<m:City>> over the City Cap"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_CAP_WARNING_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Each city you have over the {GLOBAL.CityCapConcept.Hyperlink} reduces income of all of your <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[br/][br/]If you proceed, you will have exceeded the cap by {Citiesover} <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> and your <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> will suffer an income penalty of {Incomepercentage} {GLOBAL.CityIncomeConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]Your {GLOBAL.CityCapConcept.Hyperlink} can be increased through {GLOBAL.EmpireDevelopmentConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_CAP_WARNING_TITLE"
msgstr "Warning: You are about to go over the City Cap"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_DEFENSE_STRUCTURE"
msgstr "City Defense Structure"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_DEFENSE_STRUCTURE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "City Defense Structures are <<m:{GLOBAL.CityStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>> that typically grant {GLOBAL.FortificationHealthConcept.Hyperlink} and provide defensive benefits in {GLOBAL.CombatConcept.Hyperlink} during a {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]There are different types of Defense Structures:[bulletlist][bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.CityWallStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.CityTowerStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.CitySupportStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.CityBattlementStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>>[/bulletlist]"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_DEFENSE_STRUCTURE_HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.CityDefenseStructureConcept]City Defense Structure[/hyperlink]"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Cities are located on the {GLOBAL.WorldMapConcept.Hyperlink}. Cities are built by upgrading an {GLOBAL.OutpostConcept.Hyperlink} or conquered through {GLOBAL.WarConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]A city may either belong to an {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink} or be a{GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]The {GLOBAL.DomainConcept.Hyperlink} of a city expands according to its {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink}. Cities provide {GLOBAL.CityIncomeConcept.Hyperlink}, which can be improved by adding <<m:{GLOBAL.CityStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>> and <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceImprovementConcept.Hyperlink}>>."

