msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CITY_WALL_STRUCTURE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Wall Structures are a type of {GLOBAL.CityDefenseStructureConcept.Hyperlink} which adds the requirement to {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink} the {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink} before hostile armies can attack.[br/][br/]They also define the Wall obstacles present in {GLOBAL.CombatConcept.Hyperlink} during a {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink}.[br/][br/]When multiple Wall Structures are present, only the strongest Wall obstacle is present in combat."

