msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CONCEPT_DESTINY_TRAIT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When a race adapts to its surroundings and the actions of their [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KeeperConcept]race keeper[/hyperlink], the race council may decide to proclaim a new era for their people. When they do, they approach the race keeper in an event, where it is decided if this change will manifest into a destiny trait.[br/][br/]Destiny traits change a race's {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.AlignmentConcept.Hyperlink} and need to be accepted with care, since they come with an inherent up- and downside."

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CONCEPT_DESTINY_TRAIT@NAME"
