msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CONCEPT_EMPIRE_DEVELOPMENT_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Contains <<m:{GLOBAL.EmpireSkillConcept.Hyperlink}>> that can improve your empire's economy and unlock important abilities such as Seafaring and Tunneling.[br/][br/]<<m:{GLOBAL.EmpireSkillConcept.Hyperlink}>> become available when enough Affinity Progress has been attained towards that particular {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink}. Available <<m:{GLOBAL.EmpireSkillConcept.Hyperlink}>> can be unlocked at any time by paying their {GLOBAL.ImperiumConcept.Hyperlink} cost."

