msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.EmpireSkillConcept]Empire Skill[/hyperlink]"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CONCEPT_ITEM_TRANSPORTATION@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "An item goes into transportation when you unequip it. When an item is being transported, it is unavailable for all heroes.[br/][br/]While in transport the item: [bulletlist][bullet/]Doesn't count towards arsenal effects.[bullet/]Can not be disenchanted.[bullet/]Can not be equipped.[bullet/]Can not be traded with other rulers.[/bulletlist]"

