msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@CONCEPT_SPEED_MARCH_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Forced March can be used to force your units to move further on the {GLOBAL.WorldMapConcept} than they would normally be able to in a single {GLOBAL.TurnConcept}.[br/][br/]When Forced March is activated units gain {Movepointgain}% of their <<m:{GLOBAL.MovePointConcept}>> but lose {Healthloss}% of their current <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept}>>. They also become {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.EXHAUSTED.Hyperlink} for {ExhaustedTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>. Forced March costs {Manacost} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept} per unit in the army.[br/][br/]The ability to use Forced March can be unlocked through {GLOBAL.EmpireDevelopmentConcept.Hyperlink} ."

