msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@INFUSION@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Infusions are individual improvements that can be put on created items in the {GLOBAL.ItemForgeConcept.Hyperlink}. These can be Passive Properties, Active Abilities or Damage Channels.[br/][br/]An Infusion has an {GLOBAL.InfusionPointConcept.Hyperlink} cost, which increases the cost to forge that item.[br/][br/]Each Infusion after the first also increases the total price of forging the item by {amount1}%."

