msgstr "Every {GLOBAL.InfusionConcept.Hyperlink} has a specific Infusion Point cost ranging from {amount1} to {amount2}. Normally an item can have no more than {amount3} Infusion Points.[br/][br/]The Infusion Point total determines the {GLOBAL.ItemTierConcept.Hyperlink} as follows:[bulletlist][bullet/]Item Tier I: 1 or 2 Infusion Points[bullet/]Item Tier II: 3 Infusion Points[bullet/]Item Tier III: 4 Infusion Points[bullet/]Item Tier IV: 5+ Infusion Points[/bulletlist]"

