msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@ITEM_FORGE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The Item Forge is used to create new custom hero items. Forging items costs {GLOBAL.BindingEssenceConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}, and time. Only a single item can be forged at a time.[br/][br/]The cost and time to forge an item depend on the amount of <<m:{GLOBAL.InfusionPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> used to forge the item. The amount of <<m:{GLOBAL.InfusionConcept.Hyperlink}>> also increases the cost.[br/][br/]The Infusions available are dependent on the types of <<m:{GLOBAL.MagicMaterialConcept.Hyperlink}>> that you have collected. Collecting more of the same Magic Material will unlock more powerful Infusions.[br/][br/]The Item Forge can be build in your {GLOBAL.WizardTowerConcept.Hyperlink}."

