msgstr "Siege"

msgid "INTERFACE@TEXT@SIEGE_PROJECT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Siege Projects can be used during a {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink} to speed up the siege by adding more {GLOBAL.FortificationDamageConcept.Hyperlink}. They can also remove defenses and give the besieger an advantage.[br/][br/]Siege Projects can only be added and removed in the {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink} the {GLOBAL.SiegeConcept.Hyperlink} was initiated.[br/][br/]You can only have as many siege projects added as you can have slots. More slots can be gained through <<m:{GLOBAL.EmpireSkillConcept.Hyperlink}>>."

