msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ARCANIUM_ORE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]Hurry Recruitment for <<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> is {discount} cheaper.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ARCANIUM_ORE@LORE"
msgstr "\"When the ancient Titans shaped the world, their sweat would drip onto the primal materials of the earth, fusing the two together into raw Arcanium. Now, whenever a vein is exposed above ground, a strange, ethereal vapor sees prospectors from all over rushing to its location. Its unique composition makes for magical and malleable metal, meaning far quicker production times!\"[br/][br/]— Fangir Rockborne, Journals from the Second Age: Part II"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ARCANIUM_ORE@NAME"
msgstr "Arcanium Ore^ns"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ARCHON_BLOOD@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]+{CombatCPbonus} <<m:{GLOBAL.CombatCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ARCHON_BLOOD@LORE"
msgstr "\"When the mighty and enigmatic Archons fell in ages past, their blood infused and changed the land in certain places. Now, travelers often report feeling strangely invigorated when crossing this hallowed ground. The mysterious substance found therein can be carefully cultivated and gathered as raw magical power.\"[br/][br/]— Uncredited Scholar, Remnants of the Archon: Part II"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ARCHON_BLOOD@NAME"
msgstr "Archon Blood^ns"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ASTRAL_DEW@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]+{WMapCPbonus} <<m:{GLOBAL.WorldMapCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ASTRAL_DEW@LORE"
msgstr "\"In places where the natural realms and the Astral Sea converge, certain types of flora become infused with arcane properties as they are naturally more susceptible. The dew from this flora is highly sought after by practitioners of magic, as it can act as a catalyst for both spells and research into many kinds of arcana.\"[br/][br/]— Edward Portsmith, Advanced Reports on Mana Infusion"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ASTRAL_DEW@NAME"
msgstr "Astral Dew^ns"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@COSMICFLUX_ELIXIR@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceImprovementConcept.Hyperlink}>> in provinces with Mana <<m:{GLOBAL.NodeConcept.Hyperlink}>> grant +{mananodebonus} {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist][br/]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@COSMICFLUX_ELIXIR@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmoflux Elixir"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ELDRITCH_BONE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.UnitSummonConcept} gains {damagebuff} damage on all attacks.[red]*[/red][/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@FIREFORGE_STONE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> cost {discount} less {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@FIREFORGE_STONE@LORE"
msgstr "\"Fireforge Stones are said to be the remnants of a volcano's heart. They emanate heat eternally, resisting all attempts to quench their warmth. Weapons can be more efficiently forged when using the magically enhanced temperature of these stones.\"[br/][br/]— Fangir Rockborne, Journals from the Second Age: Part I"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@FIREFORGE_STONE@NAME"
msgstr "Fireforge Stone^ns"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@FOCUS_CRYSTALS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> gain {xpbonus}[xp/] experience from combat.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@FOCUS_CRYSTALS@LORE"
msgstr "\"When a geode of crystallized astral essence forms above ground and is touched by starlight, it splits like an earthen, blooming plant. The newly exposed, glistening crystal within is highly magical and infuses its bearers with arcane power.\"[br/][br/]— Edward Portsmith, Advanced Reports on Mana Infusion"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@FOCUS_CRYSTALS@NAME"
msgstr "Focus Crystals^p"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@HASTE_BERRIES@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]Founding, migrating and absorbing <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> takes -{discount} turns.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@HASTE_BERRIES@LORE"
msgstr "\"The fruit of the Hasteberry bush grows in the blink of an eye, with a popping sound that almost sounds like music. Those who have consumed the fruit speak of a fizzing sensation and a zesty, tangy taste, as well as of their limbs immediately becoming lighter.\"[br/][br/]— Roderick Finwing, Local Flora and its Applications: Part I, Medicine and Physical Enhancement"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@HASTE_BERRIES@NAME"
msgstr "Haste Berries^p"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@IMPERIAL_ESSENCE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]{imperiumbonus} {GLOBAL.ImperiumConcept.Hyperlink} income.[/bulletlist][br/]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@IMPERIAL_ESSENCE@NAME"
msgstr "Imperial Essence"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@LIQUIDS@NAME"
msgstr "Liquids"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@ORES@NAME"
msgstr "Ores"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@PLANTS@NAME"
msgstr "Plants"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@RAINBOW_CLOVER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]+{racerelationbonus} [goodRelation/] relations with <<m:{GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink}>> and <<m:{GLOBAL.LeaderConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@RAINBOW_CLOVER@LORE"
msgstr "\"The Rainbow Clover, when lending its scintillating aspect to any setting, has been found to promote feelings of camaraderie and fellowship among those who gaze upon it. Once a notable feature at many halfling tribes' feasts and mead halls.\"[br/][br/]— Ham Binger, Mead and Meadows: A Halfling's Guide to Merrymaking"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@RAINBOW_CLOVER@NAME"
msgstr "Rainbow Clover^ns"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@RINGS_OF_BINDING@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "<<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>> gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]{defensebonus} {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{resistancebonus} {GLOBAL.ResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{damagebonus} bonus damage[/bulletlist][br/]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@RINGS_OF_BINDING@NAME"
msgstr "Rings of Binding"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@SILVERTONGUE_FRUIT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]<<m:{GLOBAL.DiplomaticTokenConcept.Hyperlink}>> grant +{AllegianceBonus} {GLOBAL.HouseInfluenceConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@SILVERTONGUE_FRUIT@LORE"
msgstr "\"An enchanting bloom that, upon consumption, encourages cooperation in those who indulge in its succulent harvest. Often used as a treat during negotiations, to bring about a fruitful outcome for all.\"[br/][br/]— Julia of House Inioch, Personal Journal from the First Age"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@SILVERTONGUE_FRUIT@NAME"
msgstr "Silvertongue Fruit^ns"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@SPIDER_SILK@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/][abilityblue][/abilityblue] have their upkeep reduced by {discount} [gold/] and/or [mana/].[red]*[/red][/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@TRANQUILITY_POOL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unique global effect: [bulletlist][bullet/]Researching <<m:{GLOBAL.SpellConcept.Hyperlink}>> costs {researchdiscount} less {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@TRANQUILITY_POOL@LORE"
msgstr "\"Rare wonders in the world, these pools are said to be the liquefaction of the collective wisdom of the people who have walked the land. Those who spend time gazing into their tranquil waters experience clarity of thought like never before.\"[br/][br/]— Laryssa Mirabilis, Myth and Truth: Folklore and its Arcane Origins"

msgid "MAGICMATERIALS@TRANQUILITY_POOL@NAME"
msgstr "Tranquility Pool^n"

