msgstr "\"{House.Name} deserves to be eradicated from the surface of this world. Good luck on your quest.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_DEFEATEDPLAYER@NEGATIVE"
msgstr "\"Enjoy your victory while it lasts. You will be the next to fall.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_DEFEATEDPLAYER@NEUTRAL"
msgstr "\"Your annihilation of {Player.Name} will not be without consequences.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_DEFEATEDPLAYER@POSITIVE"
msgstr "\"Well done! {Player.Name}'s empire is defeated. This brings us both a step closer to claiming victory.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_HIGHESTCAPABILITY@NEGATIVE"
msgstr "\"Hah, you may be the rising star now, but it won't last. Sooner or later, my empire will rise above all!\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_HIGHESTCAPABILITY@NEUTRAL"
msgstr "\"You are at the top now, but can you maintain your current stature?\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_HIGHESTCAPABILITY@POSITIVE"
msgstr "\"You are proving to be a wise leader, the {Player.Race} are fortunate to be led by one such as you!\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_IDLE@NEGATIVE"
msgstr "\"We have heard nothing of importance about you for some time. I have a feeling that you're staying quiet to further your nefarious plans.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_IDLE@NEUTRAL"
msgstr "\"The rest of the world has not heard of your actions for a while. This silence can either be good or bad.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_IDLE@POSITIVE"
msgstr "\"I haven't heard anything about your accomplishments in a while. Hopefully you are doing well in your efforts to grow your empire so we may rise from the ruins together.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_IMPROVEDRELATIONWITHFACTION@NEGATIVE"
msgstr "\"You think befriending {House.Name} will help secure your path to victory? It will be my empire that rises above all.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_IMPROVEDRELATIONWITHFACTION@NEUTRAL"
msgstr "\"Improving your relations with {House.Name} may lead to short term gains. Sustaining those relations, however... Can you trust them?\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_IMPROVEDRELATIONWITHFACTION@POSITIVE"
msgstr "\"Good, a diplomatic approach will assure victory. I hope that we may both profit from your relation with {House.Name}.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_LOWESTCAPABILITY@NEGATIVE"
msgstr "\"We've been keeping track of your capability rankings; you are the most pathetic Ruler, and that is how it should be.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_LOWESTCAPABILITY@NEUTRAL"
msgstr "\"You are at the bottom of the capability rankings now. It's your choice to live with that or rise above it.\""

msgid "PLAYER_INTERACTION@EVENT_LOWESTCAPABILITY@POSITIVE"
msgstr "\"Don't give up yet! This isn't over—you could still rise in the ranks of this world.\""

