msgid "SPAWNERS@ASTRALRIFT_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A gathering of eldritch creatures from the Astral Sea has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "SPAWNERS@ASTRALRIFT_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "Hosts of otherworldly foes have managed to break through in places where the veil between our world and the Astral Sea is weak or has been ruptured. Eerie battle cries and strange magics fill the air as this tide of danger washes onto the shores of our reality. Should such rifts be left unchecked, these foes may sweep through our lands without mercy."

msgid "SPAWNERS@ASTRALRIFT_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Astral Rift"

msgid "SPAWNERS@BANDIT_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A band of bloodthirsty brigands has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "SPAWNERS@BANDIT_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "Few know what drives the hearts of mortals. Oft it is greed, valor, or simply hunger. When the common cause grows large enough, men and women of like minds will find each other in secret places. Smoke from campfires and makeshift forges drifts among shoddy tents and huts of these haphazard armies. It is from here that they assault the surrounding lands with relentless impunity."

msgid "SPAWNERS@BANDIT_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Brigand Camp"

msgid "SPAWNERS@BIRD_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A flock of dangerous birds has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "SPAWNERS@BIRD_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "Feathers, bones, and baubles litter the nesting grounds of these gigantic kings and queens of the sky. The sound of hungrily consumed flesh and bone, interspersed with loud chirping and monstrous squawks, carries over the nests of these avian behemoths. Oftentimes their presence is so potent that lesser beings will join their flock, raiding the surrounding areas for gifts, food, and other forms of tribute."

msgid "SPAWNERS@BIRD_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Great Bird Nest"

msgid "SPAWNERS@CULTIST_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A cabal of crazed cultists has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "SPAWNERS@CULTIST_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "Eerie otherworldly shrieks mingle with the terrified whimpers of sacrificial victims-to-be. A cloud of oily smoke from hundreds of ritual candles blankets the area. Here, dark summoners invoke creatures from distant worlds and send them out to wreak havoc on the lands beyond. "

msgid "SPAWNERS@CULTIST_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Ritual Circle"

msgid "SPAWNERS@DRAGON_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A flight of mighty dragons has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "SPAWNERS@DRAGON_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "A dragon's nest is a sight that instills terror, awe... and many similar feelings one might have when in the presence of something deep and primal. Whether the inhabitant of the nest is an ancient dragon, born in the age of giants, or a younger wyvern, denizens of the surrounding lands should beware. Or better yet, flee..."

msgid "SPAWNERS@DRAGON_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Dragon's Lair"

msgid "SPAWNERS@FORSAKEN_COVE_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Nautical horrors have claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion parties."

msgid "SPAWNERS@FORSAKEN_COVE_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "Shanties warn of the Forsaken Cove, where monsters lurk beneath the waves and sunken ships rise from the depths. It was once a notorious den of pirates, cursed by a sailor's widow after they murdered her husband. Now the cove marks the edge of the world, a border even the bravest sailors should not cross. Beware! Here be monsters."

msgid "SPAWNERS@FORSAKEN_COVE_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Forsaken Cove"

msgid "SPAWNERS@INFESTATION@TYPE@BRONZE"
msgstr "Bronze [infestationBronze/] {GLOBAL.InfestationSpawnerConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "SPAWNERS@INFESTATION@TYPE@GOLD"
msgstr "Gold [infestationGold/] {GLOBAL.InfestationSpawnerConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "SPAWNERS@INFESTATION@TYPE@SILVER"
msgstr "Silver [infestationSilver/] {GLOBAL.InfestationSpawnerConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "SPAWNERS@MONSTER_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A throng of vile monsters has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "SPAWNERS@MONSTER_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "Nature is seldom good or evil. It is hungry, territorial, and protective of its young. Nests and dens such as these are home to various beasts of the wild, whose natural ferocity and power of tooth, claw, or beak may prove more than a match for the sharpest steel."

msgid "SPAWNERS@MONSTER_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Small Monster Den"

msgid "SPAWNERS@MONSTER_SPAWNER_LARGE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A horde of vile monsters has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "SPAWNERS@MONSTER_SPAWNER_LARGE@LORE"
msgstr "The crunch of half-chewed bones underfoot and the overwhelming scent of past victims drifting through the air mark this den a home of monsters. From ancient giants, shapers of the world, to vicious trolls, still incensed at the loss of their deep domains, one might expect any type of powerful creature and their minions to emerge. "

msgid "SPAWNERS@MONSTER_SPAWNER_LARGE@NAME"
msgstr "Large Monster Den"

msgid "SPAWNERS@PIRATE_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A roving band of pirates has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion parties."

msgid "SPAWNERS@PIRATE_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "Freebooters laugh as they smuggle goods along the waves and pirates raze the villages by the sea and riverside, plundering all they desire. The call of the sea resonates with these men and women who congregate in hidden coves and bays. Raucous singing can be heard in these places, accompanied by the smell of stale, stolen ale wafting through the humid air."

msgid "SPAWNERS@PIRATE_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Pirate Cove"

msgid "SPAWNERS@UNDEAD_SPAWNER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A mass of haunted undead has claimed this region.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "SPAWNERS@UNDEAD_SPAWNER@LORE"
msgstr "The dead often grow restless in troubled times. In places like graveyards, where they are all conveniently amassed in a single, sometimes less than final, resting place, this can be fatal for others. Whether driven by dark magic, a confluence of ambient spiritual energy, or some other source of ire from beyond the veil, hordes of the Undead rise with one need... to feast upon the flesh of the living."

msgid "SPAWNERS@UNDEAD_SPAWNER@NAME"
msgstr "Haunted Graveyard"

msgid "SPECIES_HUMANS@MIGRATE_OPERATION@CONFIRMATION"
msgstr "Are you sure you want to migrate this city to {Race.Name}?"

msgid "SPECIES_HUMANS@MIGRATE_OPERATION@CONFIRMATION_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "You are about to migrate the population of this city to {Race.Name}.[br/][br/][fireCol]Migration will kill {PopulationDeath} of the city's population.[/fireCol][br/][br/]You will receive {AlignmentChange}."

msgid "SPECIES_HUMANS@MIGRATE_OPERATION@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Migrates the population of this city to {Race.Name}. The city will become a city of {Race.Name}.[br/][br/]All <<m:{GLOBAL.CityDefenseStructureConcept.Hyperlink}>> of this city will be destroyed.[br/][br/][fireCol]Migration will kill {PopulationDeath} of the city's population.[/fireCol][br/]You receive {AlignmentChange}."

msgid "SPECIES_HUMANS@MIGRATE_OPERATION@IN_PROGRESS"
msgstr "City is currently being migrated to {Race.Name}. Process will complete in {Duration} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "SPECIES_HUMANS@MIGRATE_OPERATION@NAME"
msgstr "Migrate to {Race.Name}"

msgid "SPEC_WILDMAGIC@SWAP_LOCATION@LOG_MESSAGE"
msgstr "{STR_unitName1} swapped location with {STR_unitName2}"

msgid "SPEC_WILDMAGIC@SWAP_LOCATION@NAME"
msgstr "Swap Location"

msgid "STACK@CONFIRM_SPEED_MARCH@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Units in this army gain {movepointgain} of their total <<m:{GLOBAL.MovePointConcept.Hyperlink}>> back.[br/]Units lose {STR_HitpointPcnt}% of their total <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> and become {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.EXHAUSTED.Hyperlink} for {STR_ExhaustTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[br/]Cost: {STR_Cost} ({STR_UnitCost} per unit)."

msgid "STACK@CONFIRM_SPEED_MARCH@TITLE"
msgstr "Forced March"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@BERSERK@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Is uncontrollable and always attacks the closest enemy target.[bullet/]If no enemy is in range, it will attack its allies.[bullet/]Is immune to {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} effects.[bullet/]Damage penalties from {GLOBAL.CasualtyConcept} are negated.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@BERSERK@MODIFIER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Base {BERSERK_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BERSERK.Hyperlink} for {BERSERK_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} {GLOBAL.TurnConcept}"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@BERSERK@NAME"
msgstr "Berserk"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@BRAVE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This unit loses -{BRAVE>ResolvedMoraleDropModifier}% less {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@BRAVE@NAME"
msgstr "Brave"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DEMORALIZED@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]{DEMORALIZED>MoraleBonus} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} per stack.[bullet/]Stacks up to {amount} times.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DEMORALIZED@MODIFIER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Base {DEMORALIZED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMORALIZED.Hyperlink} for {DEMORALIZED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DEMORALIZED@NAME"
msgstr "Demoralized"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DESPAIRING@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Lose {REMORSE_MORALE_CHANGE>Morale Change} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} at the end of the turn.[bullet/]Stacks up to {amount} times.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]Remorse {GLOBAL.OpposingStatusEffectsConcept.Hyperlink} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.RALLYING.Hyperlink}."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DESPAIRING@MODIFIER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Base {REMORSE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REMORSE.Hyperlink} for {REMORSE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DESPAIRING@MODIFIER_GUARANTEED_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Inflicts {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REMORSE.Hyperlink} for {REMORSE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DESPAIRING@MODIFIER_GUARANTEED_MULTIPLE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Inflicts {amount} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REMORSE.Hyperlink} for {REMORSE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DESPAIRING@NAME"
msgstr "Remorse"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DOMINATED@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This unit is controlled by the opponent.[br/]If the effect lasts until the end of combat, the controller will have the option to spend [mana/] to keep the unit permanently."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DOMINATED@MODIFIER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Base {DOMINATED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DOMINATED.Hyperlink} for {DOMINATED_TEMP>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DOMINATED@MODIFIER_DESCRIPTION_END_OF_COMBAT"
msgstr "Base {DOMINATED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DOMINATED.Hyperlink} until the end of combat."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@DOMINATED@NAME"
msgstr "Dominated"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@ENCOURAGED@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "{ENCOURAGED>MoraleBonus} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} per stack."

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@ENCOURAGED@NAME"
msgstr "Encouraged"

msgid "STATUSEFFECTS_UNITPROPERTIES@FEARLESS@DESCRIPTION"
