msgstr "The {EventLeaderDefeated.Title} Defeated"

msgid "STORY_EVENT@993_8075@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventLeaderDefeated.Name} is working on some terrifying arcane work on this realm, defeating <<P:EventLeaderDefeated>> will thwart <<o:EventLeaderDefeated>> scheme and turn <<o:EventLeaderDefeated>> power over to you."

