msgstr "A projection of {EventLeaderDefeated.TitleName} appears, not acknowledging your presence as it speaks."

msgid "STORY_EVENT@993_8075@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"More meddlers to disrupt my work... See that you do not, or you will find the meaning of the words 'Knowledge is power.'\""

