msgstr "\"Give me a blanket of forest to spread across the world. Unfurl its emerald embrace over all regions, cast a lush and leafy shadow over every land. This! This will be my paradise. When the music of birdsong and the bellow of beasts accompany the breeze wafting through the eternal woods, then I shall be contented!\""

