msgid "TOME_REVELRY@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Follow the path of debauchery that rewards those who take chances and specialize in gaining {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept} and {GLOBAL.ExperienceConcept}."

msgid "TOME_REVELRY@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Asgera Spinesplitter, War Queen of the Bloodfang Orcs"

msgid "TOME_REVELRY@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"Nothing instills more doubt in an enemy than a foe who revels in battle! The warriors who feast upon the carnage, they are the ultimate victors of war, no matter the outcome. Take glory in the fray and care not who wins!\""

