msgid "TOME_ROOTS@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Birchfoot, Hermit of the Glade"

msgid "TOME_ROOTS@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"To unravel the secrets of nature, you must be of one mind with the trees and their spreading roots. Become rooted yourself. Feel the healing force replenishing you from below, and seal away those who could cut you down in a cage of entangling vines.\""

