msgid "TOME_SCRYING@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"Awaken your mind's eye to gaze beyond the physical realm. Secrets near and far will reveal themselves, and the truly observant will even be able to peer into the immediate future! Your enemy's look of shock when you deftly sidestep their attack before they have even launched it is truly a sight to behold.\""

