msgid "TOME_WILD@SKILL3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Choose a Tier I or Tier II {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ANIMAL.Hyperlink} unit to add to your army.[bullet/]The available <<m:{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ANIMAL.Hyperlink}>> depend on the type of terrain the spell is cast on.[/bulletlist]"

