msgstr "{GLOBAL.LeaderConcept.Hyperlink} starts with:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.HeroClassMage.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.EQUIPMENT.LIGHTNING_ORB.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.HeroMountConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

